Desenvolvimento rápido e eficiente"],"ru":["Автономная разработка кода","Разработка на основе спецификаций","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Высококачественный код","Быстрая и эффективная разработка"],"ar":["تطوير شفرة مستقل","تطوير مدفوع بالمواصفات","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","شفرة عالية الجودة","تطوير سريع وفعال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Ralph Wiggum","什么是Autonomous AI编码","Ralph Wiggum替代品","Ralph Wiggum vs 其他AI工具","Ralph Wiggum安装","Ralph Wiggum设置指南","AIエージェント的应用","自动化编码的优势"],"ja":["Ralph Wiggumの使用方法","Autonomous AIコーディングとは","Ralph Wiggumの代替品","Ralph Wiggum vs その他のAIツール","Ralph Wiggumのインストール","Ralph Wiggumの設定ガイド","AIエージェントの応用","自動化コーディングの利点"],"ko":["Ralph Wiggum을 사용하는 방법","자동화 AI 코딩이란","Ralph Wiggum의 대안","Ralph Wiggum vs 다른 AI 도구","Ralph Wiggum 설치","Ralph Wiggum 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트의 적용","자동화 코딩의 장점"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de IA","qué es el desarrollo de código autónomo","Ralph Wiggum alternativa","Ralph Wiggum vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de Ralph Wiggum","guía de configuración de Ralph Wiggum","desarrollo de software con IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''IA","quoi est le développement de code autonome","Ralph Wiggum alternative","Ralph Wiggum vs autres outils d''IA","installation de Ralph Wiggum","guide de configuration de Ralph Wiggum","développement de logiciels avec IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten verwendet","was ist autonomes Coden","Ralph Wiggum Alternative","Ralph Wiggum vs andere KI-Agenten","Installation von Ralph Wiggum","Konfigurationsanleitung für Ralph Wiggum","Software-Entwicklung mit KI"],"pt":["como usar agente de ia","o que é ralph wiggum","ferramentas de agente de ia","ralph wiggum vs outros agentes","instalar ralph wiggum","guia de configuração do ralph wiggum","desenvolvimento de código autônomo","spec-driven development"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агент","что такое ральф виггум","инструменты ИИ агента","ральф виггум vs другие агенты","установить ральф виггум","руководство по настройке ральф виггум","автономная разработка кода","разработка на основе спецификаций"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو رالف وايغام","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","رالف وايغام مقابل وكلاء آخرين","تثبيت رالف وايغام","دليل إعداد رالف وايغام","تطوير شفرة مستقل","تطوير مدفوع بالمواصفات"]}},"owner":"fstandhartinger","repo":"ralph-wiggum","repoPath":"fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.675Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph-wiggum","description":"Autonomous AI coding with spec-driven development. Implements Geoffrey Huntleys iterative bash loop methodology where agents work through specs one at a time, outputting a completion signal only when acceptance criteria are 100% met.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Ralph Wiggum\n\n> Autonomous AI coding with spec-driven development\n\n## What is Ralph Wiggum?\n\nRalph Wiggum combines **Geoffrey Huntley''s iterative bash loop** with **spec-driven development** for fully autonomous AI-assisted software development.\n\nThe key insight: **Fresh context each iteration**. Each loop starts a new agent process with a clean context window, preventing context overflow and degradation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse Ralph Wiggum when:\n\n- You have multiple specifications/fe","body":"# Ralph Wiggum\n\n> Autonomous AI coding with spec-driven development\n\n## What is Ralph Wiggum?\n\nRalph Wiggum combines **Geoffrey Huntley''s iterative bash loop** with **spec-driven development** for fully autonomous AI-assisted software development.\n\nThe key insight: **Fresh context each iteration**. Each loop starts a new agent process with a clean context window, preventing context overflow and degradation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse Ralph Wiggum when:\n\n- You have multiple specifications/features to implement\n- You want the AI to work autonomously through tasks\n- You need consistent, verifiable completion of acceptance criteria\n- You want to avoid context window problems in long sessions\n\n## How It Works\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     RALPH LOOP                              │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Loop 1: Pick spec A → Implement → Test → Commit → DONE    │\n│  Loop 2: Pick spec B → Implement → Test → Commit → DONE    │\n│  Loop 3: Pick spec C → Implement → Test → Commit → DONE    │\n│  ...                                                        │\n│                                                             │\n│  Each iteration = Fresh context window                      │\n│  Shared state = Files on disk (specs, plan, history)        │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Installation\n\n### Quick Install (via Skill Installers)\n\n```bash\n# Using Vercel''s add-skill\nnpx add-skill fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum\n\n# Using OpenSkills\nopenskills install fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum\n```\n\n### Full Setup (Recommended)\n\nFor full Ralph Wiggum setup with constitution and interview:\n\n```bash\n# Tell your AI agent:\n\"Set up Ralph Wiggum using https://github.com/fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum\"\n```\n\nThe agent will guide you through a **lightweight, pleasant setup**:\n\n1. **Quick Setup** (~1 min) — Create directories, download scripts\n2. **Project Interview** — Focus on your **vision and goals** (not tech details)\n3. **Constitution** — Create a guiding document for all sessions\n4. **Next Steps** — Clear guidance on creating specs and starting Ralph\n\nFor existing projects, the agent detects your tech stack automatically. The interview prioritizes understanding *what you''re building and why*.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Fresh Context Each Loop\n\nEach iteration of the Ralph loop starts a new AI agent process. This means:\n- No context window overflow\n- No degradation over time\n- Clean slate for each task\n\n### 2. Shared State on Disk\n\nState persists between loops via files:\n- `specs/` — Feature specifications with acceptance criteria\n- `ralph_history.txt` — Log of breakthroughs, blockers, learnings\n- `IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` — Optional detailed task breakdown\n\n### 3. Completion Signal\n\nThe agent outputs `<promise>DONE</promise>` **ONLY** when:\n- All acceptance criteria are verified\n- Tests pass\n- Changes are committed and pushed\n\nThe bash loop checks for this phrase. If not found, it retries.\n\n### 4. Backpressure via Tests\n\nTests, lints, and builds act as guardrails. The agent must fix issues before outputting the completion signal.\n\n## Usage\n\n### Creating Specifications\n\n**The key to success:** Each spec needs **clear, testable acceptance criteria**. This is what tells Ralph when a task is truly \"done.\"\n\n```markdown\n# Feature: User Authentication\n\n## Requirements\n- OAuth login with Google\n- Session management\n- Logout functionality\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] User can log in with Google\n- [ ] Session persists across page reloads\n- [ ] User can log out\n- [ ] Tests pass\n\n**Output when complete:** `<promise>DONE</promise>`\n```\n\n**Good criteria:** \"User can log in with Google and session persists\"\n**Bad criteria:** \"Auth works correctly\"\n\nThe more specific your acceptance criteria, the better Ralph performs.\n\n### Running the Loop\n\n```bash\n# Start building (Claude Code)\n./scripts/ralph-loop.sh\n\n# With max iterations\n./scripts/ralph-loop.sh 20\n\n# Using Codex CLI\n./scripts/ralph-loop-codex.sh\n```\n\n### Logging (All Output Captured)\n\nEvery loop run writes **all output** to log files in `logs/`:\n\n- **Session log:** `logs/ralph_*_session_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.log` (entire run, including CLI output)\n- **Iteration logs:** `logs/ralph_*_iter_N_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.log` (per-iteration CLI output)\n- **Codex last message:** `logs/ralph_codex_output_iter_N_*.txt`\n\n## Two Modes\n\n| Mode | Purpose | Command |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| **build** (default) | Pick spec, implement, test, commit | `./scripts/ralph-loop.sh` |\n| **plan** (optional) | Create detailed task breakdown | `./scripts/ralph-loop.sh plan` |\n\n## Key Principles\n\n### Let Ralph Ralph\n\nTrust the AI to self-identify, self-correct, and self-improve. Observe patterns and adjust prompts.\n\n### YOLO Mode\n\nFor Ralph to work effectively, enable full autonomy:\n- Claude Code: `--dangerously-skip-permissions`\n- Codex: `--dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox`\n\n⚠️ **Use at your own risk.** Only in sandboxed environments.\n\n## Links\n\n- **GitHub:** https://github.com/fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum\n- **Website:** https://ralph-wiggum.ai\n- **Original methodology:** [Geoffrey Huntley''s how-to-ralph-wiggum](https://github.com/ghuntley/how-to-ralph-wiggum)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:35.209Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous AI Agents needing spec-driven development and iterative bash loop capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要基于规格驱动开发和迭代bash循环能力的自治AI代理。","ja":"規格駆動開発と反復的bashループ機能を必要とする自律型AIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"사양 기반 개발 및 반복적 bash 루프 기능이 필요한 자율형 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Autónomos que necesitan desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones y capacidades de bucle bash iterativo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA Autonomes ayant besoin d''un développement piloté par des spécifications et de capacités de boucle bash itérative.","de":"Perfekt für autonome KI-Agenten, die spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung und iterative Bash-Schleifenfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Autônomos que necessitam de desenvolvimento orientado por especificações e capacidades de loop bash iterativo.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов ИИ, которым требуется развитие, управляемое спецификациями, и возможности итеративной петли bash.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين المستقلين الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير مدفوع بالمواصفات وقدرات الحلقات الباش المتكررة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform fully autonomous AI-assisted software development using spec-driven development and Geoffrey Huntley''s iterative bash loop, ensuring fresh context each iteration and preventing context overflow and degradation.","zh":"赋予代理使用基于规格驱动开发和Geoffrey Huntley的迭代bash循环执行完全自治的AI辅助软件开发的能力，确保每次迭代的新鲜上下文并防止上下文溢出和退化。","ja":"エージェントがGeoffrey Huntleyの反復的bashループを使用して、規格駆動開発による完全自律的なAIアシストソフトウェア開発を実行できるようにし、各イテレーションで新しいコンテキストを保証し、コンテキストオーバーフローと劣化を防ぐ。","ko":"에이전트가 사양 기반 개발 및 Geoffrey Huntley의 반복적 bash 루프를 사용하여 완전 자율형 AI 지원 소프트웨어 개발을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 각 반복에서 새로운 컨텍스트를 보장하고 컨텍스트 오버플로 및 열화 방지","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un desarrollo de software completamente autónomo asistido por IA utilizando el desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones y el bucle bash iterativo de Geoffrey Huntley, garantizando un contexto fresco en cada iteración y evitando el desbordamiento y la degradación del contexto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser un développement de logiciels entièrement autonome assisté par IA en utilisant le développement piloté par des spécifications et la boucle bash itérative de Geoffrey Huntley, garantissant un contexte frais à chaque itération et empêchant le débordement et la dégradation du contexte.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ein vollständig autonomes, von KI unterstütztes Software-Entwicklung durchzuführen, indem sie spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung und Geoffrey Huntleys iterative Bash-Schleife verwenden, um einen frischen Kontext bei jeder Iteration sicherzustellen und Kontextüberlauf und -degradation zu verhindern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar desenvolvimento de software totalmente autônomo com assistência de IA, usando desenvolvimento orientado por especificações e a loop bash iterativa de Geoffrey Huntley, garantindo um contexto fresco a cada iteração e prevenindo o transbordamento e degradação do contexto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять полностью автономное развитие программного обеспечения с помощью ИИ, используя развитие, управляемое спецификациями, и итеративную петлю bash Джоффри Хантли, обеспечивая свежий контекст на каждой итерации и предотвращая переполнение и деградацию контекста.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إجراء تطوير برامج مستقل بالكامل باستخدام مساعدة ذكاء اصطناعي، باستخدام التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات والحلقة الباش المتكررة لجيفري هانتلي، مما يضمن سياقًا جديدًا في كل تكرار ومانعًا فيضان السياق وتدهوره."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating software development with spec-driven development","Generating clean and efficient code using iterative bash loops","Preventing context overflow and degradation in AI-assisted development"],"zh":["使用基于规格驱动开发自动化软件开发","使用迭代bash循环生成干净高效的代码","防止AI辅助开发中的上下文溢出和退化"],"ja":["規格駆動開発によるソフトウェア開発の自動化","反復的bashループを使用したクリーンで効率的なコードの生成","AIアシスト開発におけるコンテキストオーバーフローと劣化の防止"],"ko":["사양 기반 개발을 통한 소프트웨어 개발 자동화","반복적 bash 루프를 사용한 깨끗하고 효율적인 코드 생성","AI 지원 개발에서 컨텍스트 오버플로 및 열화 방지"],"es":["Automatización del desarrollo de software con desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones","Generación de código limpio y eficiente mediante bucles bash iterativos","Prevención del desbordamiento y la degradación del contexto en el desarrollo asistido por IA"],"fr":["Automatisation du développement de logiciels avec un développement piloté par des spécifications","Génération de code propre et efficace à l''aide de boucles bash itératives","Prévention du débordement et de la dégradation du contexte dans le développement assisté par IA"],"de":["Automatisierung der Software-Entwicklung mit spezifikationsgetriebener Entwicklung","Erzeugung von sauberem und effizientem Code mithilfe iterativer Bash-Schleifen","Verhinderung von Kontextüberlauf und -degradation bei der KI-unterstützten Entwicklung"],"pt":["Automatizar o desenvolvimento de software com desenvolvimento orientado por especificações","Gerar código limpo e eficiente usando loops bash iterativos","Prevenir o transbordamento e degradação do contexto no desenvolvimento assistido por IA"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развитие программного обеспечения с помощью развития, управляемого спецификациями","Генерировать чистый и эффективный код, используя итеративные петли bash","Предотвратить переполнение и деградацию контекста в развитии, помогаемом ИИ"],"ar":["تحقيق آلي لتطوير البرمجيات باستخدام التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات","توليد رمز نظيف وفعال باستخدام الحلقات الباش المتكررة","منع فيضان السياق وتدهوره في التطوير المدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires multiple specifications/files","Dependent on Geoffrey Huntley''s iterative bash loop","Limited to autonomous AI-assisted software development"],"zh":["需要多个规格/文件","依赖Geoffrey Huntley的迭代bash循环","仅限于自治AI辅助软件开发"],"ja":["複数の仕様/ファイルを必要とする","Geoffrey Huntleyの反復的bashループに依存する","自律型AIアシストソフトウェア開発に限定される"],"ko":["여러 사양/파일 필요","Geoffrey Huntley의 반복적 bash 루프에 의존","자율형 AI 지원 소프트웨어 개발에 한정"],"es":["Requiere múltiples especificaciones/archivos","Dependiente del bucle bash iterativo de Geoffrey Huntley","Limitado al desarrollo de software asistido por IA autónomo"],"fr":["Nécessite plusieurs spécifications/fichiers","Dépendant de la boucle bash itérative de Geoffrey Huntley","Limité au développement de logiciels autonome assisté par IA"],"de":["Erfordert mehrere Spezifikationen/Dateien","Abhängig von Geoffrey Huntleys iterativer Bash-Schleife","Begrenzt auf autonomes, von KI unterstütztes Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Requer múltiplas especificações/arquivos","Dependente da loop bash iterativa de Geoffrey Huntley","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de software autônomo assistido por IA"],"ru":["Требует нескольких спецификаций/файлов","Зависит от итеративной петли bash Джоффри Хантли","Ограничен автономным развитием программного обеспечения с помощью ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب مواصفات/ملفات متعددة","يعتمد على الحلقة الباش المتكررة لجيفري هانتلي","محدود بالتطوير البرمجي المستقل المدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0c870df2aa953e2663f4725856f3c2d730a58ff99bfaa3c00d0f7a4df2ea8b19","qualityScore":56}');
