nts AGET","Outil d''Agent IA pour les développeurs","Compatibilité avec des technologies comme React, Python et Node.js","Intégration avec CLI pour une mise en œuvre plus facile"],"de":["Implementierung von 35 CAP-*-Fähigkeiten","Arbeitsmodell von foundation archetype für AGET-Agenten","KI-Agent-Tool für Entwickler","Kompatibilität mit Technologien wie React, Python und Node.js","Integration mit CLI für eine einfache Implementierung"],"pt":["Implementação de 35 CAP-* capabilities","Ferramenta de AI Agente para desenvolvedores","Base sólida para desenvolvimento de aplicações","Integração com tecnologias de desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas"],"ru":["Реализация 35 CAP-* возможностей","Инструмент ИИ Агента для разработчиков","Прочная основа для разработки приложений","Интеграция с технологиями разработки","Поддержка нескольких платформ"],"ar":["تنفيذ 35 CAP-* قدرات","أداة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","أساس متين لتطوير التطبيقات","التكامل مع تقنيات التطوير","دعم منصات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["aget-check-evolution","AI智能代理","CAP-*能力","开发者工具","如何使用aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution安装","aget-check-evolution教程"],"ja":["aget-check-evolution","AIエージェント","CAP-*機能","開発者ツール","aget-check-evolutionの使い方","aget-check-evolutionのインストール","aget-check-evolutionのチュートリアル"],"ko":["aget-check-evolution","AI 에이전트","CAP-* 기능","개발자 도구","aget-check-evolution 사용법","aget-check-evolution 설치","aget-check-evolution 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de AI Agent","aget-check-evolution","cómo usar aget-check-evolution","qué es un agente AGET","alternativas a aget-check-evolution","instalación de aget-check-evolution","guía de configuración de aget-check-evolution"],"fr":["outils d''Agent IA","aget-check-evolution","comment utiliser aget-check-evolution","quoi est un agent AGET","alternatives à aget-check-evolution","installation de aget-check-evolution","guide de configuration de aget-check-evolution"],"de":["KI-Agent-Tools","aget-check-evolution","wie man aget-check-evolution verwendet","was ist ein AGET-Agent","alternativen zu aget-check-evolution","installation von aget-check-evolution","konfigurationsanleitung für aget-check-evolution"],"pt":["como usar aget-check-evolution","o que é aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution alternativa","aget-check-evolution vs outras ferramentas","instalar aget-check-evolution","guia de configuração do aget-check-evolution","desenvolvimento de aplicações com aget-check-evolution"],"ru":["как использовать aget-check-evolution","что такое aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution альтернатива","aget-check-evolution vs другие инструменты","установить aget-check-evolution","руководство по настройке aget-check-evolution","разработка приложений с aget-check-evolution"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام aget-check-evolution","ما هو aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution بديل","aget-check-evolution مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت aget-check-evolution","دليل إعداد aget-check-evolution","تطوير التطبيقات مع aget-check-evolution"]}},"owner":"aget-framework","repo":"template-worker-aget","repoPath":"aget-framework/template-worker-aget","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T08:25:24.796Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aget-check-evolution","description":"Monitor .aget/evolution/ directory health. Validates file counts, naming conventions, disk usage, and returns health status with alerts on anomalies.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# /aget-check-evolution\n\nMonitor the health of the `.aget/evolution/` directory by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents to assess their evolution directory health without supervisor intervention.\n\n## Execution\n\nWhen invoked, perform these checks:\n\n### 1. File Inventory\n\n```bash\n# Count total files\nfind .aget/evolution -type f | wc -l\n\n# Count by extension\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.md\" | wc -l","body":"# /aget-check-evolution\n\nMonitor the health of the `.aget/evolution/` directory by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents to assess their evolution directory health without supervisor intervention.\n\n## Execution\n\nWhen invoked, perform these checks:\n\n### 1. File Inventory\n\n```bash\n# Count total files\nfind .aget/evolution -type f | wc -l\n\n# Count by extension\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.md\" | wc -l\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.json\" | wc -l\nfind .aget/evolution -type f ! -name \"*.md\" ! -name \"*.json\" | wc -l\n```\n\n### 2. Naming Convention Check\n\nValid L-doc pattern: `L###_*.md` (e.g., `L588_skill_invocation_control_semantics.md`)\n\n```bash\n# Count valid L-doc names\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"L[0-9][0-9][0-9]_*.md\" | wc -l\n\n# Find non-conforming files (excluding index.json)\nfind .aget/evolution -type f ! -name \"L[0-9][0-9][0-9]_*.md\" ! -name \"index.json\" ! -name \"README.md\"\n```\n\n### 3. Disk Usage\n\n```bash\ndu -sh .aget/evolution\n```\n\n### 4. Index Integrity\n\nCheck that `index.json` exists and is valid JSON:\n\n```bash\ntest -f .aget/evolution/index.json && jq empty .aget/evolution/index.json 2>/dev/null && echo \"valid\" || echo \"invalid\"\n```\n\n## Thresholds\n\n| Metric | OK | WARN | CRITICAL |\n|--------|-----|------|----------|\n| Total files | <500 | 500-750 | >750 |\n| Non-standard files | 0-10 | 11-50 | >50 |\n| Disk size | <10MB | 10-25MB | >25MB |\n| Index integrity | valid | - | invalid |\n\n**Note**: Thresholds inherited from supervisor defaults. Research AGET baseline (2026-02-08): 94 files, 800K - well within OK range.\n\n## Output Format\n\nReport the following:\n\n```\n=== /aget-check-evolution ===\n\nDirectory: .aget/evolution/\n\nFile Counts:\n  Total:     [count]\n  L-docs:    [count] (.md matching L###_*.md)\n  Index:     [1 if exists, 0 otherwise]\n  Other:     [count] (non-conforming)\n\nDisk Usage: [size]\n\nIndex Status: [valid/invalid/missing]\n\nNon-Conforming Files:\n  [list any files not matching expected patterns]\n\nHealth Status: [OK | WARN | CRITICAL]\nAlerts:\n  [list any threshold violations]\n```\n\n## Health Status Logic\n\n```\nIF index invalid OR index missing:\n  CRITICAL\nELIF total_files > 750 OR disk > 25MB OR non_standard > 50:\n  CRITICAL\nELIF total_files > 500 OR disk > 10MB OR non_standard > 10:\n  WARN\nELSE:\n  OK\n```\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **C1**: Read-only operation. Never modify files.\n- **C2**: Report ALL findings, even if status is OK.\n- **C3**: List non-conforming files by name for actionability.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `/aget-check-sessions` - Sessions directory health\n- `/aget-check-kb` - Knowledge base health\n- `/aget-record-lesson` - Capture findings as L-docs\n\n## Traceability\n\n| Link | Reference |\n|------|-----------|\n| POC | POC-017 |\n| Project | PROJECT_PLAN_AGET_UNIVERSAL_SKILLS.md |\n| Source | Fleet Skill Deployment Report (supervisor) |\n| Baseline | 94 files, 800K (2026-02-08) |\n\n---\n\n*aget-check-evolution v1.0.0*\n*Category: Monitoring*\n*POC-017 Phase 1*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T12:44:50.892Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Agents needing self-diagnostic capabilities for evolution directory health monitoring.","zh":"适合需要自我诊断能力以监控进化目录健康的自主代理。","ja":"進化ディレクトリのヘルスモニタリングの自己診断機能を必要とする自律エージェントに適しています。","ko":"진화 디렉토리의 건강 모니터링을 위한 자가 진단 기능이 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Autónomos que necesitan capacidades de autodiagnóstico para la monitorización de la salud del directorio de evolución.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Autonomes ayant besoin de capacités d''auto-diagnostic pour la surveillance de la santé du répertoire d''évolution.","de":"Perfekt für autonome Agenten, die Selbstdiagnosefunktionen für die Überwachung der Verzeichnisgesundheit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autônomos que necessitam de capacidades de autodiagnóstico para monitoramento de saúde do diretório de evolução.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, которым необходимы возможности самообслуживания для мониторинга здоровья директории эволюции.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل المستقلة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات التشخيص الذاتي لمراقبة حالة مجلد التطور."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to monitor their evolution directory health by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage, utilizing Unix commands like find and wc for file inventory and analysis.","zh":"使代理能够通过检查文件数、类型、命名约定和磁盘使用情况来监控其进化目录的健康，利用 Unix 命令如 find 和 wc 进行文件库存和分析。","ja":"エージェントがファイル数、タイプ、命名規則、ディスク使用状況をチェックすることで、進化ディレクトリのヘルスをモニタリングできるようにし、ファイルインベントリと分析のために find や wc などの Unix コマンドを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 파일 수, 유형, 명명 규칙, 디스크 사용량을 확인하여 진화 디렉토리의 건강을 모니터링 할 수 있도록 하며, 파일 재고 및 분석을 위해 find 및 wc와 같은 Unix 명령을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a monitorear la salud de su directorio de evolución verificando los recuentos de archivos, tipos, convenciones de nomenclatura y uso de disco, utilizando comandos de Unix como find y wc para el inventario y análisis de archivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de surveiller la santé de leur répertoire d''évolution en vérifiant les comptes de fichiers, les types, les conventions de dénomination et l''utilisation du disque, en utilisant des commandes Unix comme find et wc pour l''inventaire et l''analyse de fichiers.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Gesundheit ihres Evolution-Verzeichnisses zu überwachen, indem sie Dateizähler, Typen, Benennungskonventionen und Plattenplatznutzung überprüfen, wobei Unix-Kommandos wie find und wc für die Dateiinventarisierung und -analyse verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a monitorar a saúde do diretório de evolução, verificando contagens de arquivos, tipos, convenções de nomenclatura e uso de disco, utilizando comandos Unix como find e wc para inventário e análise de arquivos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам отслеживать здоровье директории эволюции, проверяя количество файлов, типы, соглашения об именовании и использование диска, используя команды Unix, такие как find и wc для инвентаризации и анализа файлов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية مراقبة حالة مجلد التطور عن طريق التحقق من أعداد الملفات وأنواعها وأساليب التسمية واستخدام القرص، باستخدام أوامر Unix مثل find وwc لجرد الملفات وتحليلها."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating evolution directory health checks","Debugging file system issues","Monitoring disk usage for efficient storage management"],"zh":["自动化进化目录健康检查","调试文件系统问题","监控磁盘使用情况以进行高效的存储管理"],"ja":["進化ディレクトリのヘルスチェックの自動化","ファイルシステムの問題のデバッグ","効率的なストレージ管理のためのディスク使用状況のモニタリング"],"ko":["진화 디렉토리 건강 체크 자동화","파일 시스템 문제 디버깅","효율적인 스토리지 관리를 위한 디스크 사용량 모니터링"],"es":["Automatización de comprobaciones de salud del directorio de evolución","Depuración de problemas del sistema de archivos","Monitoreo del uso de disco para una gestión de almacenamiento eficiente"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications de la santé du répertoire d''évolution","Débogage des problèmes de système de fichiers","Surveillance de l''utilisation du disque pour une gestion de stockage efficace"],"de":["Automatisierung von Überprüfungen der Verzeichnisgesundheit","Fehlerbehebung bei Dateisystemproblemen","Überwachung der Plattenplatznutzung für eine effiziente Speicherung"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de saúde do diretório de evolução","Depurar problemas do sistema de arquivos","Monitorar uso de disco para gestão de armazenamento eficiente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки здоровья директории эволюции","Отладить проблемы файловой системы","Мониторить использование диска для эффективного управления хранилищем"],"ar":["أتمتة فحوصات حالة مجلد التطور","تصحيح أخطاء نظام الملفات","مراقبة استخدام القرص لأدارة التخزين الفعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access","Unix-based system required for find and wc commands","Limited to monitoring .aget/evolution directory"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限","需要基于 Unix 的系统来使用 find 和 wc 命令","仅限于监控 .aget/evolution 目录"],"ja":["ファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","find および wc コマンドを使用するには Unix ベースのシステムが必要",".aget/evolution ディレクトリのモニタリングのみ"],"ko":["파일 시스템 접근 권한이 필요합니다.","find 및 wc 명령을 사용하려면 Unix 기반 시스템이 필요합니다.",".aget/evolution 디렉토리 모니터링만 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos","Se requiere un sistema basado en Unix para los comandos find y wc","Limitado a la monitorización del directorio .aget/evolution"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers","Un système basé sur Unix est requis pour les commandes find et wc","Limité à la surveillance du répertoire .aget/evolution"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem","Ein auf Unix basierendes System ist erforderlich für die Kommandos find und wc","Begrenzt auf die Überwachung des Verzeichnisses .aget/evolution"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos","Sistema baseado em Unix necessário para comandos find e wc","Limitado ao monitoramento do diretório .aget/evolution"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к файловой системе","Требуется система на основе Unix для команд find и wc","Ограничен мониторингом директории .aget/evolution"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات","يتطلب نظام قائم على Unix لأوامر find وwc","محدود بمراقبة مجلد .aget/evolution"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"62225f596bebfa5e6aa19d9cc2fdf738236aaf21bb057aece1bfe1c5b54b6cb3","qualityScore":56}');
