lo de soluciones con aget-check-evolution"],"fr":["comment utiliser aget-check-evolution","qu''est-ce qu''un outil d''IA","alternatives à aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution vs d''autres outils d''IA","installation de aget-check-evolution","guide de configuration de aget-check-evolution","développement de solutions avec aget-check-evolution"],"de":["wie man aget-check-evolution verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","alternativen zu aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution vs andere KI-Agenten","installation von aget-check-evolution","einrichtungsanleitung für aget-check-evolution","entwicklung von lösungen mit aget-check-evolution"],"pt":["como usar aget-check-evolution","o que é aget-check-evolution","aget-check-evolution alternative","aget-check-evolution vs outros","instalar aget-check-evolution","guia de configuração do aget-check-evolution","ferramentas de IA para consultores","recomendações baseadas em evidências"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент aget-check-evolution","что такое ИИ Агент aget-check-evolution","ИИ Агент aget-check-evolution альтернатива","ИИ Агент aget-check-evolution vs другие","установить ИИ Агент aget-check-evolution","руководство по настройке ИИ Агент aget-check-evolution","ИИ Агенты для консультантов","рекомендации на основе доказательств"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي aget-check-evolution","ما هي أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي aget-check-evolution","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي aget-check-evolution بديلة","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي aget-check-evolution مقابل الأخرى","تثبيت أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي aget-check-evolution","دليل إعداد أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي aget-check-evolution","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للاستشاريين","توصيات قائمة على الأدلة"]}},"owner":"aget-framework","repo":"template-consultant-aget","repoPath":"aget-framework/template-consultant-aget","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T08:25:24.796Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aget-check-evolution","description":"Monitor .aget/evolution/ directory health. Validates file counts, naming conventions, disk usage, and returns health status with alerts on anomalies.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# /aget-check-evolution\n\nMonitor the health of the `.aget/evolution/` directory by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents to assess their evolution directory health without supervisor intervention.\n\n## Execution\n\nWhen invoked, perform these checks:\n\n### 1. File Inventory\n\n```bash\n# Count total files\nfind .aget/evolution -type f | wc -l\n\n# Count by extension\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.md\" | wc -l","body":"# /aget-check-evolution\n\nMonitor the health of the `.aget/evolution/` directory by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents to assess their evolution directory health without supervisor intervention.\n\n## Execution\n\nWhen invoked, perform these checks:\n\n### 1. File Inventory\n\n```bash\n# Count total files\nfind .aget/evolution -type f | wc -l\n\n# Count by extension\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.md\" | wc -l\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.json\" | wc -l\nfind .aget/evolution -type f ! -name \"*.md\" ! -name \"*.json\" | wc -l\n```\n\n### 2. Naming Convention Check\n\nValid L-doc pattern: `L###_*.md` (e.g., `L588_skill_invocation_control_semantics.md`)\n\n```bash\n# Count valid L-doc names\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"L[0-9][0-9][0-9]_*.md\" | wc -l\n\n# Find non-conforming files (excluding index.json)\nfind .aget/evolution -type f ! -name \"L[0-9][0-9][0-9]_*.md\" ! -name \"index.json\" ! -name \"README.md\"\n```\n\n### 3. Disk Usage\n\n```bash\ndu -sh .aget/evolution\n```\n\n### 4. Index Integrity\n\nCheck that `index.json` exists and is valid JSON:\n\n```bash\ntest -f .aget/evolution/index.json && jq empty .aget/evolution/index.json 2>/dev/null && echo \"valid\" || echo \"invalid\"\n```\n\n## Thresholds\n\n| Metric | OK | WARN | CRITICAL |\n|--------|-----|------|----------|\n| Total files | <500 | 500-750 | >750 |\n| Non-standard files | 0-10 | 11-50 | >50 |\n| Disk size | <10MB | 10-25MB | >25MB |\n| Index integrity | valid | - | invalid |\n\n**Note**: Thresholds inherited from supervisor defaults. Research AGET baseline (2026-02-08): 94 files, 800K - well within OK range.\n\n## Output Format\n\nReport the following:\n\n```\n=== /aget-check-evolution ===\n\nDirectory: .aget/evolution/\n\nFile Counts:\n  Total:     [count]\n  L-docs:    [count] (.md matching L###_*.md)\n  Index:     [1 if exists, 0 otherwise]\n  Other:     [count] (non-conforming)\n\nDisk Usage: [size]\n\nIndex Status: [valid/invalid/missing]\n\nNon-Conforming Files:\n  [list any files not matching expected patterns]\n\nHealth Status: [OK | WARN | CRITICAL]\nAlerts:\n  [list any threshold violations]\n```\n\n## Health Status Logic\n\n```\nIF index invalid OR index missing:\n  CRITICAL\nELIF total_files > 750 OR disk > 25MB OR non_standard > 50:\n  CRITICAL\nELIF total_files > 500 OR disk > 10MB OR non_standard > 10:\n  WARN\nELSE:\n  OK\n```\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **C1**: Read-only operation. Never modify files.\n- **C2**: Report ALL findings, even if status is OK.\n- **C3**: List non-conforming files by name for actionability.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `/aget-check-sessions` - Sessions directory health\n- `/aget-check-kb` - Knowledge base health\n- `/aget-record-lesson` - Capture findings as L-docs\n\n## Traceability\n\n| Link | Reference |\n|------|-----------|\n| POC | POC-017 |\n| Project | PROJECT_PLAN_AGET_UNIVERSAL_SKILLS.md |\n| Source | Fleet Skill Deployment Report (supervisor) |\n| Baseline | 94 files, 800K (2026-02-08) |\n\n---\n\n*aget-check-evolution v1.0.0*\n*Category: Monitoring*\n*POC-017 Phase 1*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T12:44:55.690Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring self-diagnostic capabilities to monitor their evolution directory health.","zh":"适用于需要自诊断能力来监控其进化目录健康的自主代理。","ja":"進化ディレクトリのヘルスを監視するための自己診断機能を必要とする自律エージェントに適しています。","ko":"진화 디렉토리의 상태를 모니터링하기 위한 자기 진단 기능이 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requieren capacidades de autodiagnóstico para monitorear la salud del directorio de evolución.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Autonomes nécessitant des capacités d''auto-diagnostique pour surveiller la santé du répertoire d''évolution.","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die Selbstdiagnosefunktionen benötigen, um die Gesundheit des Evolution-Verzeichnisses zu überwachen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que requerem capacidades de autodiagnóstico para monitorar a saúde do diretório de evolução.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, требующих возможностей само диагностики для мониторинга здоровья каталога эволюции.","ar":"مثالي لعميل tựономي يحتاج إلى قدرات التشخيص الذاتي لتتبع صحة دليل التطور."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform file inventory checks, including total file counts, extension-specific counts, and disk usage analysis, ensuring the `.aget/evolution/` directory remains organized and healthy, utilizing bash commands like `find` and `wc` for precise diagnostics.","zh":"赋予代理执行文件清单检查的能力，包括总文件数、特定扩展名的文件数以及磁盘使用情况分析，确保 `.aget/evolution/` 目录保持有序和健康，利用像 `find` 和 `wc` 的 bash 命令进行精确的诊断。","ja":"エージェントにファイルのインベントリのチェックを実行する機能を付与し、合計ファイル数、拡張子ごとのファイル数、およびディスク使用状況の分析を含む `.aget/evolution/` ディレクトリが整理され、ヘルスに保たれることを保証する。`find` および `wc` などの bash コマンドを使用して、正確な診断を実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 파일 인벤토리 체크를 수행할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여, 총 파일 수, 확장자별 파일 수 및 디스크 사용량 분석을 포함하여 `.aget/evolution/` 디렉토리가 조직적이고 건강한 상태를 유지하도록 보장합니다. `find` 및 `wc`와 같은 bash 명령을 사용하여 정확한 진단을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar comprobaciones de inventario de archivos, incluyendo recuentos de archivos totales, recuentos específicos de extensiones y análisis de uso de disco, garantizando que el directorio `.aget/evolution/` permanezca organizado y saludable, utilizando comandos bash como `find` y `wc` para diagnósticos precisos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des vérifications d''inventaire de fichiers, incluant des décomptes de fichiers totaux, des décomptes spécifiques d''extensions et une analyse d''utilisation de disque, garantissant que le répertoire `.aget/evolution/` reste organisé et sain, en utilisant des commandes bash comme `find` et `wc` pour des diagnostics précis.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Dateiinventar-Prüfungen durchzuführen, einschließlich Gesamtdateizählungen, erweiterungsspezifischer Zählungen und Analyse der Festplattennutzung, um sicherzustellen, dass das Verzeichnis `.aget/evolution/` organisiert und gesund bleibt, unter Verwendung von bash-Befehlen wie `find` und `wc` für präzise Diagnosen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes realizem verificações de inventário de arquivos, incluindo contagens totais de arquivos, contagens específicas de extensões e análise de uso de disco, garantindo que o diretório `.aget/evolution/` permaneça organizado e saudável, utilizando comandos bash como `find` e `wc` para diagnósticos precisos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять проверки инвентаризации файлов, включая общее количество файлов, количество файлов с определенным расширением и анализ использования диска, обеспечивая организованность и здоровье каталога `.aget/evolution/`, используя команды bash seperti `find` и `wc` для точной диагностики.","ar":"يمكن للعميل من أداء فحص المخزون الملفات ، بما في ذلك إحصائيات الملفات الكلية و إحصائيات الملفات المحددة بإمتداد معين و تحليل استخدام القرص ، مما يضمن أن يبقى دليل `.aget/evolution/` منظم و صحي ، باستخدام أوامر bash مثل `find` و `wc` لأداء تشخيص دقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring file system health","Automating directory maintenance","Debugging evolution directory issues"],"zh":["文件系统健康状况监控","目录维护自动化","进化目录问题调试"],"ja":["ファイルシステムのヘルス状態の監視","ディレクトリのメンテナンスの自動化","進化ディレクトリの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["파일 시스템 상태 모니터링","디렉토리 유지보수 자동화","진화 디렉토리 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Monitoreo de la salud del sistema de archivos","Automatización del mantenimiento del directorio","Depuración de problemas del directorio de evolución"],"fr":["Surveillance de la santé du système de fichiers","Automatisation de la maintenance du répertoire","Débogage des problèmes du répertoire d''évolution"],"de":["Überwachung der Gesundheit des Dateisystems","Automatisierung der Verzeichnispflege","Fehlerbehebung bei Problemen im Evolution-Verzeichnis"],"pt":["Monitorar a saúde do sistema de arquivos","Automatizar a manutenção do diretório","Depurar problemas do diretório de evolução"],"ru":["Мониторинг здоровья файловой системы","Автоматизация обслуживания каталога","Отладка проблем каталога эволюции"],"ar":["مراقبة صحة نظام الملفات","تأتمة صيانة الدليل","تصحيح أخطاء دليل التطور"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to monitoring the `.aget/evolution/` directory","Dependent on bash command availability"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限","仅限于监控 `.aget/evolution/` 目录","依赖于 bash 命令的可用性"],"ja":["ファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","`.aget/evolution/` ディレクトリの監視のみ","bash コマンドの可用性に依存"],"ko":["파일 시스템 액세스가 필요합니다.",".aget/evolution/ 디렉토리 모니터링만 가능","bash 명령어 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos","Limitado a la supervisión del directorio `.aget/evolution/`","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de comandos bash"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers","Limité à la surveillance du répertoire `.aget/evolution/`","Dépendant de la disponibilité des commandes bash"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem","Begrenzt auf die Überwachung des Verzeichnisses `.aget/evolution/`","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit von bash-Befehlen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos","Limitado ao monitoramento do diretório `.aget/evolution/`","Dependente da disponibilidade de comandos bash"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе","Ограничен мониторингом каталога `.aget/evolution/`","Зависит от наличия команд bash"],"ar":["يتطلب وصولاً إلى نظام الملفات","محدود بمراقبة دليل `.aget/evolution/`","يعتمد على توافر أوامر bash"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"62225f596bebfa5e6aa19d9cc2fdf738236aaf21bb057aece1bfe1c5b54b6cb3","qualityScore":56}');
