a para despliegue","Respuesta a incidentes","Extiende el arquetipo Worker","Ideal para desarrolladores","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Flexibilidad y personalización"],"fr":["Modèle opérationnel pour le déploiement","Réponse aux incidents","Étend l''archétype Worker","Idéal pour les développeurs","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Flexibilité et personnalisation"],"de":["Operatives Template für die Bereitstellung","Reagieren auf Zwischenfälle","Erweitert das Worker-Archetyp","Ideal für Entwickler","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Flexibilität und Anpassung"],"pt":["Melhoria da estratégia de desenvolvimento","Extensão do arquétipo de Worker","Ferramentas de AI para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Улучшение стратегии разработки","Расширение архетипа Worker","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков"],"ar":["تحسين استراتيجية التطوير","تمديد αρχيتيكتور Worker","أدوات إدارة الأجازات لل開発"]},"keywords":{"zh":["aget-check-evolution教程","AI智能代理是什么","Worker原型扩展","部署管理工具","事件响应最佳实践","aget-check-evolution安装","aget-check-evolution替代品"],"ja":["aget-check-evolutionチュートリアル","AIエージェントとは","Workerアーキタイプ拡張","デプロイ管理ツール","インシデントレスポンスベストプラクティス","aget-check-evolutionインストール","aget-check-evolutionの代替"],"ko":["aget-check-evolution 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트란","Worker 아키타입 확장","배포 관리 도구","인시던트 응답 베스트 프랙티스","aget-check-evolution 설치","aget-check-evolution 대체"],"es":["aget-check-evolution","herramientas de AI","despliegue de software","respuesta a incidentes","arquetipo Worker","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","integración con herramientas de desarrollo","flexibilidad y personalización"],"fr":["aget-check-evolution","outils d''IA","déploiement de logiciels","réponse aux incidents","archétype Worker","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","intégration avec les outils de développement","flexibilité et personnalisation"],"de":["aget-check-evolution","KI-Tools","Bereitstellung von Software","Reagieren auf Zwischenfälle","Worker-Archetyp","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Flexibilität und Anpassung"],"pt":["aget-check-evolution","ferramenta de AI","desenvolvedores","estratégia de desenvolvimento","melhoria da estratégia de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["aget-check-evolution","ИИ Агент","разработчики","стратегия разработки","улучшение стратегии разработки"],"ar":["aget-check-evolution","أداة إدارة الأجازات","مطورين","استراتيجية التطوير","تحسين استراتيجية التطوير"]}},"owner":"aget-framework","repo":"template-operator-aget","repoPath":"aget-framework/template-operator-aget","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T08:25:24.796Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aget-check-evolution","description":"Monitor .aget/evolution/ directory health. Validates file counts, naming conventions, disk usage, and returns health status with alerts on anomalies.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# /aget-check-evolution\n\nMonitor the health of the `.aget/evolution/` directory by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents to assess their evolution directory health without supervisor intervention.\n\n## Execution\n\nWhen invoked, perform these checks:\n\n### 1. File Inventory\n\n```bash\n# Count total files\nfind .aget/evolution -type f | wc -l\n\n# Count by extension\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.md\" | wc -l","body":"# /aget-check-evolution\n\nMonitor the health of the `.aget/evolution/` directory by checking file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide self-diagnostic capability for AGET agents to assess their evolution directory health without supervisor intervention.\n\n## Execution\n\nWhen invoked, perform these checks:\n\n### 1. File Inventory\n\n```bash\n# Count total files\nfind .aget/evolution -type f | wc -l\n\n# Count by extension\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.md\" | wc -l\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"*.json\" | wc -l\nfind .aget/evolution -type f ! -name \"*.md\" ! -name \"*.json\" | wc -l\n```\n\n### 2. Naming Convention Check\n\nValid L-doc pattern: `L###_*.md` (e.g., `L588_skill_invocation_control_semantics.md`)\n\n```bash\n# Count valid L-doc names\nfind .aget/evolution -type f -name \"L[0-9][0-9][0-9]_*.md\" | wc -l\n\n# Find non-conforming files (excluding index.json)\nfind .aget/evolution -type f ! -name \"L[0-9][0-9][0-9]_*.md\" ! -name \"index.json\" ! -name \"README.md\"\n```\n\n### 3. Disk Usage\n\n```bash\ndu -sh .aget/evolution\n```\n\n### 4. Index Integrity\n\nCheck that `index.json` exists and is valid JSON:\n\n```bash\ntest -f .aget/evolution/index.json && jq empty .aget/evolution/index.json 2>/dev/null && echo \"valid\" || echo \"invalid\"\n```\n\n## Thresholds\n\n| Metric | OK | WARN | CRITICAL |\n|--------|-----|------|----------|\n| Total files | <500 | 500-750 | >750 |\n| Non-standard files | 0-10 | 11-50 | >50 |\n| Disk size | <10MB | 10-25MB | >25MB |\n| Index integrity | valid | - | invalid |\n\n**Note**: Thresholds inherited from supervisor defaults. Research AGET baseline (2026-02-08): 94 files, 800K - well within OK range.\n\n## Output Format\n\nReport the following:\n\n```\n=== /aget-check-evolution ===\n\nDirectory: .aget/evolution/\n\nFile Counts:\n  Total:     [count]\n  L-docs:    [count] (.md matching L###_*.md)\n  Index:     [1 if exists, 0 otherwise]\n  Other:     [count] (non-conforming)\n\nDisk Usage: [size]\n\nIndex Status: [valid/invalid/missing]\n\nNon-Conforming Files:\n  [list any files not matching expected patterns]\n\nHealth Status: [OK | WARN | CRITICAL]\nAlerts:\n  [list any threshold violations]\n```\n\n## Health Status Logic\n\n```\nIF index invalid OR index missing:\n  CRITICAL\nELIF total_files > 750 OR disk > 25MB OR non_standard > 50:\n  CRITICAL\nELIF total_files > 500 OR disk > 10MB OR non_standard > 10:\n  WARN\nELSE:\n  OK\n```\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **C1**: Read-only operation. Never modify files.\n- **C2**: Report ALL findings, even if status is OK.\n- **C3**: List non-conforming files by name for actionability.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `/aget-check-sessions` - Sessions directory health\n- `/aget-check-kb` - Knowledge base health\n- `/aget-record-lesson` - Capture findings as L-docs\n\n## Traceability\n\n| Link | Reference |\n|------|-----------|\n| POC | POC-017 |\n| Project | PROJECT_PLAN_AGET_UNIVERSAL_SKILLS.md |\n| Source | Fleet Skill Deployment Report (supervisor) |\n| Baseline | 94 files, 800K (2026-02-08) |\n\n---\n\n*aget-check-evolution v1.0.0*\n*Category: Monitoring*\n*POC-017 Phase 1*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T12:45:22.984Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring self-diagnostic capabilities to monitor their evolution directory health.","zh":"适用于需要自我诊断能力以监控其演进目录健康的自治代理。","ja":"自己診断機能によりエボリューションディレクトリのヘルスを監視する必要がある自律エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자신의 진화 디렉토리 상태를 모니터링하기 위한 자기 진단 기능이 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requieren capacidades de autodiagnóstico para monitorear la salud del directorio de evolución.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Autonomes nécessitant des capacités d''auto-diagnostic pour surveiller la santé du répertoire d''évolution.","de":"Ideal für Autonome Agenten, die Selbstdiagnosefunktionen zur Überwachung der Verzeichnisgesundheit benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que requerem capacidades de autodiagnóstico para monitorar a saúde do diretório de evolução.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, требующих самодиагностических возможностей для мониторинга здоровья директории эволюции.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المستقل الذي يتطلب القدرات التشخيصية الذاتية لمراقبة صحة دليل التطور."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform comprehensive checks on their .aget/evolution directory, including file counts, types, naming conventions, and disk usage, utilizing bash commands like find and wc.","zh":"赋予代理执行对其 .aget/evolution 目录进行全面检查的能力，包括文件数量、类型、命名约定和磁盘使用情况，利用诸如 find 和 wc 的 bash 命令。","ja":"エージェントに、.aget/evolution ディレクトリのファイル数、タイプ、命名規則、およびディスク使用状況を含む包括的なチェックを実行する機能を提供します。find や wc などの bash コマンドを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 .aget/evolution 디렉토리의 파일 수, 유형, 명명 규칙 및 디스크 사용량을 포함한 종합적인 검사를 수행할 수 있도록 하는데, find 및 wc와 같은 bash 명령어를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar controles exhaustivos de su directorio .aget/evolución, incluyendo recuentos de archivos, tipos, convenciones de nomenclatura y uso de disco, utilizando comandos bash como find y wc.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des vérifications complètes de leur répertoire .aget/évolution, y compris les comptes de fichiers, les types, les conventions de nommage et l''utilisation du disque, en utilisant des commandes bash comme find et wc.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, umfassende Prüfungen ihres .aget/Evolutionsverzeichnisses durchzuführen, einschließlich Dateizählungen, Typen, Namenskonventionen und Festplattennutzung, unter Verwendung von bash-Befehlen wie find und wc.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar verificações abrangentes em seu diretório .aget/evolution, incluindo contagem de arquivos, tipos, convenções de nomenclatura e uso de disco, utilizando comandos bash como find e wc.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять комплексные проверки их директории .aget/evolution, включая подсчет файлов, типы, соглашения об именах и использование диска, используя команды bash, такие как find и wc.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إجراء فحوصات شاملة في دليل .aget/evolution، بما في ذلك تعداد الملفات و أنواعها و اتفاقيات التسمية و استخدام القرص، باستخدام أوامر bash مثل find و wc."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring file inventory in the .aget/evolution directory","Debugging disk usage issues within the evolution directory","Validating naming conventions and file types in the evolution directory"],"zh":["监控 .aget/evolution 目录中的文件清单","调试 evolution 目录中的磁盘使用问题","验证 evolution 目录中的命名约定和文件类型"],"ja":[".aget/evolution ディレクトリ内のファイルインベントリの監視","エボリューションディレクトリ内のディスク使用問題のデバッグ","エボリューションディレクトリ内の命名規則とファイルタイプの検証"],"ko":[".aget/evolution 디렉토리 내의 파일 인벤토리 모니터링","진화 디렉토리 내의 디스크 사용 문제 디버깅","진화 디렉토리 내의 명명 규칙 및 파일 유형 검증"],"es":["Monitorear el inventario de archivos en el directorio .aget/evolución","Depurar problemas de uso de disco dentro del directorio de evolución","Validar convenciones de nomenclatura y tipos de archivo en el directorio de evolución"],"fr":["Surveiller l''inventaire des fichiers dans le répertoire .aget/évolution","Déboguer les problèmes d''utilisation du disque à l''intérieur du répertoire d''évolution","Valider les conventions de nommage et les types de fichiers dans le répertoire d''évolution"],"de":["Überwachung des Dateibestands im .aget/Evolutionsverzeichnis","Fehlerbehebung bei Festplattenproblemen innerhalb des Evolutionsverzeichnisses","Validierung von Namenskonventionen und Dateitypen im Evolutionsverzeichnis"],"pt":["Monitorar o inventário de arquivos no diretório .aget/evolution","Depurar problemas de uso de disco dentro do diretório de evolução","Validar convenções de nomenclatura e tipos de arquivos no diretório de evolução"],"ru":["Мониторинг инвентаря файлов в директории .aget/evolution","Отладка проблем с использованием диска внутри директории эволюции","Проверка соглашений об именах и типов файлов в директории эволюции"],"ar":["مراقبة مخزون الملفات في دليل .aget/evolution","تصحيح مشاكل استخدام القرص داخل دليل التطور","التحقق من اتفاقيات التسمية و أنواع الملفات في دليل التطور"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the .aget/evolution directory","Limited to bash-compatible environments","Does not provide automatic repair or optimization capabilities"],"zh":[".aget/evolution 目录的访问权限要求","仅限 bash 兼容环境","不提供自动修复或优化功能"],"ja":[".aget/evolution ディレクトリへのアクセス権の必要性","bash 互換環境のみ","自動修復または最適化機能の提供なし"],"ko":[".aget/evolution 디렉토리への 접근 권한 필요","bash 호환 환경만 해당","자동 수리 또는 최적화 기능 제공 안함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio .aget/evolución","Limitado a entornos compatibles con bash","No proporciona capacidades de reparación o optimización automática"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire .aget/évolution","Limité aux environnements compatibles bash","Ne fournit pas de capacités de réparation ou d''optimisation automatique"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das .aget/Evolutionsverzeichnis","Begrenzt auf bash-kompatible Umgebungen","Bietet keine automatischen Reparatur- oder Optimierungsfunktionen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório .aget/evolution","Limitado a ambientes compatíveis com bash","Não fornece capacidades de reparo ou otimização automáticas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к директории .aget/evolution","Ограничен средами, совместимыми с bash","Не предоставляет автоматические возможности ремонта или оптимизации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى دليل .aget/evolution","محدود بالبيئات المتوافقة مع bash","لا يوفر khảيات إصلاح أو تحسين تلقائي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"62225f596bebfa5e6aa19d9cc2fdf738236aaf21bb057aece1bfe1c5b54b6cb3","qualityScore":56}');
