,"Installation von ArcticDB","Konfigurationsanleitung für review-pr","Datenanalyse mit Python","Data-Science mit ArcticDB"],"pt":["como usar review-pr","o que é review-pr","alternativas para ArcticDB","ArcticDB vs outros bancos de dados","instalar review-pr","guia de configuração do review-pr","análise de dados quantitativos","análise de dados financeiros","ciência de dados com Python"],"ru":["как использовать review-pr","что такое review-pr","альтернативы для ArcticDB","ArcticDB vs другие базы данных","установить review-pr","руководство по настройке review-pr","анализ количественных данных","анализ финансовых данных","наука о данных с Python"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة review-pr","ما هي أداة review-pr","بديلات لأركتيك دي بي","أركتيك دي بي مقابل قواعد بيانات أخرى","تثبيت أداة review-pr","دليل إعداد أداة review-pr","تحليل البيانات الكمية","تحليل البيانات المالية","علوم البيانات مع بايثون"]}},"owner":"man-group","repo":"ArcticDB","repoPath":"man-group/ArcticDB","stars":2190,"forks":165,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T19:50:37Z","topics":["big-data","data","data-analysis","data-science","database","dataframe","pandas","quantitative-analysis","quantitative-finance","quantitative-trading"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-pr","description":"Review a pull request for ArcticDB","bodyPreview":"Perform a thorough code review of an ArcticDB pull request.\n\n## Context variables\n\nWhen invoked from a GitHub Actions workflow the following variables are injected before\nthis prompt: `PR_NUMBER`, `REPO`, `EVENT_ACTION`, `BEFORE_SHA`, `AFTER_SHA`.\nWhen invoked locally as a slash command the PR number is `$ARGUMENTS`\n(e.g. `/review-pr 2933`). If `$ARGUMENTS` is empty, detect from the current branch.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1 — Resolve PR number and repository\n\n```bash\n# If PR_NUMBER is not set and $ARGUMEN","body":"Perform a thorough code review of an ArcticDB pull request.\n\n## Context variables\n\nWhen invoked from a GitHub Actions workflow the following variables are injected before\nthis prompt: `PR_NUMBER`, `REPO`, `EVENT_ACTION`, `BEFORE_SHA`, `AFTER_SHA`.\nWhen invoked locally as a slash command the PR number is `$ARGUMENTS`\n(e.g. `/review-pr 2933`). If `$ARGUMENTS` is empty, detect from the current branch.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1 — Resolve PR number and repository\n\n```bash\n# If PR_NUMBER is not set and $ARGUMENTS is empty, detect from current branch:\ngh pr view --json number -q .number\n\n# If REPO is not set, detect:\ngh repo view --json nameWithOwner -q .nameWithOwner\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 2 — Fetch diffs\n\n**If `EVENT_ACTION` is `synchronize` and both `BEFORE_SHA` and `AFTER_SHA` are set:**\n\nAttempt to produce the delta diff (new commits only):\n\n```bash\ngit fetch --depth=1 origin <BEFORE_SHA>\ngit diff <BEFORE_SHA>..<AFTER_SHA>\n```\n\n- If the delta diff is non-empty, use it as the **delta diff**. Do not fetch the full\n  diff — it is not needed (the existing sticky summary covers the earlier commits).\n- If the fetch fails (e.g. force-push removed `BEFORE_SHA`) or the result is empty,\n  fall back: fetch the full diff and use it for both inline comments and summary.\n\n```bash\ngh pr diff <PR_NUMBER>   # fallback only\n```\n\n**Otherwise** (event is `opened`, `reopened`, `ready_for_review`, or this is a local run):\n\nFetch the full diff and use it as both the full diff and the delta diff:\n\n```bash\ngh pr diff <PR_NUMBER>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 3 — Fetch existing inline review comments and sticky summary\n\nFetch all existing inline review comments (for deduplication):\n\n```bash\ngh api --paginate \"repos/<REPO>/pulls/<PR_NUMBER>/comments\" \\\n  --jq ''[.[] | {path: .path, line: (.line // .original_line), author: .user.login, body: (.body | .[0:300])}]''\n```\n\nAlso fetch the existing sticky summary comment, if any (for incremental updates):\n\n```bash\ngh api \"repos/<REPO>/issues/<PR_NUMBER>/comments\" \\\n  --jq ''[.[] | select(.body | startswith(\"## ArcticDB Code Review Summary\"))] | last | {id: .id, body: .body}''\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 4 — Deduplication rule\n\nBefore posting any inline comment, check the existing comments for an entry with the\nsame `path` and `line`:\n\n- **Human comment exists**: skip the inline comment. Note the finding in the summary\n  checklist if relevant.\n- **Previous Claude comment exists**: skip the inline comment. Ensure the finding is\n  still reflected in the summary checklist.\n- **No existing comment**: post the inline comment normally.\n\n---\n\n## Step 5 — Review outputs\n\n### Inline comments\nPost only on lines present in the **delta diff**, subject to the deduplication rule above.\n\n### Summary checklist\n\n**If `EVENT_ACTION` is `synchronize` and a previous sticky summary exists:**\n\n- Evaluate only the **delta diff** against the guidelines.\n- Read the previous summary checklist.\n- Update individual checklist items that are affected by the delta:\n  - A new commit that **introduces** an issue: change the item to ❌ and add a note.\n  - A new commit that **fixes** a previously flagged issue: change the item to ✅ and\n    note the fix.\n  - Items unaffected by the delta: leave unchanged.\n- Post the amended summary as the updated sticky comment.\n\n**Otherwise** (event is `opened`, `reopened`, `ready_for_review`, or no previous summary):\n\nEvaluate the **full diff** and post a fresh summary checklist.\n\n---\n\n## Step 6 — Load review guidelines\n\nRead the file `docs/claude/PR_REVIEW_GUIDELINES.md` from the repository root using the\nRead tool. Apply all sections relevant to the files changed in the PR. The file also\ncontains the summary checklist format to use when posting the sticky comment.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T12:48:04.146Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced GitHub Actions workflow integration and ArcticDB analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 GitHub Actions 工作流集成和 ArcticDB 分析能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"GitHub Actions ワークフロー統合と ArcticDB 分析機能を必要とするコードレビュー エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 GitHub Actions 워크플로 통합과 ArcticDB 분석 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una integración avanzada de flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions y capacidades de análisis de ArcticDB.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant une intégration avancée de workflow GitHub Actions et des capacités d''analyse ArcticDB.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine erweiterte Integration von GitHub Actions-Workflows und ArcticDB-Analysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de integração avançada do fluxo de trabalho do GitHub Actions e capacidades de análise do ArcticDB.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ревью кода, которым необходима продвинутая интеграция с рабочим процессом GitHub Actions и возможности анализа ArcticDB.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متقدم في سير عمل GitHub Actions وقدرات تحليل ArcticDB."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough code reviews of ArcticDB pull requests using GitHub Actions workflow variables like PR_NUMBER, REPO, and EVENT_ACTION, and provides comprehensive content analysis for Python Data Science ecosystem.","zh":"赋予代理执行 ArcticDB 拉取请求的彻底代码审查的能力，使用 GitHub Actions 工作流变量如 PR_NUMBER、REPO 和 EVENT_ACTION，并为 Python 数据科学生态系统提供全面内容分析。","ja":"ArcticDB のプルリクエストの徹底的なコードレビューを実行するエージェントを可能にし、GitHub Actions ワークフローの変数 such as PR_NUMBER、REPO、EVENT_ACTION を使用し、Python データサイエンスエコシステムの包括的なコンテンツ分析を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 ArcticDB 풀 리퀘스트의 철저한 코드 리뷰를 수행하도록 하며, GitHub Actions 워크플로 변수인 PR_NUMBER, REPO, EVENT_ACTION 등을 사용하며, Python 데이터 과학 에코시스템에 대한 포괄적인 내용 분석을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar revisiones de código exhaustivas de solicitudes de extracción de ArcticDB utilizando variables de flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions como PR_NUMBER, REPO y EVENT_ACTION, y proporciona un análisis de contenido integral para el ecosistema de Data Science de Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des revues de code approfondies des demandes d''extraction ArcticDB en utilisant des variables de workflow GitHub Actions comme PR_NUMBER, REPO et EVENT_ACTION, et fournit une analyse de contenu complète pour l''écosystème Data Science Python.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Code-Reviews von ArcticDB-Pull-Requests durchzuführen, die GitHub Actions-Workflow-Variablen wie PR_NUMBER, REPO und EVENT_ACTION verwenden, und bietet eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse für das Python Data Science-Ökosystem.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar revisões de código aprofundadas de solicitações de pull do ArcticDB usando variáveis de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub Actions como PR_NUMBER, REPO e EVENT_ACTION, e fornece análise de conteúdo abrangente para o ecossistema de Ciência de Dados Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные ревью кода запросов на включение изменений в ArcticDB с использованием переменных рабочего процесса GitHub Actions, таких как PR_NUMBER, REPO и EVENT_ACTION, и предоставляет всесторонний анализ содержимого для экосистемы Науки о данных Python.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إجراء مراجعات شاملة للكود لطلبات السحب من ArcticDB باستخدام متغيرات سير عمل GitHub Actions مثل PR_NUMBER و REPO و EVENT_ACTION، ويقدم تحليل محتوى شامل لمجتمع Python للعلوم البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ArcticDB pull request reviews","Analyzing code changes using BEFORE_SHA and AFTER_SHA","Debugging GitHub Actions workflow issues"],"zh":["自动化 ArcticDB 拉取请求审查","使用 BEFORE_SHA 和 AFTER_SHA 分析代码变更","调试 GitHub Actions 工作流问题"],"ja":["ArcticDB プルリクエストのレビューを自動化する","BEFORE_SHA と AFTER_SHA を使用してコードの変更を分析する","GitHub Actions ワークフローの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["ArcticDB 풀 리퀘스트 리뷰 자동화","BEFORE_SHA 및 AFTER_SHA를 사용하여 코드 변경 분석","GitHub Actions 워크플로우 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de solicitudes de extracción de ArcticDB","Analizar cambios de código utilizando BEFORE_SHA y AFTER_SHA","Depurar problemas de flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions"],"fr":["Automatiser les revues de demandes d''extraction ArcticDB","Analyser les modifications de code à l''aide de BEFORE_SHA et AFTER_SHA","Déboguer les problèmes de workflow GitHub Actions"],"de":["Automatisierung von ArcticDB-Pull-Request-Reviews","Analyse von Code-Änderungen unter Verwendung von BEFORE_SHA und AFTER_SHA","Fehlerbehebung bei GitHub Actions-Workflow-Problemen"],"pt":["Automizar revisões de solicitações de pull do ArcticDB","Analizar alterações de código usando BEFORE_SHA e AFTER_SHA","Depurar problemas do fluxo de trabalho do GitHub Actions"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ревью запросов на включение изменений в ArcticDB","Анализировать изменения кода с использованием BEFORE_SHA и AFTER_SHA","Отлаживать проблемы рабочего процесса GitHub Actions"],"ar":["تحسين مراجعة طلبات السحب من ArcticDB","تحليل تغييرات الكود باستخدام BEFORE_SHA و AFTER_SHA","تصحيح مشاكل سير عمل GitHub Actions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Actions workflow setup","ArcticDB and Python Data Science ecosystem specific","Limited to pull request analysis"],"zh":["需要 GitHub Actions 工作流设置","特定于 ArcticDB 和 Python 数据科学生态系统","仅限于拉取请求分析"],"ja":["GitHub Actions ワークフローの設定が必要","ArcticDB と Python データサイエンスエコシステムに特化","プルリクエスト分析のみ"],"ko":["GitHub Actions 워크플로우 설정이 필요","ArcticDB 및 Python 데이터 과학 에코시스템에 특화됨","풀 리퀘스트 분석만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions","Específico de ArcticDB y ecosistema de Data Science de Python","Limitado al análisis de solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de workflow GitHub Actions","Spécifique à ArcticDB et à l''écosystème Data Science Python","Limité à l''analyse des demandes d''extraction"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub Actions-Workflow-Einrichtung","Spezifisch für ArcticDB und Python Data Science-Ökosystem","Begrenzt auf Pull-Request-Analyse"],"pt":["Exige configuração do fluxo de trabalho do GitHub Actions","Específico para o ecossistema de Ciência de Dados Python e ArcticDB","Limitado à análise de solicitações de pull"],"ru":["Требует настройки рабочего процесса GitHub Actions","Специфичен для экосистемы Науки о данных Python и ArcticDB","Ограничен анализом запросов на включение изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد سير عمل GitHub Actions","محدد لمجتمع Python للعلوم البيانات و ArcticDB","محدود بتحليل طلبات السحب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a5d9a1035857d0faf783feb6df56f5647e41af49b3fe170be0a3b1daf0e517b6","qualityScore":55}');
