senvolvimento","Suporte à comunidade ativo"],"ru":["Сообщество-ориентированная реализация pypto","Повышение эффективности разработки","Высококачественное тестирование программного обеспечения","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Активная поддержка сообщества"],"ar":["تنفيذ pypto المجتمعي","تحسين كفاءة التطوير","اختبار برمجيات عالي الجودة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم مجتمعي نشط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具测试","Pypto实现","自动化测试","Python测试","AI测试框架","如何使用Pypto","Pypto与其他测试工具的比较","Pypto安装和设置"],"ja":["AIエージェントのテスト","Pypto実装","自動化テスト","Pythonテスト","AIテストフレームワーク","Pyptoの使い方","Pyptoと他のテストツールの比較","Pyptoのインストールと設定"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 테스트","Pypto 구현","자동화 테스트","Python 테스트","AI 테스트 프레임워크","Pypto 사용법","Pypto와 다른 테스트 도구의 비교","Pypto 설치와 설정"],"es":["herramientas de testing de AI","implementación pypto","desarrollo de software","pruebas de inteligencia artificial","herramientas de testing personalizables","alternativas a Selenium","guía de instalación de pypto","configuración de testing de AI"],"fr":["outils de testing d''IA","mise en œuvre pypto","développement de logiciels","tests d''intelligence artificielle","outils de testing personnalisables","alternatives à Selenium","guide d''installation de pypto","configuration de testing d''IA"],"de":["AI-Testing-Tools","pypto-Implementierung","Software-Entwicklung","KI-Tests","anpassbare Testing-Tools","Alternativen zu Selenium","Installationsanleitung für pypto","Konfiguration von AI-Testing"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","como usar pypto","o que é teste de software","pypto alternativa","pypto vs unittest","instalar pypto","guia de configuração pypto"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","как использовать pypto","что такое тестирование программного обеспечения","pypto альтернатива","pypto vs unittest","установить pypto","руководство по настройке pypto"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام pypto","ما هو اختبار البرمجيات","pypto بديل","pypto vs unittest","تثبيت pypto","دليل إعداد pypto"]}},"owner":"hw-native-sys","repo":"pypto","repoPath":"hw-native-sys/pypto","stars":17,"forks":25,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T03:55:31Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing","description":"Verify testing coverage and run tests for PyPTO project. Use when running tests, checking test coverage, or when the user asks about testing.","bodyPreview":"# PyPTO Testing Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild and test the PyPTO project to verify code changes haven''t broken anything.\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Read agent instructions at [.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md](.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md)\n2. Invoke Task tool with `subagent_type=\"testing\"` (specialized agent)\n3. Agent will build project and run all tests\n\n## Environment Setup\n\n**If `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` exists**: Source it before testing.\n\n```bash\n[ -f .claude/skills/testing/testing.env ] &","body":"# PyPTO Testing Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild and test the PyPTO project to verify code changes haven''t broken anything.\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Read agent instructions at [.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md](.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md)\n2. Invoke Task tool with `subagent_type=\"testing\"` (specialized agent)\n3. Agent will build project and run all tests\n\n## Environment Setup\n\n**If `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` exists**: Source it before testing.\n\n```bash\n[ -f .claude/skills/testing/testing.env ] && source .claude/skills/testing/testing.env\n```\n\n**If doesn''t exist**: Skip and suggest creating one (see `testing.env.example`).\n\n## Testing Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Activate environment (if testing.env exists)\n[ -f .claude/skills/testing/testing.env ] && source .claude/skills/testing/testing.env\n\n# 2. Build project\ncmake --build build\n\n# 3. Set PYTHONPATH\nexport PYTHONPATH=$(pwd)/python:$PYTHONPATH\n\n# 4. Run tests\npython -m pytest tests/ut/ -v\n```\n\n## Test Commands\n\n```bash\n# Run all tests\npython -m pytest tests/ut/ -v\n\n# Run specific test file\npython -m pytest tests/ut/test_ir_basic.py -v\n\n# Run specific test\npython -m pytest tests/ut/test_ir_basic.py::test_tensor_expr_creation -v\n\n# Run with coverage\npython -m pytest tests/ut/ --cov=pypto_core --cov-report=html\n```\n\n## Test Structure\n\n```text\ntests/ut/\n├── core/          # Core functionality\n├── ir/            # IR (nodes, expressions, operators, parser)\n└── pass/          # Pass manager\n```\n\n## Testing Checklist\n\n- [ ] Project builds without errors\n- [ ] No new compiler warnings\n- [ ] All existing tests pass\n- [ ] New features have tests\n- [ ] Bug fixes have regression tests\n- [ ] Tests in `tests/ut/` (not elsewhere)\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n| ----- | -------- |\n| `ImportError: No module named ''pypto_core''` | `export PYTHONPATH=$(pwd)/python:$PYTHONPATH` |\n| Tests fail after code changes | `cmake --build build` then re-run |\n| Tests in wrong location | Move to `tests/ut/` |\n\n## Output Format\n\n```text\n## Testing Summary\n**Status:** ✅ PASS / ⚠️ WARNINGS / ❌ FAIL\n\n### Build Results\n[Compiler output, warnings/errors]\n\n### Test Results\n- Total: X | Passed: X | Failed: X | Skipped: X\n\n### Failures\n[Failed test details if any]\n\n### Recommendations\n[Actions to fix issues]\n```\n\n## Decision Criteria\n\n| Status | Criteria |\n| ------ | -------- |\n| **PASS** | All tests pass, build succeeds, no new warnings |\n| **WARNINGS** | Tests pass but new warnings or skipped tests |\n| **FAIL** | Build fails or tests fail |\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- Always rebuild before running tests\n- Check both build and test output\n- Look for new warnings even if tests pass\n- Verify new features have corresponding tests\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **`code-review`** - Code review (runs in parallel with testing)\n- **`git-commit`** - Complete commit workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:33:38.466Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing automated testing and validation of PyPTO project changes.","zh":"适合需要自动化测试和验证 PyPTO 项目更改的代码审查代理。","ja":"PyPTO プロジェクトの変更を自動テストおよび検証する必要があるコードレビューエージェントに最適です。","ko":"PyPTO 프로젝트 변경 사항을 자동 테스트 및 검증해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan pruebas y validación automatizadas de cambios en proyectos PyPTO.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Revue de Code nécessitant des tests et une validation automatisés des modifications de projet PyPTO.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die automatisierte Tests und Validierung von PyPTO-Projektänderungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de testes e validação automatizados das alterações do projeto PyPTO.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым необходимы автоматизированное тестирование и проверка изменений проекта PyPTO.","ar":"مثالي لأعضاء وكالات مراجعة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبارات وتنقيح آلي للتغييرات في مشروع PyPTO."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify code integrity by building the PyPTO project and running all tests, utilizing a community-driven implementation and supporting environment setup through `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` files.","zh":"通过构建 PyPTO 项目并运行所有测试，利用社区驱动的实现，并支持通过 `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` 文件设置环境，赋予代理验证代码完整性的能力。","ja":"コミュニティ主導の実装を使用し、`.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` ファイルを介した環境設定をサポートすることで、PyPTO プロジェクトを構築し、すべてのテストを実行することにより、エージェントにコードの完全性を検証する能力を提供します。","ko":"커뮤니티 주도적인 구현을 사용하고 `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` 파일을 통해 환경 설정을 지원하여 PyPTO 프로젝트를 구축하고 모든 테스트를 실행함으로써 에이전트가 코드의 완전성을 검증할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar la integridad del código compilando el proyecto PyPTO y ejecutando todas las pruebas, utilizando una implementación impulsada por la comunidad y admitiendo la configuración del entorno a través de archivos `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier l''intégrité du code en construisant le projet PyPTO et en exécutant tous les tests, en utilisant une mise en œuvre pilotée par la communauté et en prenant en charge la configuration de l''environnement via des fichiers `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Code-Integrität zu überprüfen, indem sie das PyPTO-Projekt erstellen und alle Tests ausführen, wobei eine communitygetriebene Implementierung verwendet wird und die Umgebungssetup über `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env`-Dateien unterstützt wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes verifiquem a integridade do código, construindo o projeto PyPTO e executando todos os testes, utilizando uma implementação impulsionada pela comunidade e suportando a configuração do ambiente por meio de arquivos `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проверять целостность кода, собирая проект PyPTO и запуская все тесты, используя реализацию, управляемую сообществом, и поддерживая настройку окружения через файлы `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التحقق من سلامة الشفرة من خلال بناء مشروع PyPTO وتنفيذ جميع الاختبارات، باستخدام تنفيذ مدعوم من المجتمع ودعم إعداد البيئة عبر ملفات `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PyPTO project testing","Validating code changes","Debugging test failures"],"zh":["自动化 PyPTO 项目测试","验证代码更改","调试测试失败"],"ja":["PyPTO プロジェクトのテストの自動化","コード変更の検証","テストの失敗のデバッグ"],"ko":["PyPTO 프로젝트 테스트 자동화","코드 변경 검증","테스트 실패 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de proyectos PyPTO","Validación de cambios de código","Depuración de fallos de prueba"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de projet PyPTO","Validation des modifications de code","Débogage des échecs de test"],"de":["Automatisierung von PyPTO-Projekttests","Validierung von Codeänderungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Testfehlern"],"pt":["Automatizar testes do projeto PyPTO","Validar alterações de código","Depurar falhas de teste"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование проекта PyPTO","Проверять изменения кода","Отлаживать неудачи тестов"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبارات مشروع PyPTO","التحقق من تغييرات الشفرة","تصحيح اخفاقات الاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md` instructions","PyPTO project dependency","Environment setup through `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` file if present"],"zh":["需要 `.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md` 指令","PyPTO 项目依赖","如果存在则需要通过 `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` 文件设置环境"],"ja":["`.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md` の指示が必要","PyPTO プロジェクトの依存関係","存在する場合は `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` ファイルを介した環境設定が必要"],"ko":["`.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md` 지침이 필요","PyPTO 프로젝트 종속성","존재하는 경우 `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` 파일을 통해 환경 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere instrucciones en `.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md`","Dependencia del proyecto PyPTO","Configuración del entorno a través de un archivo `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` si está presente"],"fr":["Nécessite des instructions dans `.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md`","Dépendance du projet PyPTO","Configuration de l''environnement via un fichier `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` si présent"],"de":["Benötigt Anweisungen in `.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md`","Abhängigkeit vom PyPTO-Projekt","Umgebungssetup über eine `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env`-Datei, wenn vorhanden"],"pt":["Requer instruções em `.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md`","Dependência do projeto PyPTO","Configuração do ambiente por meio de arquivo `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` se presente"],"ru":["Требует инструкций в `.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md`","Зависимость от проекта PyPTO","Настройка окружения через файл `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env`, если он присутствует"],"ar":["يتطلب تعليمات في `.claude/agents/testing/AGENT.md`","اعتماد مشروع PyPTO","إعداد البيئة عبر ملف `.claude/skills/testing/testing.env` إذا كان موجودًا"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5c72eeb8fd9a8bda93e84368ed06c49f661bced0627b55d011957dafd83f0ff9","qualityScore":55}');
