de a personalizar tu entorno de desarrollo con elisp y emacs-configuration","fr":"Configuration d''Emacs pour les développeurs. Apprenez à personnaliser votre environnement de développement avec elisp et emacs-configuration","de":"Emacs-Konfiguration für Entwickler. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Ihre Entwicklungsumgebung mit elisp und emacs-configuration anpassen","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Emacs para melhorar sua eficiência. Configurações avançadas para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Настройте Emacs для повышения своей эффективности. Продвинутые конфигурации для разработчиков.","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد Emacs لتعزيز كفاءتك. إعدادات متقدمة للمطورين.","en":"Emacs config"},"definition":{"en":"Emacs config"},"features":{"zh":["使用elisp语言进行Emacs配置","自定义Emacs编辑器的外观和行为","扩展Emacs的功能和插件","优化Emacs的性能和稳定性","学习Emacs配置的最佳实践"],"ja":["Elisp言語を使用したEmacs設定","Emacsエディタの外観と動作をカスタマイズ","Emacsの機能とプラグインを拡張","Emacsのパフォーマンスと安定性を最適化","Emacs設定のベストプラクティスを学ぶ"],"ko":["elisp 언어를 사용한 Emacs 설정","Emacs 편집기의 외관과 동작을 사용자화","Emacs의 기능과 플러그인을 확장","Emacs의 성능과 안정성을 최적화","Emacs 설정의最佳实践"],"es":["Personalización con elisp","Configuración de emacs-configuration","Mejora de la productividad","Integración con herramientas de AI","Compatibilidad con varios lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["Personnalisation avec elisp","Configuration d''emacs-configuration","Amélioration de la productivité","Intégration avec des outils d''IA","Compatibilité avec plusieurs langages de programmation"],"de":["Anpassung mit elisp","Konfiguration von emacs-configuration","Steigerung der Produktivität","Integration mit KI-Tools","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Configuração avançada do Emacs","Personalização do editor de texto","Melhoria da produtividade com ferramentas de IA","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Otimização do workflow de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Продвинутая настройка Emacs","Настройка текстового редактора","Повышение производительности с помощью ИИ Агентов","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки","Оптимизация рабочего процесса разработки"],"ar":["إعدادات متقدمة لبرنامج Emacs","تخصيص محرر النص","تعزيز الإنتاجية مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير أخرى","تحسين تدفق عمل التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Emacs配置","elisp语言","Emacs编辑器","Emacs设置指南","如何使用Emacs","Emacs与Vim比较","Emacs安装教程","Emacs设置最佳实践"],"ja":["Emacs設定","Elisp言語","Emacsエディタ","Emacs設定ガイド","Emacsの使い方","EmacsとVimの比較","Emacsのインストール方法","Emacs設定のベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Emacs 설정","elisp 언어","Emacs 편집기","Emacs 설정 가이드","Emacs 사용 방법","Emacs와 Vim 비교","Emacs 설치 방법","Emacs 설정의最佳实践"],"es":["cómo configurar emacs","emacs vs vim","guía de configuración de emacs","herramientas de ai para desarrolladores","instalación de emacs","mejores prácticas de configuración de emacs","personalización de emacs con elisp","configuración de emacs para principiantes"],"fr":["comment configurer emacs","emacs vs vim","guide de configuration d''emacs","outils d''ia pour les développeurs","installation d''emacs","meilleures pratiques de configuration d''emacs","personnalisation d''emacs avec elisp","configuration d''emacs pour les débutants"],"de":["wie man emacs konfiguriert","emacs vs vim","anleitung zur konfiguration von emacs","ki-tools für entwickler","installation von emacs","best practices für die konfiguration von emacs","anpassung von emacs mit elisp","konfiguration von emacs für anfänger"],"pt":["como usar o Emacs","o que é Emacs","Emacs alternativa","Emacs vs Vim","instalar Emacs","guia de configuração do Emacs","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","produtividade no desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["как использовать Emacs","что такое Emacs","альтернатива Emacs","Emacs vs Vim","установить Emacs","руководство по настройке Emacs","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","производительность в разработке программного обеспечения"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام برنامج Emacs","ما هو برنامج Emacs","بديل برنامج Emacs","Emacs مقابل Vim","تثبيت برنامج Emacs","دليل إعدادات برنامج Emacs","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","الإنتاجية في تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"conornash","repo":"dot-emacs","repoPath":"conornash/dot-emacs","stars":6,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-01-07T06:44:18Z","topics":["elisp","emacs","emacs-configuration"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"emacs","description":"Interact with a running Emacs instance via MCP. Use this skill when the user asks to interact with Emacs buffers, set up automation, or coordinate between Claude Code and Emacs. Access Elisp documentation directly via (describe-function fn) or (describe-variable var).","bodyPreview":"# Emacs Integration\n\nThe `mcp__emacs__emacs_eval` tool evaluates Emacs Lisp in the running Emacs instance.\n\n## When to Use Emacs vs CLI Tools\n\n**Use Emacs (`emacs_eval`) for:**\n\n1. **Semantic operations** (LSP-aware):\n```elisp\n(eglot-rename \"new_name\")          ; LSP knows scope, not just text\n(xref-find-references \"func\")      ; Understands imports, aliases\n(flymake-diagnostics)              ; Type errors, not just syntax\n(project-find-file)                ; Project-aware file finding\n```\n\n2. *","body":"# Emacs Integration\n\nThe `mcp__emacs__emacs_eval` tool evaluates Emacs Lisp in the running Emacs instance.\n\n## When to Use Emacs vs CLI Tools\n\n**Use Emacs (`emacs_eval`) for:**\n\n1. **Semantic operations** (LSP-aware):\n```elisp\n(eglot-rename \"new_name\")          ; LSP knows scope, not just text\n(xref-find-references \"func\")      ; Understands imports, aliases\n(flymake-diagnostics)              ; Type errors, not just syntax\n(project-find-file)                ; Project-aware file finding\n```\n\n2. **Elisp codebase exploration** (STRONGLY PREFERRED over grep/glob):\n```elisp\n;; Discover symbols matching a pattern\n(apropos-internal \"agent-shell.*hook\" ''boundp)  ; Find variables\n(apropos-internal \"^gptel-make\" ''fboundp)       ; Find functions\n\n;; Get function/variable documentation instantly\n(describe-function ''agent-shell-mcp-server-start)\n(describe-variable ''agent-shell-mode-hook)\n\n;; Check current runtime state\n(agent-shell-mcp-server-running-p)              ; Live state check\n(symbol-value ''some-variable)                   ; Current value\n\n;; Find files\n(directory-files-recursively \"~/.emacs.d\" \"\\\\.el$\")\n```\n\n**Use CLI tools (Bash/Grep) only for:**\n```bash\ngrep -r \"TODO\" --include=\"*.py\" .  # Bulk text search in non-Elisp\nsed -i ''s/old/new/g'' *.py          # Global text replace\nfind . -name \"*.test.js\"           ; File finding by pattern\n```\n\n**Rule of thumb**: For Emacs/Elisp codebases, ALWAYS use `emacs_eval` first. It''s more token-efficient (returns only what you need), provides live runtime state, and understands Elisp semantics. Only fall back to grep/glob for non-Elisp code or bulk text operations.\n\n## Why Elisp is Powerful for Agents\n\n1. **No access control** - Everything is public, agent can modify anything\n2. **Advice system** - Wrap any function without modifying source: `(advice-add ''fn :before #''my-fn)`\n3. **Instant eval** - No compilation step, immediate feedback\n4. **Self-documenting** - `(describe-function ''fn)` at runtime\n5. **Hooks everywhere** - Event-driven observation and intervention\n\n## Documentation Discovery\n\nQuery Emacs directly for any Elisp documentation:\n\n```elisp\n(describe-function ''function-name)\n(describe-variable ''variable-name)\n(apropos \"search-term\")\n```\n\n## Current Context\n\nThe Claude Code session runs in an `agent-shell-mode` buffer. Get context:\n\n```elisp\nmajor-mode                        ; => agent-shell-mode\n(buffer-name)                     ; => \"Claude Code Agent @ project-name\"\n(agent-shell--current-shell)      ; Get the shell object\n```\n\n## Self-Prompting with Timers\n\nSet up a timer to automatically queue a prompt after idle time:\n\n```elisp\n(defvar my-agent-idle-timer nil)\n\n(defun my-agent-idle-prompt ()\n  \"Queue a nudge to the agent after idle timeout.\"\n  (when-let ((shell-buf (get-buffer \"Claude Code Agent @ .emacs.d\")))\n    (with-current-buffer shell-buf\n      ;; Use enqueue - agent-shell-insert errors if agent is busy\n      (agent-shell--enqueue-request\n       :prompt \"Continue working on the current task.\"))))\n\n;; Start: prompt after 15 minutes (900 seconds) of no activity\n(setq my-agent-idle-timer\n      (run-with-idle-timer 900 t #''my-agent-idle-prompt))\n\n;; Stop the timer\n(when my-agent-idle-timer\n  (cancel-timer my-agent-idle-timer)\n  (setq my-agent-idle-timer nil))\n```\n\n**Edge case**: `agent-shell-insert` with `:submit t` returns \"Busy\" or \"Not yet supported\" errors while the agent is processing. Use `agent-shell--enqueue-request` instead - it queues the request to run after the current task completes.\n\n## Queueing Requests\n\nQueue prompts that execute when the agent is no longer busy:\n\n```elisp\n;; Queue a request (runs when current task completes)\n(agent-shell--enqueue-request :prompt \"Next task to do\")\n\n;; Check pending queue\n(with-current-buffer (agent-shell--current-shell)\n  (alist-get :pending-requests agent-shell--state))\n```\n\n## Response Size Limits\n\nLarge return values may exceed the MCP response limit. Strategies:\n\n```elisp\n;; Truncate long strings\n(substring (buffer-string) 0 (min 10000 (length (buffer-string))))\n\n;; Return counts instead of full lists\n(length (buffer-list))\n\n;; Filter before returning\n(seq-take (buffer-list) 10)\n\n;; Write to file, return path\n(with-temp-file \"/tmp/output.txt\"\n  (insert large-content))\n\"/tmp/output.txt\"  ; Return just the path\n```\n\n## Buffer Context Gotcha\n\nEvaluations run in the agent-shell buffer by default. To operate on other buffers:\n\n```elisp\n;; WRONG: operates on agent-shell buffer\n(buffer-string)\n\n;; RIGHT: explicitly target a buffer\n(with-current-buffer \"target-buffer\"\n  (buffer-string))\n\n;; Or use a temp buffer for scratch work\n(with-temp-buffer\n  (insert-file-contents \"/path/to/file\")\n  (buffer-string))\n```\n\n## Periodic Background Tasks\n\nUse `run-at-time` for scheduled operations:\n\n```elisp\n;; Run once after 5 minutes\n(run-at-time 300 nil #''my-function)\n\n;; Run every 60 seconds\n(run-at-time t 60 #''my-repeating-function)\n\n;; Cancel a timer\n(cancel-timer timer-object)\n```\n\n## Coordinating Multiple Agents\n\nIf multiple agent-shell sessions exist:\n\n```elisp\n;; List all agent buffers\n(agent-shell-buffers)\n\n;; Get project-specific buffers  \n(agent-shell-project-buffers)\n\n;; Queue request to a specific shell (safe even if busy)\n(with-current-buffer \"Claude Code Agent @ other-project\"\n  (agent-shell--enqueue-request :prompt \"message\"))\n```\n\n## Inspecting Agent State\n\nAccess internal state for debugging or coordination:\n\n```elisp\n(with-current-buffer (agent-shell--current-shell)\n  ;; Available state keys\n  (mapcar #''car agent-shell--state)\n  ;; => (:agent-config :buffer :client :request-count :pending-requests ...)\n  \n  ;; Check request count\n  (alist-get :request-count agent-shell--state)\n  \n  ;; Check if authenticated\n  (alist-get :authenticated agent-shell--state))\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\nErrors return with `isError: true`. To handle gracefully in Elisp:\n\n```elisp\n(condition-case err\n    (potentially-failing-operation)\n  (error (format \"Failed: %s\" (error-message-string err))))\n```\n\n## Event-Driven Agent Behavior (Hooks)\n\nEmacs''s hook system enables event-driven agent behavior:\n\n```elisp\n;; OBSERVE user actions\n(add-hook ''after-save-hook #''agent-on-file-saved)\n(add-hook ''compilation-finish-functions #''agent-on-compile-done)\n(add-hook ''flymake-diagnostic-functions #''agent-on-diagnostics)\n(add-hook ''buffer-list-update-hook #''agent-on-focus-change)\n\n;; INTERVENE at key moments  \n(add-hook ''before-save-hook #''agent-maybe-format)\n(add-hook ''find-file-hook #''agent-setup-buffer)\n\n;; ADVICE any function non-invasively\n(advice-add ''compile :before #''agent-log-compile-command)\n(advice-add ''save-buffer :after #''agent-notify-save)\n```\n\nThis enables proactive assistance without polling - the agent becomes an event-driven observer that reacts to user actions in real-time.\n\n## Key Insight: Dynamic Modification\n\nUnlike static languages, Elisp lets agents modify behavior at runtime:\n\n```elisp\n;; Add logging to ANY function, instantly, no rebuild\n(advice-add ''some-function :before \n  (lambda (&rest args) (message \"Called with: %S\" args)))\n\n;; Remove it just as easily\n(advice-remove ''some-function #''my-advice-fn)\n```\n\nThis is the core advantage over TypeScript/VS Code extensions - no compilation, no packaging, no restart. The agent can experiment and iterate in real-time.\n\n## Repository Structure\n\nThis is a **literate Emacs configuration** using Org-Babel. Assumes Emacs 30+ as baseline.\n\n### Configuration Hierarchy\n\nAll modules are loaded at startup via `org-babel-load-file`:\n\n```\ninit.org (2,288 lines) - MAIN ENTRY POINT\n├── emacs24.helm.org - Helm completion\n├── emacs24.smartparens.org - Structural editing\n├── emacs24.hacky.org - Misc utilities\n├── emacs24.python.org - Python dev\n├── emacs24.eshell.org - Shell with Git prompt\n├── emacs24.ess.org - R/statistics\n├── emacs24.elisp.org - Elisp dev\n├── emacs24.js2.org - JavaScript\n├── emacs24.sql.org - SQL (5 formatters, sqlfluff preferred)\n├── emacs24.scheme.org - Scheme\n├── emacs29.llm.org - LLM/AI integration\n└── private.org - API keys (external, not in repo)\n```\n\nNote: \"emacs24\" naming is historical, not version-specific.\n\n### Key Sections in init.org\n\n| Lines | Purpose |\n|-------|---------|\n| 1-150 | Core setup: GC, keybindings, platform detection, straight.el |\n| 150-450 | Org mode configuration |\n| 374-450 | External module loading |\n| 450-2100 | Language modes, UI, navigation |\n| 2100+ | Themes, finalization, auto-tangle |\n\n### Runtime Data (do not commit)\n\n- `bookmarks` - Emacs bookmark locations\n- `keyfreq` - Key frequency statistics\n- `prompts/` - LLM prompt templates\n- `snippets/` - Yasnippet templates\n- `elpa/`, `straight/repos/` - Package caches\n- `eln-cache/` - Native compilation cache\n\n### Package Management\n\nUses `straight.el` with `use-package` for declarative configuration. ~116 packages configured.\n\n### Known Issues (documented for cleanup)\n\n- **emacs24.eshell.org**: Git status runs shell commands on every keystroke (performance)\n- **emacs24.hacky.org**: `date2unix` defined twice; legacy keyboard macros\n- **emacs24.scheme.org**: xscheme is ancient/unmaintained\n- **emacs24.js2.org**: js2-mode superseded by js-ts-mode\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:36:21.036Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced Emacs Lisp evaluation and LSP-aware operations.","zh":"适合需要高级Emacs Lisp评估和LSP感知操作的代码分析代理。","ja":"Emacs Lispの高度な評価とLSP認識操作が必要なコード分析エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 Emacs Lisp 평가 및 LSP 인식 작동이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan una evaluación avanzada de Emacs Lisp y operaciones conscientes de LSP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant une évaluation avancée d''Emacs Lisp et des opérations conscientes de LSP.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine erweiterte Emacs Lisp-Auswertung und LSP-bewusste Operationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de avaliação avançada de Emacs Lisp e operações cientes de LSP.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа кода, требующих расширенной оценки Emacs Lisp и операций, осведомленных о LSP.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى تقييم متقدم للغة لسب إماس وعمليات متوافقة مع بروتوكول لغة الخادم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform semantic operations using Emacs Lisp, including LSP-aware refactoring, code diagnostics, and project-aware file finding, leveraging tools like eglot and flymake.","zh":"赋予代理使用Emacs Lisp执行语义操作的能力，包括LSP感知重构、代码诊断和项目感知文件查找，利用诸如eglot和flymake的工具。","ja":"Emacs Lispを使用して、LSP認識のリファクタリング、コード診断、プロジェクト認識のファイル検索などのセマンティック操作を実行するエージェントの機能を強化します。eglotやflymakeなどのツールを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Emacs Lisp를 사용하여 의미 분석을 수행하도록 하는데, LSP 인식 리팩토링, 코드 진단 및 프로젝트 인식 파일 찾기 등을 포함하며, eglot 및 flymake와 같은 툴을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar operaciones semánticas utilizando Emacs Lisp, incluyendo refactorización consciente de LSP, diagnósticos de código y búsqueda de archivos consciente del proyecto, aprovechando herramientas como eglot y flymake.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des opérations sémantiques à l''aide d''Emacs Lisp, notamment la refactorisation consciente de LSP, les diagnostics de code et la recherche de fichiers consciente du projet, en exploitant des outils tels que eglot et flymake.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, semantische Operationen mit Emacs Lisp durchzuführen, einschließlich LSP-bewusster Refactorierung, Code-Diagnose und projektbewusster Dateisuche, unter Nutzung von Tools wie eglot und flymake.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar operações semânticas usando Emacs Lisp, incluindo refatoração ciente de LSP, diagnósticos de código e busca de arquivos cientes do projeto, aproveitando ferramentas como eglot e flymake.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять семантические операции с помощью Emacs Lisp, включая рефакторинг, осведомленный о LSP, диагностику кода и поиск файлов, осведомленный о проекте, используя инструменты, такие как eglot и flymake.","ar":"تمكين العميل من إجراء عمليات دلالية باستخدام لغة لسب إماس، بما في ذلك إعادة هيكلة متوافقة مع بروتوكول لغة الخادم، وتشخيص الشفرة، وعمليات البحث عن الملفات التي تدرك المشروع، وتحقيق أدوات مثل إجلوت وفلوميك"},"useCases":{"en":["Renaming variables with LSP-aware scope understanding","Finding references to functions across imports and aliases","Performing project-aware file searches with Emacs"],"zh":["使用LSP感知作用域理解重命名变量","在导入和别名中查找函数的引用","使用Emacs执行项目感知文件搜索"],"ja":["LSP認識のスコープ理解を使用して変数を名前変更する","インポートとエイリアスの間で関数の参照を見つける","Emacsを使用してプロジェクト認識のファイル検索を実行する"],"ko":["LSP 인식 범위 이해를 사용하여 변수를 이름 변경","수입 및 별칭 간에 함수의 참조를 찾기","Emacs를 사용하여 프로젝트 인식 파일 검색을 수행"],"es":["Renombrar variables con comprensión de ámbito consciente de LSP","Encontrar referencias a funciones en importaciones y alias","Realizar búsquedas de archivos conscientes del proyecto con Emacs"],"fr":["Renommer des variables avec une compréhension de la portée consciente de LSP","Trouver des références à des fonctions à travers les importations et les alias","Effectuer des recherches de fichiers conscientes du projet avec Emacs"],"de":["Umbenennen von Variablen mit LSP-bewusstem Verständnis des Gültigkeitsbereichs","Finden von Verweisen auf Funktionen über Importe und Aliase hinweg","Durchführen projektbewusster Dateisuchen mit Emacs"],"pt":["Renomear variáveis com compreensão de escopo ciente de LSP","Encontrar referências a funções em imports e aliases","Realizar buscas de arquivos cientes do projeto com Emacs"],"ru":["Переименование переменных с пониманием области действия, осведомленной о LSP","Поиск ссылок на функции в импортах и псевдонимах","Выполнение поиска файлов, осведомленного о проекте, с помощью Emacs"],"ar":["إعادة تسمية المتغيرات مع فهم نطاق متوافق مع بروتوكول لغة الخادم"," العثور على المراجع إلى الدوال عبر الاستيراد والأسماء المستعارة","إجراء عمليات البحث عن الملفات التي تدرك المشروع مع إماس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires running Emacs instance","Emacs Lisp evaluation only","LSP support required for advanced operations"],"zh":["需要运行Emacs实例","仅Emacs Lisp评估","高级操作需要LSP支持"],"ja":["Emacsのインスタンスを実行する必要がある","Emacs Lispの評価のみ","高度な操作にはLSPのサポートが必要"],"ko":["실행 중인 Emacs 인스턴스가 필요","Emacs Lisp 평가만","고급 작동을 위한 LSP 지원이 필요"],"es":["Requiere una instancia de Emacs en ejecución","Evaluación de Emacs Lisp solo","Se requiere compatibilidad con LSP para operaciones avanzadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une instance d''Emacs en cours d''exécution","Évaluation d''Emacs Lisp uniquement","Prise en charge de LSP requise pour les opérations avancées"],"de":["Benötigt eine laufende Emacs-Instanz","Nur Emacs Lisp-Auswertung","LSP-Unterstützung erforderlich für erweiterte Operationen"],"pt":["Exige uma instância do Emacs em execução","Avaliação de Emacs Lisp apenas","Suporte a LSP necessário para operações avançadas"],"ru":["Требуется запущенная экземпляр Emacs","Оценка только Emacs Lisp","Поддержка LSP необходима для расширенных операций"],"ar":["يتطلب تشغيل مثيل إماس","تقييم لغة لسب إماس فقط","متطلب دعم بروتوكول لغة الخادم للعمليات المتقدمة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a2aa19f26ac9ca66184d4d33337787e7daf7ac1ca871f9fbbf511b9b45806d36","qualityScore":55}');
