","Разработка ИИ Агентов","Улучшение опыта разработки","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких форматов данных"],"ar":["شجرة مهارات Homoiconic","محتوى موجه","تطوير الإيجنت الذكي","تحسين تجربة التطوير","دمج مع أدوات التطوير","دعم متعدد صيغ البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用doc-forms","什么是内容寻址同像技能树","doc-forms替代方案","doc-forms vs 其他AI工具","doc-forms安装指南","doc-forms设置教程"],"ja":["doc-formsの使用方法","コンテンツアドレスト同像スキルツリーとは","doc-formsの代替","doc-forms vs 他のAIツール","doc-formsのインストールガイド","doc-formsの設定方法"],"ko":["doc-forms 사용 방법","콘텐츠 주소 지정 호모아이콘닉 스킬 트리란","doc-forms 대안","doc-forms vs 다른 AI 도구","doc-forms 설치 가이드","doc-forms 설정 방법"],"es":["cómo usar doc-forms","qué es doc-forms","herramientas de AI agente","alternativas a doc-forms","doc-forms vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de doc-forms","guía de configuración de doc-forms"],"fr":["comment utiliser doc-forms","qu''est-ce que doc-forms","outils d''IA agente","alternatives à doc-forms","doc-forms vs autres outils d''IA","installation de doc-forms","guide de configuration de doc-forms"],"de":["wie man doc-forms verwendet","was ist doc-forms","AI-Tools für Agentic AI","Alternativen zu doc-forms","doc-forms vs andere AI-Tools","Installation von doc-forms","Konfigurationsanleitung für doc-forms"],"pt":["como usar doc-forms","o que é doc-forms","ferramentas de AI Agents","alternativas para doc-forms","doc-forms vs outras ferramentas","instalar doc-forms","guia de configuração do doc-forms"],"ru":["как использовать doc-forms","что такое doc-forms","инструменты ИИ Агентов","альтернативы для doc-forms","doc-forms vs другие инструменты","установить doc-forms","руководство по настройке doc-forms"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام doc-forms","ما هي doc-forms","أدوات الإيجنت الذكي","بديل ل doc-forms","doc-forms مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت doc-forms","دليل إعداد doc-forms"]}},"owner":"osoleve","repo":"the-fold","repoPath":"osoleve/the-fold","stars":5,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T20:15:36Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-forms","description":"Reference for The Folds typed comments and doc forms system. Use when adding type annotations, documentation, todos, or other metadata to Scheme code. Covers (doc ...) syntax, standard tags, search commands, and type checker integration.","bodyPreview":"# Doc Forms (Typed Comments)\n\nThe Fold uses `(doc ...)` forms for searchable, introspectable annotations that survive in source code.\n\n## Basic Syntax\n\n### Contextual (belongs to enclosing definition)\n\n```scheme\n(define (add x y)\n  (doc ''type (-> Int Int Int))\n  (doc ''description \"Adds two numbers\")\n  (+ x y))\n```\n\n### Targeted (names what it documents)\n\n```scheme\n(doc factorial ''type (-> Int Int))\n(define (factorial n)\n  (if (= n 0) 1 (* n (factorial (- n 1)))))\n```\n\n## Semantics\n\n| Property |","body":"# Doc Forms (Typed Comments)\n\nThe Fold uses `(doc ...)` forms for searchable, introspectable annotations that survive in source code.\n\n## Basic Syntax\n\n### Contextual (belongs to enclosing definition)\n\n```scheme\n(define (add x y)\n  (doc ''type (-> Int Int Int))\n  (doc ''description \"Adds two numbers\")\n  (+ x y))\n```\n\n### Targeted (names what it documents)\n\n```scheme\n(doc factorial ''type (-> Int Int))\n(define (factorial n)\n  (if (= n 0) 1 (* n (factorial (- n 1)))))\n```\n\n## Semantics\n\n| Property | Behavior |\n|----------|----------|\n| Arguments | NOT evaluated (pure metadata) |\n| Return value | `void` — use in sequences, not value positions |\n| Normalization | Stripped — code with/without docs hashes identically |\n| Extraction | Tooling reads from source (`lf-todo`, `lf-types`) |\n| Type authority | **Authoritative** — `(doc f ''type ...)` takes precedence over inference |\n\n## Standard Tags\n\n| Tag | Purpose | Example |\n|-----|---------|---------|\n| `''type` | Type signature | `(doc ''type (-> Int Int))` |\n| `''description` | Human-readable description | `(doc ''description \"Adds two numbers\")` |\n| `''param` | Parameter documentation | `(doc ''param ''x \"The first operand\")` |\n| `''returns` | Return value description | `(doc ''returns \"The sum\")` |\n| `''todo` | Work to be done | `(doc ''todo \"Optimize for large inputs\")` |\n| `''fixme` | Known issue | `(doc ''fixme \"Edge case with negative numbers\")` |\n| `''deprecated` | Deprecation notice | `(doc ''deprecated \"Use add-safe instead\")` |\n| `''since` | Version introduced | `(doc ''since \"1.2.0\")` |\n| `''see` | Related items | `(doc ''see ''subtract)` |\n| `''note` | Implementation note | `(doc ''note \"Uses memoization internally\")` |\n\n## Search Commands\n\nAfter loading `lattice/meta/docs.ss`:\n\n```scheme\n(lf-todo)           ; Find all todos in codebase\n(lf-types)          ; Find all type annotations\n(docs-for ''symbol)  ; Find docs for specific target\n(doc-stats)         ; Count docs by tag\n```\n\n## Type Checker Integration\n\nDoc type annotations integrate with both the LSP and type inference:\n\n| Component | Behavior |\n|-----------|----------|\n| LSP hover | Shows doc-declared types with highest priority |\n| Type inference | Uses declared types via `lookup-declared-type` in `core/types/infer.ss` |\n| Bridge | `load-doc-types-into-checker!` populates type checker from doc index |\n\n### Example: Declaring Types for Inference\n\n```scheme\n;; The type checker will trust this annotation\n(doc my-complex-fn ''type (-> (List Int) (Maybe Int)))\n(define (my-complex-fn lst)\n  ;; Complex implementation...\n  )\n```\n\n## Todos vs BBS Issues\n\n| Use Case | When to Use |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `(doc ''todo ...)` | Colocated with code, for localized improvements (performance, refactoring, cleanup) |\n| BBS issue | Tracked work items, features, bugs, cross-cutting concerns, things needing scheduling |\n\n**Rule of thumb:** If it needs to be scheduled or tracked across sessions, use BBS. If it''s a note-to-self next to the code, use `(doc ''todo ...)`.\n\n## Examples\n\n### Full Function Documentation\n\n```scheme\n(define (binary-search vec target)\n  (doc ''type (-> (Vector Int) Int (Maybe Int)))\n  (doc ''description \"Binary search for target in sorted vector\")\n  (doc ''param ''vec \"Sorted vector of integers\")\n  (doc ''param ''target \"Value to find\")\n  (doc ''returns \"Index wrapped in Just, or Nothing if not found\")\n  (doc ''todo \"Add bounds checking\")\n  ;; implementation...\n  )\n```\n\n### Deprecation\n\n```scheme\n(doc old-api ''deprecated \"Use new-api instead. Will be removed in 2.0\")\n(define (old-api x) (new-api x))\n```\n\n### Module-Level Documentation\n\n```scheme\n;; At top of file\n(doc ''description \"Matrix operations for linear algebra\")\n(doc ''since \"1.0.0\")\n(doc ''see ''linalg/vec)\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:37:13.430Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced documentation and annotation capabilities for source code introspection.","zh":"非常适合需要高级文档和注释功能的代码分析代理，用于源代码内省。","ja":"コード分析エージェントが高度なドキュメントと注釈機能を必要とする場合に最適です。ソースコードの内省に使用します。","ko":"고급 문서 및 주석 기능이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다. 소스 코드 내省에 사용됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para Code Analysis Agents que necesitan documentación avanzada y capacidades de anotación para introspección de código fuente.","fr":"Parfait pour les Code Analysis Agents nécessitant une documentation avancée et des capacités d''annotation pour introspection de code source.","de":"Perfect für Code Analysis Agents, die fortgeschrittete Dokumentierung und Annotierungs-Fähigkeiten für Code-Quellen-Introspektion benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de documentação e anotação para introspecção de código-fonte.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым необходимы расширенные возможности документации и аннотации для интроспекции исходного кода.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتوثيق وتنقيح الشفرة المصدرية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and manage searchable, introspectable annotations using homoiconic `(doc ...)` forms, enabling comprehensive content analysis and typed comments for improved code understanding and maintainability.","zh":"赋予代理生成和管理可搜索、可内省的注释的能力，使用同像的 `(doc ...)` 形式，实现全面内容分析和类型注释，提高代码理解和可维护性。","ja":"エージェントが検索可能で内省可能な注釈を生成および管理する機能を提供します。同像の `(doc ...)` 形式を使用して、包括的なコンテンツ分析と型注釈を可能にし、コードの理解と保守性を向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 검색 가능하고 내省 가능한 주석을 생성 및 관리할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 동형의 `(doc ...)` 형식을 사용하여 포괄적인 내용 분석과 유형 주석을 가능하게 하며, 코드 이해와 유지 보수성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para generar y gestionar anotaciones de búsqueda, introspectables usando formas homoiconicas `(doc ...)` formas, permitiendo un análisis de contenido completo y comentarios tipados para una mejor comprensión de código y mantenibilidad.","fr":"Empodera a los agentes pour générer et gérer des annotations de recherche, introspectables en utilisant des formes homoiconiques `(doc ...)` formes, permettant un analyse de contenu complet et des commentaires typés pour une meilleure compréhension de code et maintenabilité.","de":"Empodera a los agentes, um searchable, introspectable Annotations zu erstellen und zu verwalten, die homoiconische `(doc ...)` Formen verwenden, was eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und tipierte Kommentare für eine bessere Code-Verständlichkeit und Wartbarkeit ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e gerenciar anotações pesquisáveis e introspectáveis usando formas homoicônicas `(doc ...)` , permitindo uma análise de conteúdo abrangente e comentários tipados para uma melhor compreensão e manutenção do código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и управлять поисковыми, интроспективными аннотациями с использованием гомоиконических форм `(doc ...)` , что позволяет проводить всесторонний анализ содержания и типизированные комментарии для улучшения понимания и поддержки кода.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من توليد وتحديث تعليقات قابلة للبحث والاستعلام باستخدام أشكال Homoiconic `(doc ...)` ، وتمكين تحليل المحتوى الشامل والتعليقات المحددة لنوع للتحسين من فهم الشفرة وصيانتها."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation generation for complex codebases","Creating targeted annotations for specific functions or variables","Introspecting code definitions using contextual `(doc ...)` forms"],"zh":["自动为复杂代码库生成文档","为特定函数或变量创建有针对性的注释","使用上下文 `(doc ...)` 形式内省代码定义"],"ja":["複雑なコードベースのドキュメントを自動生成する","特定の関数または変数にターゲットを絞った注釈を作成する","コンテキスト `(doc ...)` 形式を使用してコード定義を内省する"],"ko":["복잡한 코드베이스에 대한 문서 자동 생성","특정 함수 또는 변수를 위한 목적 주석 생성","컨텍스트 `(doc ...)` 형식을 사용한 코드 정의 내省"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de documentación para codebases complejos","Crear anotaciones dirigidas para funciones o variables específicas","Introspectar definiciones de código usando formas contextuales `(doc ...)`"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de documentations pour des codebases complexes","Créer des annotations ciblées pour des fonctions ou des variables spécifiques","Introspecter des définitions de code en utilisant des formes contextuelles `(doc ...)`"],"de":["Automatisieren der Dokumentengenerierung für komplexe Codebases","Erstellen von zielgerichteten Annotierungen für spezifische Funktionen oder Variablen","Introspektion von Code-Definitionen mithilfe von kontextuellen `(doc ...)` Formen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de documentação para bases de código complexas","Criar anotações direcionadas para funções ou variáveis específicas","Introspecção de definições de código usando formas contextuais `(doc ...)`"],"ru":["Автоматизация генерации документации для сложных баз кода","Создание целевых аннотаций для конкретных функций или переменных","Интроспекция определений кода с помощью контекстных форм `(doc ...)`"],"ar":["AutoSize تلقائي لتوليد توثيق للقواعد المشفرة المعقدة","إنشاء تعليقات موجهة لدوال أو متغيرات محددة","استعلام التعريفات البرمجية باستخدام أشكال `(doc ...)` السياقية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Scheme-like syntax support","Limited to codebases utilizing `(doc ...)` form annotations"],"zh":["需要Scheme样式语法支持","仅限于使用 `(doc ...)` 形式注释的代码库"],"ja":["Schemeスタイルの構文サポートが必要"," `(doc ...)` 形式の注釈を使用するコードベースに限定される"],"ko":["Scheme 스타일 구문 지원이 필요"," `(doc ...)` 형식 주석을 사용하는 코드베이스에 한정"],"es":["Requiere soporte de sintaxis similar a Scheme","Limitado a codebases que utilizan anotaciones de forma `(doc ...)`"],"fr":["Requiert un support de syntaxe similaire à Scheme","Limité aux codebases qui utilisent des annotations de forme `(doc ...)`"],"de":["Erfordert Scheme-ähnliche Syntax-Unterstützung","Eingeschränkt auf Codebases, die Annotations von Form `(doc ...)` verwenden"],"pt":["Exige suporte à sintaxe semelhante ao Scheme","Limitado a bases de código que utilizam anotações da forma `(doc ...)`"],"ru":["Требует поддержки синтаксиса, подобного Scheme","Ограничен для баз кода, использующих аннотации формы `(doc ...)`"],"ar":["يتطلب دعمًا لسلسلة بناء متشابهة لـ Scheme","محدود للقواعد البرمجية التي تستخدم تعليقات الشكل `(doc ...)`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1a88c32acb179e3bcecdd3b28a6985561b1e27f7447091aca1754fd33623ca73","qualityScore":55}');
