wright マイグレーションツール","AIエージェント","自動化テストワークフロー","ProtractorとPlaywrightフレームワーク","Protractor to Playwright マイグレーションツールの使用方法","Protractor to Playwright マイグレーションツールのインストール","Protractor to Playwright マイグレーションツールの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Protractor에서 Playwright로 마이그레이션","AI 에이전트","자동화 테스트 작업 흐름","Protractor와 Playwright 프레임워크","Protractor에서 Playwright로 마이그레이션하는 방법","Protractor에서 Playwright로 마이그레이션 설치","Protractor에서 Playwright로 마이그레이션 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de migración de código","protractor vs playwright","guía de instalación de playwright","cómo migrar de protractor a playwright","mejores prácticas de migración de código","alternativas a protractor","playwright para principiantes","migración de código automatizada"],"fr":["outils de migration de code","protractor vs playwright","guide d''installation de playwright","comment migrer de protractor à playwright","meilleures pratiques de migration de code","alternatives à protractor","playwright pour débutants","migration de code automatisée"],"de":["Code-Migrations-Tools","protractor vs playwright","playwright installieren","wie man von protractor zu playwright migriert","beste praxis für code-migration","alternativen zu protractor","playwright für anfänger","automatisierte code-migration"],"pt":["migração protractor playwright","cli migrador testes e2e","ferramenta ia desenvolvimento","como migrar protractor","playwright vs protractor","automacao testes playwright","instalar protractor migrator","nodejs teste integracao"],"ru":["миграция protractor playwright","cli мигратор e2e тестов","ии инструмент разработки","как мигрировать protractor","playwright vs protractor","автоматизация тестов playwright","установить protractor migrator","nodejs интеграционное тестирование"],"ar":["ترحيل protractor إلى playwright","أداة CLI لاختبارات E2E","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتطوير","كيفية ترحيل protractor","playwright مقابل protractor","أتمتة اختبارات playwright","تثبيت أداة migrator","اختبار تكامل nodejs"]}},"owner":"RoukSonix","repo":"claude-code-octopus","repoPath":"RoukSonix/claude-code-octopus","stars":2,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T14:21:26Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"protractor-playwright-migrator","description":"Migrate Creatio end-to-end tests from legacy Protractor sources into Playwright TestKit-compliant feature folders, or build a full migration plan before implementation. Use when invoked as $protractor-playwright-migrator [protractor-tests-location] [playwright-tests-destination], or when a request includes source and target paths and requires business-logic preservation per test, TestKit-first patterns, gap analysis for missing TestKit components, verification on Creatio via mcp chrome-devtools, and failure debugging using mcp chrome-devtools plus Playwright artifacts from test-results and playwright-report.","bodyPreview":"# Protractor to Playwright Migrator\n\n## Goal\n\nProduce a migration plan (and optionally migration changes) from Protractor to Playwright that matches this repository rules and TestKit conventions.\n\n## Required Inputs\n\nCollect these values from the user request:\n\n- Source directory (Protractor): `ARGUMENT-1`\n- Target directory (Playwright): `ARGUMENT-2`\n- Scope mode: `plan-only` or `plan-and-implement` (default `plan-only`)\n\nIf any input is missing, derive from context and state assumptions explic","body":"# Protractor to Playwright Migrator\n\n## Goal\n\nProduce a migration plan (and optionally migration changes) from Protractor to Playwright that matches this repository rules and TestKit conventions.\n\n## Required Inputs\n\nCollect these values from the user request:\n\n- Source directory (Protractor): `ARGUMENT-1`\n- Target directory (Playwright): `ARGUMENT-2`\n- Scope mode: `plan-only` or `plan-and-implement` (default `plan-only`)\n\nIf any input is missing, derive from context and state assumptions explicitly.\n\n## Non-Negotiable Lookup Order\n\nFollow this order every time:\n\n1. Check TestKit docs first at `node_modules/@creatio/playwright-testkit/dist/docs`.\n2. Check migration rules at `docs/ai-migration/migration-patterns.md`.\n3. Check repository code and `external-source/protractor` only after steps 1-2.\n\nIf TestKit docs are missing/unreadable, stop and report blocker. Recommend `git pull` and `npm install`, then wait for user approval to continue without TestKit docs.\n\n## Required Subagent Orchestration\n\nUse subagents for non-trivial scope.\n\n- Spawn `explorer` 1: TestKit conventions extractor (pages, elements, fixtures, auth, waits).\n- Spawn `explorer` 2: Source inventory and path mapping analyzer for `ARGUMENT-1`.\n- Spawn `explorer` 3: Plan synthesizer that builds phased migration work and verification checkpoints.\n- Spawn `explorer` 4: Business-flow reconnaissance agent that reproduces target user flows in Creatio via `mcp chrome-devtools` and captures behavior notes/evidence.\n\nFor large scopes (more than 10 spec files), split implementation by feature area and assign `worker` subagents with explicit file ownership.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Validate paths.\n- Confirm `ARGUMENT-1` and `ARGUMENT-2` exist or create `ARGUMENT-2` when implementation mode requires it.\n\n2. Build source inventory.\n- Resolve the inventory script path relative to the skill root (do not assume repository `scripts/` and do not require `CODEX_HOME`):\n  - Preferred from skill root: `scripts/build_migration_inventory.py`\n  - Fallback: locate the script in the active CLI''s skills directory\n  - If needed, discover dynamically: `find . -path ''*/skills/protractor-playwright-migrator/scripts/build_migration_inventory.py'' -print -quit`\n- Run `<resolved-script-path> --source <ARGUMENT-1> --target <ARGUMENT-2>`.\n- Do not fail migration planning if `<repo>/scripts/build_migration_inventory.py` is missing; it is not expected to exist there.\n- Group files into `specs`, `pages`, `elements`, `data`, `utils`, `other`.\n\n3. Define target mapping.\n- Place migrated assets under `tests/_migrated/features/<feature>/...`.\n- Keep import boundary: no imports from `tests/_migrated` into `tests/features`.\n\n4. Analyze business logic of every migrated test before translation.\n- Run subagent-driven business-flow reconnaissance in parallel for test groups:\n  - assign `explorer` subagents to reproduce real user flows in Creatio with `mcp chrome-devtools`,\n  - capture screen/state transitions, important controls/markers, role constraints, and expected outcomes,\n  - attach concise evidence references (screenshots or step logs).\n- For each Protractor spec/test case, extract test intent and protected behavior from both code and live app behavior:\n  - business scenario and user role/context,\n  - critical actions and data transitions,\n  - assertions that protect business value.\n- Correlate Protractor assertions with observed application behavior from `mcp chrome-devtools` and resolve mismatches before planning.\n- Build a parity checklist per test: `original intent -> migrated coverage`.\n- Do not drop business assertions during migration; if UI details change, preserve intent with equivalent Playwright/TestKit assertions.\n- If reconnaissance cannot be completed (environment/auth/data blockers), stop and report blockers explicitly with assumptions that require user confirmation.\n\n5. Apply TestKit-first migration rules.\n- Use appropriate base pages (`BaseListPage`, `BaseFormPage`, `Base8xPage`, `Base7xPage`, `BaseSystemDesignerPage`).\n- Prefer TestKit elements and `ElementProps` (`marker` first, then `ariaLabel`, then stable attributes).\n- Use fixture-based auth (`test.use({ userType })`) and avoid routine manual login.\n- Use auto-retrying expectations and avoid hardcoded waits.\n\n6. Perform gap analysis.\n- Identify features not covered by TestKit.\n- Plan implementation of missing custom elements/helpers as part of migration under `elements/` or `utils/`.\n- Prefer reusable abstractions over one-off locators.\n\n7. Build phased migration plan.\n- Include per-file migration actions.\n- Include risk/complexity flags (7.x/extJs, dynamic grids, unsupported elements, brittle selectors).\n- Include required tests and lint/type checks.\n\n8. Define mandatory verification on real app with `mcp chrome-devtools`.\n- Execute affected migrated tests to produce artifacts before deep debug:\n  - `npx playwright test <affected-specs> --trace on`\n- Open Creatio and navigate migrated flow.\n- Validate key user path per migrated spec (open page, perform action, assert visible outcomes).\n- Capture evidence (screenshots and concise pass/fail notes).\n\n9. Debug failed validation runs.\n- If migrated tests fail or are unstable, start with live app exploration in Creatio via `mcp chrome-devtools` as the primary debugging method.\n- Use subagents to reproduce failing flows in parallel when scope is large (split by failing spec group).\n- During debugging, prioritize understanding real runtime behavior first, then correlate with test artifacts.\n- Inspect Playwright artifacts produced after each run:\n  - `test-results/` for traces, screenshots, videos, and per-test artifacts.\n  - `playwright-report/` for HTML run summary and error context.\n- Correlate artifact failures with live UI behavior in `mcp chrome-devtools` and produce:\n  - validated root-cause hypothesis,\n  - minimal fix actions,\n  - re-check steps in application before re-running full tests.\n\n## Output Contract\n\nAlways return:\n\n- Inventory summary with counts by category.\n- File mapping table: `source -> target`.\n- Application reconnaissance summary from `mcp chrome-devtools` (observed flow steps, markers/controls, role constraints, evidence links).\n- Business-logic parity matrix for every migrated test (`Protractor intent -> Playwright assertions`).\n- TestKit compliance checklist.\n- Gap analysis for missing TestKit coverage and implementation tasks.\n- Phased migration plan with execution order and parallel tracks.\n- Verification plan using `mcp chrome-devtools` with explicit steps and expected results.\n- Validation execution summary with exact Playwright command(s) and artifact locations.\n- Failure-debug plan that uses `mcp chrome-devtools` and Playwright artifacts from `test-results/` and `playwright-report/`.\n- Used references list where the first item is a TestKit docs path.\n\nUse `references/migration-plan-template.md` as the default response format.\n\n## Prompt Template\n\nInvoke the skill with positional arguments:\n\n```text\n$protractor-playwright-migrator $ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nWhere:\n\n- `$ARGUMENTS` = `[protractor-tests-location] [playwright-tests-destination]`\n- argument 1 = source directory (Protractor)\n- argument 2 = target directory (Playwright)\n\nDefault user prompt after parsing arguments:\n\n```text\nI need to migrate tests from Protractor to Playwright.\nSource directory: ARGUMENT-1\nTarget directory: ARGUMENT-2\nCreate a migration plan for all tests in this directory.\nIf something is not provided by testkit it should be implemented as part of the migration.\nThe plan must include verification of migrated tests in Creatio using mcp chrome-devtools.\n```\n\n## Context7 Rule\n\nWhen querying external docs for coding details, use Context7 and append `use context7` to the query text.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:23:03.535Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring seamless migration from Protractor to Playwright for enhanced test automation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要从 Protractor 到 Playwright 无缝迁移的自动化代理，用于增强测试自动化能力。","ja":"Protractor から Playwright への無縫な移行を必要とする自動化エージェントに適しています。テスト自動化の機能を強化するために。","ko":"Protractor에서 Playwright로 무중단 마이그레이션이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다. 테스트 자동화 기능을 향상시키기 위해.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que requieren una migración sin problemas de Protractor a Playwright para capacidades de automatización de pruebas mejoradas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant une migration transparente de Protractor à Playwright pour des capacités d''automatisation de tests améliorées.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine reibungslose Migration von Protractor zu Playwright für verbesserte Testautomatisierungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que exigem uma migração sem problemas do Protractor para o Playwright para capacidades de automação de testes aprimoradas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, требующих бесшовной миграции с Protractor на Playwright для улучшения возможностей автоматизации тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التأشير الذين يتطلبون هجرة بدون مشاكل من Protractor إلى Playwright لتعزيز قدرات التأشير الآلي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate migration plans and implement changes from Protractor to Playwright, leveraging TestKit conventions and repository rules, while supporting scope modes like ''plan-only'' and ''plan-and-implement'' with source and target directory specifications.","zh":"赋予代理生成迁移计划和使用 TestKit 约定和仓库规则从 Protractor 到 Playwright 实现更改的能力，同时支持如 ''plan-only'' 和 ''plan-and-implement'' 的范围模式，并指定源和目标目录。","ja":"エージェントに、TestKit の規約とリポジトリ ルールを使用して Protractor から Playwright に移行する計画を生成し、変更を実施する能力を与え、''plan-only'' や ''plan-and-implement'' などのスコープ モードをサポートし、ソースおよびターゲット ディレクトリを指定する。","ko":"에이전트에 TestKit 규약과 저장소 규칙을 사용하여 Protractor에서 Playwright로 마이그레이션하는 계획을 생성하고 변경 사항을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, ''plan-only'' 또는 ''plan-and-implement''와 같은 범위 모드를 지원하고, 소스 및 대상 디렉토리를 지정합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar planes de migración e implementar cambios de Protractor a Playwright, aprovechando las convenciones de TestKit y las reglas del repositorio, al mismo tiempo que admite modos de ámbito como ''plan-only'' y ''plan-and-implement'' con especificaciones de directorios de origen y destino.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des plans de migration et de mettre en œuvre des modifications de Protractor à Playwright, en exploitant les conventions de TestKit et les règles de référentiel, tout en prenant en charge des modes d''étendue tels que ''plan-only'' et ''plan-and-implement'' avec des spécifications de répertoires source et cible.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Migrationspläne zu generieren und Änderungen von Protractor zu Playwright umzusetzen, indem es die TestKit-Konventionen und Repository-Regeln nutzt, während es gleichzeitig Bereichsmodi wie ''plan-only'' und ''plan-and-implement'' mit Quell- und Zielverzeichnisspezifikationen unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar planos de migração e implementar alterações do Protractor para o Playwright, aproveitando convenções do TestKit e regras do repositório, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta modos de escopo como ''plan-only'' e ''plan-and-implement'' com especificações de diretórios de origem e destino.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать планы миграции и вносить изменения с Protractor на Playwright, используя соглашения TestKit и правила репозитория, при этом поддерживая режимы области действия, такие как ''plan-only'' и ''plan-and-implement'', с указанием исходного и целевого каталогов.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتوليد خطط الهجرة وتنفيذ التغييرات من Protractor إلى Playwright، مستفيداً من اتفاقيات TestKit وقواعد المستودع، مع دعم أوضاع نطاق مثل ''plan-only'' و ''plan-and-implement'' مع مواصفات الدليل المصدر والوجهة"},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating existing Protractor test suites to Playwright for improved performance and reliability","Generating migration plans for large-scale test automation projects","Implementing automated test migrations with specified scope modes and directory structures"],"zh":["将现有的 Protractor 测试套件迁移到 Playwright 以提高性能和可靠性","为大规模测试自动化项目生成迁移计划","使用指定的范围模式和目录结构实施自动化测试迁移"],"ja":["既存の Protractor テスト スイートを Playwright に移行してパフォーマンスと信頼性を向上させる","大規模なテスト自動化プロジェクトの移行計画を生成する","指定されたスコープ モードとディレクトリ構造を使用して自動テスト移行を実施する"],"ko":["기존 Protractor 테스트套件을 Playwright로 마이그레이션하여 성능과 신뢰성을 향상시키기","대규모 테스트 자동화 프로젝트에 대한 마이그레이션 계획을 생성하기","지정된 범위 모드와 디렉토리 구조를 사용하여 자동화된 테스트 마이그레이션을 구현하기"],"es":["Migrar suites de pruebas de Protractor existentes a Playwright para mejorar el rendimiento y la confiabilidad","Generar planes de migración para proyectos de automatización de pruebas a gran escala","Implementar migraciones de pruebas automatizadas con modos de ámbito especificados y estructuras de directorios"],"fr":["Migrer les suites de tests Protractor existantes vers Playwright pour améliorer les performances et la fiabilité","Générer des plans de migration pour les projets d''automatisation de tests à grande échelle","Mettre en œuvre des migrations de tests automatisés avec des modes d''étendue spécifiés et des structures de répertoires"],"de":["Bestehende Protractor-Test-Suiten auf Playwright migrieren, um die Leistung und Zuverlässigkeit zu verbessern","Migrationspläne für groß angelegte Testautomatisierungsprojekte generieren","Automatisierte Testmigrationen mit angegebenen Bereichsmodi und Verzeichnisstrukturen implementieren"],"pt":["Migrar conjuntos de testes Protractor existentes para o Playwright para melhorar o desempenho e a confiabilidade","Gerar planos de migração para projetos de automação de testes em grande escala","Implementar migrações de testes automatizados com modos de escopo especificados e estruturas de diretórios"],"ru":["Мигрировать существующие наборы тестов Protractor в Playwright для улучшения производительности и надежности","Генерировать планы миграции для крупномасштабных проектов автоматизации тестирования","Реализовывать автоматические миграции тестов с указанными режимами области действия и структурами каталогов"],"ar":["هجرة مجموعات اختبار Protractor الحالية إلى Playwright لتحسين الأداء والموثوقية","توليد خطط الهجرة لمشاريع التأشير الآلي على نطاق كبير","تنفيذ هجرات اختبار آلية مع أوضاع نطاق محددة وهياكل دليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires source and target directory specifications","Limited to Protractor and Playwright test automation frameworks","Scope mode restricted to ''plan-only'' or ''plan-and-implement''"],"zh":["需要指定源和目标目录","仅限 Protractor 和 Playwright 测试自动化框架","范围模式仅限 ''plan-only'' 或 ''plan-and-implement''"],"ja":["ソースおよびターゲット ディレクトリの指定が必要","Protractor と Playwright のテスト自動化フレームワークのみに限られる","スコープ モードは ''plan-only'' または ''plan-and-implement'' に制限される"],"ko":["소스 및 대상 디렉토리를 지정해야 함","Protractor와 Playwright 테스트 자동화 프레임워크에만 한정됨","범위 모드는 ''plan-only'' 또는 ''plan-and-implement''로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere especificaciones de directorios de origen y destino","Limitado a los marcos de automatización de pruebas Protractor y Playwright","El modo de ámbito está restringido a ''plan-only'' o ''plan-and-implement''"],"fr":["Nécessite des spécifications de répertoires source et cible","Limité aux frameworks d''automatisation de tests Protractor et Playwright","Le mode d''étendue est limité à ''plan-only'' ou ''plan-and-implement''"],"de":["Erfordert Quell- und Zielverzeichnisspezifikationen","Begrenzt auf die Testautomatisierungsframeworks Protractor und Playwright","Der Bereichsmodus ist auf ''plan-only'' oder ''plan-and-implement'' beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige especificações de diretórios de origem e destino","Limitado aos frameworks de automação de testes Protractor e Playwright","Modo de escopo restrito a ''plan-only'' ou ''plan-and-implement''"],"ru":["Требует указания исходного и целевого каталогов","Ограничен только фреймворками автоматизации тестирования Protractor и Playwright","Режим области действия ограничен ''plan-only'' или ''plan-and-implement''"],"ar":["يتطلب مواصفات الدليل المصدر والوجهة","محدود بالإطارات التأشير الآلي Protractor و Playwright","وضع نطاق مقيد بـ ''plan-only'' أو ''plan-and-implement''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6103b7b701ef871cc8db3e54194291a6ac44e3f52c198eff1870fe25d501c720","qualityScore":55}');
