ューと最適化を自動化","ko":"review-pr 기능은 Main-Full-autonomouse-agentic-system의 일부로 자동화된 코드 리뷰와 최적화를 제공","es":"El sistema de Agentes de IA Main-Full-autonomouse-agentic-system permite una revisión de PR automatizada y eficiente","fr":"Le système d''Agents d''IA Main-Full-autonomouse-agentic-system permet une révision de PR automatisée et efficace","de":"Das KI-Agents-System Main-Full-autonomouse-agentic-system ermöglicht eine automatisierte und effiziente PR-Überprüfung","pt":"O review-pr é um sistema autônomo de revisão de código que ajuda a melhorar a qualidade do código","ru":"review-pr - автономная система обзора кода, которая помогает улучшить качество кода - ИИ Агенты","ar":"أداة review-pr هي نظام مراجعة الكود الذكي الذي يساعد على تحسين جودة الكود","en":"Main-Full-autonomouse-agentic-system"},"definition":{"en":"Main-Full-autonomouse-agentic-system"},"features":{"zh":["自动化代码审查","代码优化建议","集成到CI/CD流程","支持多种编程语言","自定义审查规则"],"ja":["コードレビューの自動化","コード最適化の提案","CI/CDワークフローへの統合","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","カスタムレビュールール"],"ko":["자동화된 코드 리뷰","코드 최적화 제안","CI/CD 워크플로에 통합","다수의 프로그래밍 언어 지원","사용자 정의 리뷰 규칙"],"es":["Revisión de PR automatizada","Integración con GitHub y GitLab","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación","Análisis de código y detección de errores","Informes detallados y personalizables"],"fr":["Révision de PR automatisée","Intégration avec GitHub et GitLab","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation","Analyse de code et détection d''erreurs","Rapports détaillés et personnalisables"],"de":["Automatisierte PR-Überprüfung","Integration mit GitHub und GitLab","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Code-Analyse und Fehlererkennung","Detaillierte und anpassbare Berichte"],"pt":["Revisão de código autônoma","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Melhoria da qualidade do código","Análise de código personalizada","Relatórios detalhados"],"ru":["Автономный обзор кода","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Улучшение качества кода","Пользовательский анализ кода","Детальные отчеты - ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود الذكية","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تحسين جودة الكود","تحليل الكود المخصص","تقارير مفصلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","review-pr技能","代码审查工具","代码优化技巧","如何使用review-pr","review-pr替代品","review-pr安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","review-prスキル","コードレビューツール","コード最適化テクニック","review-prの使い方","review-prの代替","review-prのセットアップガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","review-pr 기능","코드 리뷰 도구","코드 최적화 기술","review-pr 사용법","review-pr 대체品","review-pr 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es un Agente de IA","herramientas de revisión de PR","Agentes de IA para desarrolladores","revisión de PR automatizada","integración con GitHub","alternativas a los Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Agents d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un Agent d''IA","outils de révision de PR","Agents d''IA pour les développeurs","révision de PR automatisée","intégration avec GitHub","alternatives aux Agents d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","PR-Überprüfungstools","KI-Agents für Entwickler","automatisierte PR-Überprüfung","Integration mit GitHub","Alternativen zu KI-Agents"],"pt":["ferramenta de revisão de código","sistema autônomo de revisão de código","melhoria da qualidade do código","como usar review-pr","review-pr vs outras ferramentas","instalar review-pr"],"ru":["инструмент обзора кода","автономная система обзора кода - ИИ Агенты","улучшение качества кода","как использовать review-pr","review-pr альтернатива","установить review-pr"],"ar":["أداة مراجعة الكود","نظام مراجعة الكود الذكي","تحسين جودة الكود","كيفية استخدام review-pr","review-pr بديل","تثبيت review-pr"]}},"owner":"Fallenproud","repo":"magmabot","repoPath":"Fallenproud/magmabot","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-12T01:17:56Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-pr","description":"Review-only GitHub pull request analysis with the gh CLI. Use when asked to review a PR, provide structured feedback, or assess readiness to land. Do not merge, push, or make code changes you intend to keep.","bodyPreview":"# Review PR\n\n## Overview\n\nPerform a thorough review-only PR assessment and return a structured recommendation on readiness for /preparepr.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Ask for PR number or URL.\n- If missing, always ask. Never auto-detect from conversation.\n- If ambiguous, ask.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Never push to `main` or `origin/main`, not during review, not ever.\n- Do not run `git push` at all during review. Treat review as read only.\n- Do not stop or kill the gateway. Do not run gateway stop commands. Do not kill p","body":"# Review PR\n\n## Overview\n\nPerform a thorough review-only PR assessment and return a structured recommendation on readiness for /preparepr.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Ask for PR number or URL.\n- If missing, always ask. Never auto-detect from conversation.\n- If ambiguous, ask.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Never push to `main` or `origin/main`, not during review, not ever.\n- Do not run `git push` at all during review. Treat review as read only.\n- Do not stop or kill the gateway. Do not run gateway stop commands. Do not kill processes on port 18792.\n\n## Execution Rule\n\n- Execute the workflow. Do not stop after printing the TODO checklist.\n- If delegating, require the delegate to run commands and capture outputs, not a plan.\n\n## Known Failure Modes\n\n- If you see \"fatal: not a git repository\", you are in the wrong directory. Use `~/openclaw`.\n- Do not stop after printing the checklist. That is not completion.\n\n## Writing Style for Output\n\n- Write casual and direct.\n- Avoid em dashes and en dashes. Use commas or separate sentences.\n\n## Completion Criteria\n\n- Run the commands in the worktree and inspect the PR directly.\n- Produce the structured review sections A through J.\n- Save the full review to `.local/review.md` inside the worktree.\n\n## First: Create a TODO Checklist\n\nCreate a checklist of all review steps, print it, then continue and execute the commands.\n\n## Setup: Use a Worktree\n\nUse an isolated worktree for all review work.\n\n```sh\ncd ~/Development/openclaw\n# Sanity: confirm you are in the repo\ngit rev-parse --show-toplevel\n\nWORKTREE_DIR=\".worktrees/pr-<PR>\"\ngit fetch origin main\n\n# Reuse existing worktree if it exists, otherwise create new\nif [ -d \"$WORKTREE_DIR\" ]; then\n  cd \"$WORKTREE_DIR\"\n  git checkout temp/pr-<PR> 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b temp/pr-<PR>\n  git fetch origin main\n  git reset --hard origin/main\nelse\n  git worktree add \"$WORKTREE_DIR\" -b temp/pr-<PR> origin/main\n  cd \"$WORKTREE_DIR\"\nfi\n\n# Create local scratch space that persists across /reviewpr to /preparepr to /mergepr\nmkdir -p .local\n```\n\nRun all commands inside the worktree directory.\nStart on `origin/main` so you can check for existing implementations before looking at PR code.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Identify PR meta and context\n\n```sh\ngh pr view <PR> --json number,title,state,isDraft,author,baseRefName,headRefName,headRepository,url,body,labels,assignees,reviewRequests,files,additions,deletions --jq ''{number,title,url,state,isDraft,author:.author.login,base:.baseRefName,head:.headRefName,headRepo:.headRepository.nameWithOwner,additions,deletions,files:.files|length,body}''\n```\n\n2. Check if this already exists in main before looking at the PR branch\n\n- Identify the core feature or fix from the PR title and description.\n- Search for existing implementations using keywords from the PR title, changed file paths, and function or component names from the diff.\n\n```sh\n# Use keywords from the PR title and changed files\nrg -n \"<keyword_from_pr_title>\" -S src packages apps ui || true\nrg -n \"<function_or_component_name>\" -S src packages apps ui || true\n\ngit log --oneline --all --grep=\"<keyword_from_pr_title>\" | head -20\n```\n\nIf it already exists, call it out as a BLOCKER or at least IMPORTANT.\n\n3. Claim the PR\n\nAssign yourself so others know someone is reviewing. Skip if the PR looks like spam or is a draft you plan to recommend closing.\n\n```sh\ngh_user=$(gh api user --jq .login)\ngh pr edit <PR> --add-assignee \"$gh_user\"\n```\n\n4. Read the PR description carefully\n\nUse the body from step 1. Summarize goal, scope, and missing context.\n\n5. Read the diff thoroughly\n\nMinimum:\n\n```sh\ngh pr diff <PR>\n```\n\nIf you need full code context locally, fetch the PR head to a local ref and diff it. Do not create a merge commit.\n\n```sh\ngit fetch origin pull/<PR>/head:pr-<PR>\n# Show changes without modifying the working tree\n\ngit diff --stat origin/main..pr-<PR>\ngit diff origin/main..pr-<PR>\n```\n\nIf you want to browse the PR version of files directly, temporarily check out `pr-<PR>` in the worktree. Do not commit or push. Return to `temp/pr-<PR>` and reset to `origin/main` afterward.\n\n```sh\n# Use only if needed\n# git checkout pr-<PR>\n# ...inspect files...\n\ngit checkout temp/pr-<PR>\ngit reset --hard origin/main\n```\n\n6. Validate the change is needed and valuable\n\nBe honest. Call out low value AI slop.\n\n7. Evaluate implementation quality\n\nReview correctness, design, performance, and ergonomics.\n\n8. Perform a security review\n\nAssume OpenClaw subagents run with full disk access, including git, gh, and shell. Check auth, input validation, secrets, dependencies, tool safety, and privacy.\n\n9. Review tests and verification\n\nIdentify what exists, what is missing, and what would be a minimal regression test.\n\n10. Check docs\n\nCheck if the PR touches code with related documentation such as README, docs, inline API docs, or config examples.\n\n- If docs exist for the changed area and the PR does not update them, flag as IMPORTANT.\n- If the PR adds a new feature or config option with no docs, flag as IMPORTANT.\n- If the change is purely internal with no user-facing impact, skip this.\n\n11. Check changelog\n\nCheck if `CHANGELOG.md` exists and whether the PR warrants an entry.\n\n- If the project has a changelog and the PR is user-facing, flag missing entry as IMPORTANT.\n- Leave the change for /preparepr, only flag it here.\n\n12. Answer the key question\n\nDecide if /preparepr can fix issues or the contributor must update the PR.\n\n13. Save findings to the worktree\n\nWrite the full structured review sections A through J to `.local/review.md`.\nCreate or overwrite the file and verify it exists and is non-empty.\n\n```sh\nls -la .local/review.md\nwc -l .local/review.md\n```\n\n14. Output the structured review\n\nProduce a review that matches what you saved to `.local/review.md`.\n\nA) TL;DR recommendation\n\n- One of: READY FOR /preparepr | NEEDS WORK | NEEDS DISCUSSION | NOT USEFUL (CLOSE)\n- 1 to 3 sentences.\n\nB) What changed\n\nC) What is good\n\nD) Security findings\n\nE) Concerns or questions (actionable)\n\n- Numbered list.\n- Mark each item as BLOCKER, IMPORTANT, or NIT.\n- For each, point to file or area and propose a concrete fix.\n\nF) Tests\n\nG) Docs status\n\n- State if related docs are up to date, missing, or not applicable.\n\nH) Changelog\n\n- State if `CHANGELOG.md` needs an entry and which category.\n\nI) Follow ups (optional)\n\nJ) Suggested PR comment (optional)\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Worktree only.\n- Do not delete the worktree after review.\n- Review only, do not merge, do not push.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:25:37.750Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing structured PR assessment and readiness evaluation for /preparepr.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化PR评估和为/preparepr做好准备的代码审查代理","ja":"コードレビューエージェントがSTRUCTURED PR評価と/prepareprの準備を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 구조화된 PR 평가 및 /preparepr 준비 평가를 필요로 할 때 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una evaluación estructurada de PR y evaluación de preparación para /preparepr.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une évaluation structurée de PR et une évaluation de préparation pour /preparepr.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine strukturierte PR-Bewertung und Bereitschaftsbewertung für /preparepr benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de avaliação estruturada de PR e avaliação de prontidão para /preparepr.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым требуется структурированная оценка PR и оценка готовности для /preparepr.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مراجعة الكود التي تحتاج إلى تقييم منظم للتقارير و تقييم الجاهزية لـ /preparepr."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough review-only PR assessments, returning structured recommendations on readiness, while ensuring safety protocols such as never pushing to ''main'' or running ''git push'' during review, and treating the review as read-only, utilizing protocols like git and handling PR numbers or URLs.","zh":"赋予代理执行彻底的仅审查PR评估，返回结构化的就绪建议，同时确保安全协议，例如永远不会将更改推送到''main''或运行''git push'' during review，并将审查视为只读，利用git等协议并处理PR编号或URL","ja":"エージェントが徹底的なレビューのみのPR評価を実行できるようにし、安全性の確保を同時に実現し、''main''または''git push'' during reviewへのプッシュを禁止し、レビューを読み取り専用として扱い、gitなどのプロトコルを利用し、PR番号やURLを処理する","ko":"에이전트가 철저한 리뷰 전용 PR 평가를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 안전 프로토콜을 동시에 보장하고 ''main'' 또는 리뷰 중 ''git push''를 실행하지 않으며, 리뷰를 읽기 전용으로 처리하며, git과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 PR 번호 또는 URL을 처리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar evaluaciones exhaustivas de solo revisión de PR, devolviendo recomendaciones estructuradas sobre la preparación, al mismo tiempo que garantiza protocolos de seguridad como nunca empujar a ''main'' o ejecutar ''git push'' durante la revisión, y tratar la revisión como de solo lectura, utilizando protocolos como git y manejo de números o URLs de PR.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des évaluations approfondies de révision uniquement de PR, renvoyant des recommandations structurées sur la préparation, tout en garantissant des protocoles de sécurité tels que ne jamais pousser vers ''main'' ou exécuter ''git push'' pendant la révision, et en traitant la révision comme en lecture seule, en utilisant des protocoles comme git et en gérant les numéros ou les URLs de PR.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gründliche Review-only-PR-Bewertungen durchzuführen und strukturierte Empfehlungen zur Bereitschaft zurückzugeben, während es gleichzeitig Sicherheitsprotokolle wie nie auf ''main'' zu pushen oder ''git push'' während der Überprüfung auszuführen und die Überprüfung als schreibgeschützt zu behandeln, wobei Protokolle wie git verwendet und PR-Nummern oder -URLs gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a realizar avaliações de PR somente para revisão, retornando recomendações estruturadas sobre prontidão, garantindo protocolos de segurança, como nunca empurrar para ''main'' ou executar ''git push'' durante a revisão, e tratando a revisão como somente leitura, utilizando protocolos como git e lidando com números ou URLs de PR.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные оценки PR только для просмотра, возвращая структурированные рекомендации по готовности, обеспечивая протоколы безопасности, такие как никогда не đẩyивание в ''main'' или запуск ''git push'' во время просмотра, и рассматривая просмотр как только для чтения, используя протоколы, такие как git, и обрабатывая номера или URL-адреса PR.","ar":"تمكين العوامل من إجراء تقييمات شاملة للتقارير من أجل المراجعة فقط، مع إرجاع توصيات منظمات بشأن الجاهزية، مع ضمان بروتوكولات الأمان مثل أبدا دفع إلى ''main'' أو تشغيل ''git push'' أثناء المراجعة، ومعالجة المراجعة على أنها للقراءة فقط، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل git ومعالجة أرقام أو عناوين URL للتقارير."},"useCases":{"en":["Assessing PR readiness for /preparepr","Evaluating code changes in a PR","Providing structured recommendations for PR approval"],"zh":["为/preparepr评估PR就绪性","评估PR中的代码更改","提供结构化的PR批准建议"],"ja":["PRの準備状況を/prepareprで評価する","PR内のコード変更を評価する","PRの承認について構造化された提案を提供する"],"ko":["/preparepr에서 PR 준비 상태 평가","PR의 코드 변경 평가","PR 승인에 대한 구조화된 제안 제공"],"es":["Evaluar la preparación de PR para /preparepr","Evaluar los cambios de código en un PR","Proporcionar recomendaciones estructuradas para la aprobación de PR"],"fr":["Évaluer la préparation de PR pour /preparepr","Évaluer les modifications de code dans un PR","Fournir des recommandations structurées pour l''approbation de PR"],"de":["PR-Bereitschaft für /preparepr bewerten","Code-Änderungen in einem PR bewerten","Strukturierte Empfehlungen für die PR-Genehmigung bereitstellen"],"pt":["Avaliando prontidão de PR para /preparepr","Avaliando alterações de código em uma PR","Fornecendo recomendações estruturadas para aprovação de PR"],"ru":["Оценка готовности PR для /preparepr","Оценка изменений кода в PR","Предоставление структурированных рекомендаций для утверждения PR"],"ar":["تقييم جاهزية التقارير لـ /preparepr","تقييم تغييرات الكود في تقرير","تقديم توصيات منظمات لل批 الأمريكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PR number or URL as input","Never pushes to ''main'' or ''origin/main''","Treats review as read-only, no ''git push'' allowed"],"zh":["需要PR编号或URL作为输入","永远不会将更改推送到''main''或''origin/main''","将审查视为只读，禁止''git push''"],"ja":["PR番号またはURLが入力として必要","''main''または''origin/main''へのプッシュは禁止","レビューは読み取り専用とみなされ、''git push''は許可されない"],"ko":["PR 번호 또는 URL이 입력으로 필요","''main'' 또는 ''origin/main''으로의 푸시를 금지","리뷰를 읽기 전용으로 처리하며 ''git push''를 허용하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere número de PR o URL como entrada","Nunca empuja a ''main'' o ''origin/main''","Trata la revisión como de solo lectura, no se permite ''git push''"],"fr":["Nécessite un numéro de PR ou une URL comme entrée","Ne pousse jamais sur ''main'' ou ''origin/main''","Traite la révision comme en lecture seule, ''git push'' non autorisé"],"de":["Benötigt PR-Nummer oder URL als Eingabe","Pusht nie auf ''main'' oder ''origin/main''","Behandelt die Überprüfung als schreibgeschützt, ''git push'' nicht erlaubt"],"pt":["Requer número ou URL de PR como entrada","Nunca empurra para ''main'' ou ''origin/main''","Trata a revisão como somente leitura, sem ''git push'' permitido"],"ru":["Требует номер или URL-адрес PR в качестве входных данных","Никогда не đẩyивает в ''main'' или ''origin/main''","Рассматривает просмотр как только для чтения, без разрешения ''git push''"],"ar":["يتطلب رقم أو عنوان URL للتقارير كمدخل","أبدا دفع إلى ''main'' أو ''origin/main''","معالجة المراجعة على أنها للقراءة فقط، بدون سماح ''git push''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ed21ddf73747c2ee783476cbe250c6b3effe768a9137ea7d0374bba1c3df9859","qualityScore":55}');
