され、開発者が AI ソリューションを最適化するのに役立ちます","ko":"메트릭 생성기는 AI 에이전트 구현을 평가하고 측정하는 데 사용되며 개발자가 AI 솔루션을 최적화하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El creador de métricas es una herramienta para evaluar y medir la implementación de asistentes de IA","fr":"Le créateur de métriques est un outil pour évaluer et mesurer la mise en œuvre d''outils d''IA","de":"Der Metrik-Ersteller ist ein Tool, um die Implementierung von KI-Agents zu bewerten und zu messen","pt":"Avalie e meça a implementação do seu assistente de IA com metric-creator, uma ferramenta para melhorar o desempenho do seu agente de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты: оцените и измерьте реализацию вашего ИИ Агента с metric-creator, инструментом для улучшения производительности","ar":"قيم وقيّم تنفيذ مساعدك الذكي مع metric-creator، أداة لتحسين أداء وكيلك الذكي","en":"Evaluate & measure your AI assistant''s implementation"},"definition":{"en":"Evaluate & measure your AI assistant''s implementation"},"features":{"zh":["评估 AI 智能工具实施效果","提供详细的性能指标","支持多种 AI 框架","易于使用的界面","实时数据分析"],"ja":["AIエージェントの実装を評価する","詳細なパフォーマンス指標を提供する","複数の AI フレームワークをサポートする","使いやすいインターフェース","リアルタイムデータ分析"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 구현을 평가한다","詳細한 성능 지표를 제공한다","여러 개의 AI 프레임워크를 지원한다","사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스","실시간 데이터 분석"],"es":["Evaluación de la implementación de agentes de IA","Creación de métricas personalizadas","Análisis de rendimiento de los agentes de IA","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como React y Node.js","Compatibilidad con CLI para una implementación más fácil"],"fr":["Évaluation de la mise en œuvre d''outils d''IA","Création de métriques personnalisées","Analyse des performances des outils d''IA","Intégration avec des outils de développement comme React et Node.js","Compatibilité avec CLI pour une mise en œuvre plus facile"],"de":["Bewertung der Implementierung von KI-Agents","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Metriken","Leistungsanalyse von KI-Agents","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js","Kompatibilität mit CLI für eine einfachere Implementierung"],"pt":["Criação de métricas personalizadas para assistentes de IA","Avaliação do desempenho do agente de IA","Integração com plataformas de desenvolvimento de IA","Relatórios detalhados de desempenho","Otimização do desempenho do agente de IA"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских метрик для ИИ Агентов","Оценка производительности ИИ Агента","Интеграция с платформами разработки ИИ","Детальные отчеты о производительности","Оптимизация производительности ИИ Агента"],"ar":["إنشاء مقاييس مخصصة للوكلاء الذكيين","تقييم أداء وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع منصات تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقارير مفصلة عن الأداء","تحسين أداء وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Metric Creator","什么是 AI 智能工具","Metric Creator 替代品","AI 智能工具 vs 传统工具","Metric Creator 安装","Metric Creator 设置指南","AI 智能工具开发","AI 智能工具优化"],"ja":["メトリック作成ツールの使い方","AIエージェントとは","メトリック作成ツールの代替","AIエージェント vs 伝統的なツール","メトリック作成ツールのインストール","メトリック作成ツールの設定ガイド","AIエージェント開発","AIエージェント最適化"],"ko":["메트릭 생성기 사용법","AI 에이전트란","메트릭 생성기 대체","AI 에이전트 vs 전통적인 툴","메트릭 생성기 설치","메트릭 생성기 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발","AI 에이전트 최적화"],"es":["cómo usar el creador de métricas","qué es el creador de métricas","alternativas al creador de métricas","creador de métricas vs competidores","instalación del creador de métricas","guía de configuración del creador de métricas","desarrollo de agentes de IA con Python","integración de agentes de IA con Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser le créateur de métriques","qu''est-ce que le créateur de métriques","alternatives au créateur de métriques","créateur de métriques vs concurrents","installation du créateur de métriques","guide de configuration du créateur de métriques","développement d''outils d''IA avec Python","intégration d''outils d''IA avec Node.js"],"de":["wie man den Metrik-Ersteller verwendet","was ist der Metrik-Ersteller","Alternativen zum Metrik-Ersteller","Metrik-Ersteller vs Wettbewerber","Installation des Metrik-Erstellers","Konfigurationsanleitung für den Metrik-Ersteller","Entwicklung von KI-Agents mit Python","Integration von KI-Agents mit Node.js"],"pt":["como usar metric-creator","o que é metric-creator","alternativas para metric-creator","metric-creator vs outras ferramentas","instalar metric-creator","guia de configuração do metric-creator","desenvolvimento de IA","ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["как использовать metric-creator","что такое metric-creator","альтернативы для metric-creator","metric-creator vs другие инструменты","установить metric-creator","руководство по настройке metric-creator","разработка ИИ","инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام metric-creator","ما هي metric-creator","بديلات لmetric-creator","metric-creator مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت metric-creator","دليل إعداد metric-creator","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Alquimia-ai","repo":"fair-forge","repoPath":"Alquimia-ai/fair-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T16:27:09Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"metric-creator","description":"Create new Fair-Forge metrics with proper structure, schema, tests, and fixtures. Use when adding a new evaluation metric to fair-forge.","bodyPreview":"# Fair-Forge Metric Creator\n\nCreate new metrics for the Fair-Forge AI evaluation library. This skill generates all required files following the established patterns.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/metric-creator [metric-name] [optional description]\n```\n\nExamples:\n```\n/metric-creator safety \"Evaluate AI response safety and harmlessness\"\n/metric-creator coherence \"Measure logical coherence in multi-turn conversations\"\n/metric-creator factuality\n```\n\n## Files to Create\n\nFor a new metric called `{MetricName}`:\n\n|","body":"# Fair-Forge Metric Creator\n\nCreate new metrics for the Fair-Forge AI evaluation library. This skill generates all required files following the established patterns.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/metric-creator [metric-name] [optional description]\n```\n\nExamples:\n```\n/metric-creator safety \"Evaluate AI response safety and harmlessness\"\n/metric-creator coherence \"Measure logical coherence in multi-turn conversations\"\n/metric-creator factuality\n```\n\n## Files to Create\n\nFor a new metric called `{MetricName}`:\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `fair_forge/metrics/{metric_name}.py` | Metric implementation |\n| `fair_forge/schemas/{metric_name}.py` | Pydantic schema for results |\n| `tests/metrics/test_{metric_name}.py` | Unit tests |\n| `tests/fixtures/mock_data.py` | Add `create_{metric_name}_dataset()` |\n| `tests/fixtures/mock_retriever.py` | Add `{MetricName}DatasetRetriever` |\n| `pyproject.toml` | Add optional dependency group |\n| `examples/{metric_name}/jupyter/{metric_name}.ipynb` | Example notebook |\n| `examples/{metric_name}/data/dataset.json` | Sample dataset for examples |\n\n### For LLM-Judge Metrics (additional files)\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `fair_forge/llm/schemas.py` | Add `{MetricName}JudgeOutput` schema |\n| `fair_forge/llm/prompts.py` | Add `{metric_name}_reasoning_system_prompt` |\n| `fair_forge/llm/__init__.py` | Export `{MetricName}JudgeOutput` |\n| `tests/llm/test_schemas.py` | Add `Test{MetricName}JudgeOutput` tests |\n\n## Architecture Pattern\n\nAll metrics follow this pattern:\n\n```\nFairForge (base class)\n    └── YourMetric\n            ├── __init__(): Initialize with retriever and config\n            ├── batch(): Process each conversation batch\n            └── (optional) _process(): Override for custom aggregation\n```\n\n### Data Flow\n\n```\nRetriever.load_dataset() -> list[Dataset]\n    ↓\nFairForge._process() iterates datasets\n    ↓\nYourMetric.batch() processes each conversation\n    ↓\nResults appended to self.metrics\n```\n\n## Step-by-Step Workflow\n\n### 1. Create the Schema\n\nFirst, create the schema in `fair_forge/schemas/{metric_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n\"\"\"{{MetricName}} metric schemas.\"\"\"\n\nfrom .metrics import BaseMetric\n\n\nclass {{MetricName}}Metric(BaseMetric):\n    \"\"\"\n    {{MetricName}} metric for evaluating {{description}}.\n\n    Attributes:\n        qa_id: Unique identifier for the Q&A interaction\n        {{metric_name}}_score: Main evaluation score (0.0-1.0)\n        {{metric_name}}_insight: Explanation of the evaluation\n        # Add additional fields as needed\n    \"\"\"\n\n    qa_id: str\n    {{metric_name}}_score: float\n    {{metric_name}}_insight: str\n    # Add more metric-specific fields\n```\n\n### 2. Create the Metric Implementation\n\nCreate `fair_forge/metrics/{metric_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n\"\"\"{{MetricName}} metric for {{description}}.\"\"\"\n\nfrom fair_forge.core import FairForge, Retriever\nfrom fair_forge.schemas import Batch\nfrom fair_forge.schemas.{{metric_name}} import {{MetricName}}Metric\n\n\nclass {{MetricName}}(FairForge):\n    \"\"\"{{Description}}.\n\n    Args:\n        retriever: Retriever class for loading datasets\n        # Add constructor parameters with defaults\n        **kwargs: Additional arguments passed to FairForge base class\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n        retriever: type[Retriever],\n        # Add your parameters here\n        **kwargs,\n    ):\n        super().__init__(retriever, **kwargs)\n        # Initialize your metric-specific attributes\n\n        self.logger.info(\"--{{METRIC_NAME}} CONFIGURATION--\")\n        # Log configuration for debugging\n\n    def batch(\n        self,\n        session_id: str,\n        context: str,\n        assistant_id: str,\n        batch: list[Batch],\n        language: str | None = \"english\",\n    ):\n        \"\"\"Process a batch of conversations.\n\n        Args:\n            session_id: Unique session identifier\n            context: Context information for the conversation\n            assistant_id: ID of the assistant being evaluated\n            batch: List of Q&A interactions to evaluate\n            language: Language of the conversation\n        \"\"\"\n        for interaction in batch:\n            self.logger.debug(f\"QA ID: {interaction.qa_id}\")\n\n            # Your evaluation logic here\n            score = self._evaluate(interaction)\n\n            metric = {{MetricName}}Metric(\n                session_id=session_id,\n                assistant_id=assistant_id,\n                qa_id=interaction.qa_id,\n                {{metric_name}}_score=score,\n                {{metric_name}}_insight=\"Evaluation explanation\",\n            )\n\n            self.metrics.append(metric)\n\n    def _evaluate(self, interaction: Batch) -> float:\n        \"\"\"Evaluate a single interaction.\n\n        Args:\n            interaction: The Q&A interaction to evaluate\n\n        Returns:\n            Evaluation score between 0.0 and 1.0\n        \"\"\"\n        # Implement your evaluation logic\n        return 0.0\n```\n\n### 3. Update Module Exports\n\nAdd to `fair_forge/metrics/__init__.py`:\n\n```python\n# In __all__ list:\n__all__ = [\n    # ... existing metrics\n    \"{{MetricName}}\",\n]\n\n# In docstring:\n\"\"\"\n    from fair_forge.metrics.{{metric_name}} import {{MetricName}}\n\"\"\"\n```\n\n### 3b. Update pyproject.toml\n\nAdd the metric to the optional dependencies in `pyproject.toml`:\n\n```toml\n[project.optional-dependencies]\n# For LLM-based metrics (no extra dependencies, user installs their LLM provider):\n{{metric_name}} = []\n\n# For data-based metrics with dependencies:\n{{metric_name}} = [\n    \"numpy>=1.24.0\",\n    # Add required dependencies\n]\n\n# Also update the metrics group to include the new metric:\nmetrics = [\n    \"alquimia-fair-forge[context,conversational,bestof,agentic,regulatory,{{metric_name}},humanity,toxicity,bias]\",\n]\n```\n\n### 4. Create Test Fixtures\n\nAdd to `tests/fixtures/mock_data.py`:\n\n```python\ndef create_{{metric_name}}_dataset() -> Dataset:\n    \"\"\"Create a dataset for {{MetricName}} metric testing.\"\"\"\n    return Dataset(\n        session_id=\"{{metric_name}}_session_001\",\n        assistant_id=\"test_assistant\",\n        language=\"english\",\n        context=\"Test context for {{metric_name}} evaluation.\",\n        conversation=[\n            Batch(\n                qa_id=\"{{metric_name}}_qa_001\",\n                query=\"Test query\",\n                assistant=\"Test assistant response\",\n                ground_truth_assistant=\"Expected response\",\n            ),\n            # Add more test interactions\n        ],\n    )\n```\n\nAdd to `tests/fixtures/mock_retriever.py`:\n\n```python\nfrom tests.fixtures.mock_data import create_{{metric_name}}_dataset\n\nclass {{MetricName}}DatasetRetriever(Retriever):\n    \"\"\"Mock retriever for {{MetricName}} metric testing.\"\"\"\n\n    def load_dataset(self) -> list[Dataset]:\n        \"\"\"Return {{metric_name}} testing dataset.\"\"\"\n        return [create_{{metric_name}}_dataset()]\n```\n\n### 5. Update conftest.py\n\nAdd to `tests/conftest.py`:\n\n```python\n# Import in the imports section:\nfrom tests.fixtures.mock_data import create_{{metric_name}}_dataset\nfrom tests.fixtures.mock_retriever import {{MetricName}}DatasetRetriever\n\n# Add fixture:\n@pytest.fixture\ndef {{metric_name}}_dataset() -> Dataset:\n    \"\"\"Fixture providing a {{metric_name}} testing dataset.\"\"\"\n    return create_{{metric_name}}_dataset()\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever() -> type[{{MetricName}}DatasetRetriever]:\n    \"\"\"Fixture providing {{MetricName}}DatasetRetriever class.\"\"\"\n    return {{MetricName}}DatasetRetriever\n```\n\n### 6. Create Tests\n\nCreate `tests/metrics/test_{metric_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Unit tests for {{MetricName}} metric.\"\"\"\n\nfrom fair_forge.metrics.{{metric_name}} import {{MetricName}}\nfrom fair_forge.schemas.{{metric_name}} import {{MetricName}}Metric\n\n\nclass Test{{MetricName}}Metric:\n    \"\"\"Test suite for {{MetricName}} metric.\"\"\"\n\n    def test_initialization(self, {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever):\n        \"\"\"Test that {{MetricName}} metric initializes correctly.\"\"\"\n        metric = {{MetricName}}({{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever)\n        assert metric is not None\n        assert hasattr(metric, \"metrics\")\n        assert metric.metrics == []\n\n    def test_batch_processing(self, {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever, {{metric_name}}_dataset):\n        \"\"\"Test batch processing of interactions.\"\"\"\n        metric = {{MetricName}}({{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever)\n\n        dataset = {{metric_name}}_dataset\n        metric.batch(\n            session_id=dataset.session_id,\n            context=dataset.context,\n            assistant_id=dataset.assistant_id,\n            batch=dataset.conversation,\n            language=dataset.language,\n        )\n\n        assert len(metric.metrics) == len(dataset.conversation)\n\n        for m in metric.metrics:\n            assert isinstance(m, {{MetricName}}Metric)\n            assert hasattr(m, \"{{metric_name}}_score\")\n\n    def test_run_method(self, {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever):\n        \"\"\"Test the run class method.\"\"\"\n        metrics = {{MetricName}}.run({{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever, verbose=False)\n\n        assert isinstance(metrics, list)\n        assert len(metrics) > 0\n\n        for m in metrics:\n            assert isinstance(m, {{MetricName}}Metric)\n\n    def test_verbose_mode(self, {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever):\n        \"\"\"Test that verbose mode works without errors.\"\"\"\n        metrics = {{MetricName}}.run({{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever, verbose=True)\n        assert isinstance(metrics, list)\n\n    def test_metric_attributes(self, {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever):\n        \"\"\"Test that all expected attributes exist in {{MetricName}}Metric.\"\"\"\n        metrics = {{MetricName}}.run({{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever, verbose=False)\n\n        assert len(metrics) > 0\n        m = metrics[0]\n\n        required_attributes = [\n            \"session_id\",\n            \"assistant_id\",\n            \"qa_id\",\n            \"{{metric_name}}_score\",\n            \"{{metric_name}}_insight\",\n        ]\n\n        for attr in required_attributes:\n            assert hasattr(m, attr), f\"Missing attribute: {attr}\"\n```\n\n## Metric Categories\n\n### Simple Metrics (like Humanity)\n- No external dependencies beyond base libraries\n- Process each interaction independently\n- Use lexicons or rule-based evaluation\n\n### LLM-Judge Metrics (like Context, Conversational)\n- Require a `BaseChatModel` parameter\n- Use the `Judge` class from `fair_forge.llm`\n- Need prompt templates in `fair_forge/llm/prompts.py`\n\n### Guardian-Based Metrics (like Bias)\n- Require a `Guardian` class for evaluation\n- Use statistical confidence intervals\n- Need guardian implementations in `fair_forge/guardians/`\n\n### Aggregation Metrics (like BestOf, Agentic)\n- Override `_process()` instead of just `batch()`\n- Compare multiple responses or assistants\n- Return aggregated results\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Using the Judge for LLM Evaluation\n\n```python\nfrom fair_forge.llm import Judge\n\njudge = Judge(\n    model=self.model,\n    use_structured_output=self.use_structured_output,\n    bos_json_clause=self.bos_json_clause,\n    eos_json_clause=self.eos_json_clause,\n)\n\nreasoning, result = judge.check(\n    system_prompt,\n    user_query,\n    data_dict,\n    output_schema=YourOutputSchema,\n)\n```\n\n### Statistical Analysis\n\n```python\nfrom fair_forge.statistical import FrequentistMode, BayesianMode\n\n# For frequentist statistics\nmode = FrequentistMode()\nrate = mode.rate_estimation(successes=k, trials=n)\n\n# For Bayesian statistics\nmode = BayesianMode(mc_samples=5000)\nrate = mode.rate_estimation(successes=k, trials=n)\n```\n\n### Logging Best Practices\n\n```python\n# Use self.logger for all logging\nself.logger.info(\"Processing batch...\")\nself.logger.debug(f\"QA ID: {interaction.qa_id}\")\nself.logger.warning(\"Optional field missing, using default\")\n```\n\n### 7. Create Example Notebook\n\nCreate the example directory structure and files:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p examples/{{metric_name}}/jupyter examples/{{metric_name}}/data\n```\n\nCreate `examples/{{metric_name}}/data/dataset.json` with sample test data:\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"session_id\": \"{{metric_name}}_session_001\",\n    \"assistant_id\": \"test_assistant\",\n    \"language\": \"english\",\n    \"context\": \"Sample context for {{metric_name}} evaluation\",\n    \"conversation\": [\n      {\n        \"qa_id\": \"qa_001\",\n        \"query\": \"Sample user query\",\n        \"assistant\": \"Sample assistant response\",\n        \"ground_truth_assistant\": \"Expected response\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]\n```\n\nCreate `examples/{{metric_name}}/jupyter/{{metric_name}}.ipynb` with:\n\n1. **Title & Introduction** - Explain the metric and use cases\n2. **Installation** - `!pip install \"alquimia-fair-forge[{{metric_name}}]\" langchain-groq -q`\n3. **Setup** - Import modules and configure API keys\n4. **Custom Retriever** - Load the sample dataset\n5. **Configuration** - Any metric-specific parameters (e.g., regulations list)\n6. **Run Metric** - Execute and show results\n7. **Analyze Results** - Display scores and insights\n8. **Export Results** - Save to JSON for reporting\n\n### 8. For LLM-Judge Metrics: Add Judge Output Schema\n\nAdd to `fair_forge/llm/schemas.py`:\n\n```python\nclass {{MetricName}}JudgeOutput(BaseModel):\n    \"\"\"Structured output for {{metric_name}} evaluation.\"\"\"\n\n    {{metric_name}}_score: float = Field(\n        ge=0, le=1, description=\"{{MetricName}} score (0-1)\"\n    )\n    insight: str = Field(description=\"Insight about the evaluation\")\n    # Add metric-specific fields\n```\n\nAdd to `fair_forge/llm/__init__.py`:\n\n```python\nfrom .schemas import (\n    # ... existing exports\n    {{MetricName}}JudgeOutput,\n)\n\n__all__ = [\n    # ... existing exports\n    \"{{MetricName}}JudgeOutput\",\n]\n```\n\nAdd prompt to `fair_forge/llm/prompts.py`:\n\n```python\n{{metric_name}}_reasoning_system_prompt = \"\"\"\nYou are a {{MetricName}} Analyzer. Your role is to evaluate...\n\n1. **Step 1:** ...\n2. **Step 2:** ...\n\n## Input Data:\n{input_field}\n\n## Assistant''s Response:\n{assistant_answer}\n\"\"\"\n```\n\nAdd tests to `tests/llm/test_schemas.py`:\n\n```python\nclass Test{{MetricName}}JudgeOutput:\n    \"\"\"Tests for {{MetricName}}JudgeOutput schema.\"\"\"\n\n    def test_valid_output(self):\n        output = {{MetricName}}JudgeOutput(\n            {{metric_name}}_score=0.85,\n            insight=\"Good evaluation\"\n        )\n        assert output.{{metric_name}}_score == 0.85\n\n    def test_score_bounds(self):\n        with pytest.raises(ValidationError):\n            {{MetricName}}JudgeOutput({{metric_name}}_score=1.5, insight=\"Test\")\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nAfter creating all files, verify:\n\n- [ ] Schema inherits from `BaseMetric`\n- [ ] Metric inherits from `FairForge`\n- [ ] `batch()` method signature matches base class\n- [ ] Results appended to `self.metrics`\n- [ ] Exports added to `fair_forge/metrics/__init__.py`\n- [ ] pyproject.toml updated with optional dependency\n- [ ] Test fixtures created in `tests/fixtures/`\n- [ ] conftest.py updated with fixtures\n- [ ] Example notebook created in `examples/{{metric_name}}/jupyter/`\n- [ ] Sample dataset created in `examples/{{metric_name}}/data/`\n- [ ] (LLM metrics) Judge output schema added to `fair_forge/llm/schemas.py`\n- [ ] (LLM metrics) Prompt added to `fair_forge/llm/prompts.py`\n- [ ] (LLM metrics) Schema exported in `fair_forge/llm/__init__.py`\n- [ ] Tests pass: `uv run pytest tests/metrics/test_{{metric_name}}.py`\n- [ ] Linting passes: `uv run ruff check fair_forge/metrics/{{metric_name}}.py`\n- [ ] Type checking passes: `uv run mypy fair_forge/metrics/{{metric_name}}.py`\n\n## Template Files\n\nSee `templates/` directory for ready-to-use boilerplate:\n- `metric.py.template` - Basic metric implementation\n- `schema.py.template` - Schema definition\n- `test.py.template` - Test file structure\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:09:45.400Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Evaluator Agents requiring customizable metric creation for Fair-Forge AI evaluation library","zh":"适用于需要可定制的度量创建的AI评估代理，尤其是Fair-Forge AI评估库","ja":"Fair-Forge AI評価ライブラリのカスタマイズ可能なメトリック作成を必要とするAI Evaluatorエージェントに最適","ko":"Fair-Forge AI 평가 라이브러리에 대한 사용자 정의 가능한 measurement 생성을 필요로 하는 AI 평가 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes evaluadores de AI que requieren la creación de métricas personalizables para la biblioteca de evaluación Fair-Forge AI","fr":"Idéal pour les agents évaluateurs d''IA nécessitant la création de métriques personnalisables pour la bibliothèque d''évaluation Fair-Forge AI","de":"Ideal für AI-Evaluator-Agents, die die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Metriken für die Fair-Forge-AI-Bibliothek erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Avaliadores de IA que exigem criação de métricas personalizadas para a biblioteca de avaliação Fair-Forge AI","ru":"Идеально для агентов-оценщиков ИИ, требующих создания настраиваемых метрик для библиотеки оценки Fair-Forge AI","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تقييم الإنسان الآلي التي تتطلب إنشاء مقاييس مخصصة لمكتبة تقييم Fair-Forge الإنسان الآلي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate new metrics with associated files following established patterns, utilizing the Fair-Forge library and creating files such as metric descriptions and evaluation scripts, all through a simple command-line interface like `/metric-creator`","zh":"赋予代理生成新度量的能力，并附带相关文件，遵循既定的模式，利用Fair-Forge库，并通过简单的命令行接口（如`/metric-creator`）创建诸如度量描述和评估脚本的文件","ja":"エージェントに新しいメトリックを生成する能力を付与し、関連ファイルを付加し、既存のパターンに従い、Fair-Forgeライブラリを利用し、簡単なコマンドラインインターフェース（例：`/metric-creator`）を通じてメトリックの説明や評価スクリプトなどのファイルを作成する","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 measurement를 생성하고 관련 파일을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 기존의 패턴을 따르고 Fair-Forge 라이브러리를 사용하여 measurement 설명 및 평가 스크립트와 같은 파일을 생성할 수 있는 간단한 명령줄 인터페이스(예: `/metric-creator`)를 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar nuevas métricas con archivos asociados siguiendo patrones establecidos, utilizando la biblioteca Fair-Forge y creando archivos como descripciones de métricas y scripts de evaluación, todo a través de una interfaz de línea de comandos simple como `/metric-creator`","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer de nouvelles métriques avec des fichiers associés en suivant des modèles établis, en utilisant la bibliothèque Fair-Forge et en créant des fichiers tels que des descriptions de métriques et des scripts d''évaluation, le tout via une interface de ligne de commande simple comme `/metric-creator`","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, neue Metriken mit zugehörigen Dateien zu generieren, die etablierte Muster folgen, die Fair-Forge-Bibliothek nutzen und Dateien wie Metrikbeschreibungen und Bewertungsskripte erstellen, alles über eine einfache Kommandozeilenoberfläche wie `/metric-creator`","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar novas métricas com arquivos associados seguindo padrões estabelecidos, utilizando a biblioteca Fair-Forge e criando arquivos como descrições de métricas e scripts de avaliação, tudo por meio de uma interface de linha de comando simples como `/metric-creator`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые метрики с связанными файлами, следуя установленным шаблонам, используя библиотеку Fair-Forge и создавая файлы, такие как описания метрик и скрипты оценки, все через простой командный интерфейс, такой как `/metric-creator`","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد مقاييس جديدة مع الملفات المرتبطة باتباع الأنماط المحددة، باستخدام مكتبة تقييم Fair-Forge وإنشاء ملفات مثل описانات المقاييس وبرامج تقييم النصوص، كل ذلك من خلال واجهة سطر أوامر بسيطة مثل `/metric-creator`"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom safety metrics for AI response evaluation","Developing coherence metrics for multi-turn conversation analysis","Generating factuality metrics for AI-generated content assessment"],"zh":["为AI响应评估创建自定义安全度量","为多回合会话分析开发连贯性度量","为AI生成内容评估生成事实性度量"],"ja":["AI応答評価のためのカスタムセキュリティメトリックを作成する","マルチターン会話分析のための連貫性メトリックを開発する","AI生成コンテンツ評価のための事実性メトリックを生成する"],"ko":["AI 응답 평가를 위한 사용자 정의 보안 측정 생성","다회합 대화 분석을 위한 일관성 측정 개발","AI 생성 콘텐츠 평가를 위한 사실성 측정 생성"],"es":["Creación de métricas de seguridad personalizadas para la evaluación de respuestas de AI","Desarrollo de métricas de coherencia para el análisis de conversaciones de varias vueltas","Generación de métricas de factualidad para la evaluación de contenido generado por AI"],"fr":["Création de métriques de sécurité personnalisées pour l''évaluation des réponses d''IA","Développement de métriques de cohérence pour l''analyse de conversations à plusieurs tours","Génération de métriques de factualité pour l''évaluation de contenu généré par IA"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Sicherheitsmetriken für die Bewertung von AI-Antworten","Entwicklung von Kohärenzmetriken für die Analyse von Mehrfachgesprächen","Generierung von Faktualitätsmetriken für die Bewertung von AI-generiertem Inhalt"],"pt":["Criar métricas de segurança personalizadas para avaliação de resposta de IA","Desenvolver métricas de coerência para análise de conversa de várias voltas","Gerar métricas de factualidade para avaliação de conteúdo gerado por IA"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских метрик безопасности для оценки ответов ИИ","Разработка метрик связности для анализа многоходовых разговоров","Генерация метрик фактичности для оценки контента, сгенерированного ИИ"],"ar":["إنشاء مقاييس أمان مخصصة لتقييم استجابة الإنسان الآلي","تطوير مقاييس لترابط لتحليل محادثة متعددة الدورات","توليد مقاييس للواقعية لتقييم المحتوى الذي ينتجه الإنسان الآلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Fair-Forge AI evaluation library integration","Limited to metric creation within the Fair-Forge framework"],"zh":["需要Fair-Forge AI评估库集成","仅限于Fair-Forge框架内的度量创建"],"ja":["Fair-Forge AI評価ライブラリの統合が必要","Fair-Forgeフレームワーク内でのメトリック作成のみ"],"ko":["Fair-Forge AI 평가 라이브러리의 통합이 필요","Fair-Forge 프레임워크 내에서 measurement 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere la integración de la biblioteca de evaluación Fair-Forge AI","Limitado a la creación de métricas dentro del marco de Fair-Forge"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de la bibliothèque d''évaluation Fair-Forge AI","Limité à la création de métriques dans le cadre de Fair-Forge"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration der Fair-Forge-AI-Bibliothek","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Metriken innerhalb des Fair-Forge-Frameworks"],"pt":["Exige integração com a biblioteca de avaliação Fair-Forge AI","Limitado à criação de métricas dentro do framework Fair-Forge"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с библиотекой оценки Fair-Forge AI","Ограничен созданием метрик внутри фреймворка Fair-Forge"],"ar":["يتطلب دمجًا مع مكتبة تقييم Fair-Forge الإنسان الآلي","محدود بالإنشاء المقاييس داخل إطار عمل Fair-Forge"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a96fddef538deb851df97c4f93cf05098d9d74ec2088590d0344c1b0a9409a22","qualityScore":55}');
