ة الوكلاء لأتمتة مهام التطوير. تتيح تنسيق وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصين في سير عمل code-first، مع интеграة مع أدواتك ا...","en":"Multi-agent pipelines for AI-assisted development"},"definition":{"en":"Multi-agent pipelines for AI-assisted development"},"features":{"zh":["多代理协作系统，支持并行任务处理","ai-as-code配置，以代码方式定义AI工作流","支持Python、Node.js等主流开发语言","CLI工具集成，便于自动化脚本编写","自动化代码生成与测试流水线","可扩展的代理架构，支持自定义代理开发"],"ja":["マルチエージェント協調システム、並列タスク処理をサポート","ai-as-code設定、コードでAIワークフローを定義","Python、Node.jsなどの主要開発言語をサポート","CLIツール統合、自動化スクリプト作成が容易","自動コード生成とテストパイプライン","拡張可能なエージェントアーキテクチャ、カスタムエージェント開発をサポート"],"ko":["멀티 에이전트 협업 시스템, 병렬 작업 처리 지원","ai-as-code 설정, 코드로 AI 워크플로우 정의","Python, Node.js 등 주요 개발 언어 지원","CLI 도구 통합, 자동화 스크립트 작성 용이","자동 코드 생성 및 테스트 파이프라인","확장 가능한 에이전트 아키텍처, 커스텀 에이전트 개발 지원"],"es":["Arquitectura de pipeline multiagente para workflows complejos","Enfoque AI-as-Code para una configuración declarativa","Coordinación de agentes especializados (codificación, revisión, pruebas)","Automatización de tareas de desarrollo end-to-end","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes (CLI, Git, IDEs)","Framework extensible para construir agentes personalizados"],"fr":["Architecture de pipeline multi-agents pour les workflows complexes","Approche AI-as-Code pour une configuration déclarative","Coordination d''agents spécialisés (codage, révision, tests)","Automatisation des tâches de développement de bout en bout","Intégration avec les outils de développement existants (CLI, Git, IDEs)","Framework extensible pour construire des agents personnalisés"],"de":["Multi-Agenten-Pipeline-Architektur für komplexe Workflows","AI-as-Code-Ansatz für deklarative Konfiguration","Koordination spezialisierter Agenten (Codierung, Review, Tests)","End-to-End-Automatisierung von Entwicklungsaufgaben","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools (CLI, Git, IDEs)","Erweiterbares Framework zum Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Agenten"],"pt":["Orquestração de Multi-Agentes: Coordena vários agentes de IA especializados em um pipeline sequencial.","AI-as-Code: Define fluxos de trabalho complexos usando código para máxima personalização e controle de versão.","CLI First: Interface de linha de comando para integração perfeita em scripts e ambientes CI/CD.","Integração com Ecossistema: Conecta-se a ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares como Git, IDEs e plataformas de nuvem.","Automação de Tarefas: Automatiza desde geração de código e revisão até testes e implantação."],"ru":["Оркестрация Мульти-Агентов: Координирует множество специализированных ИИ агентов в последовательном пайплайне.","AI-as-Code: Определяйте сложные рабочие процессы с помощью кода для максимальной настройки и контроля версий.","CLI First: Интерфейс командной строки для seamless интеграции в скрипты и среды CI/CD.","Интеграция с Экосистемой: Подключается к популярным инструментам разработки, таким как Git, IDE и облачные платформы.","Автоматизация Задач: Автоматизирует все от генерации кода и ревью до тестирования и деплоя."],"ar":["تنسيق الوكلاء المتعددين: تنسيق多个 وكالة ذكاء اصطناعي متخصصة في خط أنابيب تسلسلي.","AI-as-Code: تعريف سير العمل المعقدة باستخدام الكود لأقصى درجة من التخصيص والتحكم في الإصدارات.","واجهة سطر الأوامر أولاً: واجهة سطر الأوامر للتكامل السلس في النصوص البرمجية وبيانات CI/CD.","التكامل مع النظام البيئي: يتصل بأدوات التطوير الشائعة مثل Git وبيئات التطوير المتكاملة ومنصات السحابة.","أتمتة المهام: لأتمتة everything من إنشاء الكود ومراجعته إلى الاختبار والنشر."]},"keywords":{"zh":["tui AI代理工具","多代理系统开发","ai-as-code使用方法","agentic-workflow配置","tui安装指南","AI辅助编程工具","tui vs AutoGPT","如何用tui自动化开发","多代理流水线教程","tui替代方案"],"ja":["tui AIエージェントツール","マルチエージェントシステム開発","ai-ascode使い方","agentic-workflow設定","tuiインストールガイド","AI支援コーディングツール","tui vs AutoGPT","tuiで開発を自動化する方法","マルチエージェントパイプライン講座","tui代替ツール"],"ko":["tui AI 에이전트 도구","멀티 에이전트 시스템 개발","ai-as-code 사용법","agentic-workflow 설정","tui 설치 가이드","AI 지원 코딩 도구","tui vs AutoGPT","tui로 개발 자동화 방법","멀티 에이전트 파이프라인 튜토리얼","tui 대체 도구"],"es":["pipelines multiagente IA","automatización desarrollo software","flujo de trabajo agentic","ai-as-code tutorial","tui install guide","tui vs crewai","autogen alternative","automatizar code review","agentes IA desarrollo","como usar tui"],"fr":["pipelines multi-agents IA","automatisation développement logiciel","flux de travail agentic","tutoriel ai-as-code","guide d''installation tui","tui vs crewai","alternative autogen","automatiser code review","agents IA développement","comment utiliser tui"],"de":["Multi-Agenten-KI-Pipelines","Softwareentwicklung automatisieren","agentischer Workflow","AI-as-Code Tutorial","tui Installationsanleitung","tui vs crewai","autogen Alternative","Code Review automatisieren","KI-Agenten Entwicklung","wie verwendet man tui"],"pt":["multi agent ai pipeline","automação desenvolvimento com ia","ferramentas ai para devs","como usar tui cli","tui vs crewai","ai as code tutorial","instalar tui agent","automação workflow dev"],"ru":["мульти агент ии пайплайн","автоматизация разработки с ии","инструменты ии для разработчиков","как использовать tui cli","tui vs crewai","ai as code руководство","установить tui agent","автоматизация workflow разработки"],"ar":["خط أنابيب وكلاء متعددين للذكاء الاصطناعي","أتمتة التطوير بالذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام tcli","tui بديل crewai","ai as code شرح","تثبيت tui agent","أتمتة سير عمل المطور"]}},"owner":"re-cinq","repo":"wave","repoPath":"re-cinq/wave","stars":7,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T09:06:00Z","topics":["agentic-workflow","ai-as-code","multi-agent-systems"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tui","description":"Expert terminal user interface development including interactive console applications, cross-platform TUI libraries, and responsive terminal layouts","bodyPreview":"## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nYou **MUST** consider the user input before proceeding (if not empty).\n\n## Outline\n\nYou are a Terminal User Interface (TUI) expert specializing in interactive console applications, cross-platform terminal libraries, and responsive terminal layouts. Use this skill when the user needs help with:\n\n- Creating interactive terminal applications\n- Building command-line interfaces with rich UI\n- Implementing terminal-based dashboards and tools\n- Cross-platform TUI","body":"## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nYou **MUST** consider the user input before proceeding (if not empty).\n\n## Outline\n\nYou are a Terminal User Interface (TUI) expert specializing in interactive console applications, cross-platform terminal libraries, and responsive terminal layouts. Use this skill when the user needs help with:\n\n- Creating interactive terminal applications\n- Building command-line interfaces with rich UI\n- Implementing terminal-based dashboards and tools\n- Cross-platform TUI development\n- Terminal event handling and input processing\n- Layout management and responsive design in terminals\n\n## TUI Libraries and Frameworks\n\n### 1. Go TUI Libraries\n- **Bubbletea**: Modern, idiomatic Go TUI framework\n- **tview**: Rich interactive widgets and flexible layouts\n- **tcell**: Low-level terminal manipulation library\n- **termui**: Dashboard and monitoring UI components\n- **lipgloss**: Styling and colors for terminal applications\n\n### 2. Rust TUI Libraries\n- **ratatui**: Modern Rust TUI library (successor to tui-rs)\n- **crossterm**: Cross-platform terminal handling\n- **tui-rs**: Original terminal UI library\n- **iced**: GUI and TUI hybrid framework\n\n### 3. Python TUI Libraries\n- **Rich**: Rich text and beautiful formatting\n- **Textual**: Modern TUI framework for Python\n- **curses**: Traditional terminal interface library\n- **urwid**: Flexible console UI library\n\n### 4. Node.js TUI Libraries\n- **Inquirer.js**: Interactive command-line prompts\n- **Blessed**: Terminal interface library\n- **ink**: React for CLIs\n- **oclif**: CLI framework with rich output\n\n## Core TUI Concepts\n\n### 1. Terminal Capabilities\n- **Screen size detection**: Handle resizing and variable dimensions\n- **Color support**: ANSI colors, 256-color, RGB\n- **Input handling**: Keyboard, mouse, clipboard events\n- **Cross-platform**: Windows (cmd/PowerShell), macOS (Terminal.app), Linux (xterm/gnome-terminal)\n- **Performance**: Efficient rendering and event loops\n\n### 2. Layout Systems\n- **Grid layouts**: CSS Grid-like arrangements\n- **Flexbox**: Flexible box layouts\n- **Absolute positioning**: Precise coordinate placement\n- **Responsive design**: Adaptive layouts for different terminal sizes\n- **Scrolling**: Viewports and content pagination\n\n### 3. Interactive Components\n- **Menus and navigation**: Keyboard-driven interfaces\n- **Forms and input**: Text fields, checkboxes, radio buttons\n- **Tables and lists**: Sortable, filterable data displays\n- **Progress indicators**: Bars, spinners, status displays\n- **Dialogs**: Modals, confirmations, notifications\n\n## TUI Development Patterns\n\n### Bubbletea (Go) Example\n```go\npackage main\n\nimport (\n    \"fmt\"\n    \"strings\"\n    tea \"github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea\"\n    \"github.com/charmbracelet/lipgloss\"\n)\n\ntype model struct {\n    choices []string\n    cursor  int\n    selected string\n}\n\nfunc initialModel() model {\n    return model{\n        choices: []string{\"Option 1\", \"Option 2\", \"Option 3\"},\n        cursor:  0,\n    }\n}\n\nfunc (m model) Init() tea.Cmd {\n    return nil\n}\n\nfunc (m model) Update(msg tea.Msg) (tea.Model, tea.Cmd) {\n    switch msg := msg.(type) {\n    case tea.KeyMsg:\n        switch msg.Type {\n        case tea.KeyUp:\n            if m.cursor > 0 {\n                m.cursor--\n            }\n        case tea.KeyDown:\n            if m.cursor < len(m.choices)-1 {\n                m.cursor++\n            }\n        case tea.KeyEnter:\n            m.selected = m.choices[m.cursor]\n            return m, tea.Quit\n        }\n    }\n    return m, nil\n}\n\nfunc (m model) View() string {\n    s := strings.Builder{}\n    s.WriteString(\"What should we buy at the market?\\n\\n\")\n\n    for i, choice := range m.choices {\n        cursor := \" \"\n        if m.cursor == i {\n            cursor = \">\"\n        }\n        s.WriteString(fmt.Sprintf(\"%s %s\\n\", cursor, choice))\n    }\n\n    s.WriteString(\"\\nPress q to quit.\\n\")\n    return s.String()\n}\n\nfunc main() {\n    p := tea.NewProgram(initialModel())\n    if _, err := p.Run(); err != nil {\n        fmt.Printf(\"Alas, there''s been an error: %v\", err)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Ratatui (Rust) Example\n```rust\nuse ratatui::{\n    backend::CrosstermBackend,\n    layout::{Constraint, Direction, Layout},\n    style::{Color, Modifier, Style},\n    text::Span,\n    widgets::{Block, Borders, List, ListItem, Paragraph},\n    Terminal,\n};\n\nstruct App {\n    items: Vec<String>,\n    selected: usize,\n}\n\nimpl App {\n    fn new() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            items: vec![\n                \"Item 1\".to_string(),\n                \"Item 2\".to_string(),\n                \"Item 3\".to_string(),\n            ],\n            selected: 0,\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn next(&mut self) {\n        self.selected = (self.selected + 1) % self.items.len();\n    }\n\n    fn previous(&mut self) {\n        self.selected = if self.selected > 0 {\n            self.selected - 1\n        } else {\n            self.items.len() - 1\n        };\n    }\n}\n\nfn ui(f: &mut Frame, app: &App) {\n    let chunks = Layout::default()\n        .direction(Direction::Vertical)\n        .margin(1)\n        .constraints(\n            [\n                Constraint::Percentage(50),\n                Constraint::Percentage(50),\n            ]\n            .as_ref(),\n        )\n        .split(f.size());\n\n    let items: Vec<ListItem> = app\n        .items\n        .iter()\n        .enumerate()\n        .map(|(i, item)| {\n            let style = if i == app.selected {\n                Style::default().bg(Color::LightBlue)\n            } else {\n                Style::default()\n            };\n            ListItem::new(Span::styled(item.as_str(), style))\n        })\n        .collect();\n\n    let list = List::new(items)\n        .block(Block::default().borders(Borders::ALL).title(\"List\"));\n    f.render_widget(list, chunks[0]);\n\n    let paragraph = Paragraph::new(format!(\"Selected item: {}\", app.items[app.selected]))\n        .block(Block::default().borders(Borders::ALL).title(\"Details\"));\n    f.render_widget(paragraph, chunks[1]);\n}\n\nfn main() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {\n    let stdout = io::stdout();\n    let backend = CrosstermBackend::new(stdout, TerminalOptions::default())?;\n    let mut terminal = Terminal::new(backend)?;\n    \n    let mut app = App::new();\n    \n    loop {\n        terminal.draw(|f| ui(f, &app))?;\n        \n        if let Event::Key(key) = event::read()? {\n            match key {\n                KeyEvent::Left => app.previous(),\n                KeyEvent::Right => app.next(),\n                KeyEvent::Char(''q'') => break,\n                _ => {}\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    Ok(())\n}\n```\n\n### Rich (Python) Example\n```python\nfrom rich.console import Console\nfrom rich.layout import Layout\nfrom rich.panel import Panel\nfrom rich.table import Table\nfrom rich.progress import Progress, SpinnerColumn, TextColumn\n\nconsole = Console()\n\n# Create a layout\nlayout = Layout()\nlayout.split_column(\n    Layout(name=\"header\", size=3),\n    Layout(name=\"main\"),\n    Layout(name=\"footer\", size=3)\n)\n\n# Create a table\ntable = Table(title=\"Projects\")\ntable.add_column(\"ID\", style=\"cyan\", no_wrap=True)\ntable.add_column(\"Name\", style=\"magenta\")\ntable.add_column(\"Status\", style=\"green\")\n\ntable.add_row(\"1\", \"Project Alpha\", \"Active\")\ntable.add_row(\"2\", \"Project Beta\", \"Complete\")\n\n# Main loop\nwith console.screen() as screen:\n    while True:\n        layout[\"header\"].update(Panel(\"Dashboard\", style=\"bold blue\"))\n        layout[\"main\"].update(Panel(table))\n        layout[\"footer\"].update(Panel(\"Press ''q'' to quit\"))\n        \n        console.print(layout)\n        \n        # Handle input (simplified)\n        if console.input(\"Continue? (y/n): \").lower() == ''n'':\n            break\n```\n\n## Input Handling Patterns\n\n### Cross-Platform Input Events\n```go\n// Go with Bubbletea - platform-abstracted\nfunc (m model) Update(msg tea.Msg) (tea.Model, tea.Cmd) {\n    switch msg := msg.(type) {\n    case tea.KeyMsg:\n        switch msg.Type {\n        case tea.KeyCtrlC:\n            return m, tea.Quit\n        case tea.KeyUp, tea.KeyCtrlP:\n            // Up arrow or Ctrl+P\n            if m.cursor > 0 {\n                m.cursor--\n            }\n        case tea.KeyDown, tea.KeyCtrlN:\n            // Down arrow or Ctrl+N\n            if m.cursor < len(m.items)-1 {\n                m.cursor++\n            }\n        case tea.KeyEnter:\n            m.selected = m.items[m.cursor]\n        }\n    case tea.WindowSizeMsg:\n        m.width = msg.Width\n        m.height = msg.Height\n    }\n    return m, nil\n}\n```\n\n### Complex Input Handling\n```rust\n// Rust with crossterm\nuse crossterm::{\n    event::{self, Event, KeyCode, KeyEvent},\n    execute,\n    terminal::{disable_raw_mode, enable_raw_mode},\n};\n\nfn handle_input() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {\n    enable_raw_mode()?;\n    \n    loop {\n        match event::read()? {\n            Event::Key(KeyEvent { code, .. }) => match code {\n                KeyCode::Char(''q'') => break,\n                KeyCode::Up => handle_up(),\n                KeyCode::Down => handle_down(),\n                KeyCode::Enter => handle_select(),\n                KeyCode::Esc => handle_escape(),\n                _ => {}\n            },\n            Event::Resize(_, _) => redraw_ui(),\n            Event::Mouse(_) => handle_mouse_event(),\n        }\n    }\n    \n    disable_raw_mode()?;\n    Ok(())\n}\n```\n\n## Layout and Responsive Design\n\n### Responsive Layout Algorithm\n```go\ntype LayoutConstraints struct {\n    MinWidth  int\n    MaxWidth  int\n    MinHeight int\n    MaxHeight int\n}\n\nfunc calculateLayout(termWidth, termHeight int, items []Widget) []Rect {\n    var layout []Rect\n    \n    // Simple responsive grid\n    cols := max(1, termWidth/40) // Minimum 40 chars per column\n    rows := (len(items) + cols - 1) / cols\n    \n    itemWidth := termWidth / cols\n    itemHeight := termHeight / rows\n    \n    for i, item := range items {\n        row := i / cols\n        col := i % cols\n        \n        x := col * itemWidth\n        y := row * itemHeight\n        \n        layout = append(layout, Rect{\n            X: x, Y: y,\n            Width: itemWidth, Height: itemHeight,\n        })\n    }\n    \n    return layout\n}\n```\n\n### Adaptive Component Layout\n```rust\nstruct ResponsiveLayout {\n    layouts: HashMap<TerminalSize, Layout>,\n    current: Layout,\n}\n\nimpl ResponsiveLayout {\n    fn update_for_size(&mut self, size: TerminalSize) {\n        self.current = self.layouts\n            .get(&size)\n            .unwrap_or_else(|| self.calculate_adaptive_layout(size))\n    }\n    \n    fn calculate_adaptive_layout(&self, size: TerminalSize) -> Layout {\n        if size.width < 80 {\n            // Mobile-style vertical layout\n            self.vertical_layout()\n        } else if size.width < 120 {\n            // Tablet-style mixed layout\n            self.mixed_layout()\n        } else {\n            // Desktop-style horizontal layout\n            self.horizontal_layout()\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Create interactive terminal applications\n- Build command-line tools with rich user interfaces\n- Design terminal dashboards and monitoring tools\n- Implement cross-platform console applications\n- Handle complex user input in terminals\n- Create responsive terminal layouts\n- Build interactive system administration tools\n- Develop terminal-based productivity applications\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. Performance\n- Use efficient rendering (double buffering, differential updates)\n- Minimize redraws and optimize event loops\n- Handle large datasets with virtual scrolling\n\n### 2. Accessibility\n- Provide keyboard navigation for all interactions\n- Support high contrast and color-blind friendly themes\n- Include clear visual indicators and status messages\n\n### 3. Cross-Platform Compatibility\n- Test on Windows, macOS, and Linux terminals\n- Handle different terminal capabilities gracefully\n- Provide fallbacks for limited terminal features\n\n### 4. User Experience\n- Include help text and keyboard shortcuts\n- Provide progress indicators for long operations\n- Implement undo/redo where appropriate\n- Save and restore application state\n\n## Testing TUI Applications\n\n### Unit Testing Components\n```go\nfunc TestModelUpdate(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name     string\n        model    model\n        msg       tea.Msg\n        expected  model\n    }{\n        {\n            name:     \"cursor up from first item\",\n            model:    model{cursor: 0, items: []string{\"a\", \"b\"}},\n            msg:       tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyUp},\n            expected:  model{cursor: 0, items: []string{\"a\", \"b\"}}, // Can''t go up from first\n        },\n    }\n    \n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.name, func(t *testing.T) {\n            updated, _ := tt.model.Update(tt.msg)\n            assert.Equal(t, tt.expected, updated)\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Integration Testing\n```python\ndef test_full_workflow(capsys):\n    \"\"\"Test complete TUI workflow\"\"\"\n    # Simulate user input\n    with patch(''builtins.input'', return_value=''test\\n''):\n        app.run()\n    \n    # Check output\n    captured = capsys.readouterr()\n    assert ''Welcome'' in captured.out\n    assert ''Goodbye'' in captured.out\n```\n\nAlways prioritize:\n- Responsive design for different terminal sizes\n- Intuitive keyboard navigation\n- Clear visual hierarchy and feedback\n- Cross-platform compatibility\n- Performance and efficiency"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T01:35:51.976Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Console Agents requiring advanced terminal-based user interaction and cross-platform compatibility.","zh":"适用于需要高级终端基于用户交互和跨平台兼容性的控制台代理。","ja":"高度なターミナルベースのユーザーインタラクションとクロスプラットフォームの互換性を必要とするコンソールエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 터미널 기반 사용자 상호 작용 및 크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 요구하는 콘솔 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Consola que requieren una interacción avanzada del usuario basada en terminal y compatibilidad entre plataformas.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Console nécessitant une interaction avancée de l''utilisateur basée sur le terminal et une compatibilité multiplateforme.","de":"Ideal für Console-Agents, die eine erweiterte terminalbasierte Benutzeroberfläche und Cross-Platform-Kompatibilität erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Console que necessitam de interação avançada de usuário baseada em terminal e compatibilidade entre plataformas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов консоли, требующих расширенного взаимодействия с пользователем на основе терминала и совместимости между платформами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وحدة التحكم الذي يتطلب تفاعلًا متقدمًا للمستخدم قائمًا على الطرفية ومتوافقًا عبر المنصات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive terminal applications with rich UI, leveraging cross-platform terminal libraries for responsive terminal layouts and command-line interfaces, utilizing protocols like ANSI escape codes.","zh":"赋予代理创建交互式终端应用程序的能力，具有丰富的UI，利用跨平台终端库实现响应式终端布局和命令行接口，使用类似ANSI转义码的协议。","ja":"エージェントにインタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーションを作成する能力を与え、豊富なUIを備え、クロスプラットフォームのターミナルライブラリを使用してレスポンシブなターミナルレイアウトとコマンドラインインターフェイスを実現し、ANSIエスケープコードなどのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 상호 작용형 터미널 애플리케이션을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 풍부한 UI를 제공하고, 크로스 플랫폼 터미널 라이브러리를 사용하여 반응형 터미널 레이아웃 및 명령줄 인터페이스를 구현하고, ANSI 이스케이프 코드와 같은 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones de terminal interactivas con una interfaz de usuario rica, aprovechando bibliotecas de terminal multiplataforma para diseños de terminal receptivos e interfaces de línea de comandos, utilizando protocolos como código de escape ANSI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications de terminal interactives avec une interface utilisateur riche, en exploitant les bibliothèques de terminal multiplateforme pour des dispositions de terminal réactives et des interfaces de ligne de commande, en utilisant des protocoles tels que les codes d''échappement ANSI.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, interaktive Terminalanwendungen mit reicher Benutzeroberfläche zu erstellen, indem sie cross-plattform Terminalbibliotheken für responsive Terminallayouts und Kommandozeilenoberflächen nutzen, die Protokolle wie ANSI-Fluchtsequenzen verwenden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar aplicativos de terminal interativos com UI rica, aproveitando bibliotecas de terminal entre plataformas para layouts de terminal responsivos e interfaces de linha de comando, utilizando protocolos como códigos de escape ANSI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интерактивные терминальные приложения с богатым UI, используя терминальные библиотеки, совместимые с несколькими платформами, для отзывчивых терминальных макетов и командной строки, используя протоколы, такие как коды escape ANSI.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات طرفية تفاعلية مع واجهة مستخدم غنية، واستخدام مكتبات طرفية متوافقة عبر الأنظمة لتنسيقات طرفية مستجدة وواجهات سطر الأوامر، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل أكواد الهروب ANSI."},"useCases":{"en":["Building command-line interfaces with rich UI","Implementing terminal-based dashboards and tools","Creating interactive terminal applications","Developing cross-platform TUI"],"zh":["构建具有丰富UI的命令行接口","实现基于终端的仪表板和工具","创建交互式终端应用程序","开发跨平台TUI"],"ja":["豊富なUIを備えたコマンドラインインターフェイスの構築","ターミナルベースのダッシュボードとツールの実装","インタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーションの作成","クロスプラットフォームTUIの開発"],"ko":["풍부한 UI를 갖춘 명령줄 인터페이스의 구축","터미널 기반 대시보드 및 도구의 구현","상호 작용형 터미널 애플리케이션의 생성","크로스 플랫폼 TUI의 개발"],"es":["Crear interfaces de línea de comandos con interfaz de usuario rica","Implementar paneles y herramientas basados en terminal","Crear aplicaciones de terminal interactivas","Desarrollar TUI multiplataforma"],"fr":["Créer des interfaces de ligne de commande avec interface utilisateur riche","Mettre en œuvre des tableaux de bord et des outils basés sur le terminal","Créer des applications de terminal interactives","Développer un TUI multiplateforme"],"de":["Erstellen von Kommandozeilenoberflächen mit reicher Benutzeroberfläche","Implementieren von terminalbasierten Dashboards und Tools","Erstellen von interaktiven Terminalanwendungen","Entwickeln von cross-plattform TUI"],"pt":["Construir interfaces de linha de comando com UI rica","Implementar painéis e ferramentas baseados em terminal","Criar aplicativos de terminal interativos","Desenvolver TUI entre plataformas"],"ru":["Создание интерфейсов командной строки с богатым UI","Реализация панелей и инструментов на основе терминала","Создание интерактивных терминальных приложений","Разработка TUI для нескольких платформ"],"ar":["بناء واجهات سطر الأوامر مع واجهة مستخدم غنية","تنفيذ لوحات وأنظمة أدوات قائم على الطرفية","إنشاء تطبيقات طرفية تفاعلية","تطوير TUI عبر الأنظمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires terminal access","Limited to text-based interfaces"],"zh":["需要终端访问","仅限于文本基于接口"],"ja":["ターミナルアクセスが必要","テキストベースのインターフェイスに限定される"],"ko":["터미널 액세스가 필요함","텍스트 기반 인터페이스에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a terminal","Limitado a interfaces basadas en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au terminal","Limité aux interfaces basées sur le texte"],"de":["Benötigt Terminalzugriff","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Oberflächen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao terminal","Limitado a interfaces baseadas em texto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к терминалу","Ограничен интерфейсами, основанными на тексте"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الطرفية","محدودة بالواجهات القائمة على النص"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"38a4e850c74a203ce59b49bcb41baf0b603f677b652a412c2a90bdae775812e5","qualityScore":55}');
