Integration mit KI-Coding-Assistenten","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle","Relevante Suchergebnisse","Einfachheit der Bedienung"],"pt":["Busca rápida e eficaz de informações","Integração com assistentes de codificação de IA","Interface de linha de comando fácil de usar","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de documentação","Personalização de resultados de busca"],"ru":["Быстрый и эффективный поиск информации","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Простой и удобный интерфейс командной строки","Поддержка нескольких форматов документации","Настройка результатов поиска"],"ar":["البحث السريع والفعال عن المعلومات","التكامل مع مساعدي الترميز الاصطناعي","واجهة سطر الأوامر سهلة الاستخدام","دعم عدة صيغ للوثائق","تخصيص نتائج البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","代码编写助手","文档搜索CLI","ccmds安装","ccmds使用教程","代码编写效率","AI代码助手","CLI工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","コード作成アシスタント","ドキュメント検索CLI","ccmdsのインストール","ccmdsの使用方法","コード作成効率","AIコードアシスタント","CLIツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","코드 작성 도우미","문서 검색 CLI","ccmds 설치","ccmds 사용 방법","코드 작성 효율","AI 코드 도우미","CLI 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI","ccmds","búsqueda de documentación","asistentes de codificación de IA","cómo usar ccmds","alternativas a ccmds","ccmds vs otros herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA","ccmds","recherche de documentation","assistants de codage IA","comment utiliser ccmds","alternatives à ccmds","ccmds vs autres outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","ccmds","Dokumentensuche","KI-Coding-Assistenten","wie man ccmds verwendet","Alternativen zu ccmds","ccmds vs andere KI-Tools"],"pt":["ccmds","ferramenta de busca de documentação","assistente de codificação de IA","como usar ccmds","ccmds vs ferramentas de busca de documentação","instalar ccmds","guia de configuração do ccmds","o que é ccmds","ccmds para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ccmds","поисковая документация","ИИ Агенты","как использовать ccmds","ccmds vs поисковые инструменты документации","установить ccmds","руководство по настройке ccmds","что такое ccmds","ccmds для разработчиков"],"ar":["ccmds","أداة بحث الوثائق","مساعد الترميز الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام ccmds","ccmds مقابل أدوات بحث الوثائق","تثبيت ccmds","دليل إعداد ccmds","ما هو ccmds","ccmds لمطوري البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"bjeber","repo":"cc-md-search-cli","repoPath":"bjeber/cc-md-search-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.665Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ccmds","description":">","bodyPreview":"# ccmds - Documentation Search\n\n> Use this skill when user asks about documentation. More efficient than reading files directly.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- \"What do the docs say about...\"\n- \"Check the documentation\" / \"check the docs\"\n- \"How do I...\" (setup/config questions)\n- \"Find in documentation\" / \"search docs\"\n- Questions about setup, configuration, installation, API\n\n## First: Check Configuration\n\n```bash\nccmds config          # View current config\nccmds init            # Create .ccmdsrc if","body":"# ccmds - Documentation Search\n\n> Use this skill when user asks about documentation. More efficient than reading files directly.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- \"What do the docs say about...\"\n- \"Check the documentation\" / \"check the docs\"\n- \"How do I...\" (setup/config questions)\n- \"Find in documentation\" / \"search docs\"\n- Questions about setup, configuration, installation, API\n\n## First: Check Configuration\n\n```bash\nccmds config          # View current config\nccmds init            # Create .ccmdsrc if missing\n```\n\nWith a `.ccmdsrc` config file, commands use project defaults automatically.\n\n## Command Decision Guide\n\n| User Intent | Command | Why |\n|-------------|---------|-----|\n| Conceptual question, don''t know exact terms | `ccmds find \"query\"` | Fuzzy search |\n| Exact term, error code, pattern | `ccmds grep \"pattern\"` | Regex match |\n| Understand doc structure | `ccmds outline` | Headings only, minimal context |\n| Need specific section | `ccmds section file.md \"Heading\"` | Targeted extraction |\n| See what docs exist | `ccmds list` | File listing |\n| Read full file (after finding it) | `ccmds show file.md` | Full content |\n\n## Basic Syntax\n\n```bash\nccmds find \"authentication\"           # Fuzzy search\nccmds grep \"ERROR_[0-9]+\"             # Regex search\nccmds outline                         # Show structure\nccmds section ./docs/setup.md \"Install\"  # Extract section\nccmds list                            # List files\nccmds show ./docs/api.md              # Show file\n```\n\n## Output Modes\n\n| Mode | Use | Context |\n|------|-----|---------|\n| `json` | AI-optimized (default) | Compact |\n| `files` | Just need paths | Minimal |\n| `compact` | Human-readable snippets | Small |\n| `detailed` | Full context | Medium |\n\nDefault: `json`. Use `-o compact` for human-readable output.\n\n## Common Overrides\n\n```bash\nccmds find \"query\" -l 5              # Limit results\nccmds find \"query\" ./other/docs      # Different directory\nccmds find \"query\" --doc api         # Search only \"api\" docs\nccmds grep \"pattern\" -o files        # Files only output\nccmds list -e \"**/archive/**\"        # Exclude pattern\n```\n\n## Recommended Workflow\n\n1. `ccmds outline -d 2` - Understand structure (minimal context)\n2. `ccmds find \"topic\"` - Find relevant docs\n3. `ccmds section file.md \"Section\"` - Extract what you need\n\n---\n\n**For detailed documentation:**\n- [Command Reference](./ccmds-commands.md) - Full options for all commands\n- [Examples & Workflows](./ccmds-examples.md) - Common patterns and use cases\n- [Configuration](./ccmds-config.md) - Config file schema and patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:21:16.194Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Coding Assistants seeking efficient documentation search capabilities via CLI","zh":"适合于寻求通过CLI实现高效文档搜索功能的编码助手","ja":"CLIを通じて効率的なドキュメント検索機能を求めるコーディングアシスタントに適しています","ko":"CLI를 통해 효율적인 문서 검색 기능을 찾는 코딩 도우미에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para asistentes de codificación que buscan capacidades de búsqueda de documentación eficientes a través de CLI","fr":"Idéal pour les assistants de codage recherchant des capacités de recherche de documentation efficaces via CLI","de":"Ideal für Coding-Assistenten, die effiziente Dokumentationssuchfunktionen über CLI suchen","pt":"Ideal para Assistente de Codificação que busca capacidades de busca de documentação eficientes via CLI","ru":"Идеально для Помощников Кодирования, ищущих эффективные возможности поиска документации через CLI","ar":"مثالي للمساعدين في كتابة الشفرة الذين يبحثون عن قدرات بحث وثائق فعالة عبر CLI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to rapidly search documentation using command-line interfaces, facilitating setup and configuration inquiries through .ccmdsrc files and supporting API and installation questions","zh":"赋予代理人通过命令行界面快速搜索文档的能力，通过.ccmdsrc文件实现设置和配置查询，并支持API和安装问题","ja":"エージェントにコマンドラインインターフェイスを使用してドキュメントを迅速に検索する能力を与え、.ccmdsrcファイルを介して設定と構成の問い合わせを容易にし、APIおよびインストールに関する質問にも対応","ko":"에이전트에게 명령줄 인터페이스를 통해 문서를 신속하게 검색할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, .ccmdsrc 파일을 통해 설정 및 구성 문의를 쉽게 하며, API 및 설치 관련 질문도 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a buscar rápidamente la documentación utilizando interfaces de línea de comandos, facilitando las consultas de configuración y configuración a través de archivos .ccmdsrc y respaldando preguntas de API y instalación","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher rapidement la documentation en utilisant des interfaces de ligne de commande, facilitant les demandes de configuration et de configuration via des fichiers .ccmdsrc et prenant en charge les questions d''API et d''installation","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Dokumentationen mithilfe von Kommandozeilen-Schnittstellen schnell zu suchen, wodurch Einrichtungs- und Konfigurationsanfragen über .ccmdsrc-Dateien erleichtert und API- und Installationsfragen unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pesquisar rapidamente a documentação usando interfaces de linha de comando, facilitando consultas de configuração e instalação por meio de arquivos .ccmdsrc e suportando perguntas de API e instalação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью быстро искать документацию с помощью командной строки, облегчая настройку и конфигурирование через файлы .ccmdsrc и поддерживая вопросы API и установки","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من البحث بسرعة في الوثائق باستخدام واجهات سطر الأوامر، و تسهيل استفسارات الإعداد والتكوين من خلال ملفات .ccmdsrc ودعم أسئلة API والتركيب"},"useCases":{"en":["Searching documentation for setup and configuration details","Automating checks for API documentation","Debugging installation issues through documentation search"],"zh":["搜索文档以获取设置和配置详细信息","自动检查API文档","通过文档搜索调试安装问题"],"ja":["設定および構成の詳細を取得するためのドキュメントの検索","APIドキュメントの自動チェック","ドキュメント検索によるインストールの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["설정 및 구성 세부 정보를 얻기 위한 문서 검색","API 문서 자동 확인","문서 검색을 통해 설치 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Buscar documentación para detalles de configuración y configuración","Automatizar comprobaciones de documentación de API","Depurar problemas de instalación a través de la búsqueda de documentación"],"fr":["Rechercher la documentation pour les détails de configuration et de configuration","Automatiser les vérifications de la documentation de l''API","Déboguer les problèmes d''installation via la recherche de documentation"],"de":["Dokumentation für Einrichtungs- und Konfigurationsdetails suchen","Automatisierung von Prüfungen der API-Dokumentation","Beheben von Installationsproblemen durch Dokumentationssuche"],"pt":["Pesquisa de documentação para detalhes de configuração e instalação","Automatização de verificações de documentação de API","Depuração de problemas de instalação por meio da busca de documentação"],"ru":["Поиск документации для деталей настройки и установки","Автоматизация проверок документации API","Отладка проблем установки через поиск документации"],"ar":["بحث الوثائق لمعلومات الإعداد والتثبيت","تحسين عمليات التحقق من وثائق API","تصحيح مشاكل التثبيت من خلال البحث في الوثائق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .ccmdsrc configuration file","Limited to documentation search functionality","Dependent on CLI compatibility"],"zh":[".ccmdsrc配置文件是必需的","仅限于文档搜索功能","依赖于CLI兼容性"],"ja":[".ccmdsrc設定ファイルが必要","ドキュメント検索機能のみ","CLIの互換性に依存"],"ko":[".ccmdsrc 구성 파일이 필요함","문서 검색 기능만 해당","CLI 호환성에 종속됨"],"es":["Requiere archivo de configuración .ccmdsrc","Limitado a la funcionalidad de búsqueda de documentación","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de configuration .ccmdsrc","Limité à la fonctionnalité de recherche de documentation","Dépend de la compatibilité de la CLI"],"de":["Benötigt .ccmdsrc-Konfigurationsdatei","Begrenzt auf Dokumentationssuchfunktion","Von der CLI-Kompatibilität abhängig"],"pt":["Exige arquivo de configuração .ccmdsrc","Limitado à funcionalidade de busca de documentação","Dependente da compatibilidade CLI"],"ru":["Требует файла конфигурации .ccmdsrc","Ограничен функциональностью поиска документации","Зависит от совместимости CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف تكوين .ccmdsrc","محدود بوظيفة البحث في الوثائق","يعتمد على توافق CLI"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"52512042ee6a5c7aab01080dcb12cfb55b18d3817d3095ae6bd1987cb874443f","qualityScore":55}');
