"ja":"ビジュアルQA検証は、自動化ツールと構造化設計レビューメソッドを組み合わせた包括的な視覚とアクセシビリティの検証方法","ko":"비주얼 QA 검증은 자동화 도구와 구조화된 디자인 리뷰 방법을 결합한 포괄적인 시각적 및 접근성 검증 방법","es":"La validación QA visual combina herramientas automatizadas con metodologías de revisión de diseño para una validación integral","fr":"La validation QA visuelle combine des outils automatisés avec des méthodologies de révision de design pour une validation complète","de":"Die visuelle QA-Validierung kombiniert automatisierte Tools mit strukturierten Design-Review-Methoden für eine umfassende Validierung","pt":"QA visual é uma abordagem que combina ferramentas automatizadas com revisão de design estruturada para garantir a qualidade da interface e acessibilidade","ru":"Визуальный QA - это подход, который сочетает автоматизированные инструменты с структурированным дизайн-ревью для обеспечения качества интерфейса и доступности","ar":"QA المرئي هو نهج يجمع بين أدوات التutomatizada ومراجعة التصميم الهيكلية لضمان جودة الواجهة وإمكانية الوصول","en":"Vulcan may be a good name"},"definition":{"en":"Vulcan may be a good name"},"features":{"zh":["自动化工具","结构化设计审查","视觉验证","无障碍验证","设计审查方法"],"ja":["自動化ツール","構造化設計レビュー","視覚検証","アクセシビリティ検証","設計レビューメソッド"],"ko":["자동화 도구","구조화된 디자인 리뷰","시각적 검증","접근성 검증","디자인 리뷰 방법"],"es":["Validación visual y de accesibilidad","Metodologías de revisión de diseño estructuradas","Herramientas automatizadas para la validación","Análisis de la calidad y el rendimiento","Identificación de problemas de accesibilidad","Mejora de la calidad y la usabilidad"],"fr":["Validation visuelle et d''accessibilité","Méthodologies de révision de design structurées","Outils automatisés pour la validation","Analyse de la qualité et des performances","Identification des problèmes d''accessibilité","Amélioration de la qualité et de l''ergonomie"],"de":["Visuelle und barrierefreie Validierung","Strukturierte Design-Review-Methoden","Automatisierte Tools für die Validierung","Analyse der Qualität und Leistung","Identifizierung von Barrierefreiheitsproblemen","Verbesserung der Qualität und Benutzerfreundlichkeit"],"pt":["Validação visual e de acessibilidade","Metodologia de revisão de design estruturada","Ferramentas automatizadas de teste","Análise de impacto na experiência do usuário","Critérios específicos para avaliação"],"ru":["Визуальная и доступная проверка","Структурированная методология дизайн-ревью","Автоматизированные инструменты тестирования","Анализ влияния на опыт пользователя","Конкретные критерии для оценки"],"ar":["التحقق المرئي وإمكانية الوصول","منهجية مراجعة التصميم الهيكلية","أدوات التautomatizada للاختبار","تحليل التأثير على تجربة المستخدم","معايير محددة للتقييم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["视觉QA验证","自动化工具","设计审查","无障碍验证","视觉验证","web开发","前端开发"],"ja":["ビジュアルQA検証","自動化ツール","設計レビュー","アクセシビリティ検証","視覚検証","web開発","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["비주얼 QA 검증","자동화 도구","디자인 리뷰","접근성 검증","시각적 검증","웹 개발","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["validación QA visual","accesibilidad web","metodologías de diseño","herramientas de validación","calidad y rendimiento","usabilidad y accesibilidad","desarrollo web","pruebas de QA"],"fr":["validation QA visuelle","accessibilité web","méthodologies de design","outils de validation","qualité et performances","ergonomie et accessibilité","développement web","tests de QA"],"de":["visuelle QA-Validierung","barrierefreie Webentwicklung","Design-Review-Methoden","Validierungstools","Qualität und Leistung","Benutzerfreundlichkeit und Barrierefreiheit","Webentwicklung","QA-Tests"],"pt":["QA visual","validação de interface","acessibilidade web","metodologia de revisão de design","ferramentas de teste automatizadas","experiência do usuário","garantia de qualidade"],"ru":["Визуальный QA","проверка интерфейса","доступность веб-сайта","методология дизайн-ревью","автоматизированные инструменты тестирования","опыт пользователя","обеспечение качества"],"ar":["QA المرئي","التحقق من الواجهة","مأمونية موقع","منهجية مراجعة التصميم","أدوات التautomatizada للاختبار","تجربة المستخدم","ضمان الجودة"]}},"owner":"darkroomengineering","repo":"cc-settings","repoPath":"darkroomengineering/cc-settings","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.665Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"qa","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Visual QA Validation\n\nVisual and accessibility validation using pinchtab. Combines automated tooling with structured design review methodology.\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n- **Screenshot first, then critique.** Always look at the actual rendered output, not just the code.\n- **Be specific.** \"The spacing looks off\" is useless. \"The gap between the heading and paragraph is 32px but should be 16px based on the surrounding spacing rhythm\" is useful.\n- **Prioritize impact.** Not every pixel matters. Focus","body":"# Visual QA Validation\n\nVisual and accessibility validation using pinchtab. Combines automated tooling with structured design review methodology.\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n- **Screenshot first, then critique.** Always look at the actual rendered output, not just the code.\n- **Be specific.** \"The spacing looks off\" is useless. \"The gap between the heading and paragraph is 32px but should be 16px based on the surrounding spacing rhythm\" is useful.\n- **Prioritize impact.** Not every pixel matters. Focus on what users will actually notice.\n- **Reference the intent.** Compare against design tokens, mockups, or stated design goals.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Validate dev server\npinchtab nav http://localhost:3000\npinchtab text        # Token-efficient content check (~800 tokens)\npinchtab screenshot  # Visual inspection\npinchtab snap -i -c  # Interactive compact accessibility tree\n```\n\n---\n\n## Review Categories (Priority Order)\n\n### 1. Layout & Spacing\n\n**Check for:**\n- Consistent spacing rhythm (is everything on the spacing grid?)\n- Alignment -- are elements that should be aligned actually aligned?\n- Padding consistency within similar components\n- Container widths and max-widths\n- No horizontal overflow\n- Responsive behavior (if multiple viewport screenshots available)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Inconsistent padding in cards (e.g., 24px top, 16px sides)\n- Elements slightly off-grid (15px instead of 16px)\n- Text not aligned with adjacent elements\n- Sections with wildly different vertical spacing\n\n### 2. Typography\n\n**Check for:**\n- Hierarchy -- is it clear what''s a heading vs body vs caption?\n- Line length -- body text should be 45-75 characters per line\n- Line height -- too tight or too loose for the font size?\n- Font weight usage -- are weights used consistently for the same role?\n- Heading hierarchy is correct (h1 > h2 > h3)\n- Orphans/widows -- single words on their own line in headings\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Heading that doesn''t look like a heading (weight/size too close to body)\n- Body text line length > 80 characters (hard to read)\n- Inconsistent heading sizes across sections\n- All-caps text without letter-spacing adjustment\n\n### 3. Color & Contrast\n\n**Check for:**\n- Text meets 4.5:1 contrast ratio\n- UI elements meet 3:1 contrast ratio\n- Consistent use of brand colors\n- Color meaning consistency (is the same blue used for links AND errors?)\n- Dark mode issues (if applicable)\n- Hover/active state visibility\n- UI elements are distinguishable\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Light gray text on white background (contrast fail)\n- Primary color used for too many different purposes\n- Borders that are nearly invisible\n- Status colors that conflict (green for danger, red for success)\n\n### 4. Visual Hierarchy\n\n**Check for:**\n- Eye flow -- where does the eye go first? Is that correct?\n- CTA prominence -- is the primary action the most visible element?\n- Information density -- too sparse or too crowded?\n- Grouping -- are related items visually grouped?\n- White space -- is it used intentionally or just leftover?\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Two equally prominent CTAs competing for attention\n- Important information buried below less important elements\n- Sections that feel disconnected from each other\n- Dense walls of text without visual breaks\n\n### 5. Component Quality\n\n**Check for:**\n- Button sizing and padding consistency\n- Input field styling consistency\n- Card styling consistency (shadows, borders, radius)\n- Icon sizing and alignment with text\n- Image aspect ratios and cropping\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Buttons with inconsistent padding or height\n- Mixed border-radius values (some 8px, some 12px, some 4px)\n- Icons misaligned with adjacent text baselines\n- Images stretched or poorly cropped\n\n### 6. Accessibility\n\n- [ ] All images have `alt` text\n- [ ] Icon-only buttons have `aria-label`\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] Heading hierarchy is correct\n- [ ] Focus order is logical\n- [ ] Interactive elements >= 44x44px\n- [ ] Adequate spacing between touch targets\n- [ ] Focus indicators present (no `outline: none` without replacement)\n\n### 7. Polish & Micro-details\n\n**Check for:**\n- Hover states exist and are visible\n- Focus states for keyboard navigation\n- Loading states (skeleton screens, spinners)\n- Empty states (what shows when there''s no data?)\n- Transitions between states (abrupt vs smooth)\n- Error states are clear\n\n**Common issues:**\n- No hover state on interactive elements\n- Focus ring removed with no replacement\n- Abrupt content shifts when data loads\n- No empty state -- just a blank area\n\n### 8. Responsive Issues (if multiple viewports available)\n\n**Check for:**\n- Content readable on mobile (not too small)\n- Touch targets >= 44px on mobile\n- Navigation accessible on small screens\n- Images not overflowing containers\n- Horizontal scroll (almost always a bug)\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Navigate** to target URL\n2. **Screenshot** current state\n3. **Snapshot** accessibility tree\n4. **Analyze** against review categories above\n5. **Score** using the output format below\n6. **Report** issues with actionable fixes\n\n### After Building a Component\n\n1. Render the component in the browser\n2. Take a screenshot\n3. Run visual QA review\n4. Fix issues\n5. Re-screenshot and verify\n\n### After Building a Full Page\n\n1. Screenshot at desktop (1440px), tablet (768px), and mobile (375px)\n2. Run responsive review across all three\n3. Run full review on the desktop version\n4. Fix issues, prioritizing critical ones\n\n### Comparing to a Mockup\n\n1. Get the mockup image:\n   - **From Figma (preferred):** Use `/figma` to launch Figma desktop, navigate to the frame, and screenshot it directly\n   - **Manual:** Figma export, screenshot, or user-provided image\n2. Screenshot the implementation at the same viewport size\n3. Run comparison review\n4. Fix deviations by priority\n\n---\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\n# Navigate\npinchtab nav http://localhost:3000/page\n\n# Token-efficient page text (~800 tokens — preferred first step)\npinchtab text\n\n# Screenshot\npinchtab screenshot\n\n# Interactive compact accessibility tree\npinchtab snap -i -c\n\n# Interact with elements\npinchtab click e5\npinchtab fill e3 \"test input\"\n\n# Hover states and scroll for below-fold content\npinchtab hover e5\npinchtab scroll down\npinchtab scroll up\n\n# Keyboard interaction\npinchtab press Enter\npinchtab press Tab\n```\n\n**Multi-instance parallel QA:** Test multiple viewports simultaneously using separate pinchtab instances for desktop, tablet, and mobile widths.\n\n---\n\n## Output Formats\n\n### Full Review\n\n```\n## QA Report: [Page/Component]\n\n**Overall impression:** [One sentence -- first gut reaction]\n**Quality score:** [1-10] / 10\n\n### Critical Issues (fix before shipping)\n1. **[Category]:** [Specific issue with exact details]\n   -> **Fix:** [Actionable recommendation]\n\n### Improvements (should fix)\n1. **[Category]:** [Specific issue]\n   -> **Fix:** [Recommendation]\n\n### Minor Polish (nice to fix)\n1. **[Category]:** [Specific issue]\n   -> **Fix:** [Recommendation]\n\n### What''s Working Well\n- [Specific praise -- what''s well-executed]\n- [Another positive]\n\n### Passed Checks\n- [x] Touch targets adequate\n- [x] Heading hierarchy correct\n\n### Issues Found\n- [ ] Missing alt text on hero image\n  -> Add alt=\"...\" to components/hero/index.tsx:15\n\n- [ ] Contrast too low on muted text\n  -> Change text-gray-400 to text-gray-500\n\n### Recommendations\n- Consider adding loading skeleton for async content\n```\n\n### Quick Review\n\n```\n## Quick QA: [Page/Component Name]\n\nScore: [X]/10\n\nTop 3 fixes:\n1. [Most impactful issue + fix]\n2. [Second issue + fix]\n3. [Third issue + fix]\n\nLooks good: [What''s working]\n```\n\n### Comparison Review (Implementation vs Mockup)\n\n```\n## Design vs Implementation Review\n\n**Fidelity score:** [1-10] / 10\n\n### Deviations Found\n1. **[Element]:** Mockup shows [X], implementation has [Y]\n   Impact: [High/Medium/Low]\n   -> **Fix:** [How to match the mockup]\n\n### Matching Well\n- [Elements that accurately match the design]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nRequires `pinchtab` (installed by `setup.sh`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:21:12.192Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual QA Agents needing structured design review methodology and automated tooling with pinchtab.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化设计审查方法论和自动化工具的视觉QA代理，具有pinchtab集成","ja":"視覚QAエージェントが構造化されたデザインレビューメソドロジーと自動化ツールを必要とする場合に最適。pinchtabを使用します","ko":"구조화된 디자인 리뷰 방법론과 자동화 도구가 필요한 시각적 QA 에이전트에게 적합합니다. pinchtab를 사용합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de QA Visuales que necesitan una metodología de revisión de diseño estructurada y herramientas automatizadas con pinchtab.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de QA Visuels nécessitant une méthodologie de révision de conception structurée et des outils automatiques avec pinchtab.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle QA-Agenten, die eine strukturierte Design-Review-Methodik und automatisierte Werkzeuge mit pinchtab benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de QA Visual que precisam de uma metodologia de revisão de design estruturada e ferramentas automatizadas com pinchtab.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Визуальных агентов QA, которым необходима структурированная методология проверки дизайна и автоматизированное инструментирование с помощью pinchtab.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المرئيين لضمان الجودة الذين يحتاجون إلى منهجية مراجعة التصميم المنظمة والأدوات الآلية مع pinchtab."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform visual and accessibility validation using pinchtab, combining automated tooling with structured design review methodology, and providing specific critiques based on surrounding spacing rhythm, prioritizing impact on the actual rendered output.","zh":"赋予代理使用pinchtab执行视觉和可访问性验证的能力，结合自动化工具和结构化设计审查方法论，并根据周围的间距节奏提供具体的批评，优先考虑对实际渲染输出的影响","ja":"エージェントがpinchtabを使用して視覚的およびアクセシビリティの検証を実行できるようにし、自動化ツールと構造化されたデザインレビューメソドロジーを組み合わせ、周囲のスペースのリズムに基づいて具体的な批評を提供し、実際のレンダリング出力への影響に優先順位を付ける","ko":"에이전트가 pinchtab를 사용하여 시각적 및 접근성 검증을 수행할 수 있도록 하고, 자동화 도구와 구조화된 디자인 리뷰 방법론을 결합하여, 주변의 간격 리듬에 따라 구체적인 비평을 제공하고, 실제 렌더링 출력에 대한 영향에 우선 순위를 부여합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar validaciones visuales y de accesibilidad utilizando pinchtab, combinando herramientas automatizadas con metodologías de revisión de diseño estructuradas y proporcionando críticas específicas basadas en el ritmo de espaciado circundante, priorizando el impacto en la salida renderizada real.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des validations visuelles et d''accessibilité en utilisant pinchtab, en combinant des outils automatiques avec des méthodologies de révision de conception structurées et en fournissant des critiques spécifiques basées sur le rythme d''espacement environnant, en donnant la priorité à l''impact sur la sortie réellement rendue.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, visuelle und barrierefreie Validierungen unter Verwendung von pinchtab durchzuführen, indem automatisierte Werkzeuge mit strukturierten Design-Review-Methoden kombiniert und spezifische Kritik basierend auf dem umgebenden Abstandsrhythmus bereitgestellt werden, wobei der Einfluss auf die tatsächlich gerenderte Ausgabe priorisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar validação visual e de acessibilidade usando pinchtab, combinando ferramentas automatizadas com metodologia de revisão de design estruturada, e fornecendo críticas específicas com base no ritmo de espaçamento circundante, priorizando o impacto na saída renderizada real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять визуальную и проверку доступности с помощью pinchtab, сочетая автоматизированное инструментирование со структурированной методологией проверки дизайна и предоставляя конкретные критические замечания на основе ритма окружающего пространства, отдающие приоритет влиянию на фактический отображаемый результат.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من أداء التحقق المرئي والتوافق باستخدام pinchtab، حيث ي結ب بين الأدوات الآلية و منهجية مراجعة التصميم المنظمة، ويتوفر على تعليقات محددة بناءً على إيقاع المساحة المحيطة، مع إعطاء الأولوية للتأثير على الإخراج المُعالَج الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating screenshot rendering","Automating design review methodology","Debugging spacing and accessibility issues"],"zh":["验证截图渲染","自动化设计审查方法论","调试间距和可访问性问题"],"ja":["スクリーンショットのレンダリングを検証する","デザインレビューメソドロジーを自動化する","スペースとアクセシビリティの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["스크린샷 렌더링을 검증","디자인 리뷰 방법론을 자동화","간격 및 접근성 문제를 디버깅"],"es":["Validar la representación de capturas de pantalla","Automatizar la metodología de revisión de diseño","Depurar problemas de espaciado y accesibilidad"],"fr":["Valider le rendu des captures d''écran","Automatiser la méthodologie de révision de conception","Déboguer les problèmes d''espacement et d''accessibilité"],"de":["Überprüfen der Darstellung von Screenshots","Automatisieren der Design-Review-Methodik","Debuggen von Abstands- und Barrierefreiheitsproblemen"],"pt":["Validar renderização de capturas de tela","Automatizar metodologia de revisão de design","Depurar problemas de espaçamento e acessibilidade"],"ru":["Проверка рендеринга скриншотов","Автоматизация методологии проверки дизайна","Отладка проблем с пробелами и доступностью"],"ar":[" التحقق منتصر renderização الشاشة","تأتمتة منهجية مراجعة التصميم","تصحيح أخطاء في المسافات والتوافق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pinchtab integration","Focus on visual and accessibility validation only"],"zh":["需要pinchtab集成","仅限视觉和可访问性验证"],"ja":["pinchtabの統合が必要","視覚的およびアクセシビリティの検証のみ"],"ko":["pinchtab 통합이 필요","시각적 및 접근성 검증만"],"es":["Requiere integración con pinchtab","Enfocarse en la validación visual y de accesibilidad solo"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec pinchtab","Se concentrer uniquement sur la validation visuelle et d''accessibilité"],"de":["Erfordert eine Integration mit pinchtab","Fokus nur auf visuelle und barrierefreie Validierung"],"pt":["Requer integração com pinchtab","Foco apenas na validação visual e de acessibilidade"],"ru":["Требуется интеграция с pinchtab","Фокус только на визуальной и проверке доступности"],"ar":["يتطلب إدماج pinchtab","التركيز فقط على التحقق المرئي والتوافق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ee70681c3009cbeba8ab504a122506bca38bd63462a086c559a1f0e2b71c2ebf","qualityScore":55}');
