и"],"ar":["واجهة سطر أوامر كفاءة عالية لليانر","تكنولوجيا موظفة للتكنولوجيا متقدمة","تحسين الإنتاجية","سهل الاستخدام","التكامل مع أدوات أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Triage","什么是Triage","Triage替代品","Triage与Linear比较","Triage安装","Triage设置指南","Linear CLI工具","开发者生产力工具"],"ja":["Triageの使い方","Triageとは","Triageの代替","TriageとLinearの比較","Triageのインストール","Triageの設定ガイド","LinearのCLIツール","開発者の生産性ツール"],"ko":["Triage 사용법","Triage란","Triage 대체품","Triage와 Linear 비교","Triage 설치","Triage 설정 가이드","Linear의 CLI 도구","개발者の 생산성 도구"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","Triage CLI","Linear","productividad para desarrolladores","cómo usar Triage","alternativas a Triage","Triage vs competidores","instalación de Triage","guía de configuración de Triage"],"fr":["outils d''IA","Triage CLI","Linear","productivité pour développeurs","comment utiliser Triage","alternatives à Triage","Triage vs concurrents","installation de Triage","guide de configuration de Triage"],"de":["KI-Tools","Triage-CLI","Linear","Produktivität für Entwickler","wie man Triage verwendet","Alternativen zu Triage","Triage vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Triage","Einrichtungsanleitung für Triage"],"pt":["como usar Triage","o que é Triage","Triage alternativa","Triage vs outras ferramentas","instalar Triage","guia de configuração do Triage","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","CLI para Linear"],"ru":["как использовать Triage","что такое Triage","альтернатива Triage","Triage vs другие инструменты","установить Triage","руководство по настройке Triage","ИИ инструменты для разработчиков","CLI для Linear"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Triage","ما هو Triage","بديل Triage","Triage مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Triage","دليل إعداد Triage","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين","واجهة سطر أوامر لليانر"]}},"owner":"joa23","repo":"linear-cli","repoPath":"joa23/linear-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.681Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"triage","description":"Triage and prioritize Linear backlog. Analyzes issues for staleness, blockers, and suggests priorities based on dependencies and capacity.","bodyPreview":"# Triage Skill - Backlog Analysis\n\nYou are an expert at analyzing and prioritizing software backlogs.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The backlog needs cleanup\n- Prioritization decisions need to be made\n- Looking for stale or blocked issues\n\n## Process\n\n### CRITICAL: Setup First\n**Ensure team context is set:**\n```bash\nlinear init  # If .linear.yaml doesn''t exist\n```\n\n1. **Fetch the Backlog**\n   ```bash\n   # Get all backlog issues (returns ALL issues, not just assigned)\n   linear issues l","body":"# Triage Skill - Backlog Analysis\n\nYou are an expert at analyzing and prioritizing software backlogs.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The backlog needs cleanup\n- Prioritization decisions need to be made\n- Looking for stale or blocked issues\n\n## Process\n\n### CRITICAL: Setup First\n**Ensure team context is set:**\n```bash\nlinear init  # If .linear.yaml doesn''t exist\n```\n\n1. **Fetch the Backlog**\n   ```bash\n   # Get all backlog issues (returns ALL issues, not just assigned)\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --format full --limit 100\n   ```\n\n2. **Analyze Dependencies**\n   ```bash\n   linear deps --team ENG\n   ```\n\n3. **Filter by Priority**\n   ```bash\n   # High priority backlog items\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --format full\n\n   # Urgent only (P1)\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --format full\n\n   # Customer issues\n   linear issues list --labels customer --format full\n\n   # Bugs in backlog\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --labels bug --format full\n   ```\n\n4. **Identify Issues**\n   Look for:\n   - **Stale issues**: No updates in 30+ days\n   - **Blocked issues**: Dependencies not resolved\n   - **Priority mismatches**: High priority but blocked\n   - **Orphaned issues**: No assignee, no activity\n\n5. **Generate Recommendations**\n\n## Analysis Framework\n\n### Staleness Check\n- Last updated > 30 days ago = Stale\n- Last updated > 60 days ago = Very stale (consider closing)\n- No activity + no assignee = Orphaned\n\n### Dependency Health\n- Blocked by completed issues = Unblock\n- Circular dependencies = Flag for resolution\n- Long blocking chains = Risk\n\n### Priority Assessment\n- P1/P2 but blocked = Escalate blocker\n- P3/P4 with no activity = Consider closing\n- No priority set = Needs triage\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\nBACKLOG TRIAGE: Team ENG\n════════════════════════════════════════\n\nURGENT ATTENTION (3)\n────────────────────────────────────────\nENG-101 [Stale 45d] Login bug - P1 but no activity\nENG-102 [Blocked] Payment flow - blocked by ENG-99\nENG-103 [Orphaned] API refactor - no owner\n\nRECOMMENDED ACTIONS\n────────────────────────────────────────\n1. Unblock ENG-102: Complete ENG-99 or remove dependency\n2. Assign ENG-103: Needs owner or close if abandoned\n3. Update ENG-101: Stale P1 needs attention\n\nHEALTH SUMMARY\n────────────────────────────────────────\nTotal issues: 45\nBlocked: 8 (17%)\nStale: 12 (26%)\nHealthy: 25 (55%)\n```\n\n## Commands Used\n\n```bash\n# FIRST: Ensure team context is set\nlinear init  # If .linear.yaml doesn''t exist\n\n# Get backlog issues (returns ALL issues, not just assigned)\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --format full --limit 100\n\n# Filter by priority\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --format full  # Urgent\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --priority 2 --format full  # High\n\n# Filter by labels\nlinear issues list --labels customer --format full\nlinear issues list --labels bug --format full\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --labels \"customer,bug\" --format full\n\n# Combine filters\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --labels customer --format full\n\n# Check dependencies\nlinear deps --team ENG\n\n# Update priority\nlinear issues update ENG-123 --priority 2\n\n# Add a comment about triage\nlinear issues comment ENG-123 --body \"Triaged: Needs unblocking before sprint\"\n```\n\n## Key Learnings\n\n- **`linear issues list` returns ALL issues** (not just assigned to you)\n- Use `--format full` for structured output\n- Combine filters: `--state Backlog --labels customer`\n- Priority values: 0=none, 1=urgent, 2=high, 3=normal, 4=low\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Regular cadence** - Triage weekly or bi-weekly\n2. **Be decisive** - Close issues that won''t be done\n3. **Document reasoning** - Add comments explaining priority changes\n4. **Involve stakeholders** - Flag issues needing product input\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:33.213Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing efficient backlog analysis and prioritization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的待处理事项分析和优先级排序的CLI代理。","ja":"CLIエージェントが効率的なバックログ分析と優先順位付けの機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 백로그 분석 및 우선 순위 지정 기능이 필요한 CLI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de CLI que necesitan capacidades de análisis y priorización de backlog eficientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents CLI nécessitant des capacités d''analyse et de priorisation de backlog efficaces.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-Agents, die effiziente Backlog-Analyse- und Priorisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes CLI que necessitam de análise e priorização eficientes de backlog.","ru":"Идеально для агентов CLI, которым необходимы эффективные возможности анализа и приоритизации бэклога.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة سطر الأوامر الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل وتحديد أسبقية الفهرس بشكل فعال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and prioritize software backlogs using Linear, providing features like fetching all backlog issues and identifying stale or blocked issues through commands like ''linear issues l''.","zh":"使代理能够使用Linear分析和优先级排序软件待处理事项，提供的功能包括使用命令如''linear issues l''来获取所有待处理事项和识别过时或被阻塞的待处理事项。","ja":"エージェントがLinearを使用してソフトウェアバックログを分析および優先順位付けできるようにし、''linear issues l''などのコマンドを使用してすべてのバックログの問題を取得し、古くなったまたはブロックされた問題を識別するなどの機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Linear를 사용하여 소프트웨어 백로그를 분석하고 우선 순위를 지정할 수 있도록 하며, ''linear issues l''などの 명령을 사용하여 모든 백로그 문제를 가져오고, 오래된 또는 차단된 문제를 식별하는 등의 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar y priorizar backlogs de software utilizando Linear, proporcionando características como la recuperación de todos los problemas de backlog e identificación de problemas estancados o bloqueados a través de comandos como ''linear issues l''.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et de prioriser les backlogs de logiciels en utilisant Linear, en fournissant des fonctionnalités telles que la récupération de tous les problèmes de backlog et l''identification des problèmes stagnants ou bloqués via des commandes comme ''linear issues l''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Software-Backlogs mit Linear zu analysieren und zu priorisieren, indem Funktionen wie das Abrufen aller Backlog-Probleme und das Identifizieren von veralteten oder blockierten Problemen über Befehle wie ''linear issues l'' bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar e priorizar backlogs de software usando Linear, fornecendo recursos como buscar todas as questões do backlog e identificar questões estagnadas ou bloqueadas por meio de comandos como ''linear issues l''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать и приоритизировать программные бэклоги с помощью Linear, предоставляя функции, такие как получение всех вопросов бэклога и определение застойных или заблокированных вопросов с помощью команд, таких как ''linear issues l''.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل وتحديد أسبقية الفهرس البرمجي باستخدام Linear، مع توفير ميزات مثل استرجاع جميع مشاكل الفهرس وتحديد المشاكل الراكدة أو المحظورة من خلال أوامر مثل ''linear issues l''."},"useCases":{"en":["Prioritizing issues in a software backlog","Identifying stale or blocked issues","Cleaning up backlogs"],"zh":["在软件待处理事项中优先级排序","识别过时或被阻塞的待处理事项","清理待处理事项"],"ja":["ソフトウェアバックログの問題を優先順位付けする","古くなったまたはブロックされた問題を識別する","バックログをクリーンアップする"],"ko":["소프트웨어 백로그의 문제를 우선 순위 지정하기","오래된 또는 차단된 문제를 식별하기","백로그를 정리하기"],"es":["Priorizar problemas en un backlog de software","Identificar problemas estancados o bloqueados","Limpiar backlogs"],"fr":["Prioriser les problèmes dans un backlog de logiciel","Identifier les problèmes stagnants ou bloqués","Nettoyer les backlogs"],"de":["Probleme in einem Software-Backlog priorisieren","Veraltete oder blockierte Probleme identifizieren","Backlogs aufräumen"],"pt":["Priorizar questões em um backlog de software","Identificar questões estagnadas ou bloqueadas","Limpar backlogs"],"ru":["Приоритизация вопросов в программном бэклоге","Определение застойных или заблокированных вопросов","Очистка бэклогов"],"ar":["تحديد أسبقية المشاكل في فهرس البرنامج","تحديد المشاكل الراكدة أو المحظورة","تنقية الفهارس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Linear initialization with ''linear init''","Dependent on Linear CLI and .linear.yaml configuration"],"zh":["需要使用''linear init''进行Linear初始化","依赖于Linear CLI和.linear.yaml配置"],"ja":["''linear init''でLinearを初期化する必要がある","Linear CLIおよび.linear.yamlの構成に依存する"],"ko":["''linear init''로 Linear를 초기화해야 함","Linear CLI 및 .linear.yaml 구성에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere la inicialización de Linear con ''linear init''","Dependiente de la configuración de Linear CLI y .linear.yaml"],"fr":["Nécessite l''initialisation de Linear avec ''linear init''","Dépend de la configuration de Linear CLI et .linear.yaml"],"de":["Benötigt die Initialisierung von Linear mit ''linear init''","Abhängig von der Konfiguration von Linear CLI und .linear.yaml"],"pt":["Requer inicialização do Linear com ''linear init''","Dependente do Linear CLI e configuração .linear.yaml"],"ru":["Требует инициализации Linear с ''linear init''","Зависит от Linear CLI и конфигурации .linear.yaml"],"ar":["يتطلب تهيئة Linear bằng ''linear init''","يعتمد على Linear CLI وتهيئة .linear.yaml"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e0b185c9527c952d57524098c948340bfa07f5ad316b50bc4d5c2fc425803399","qualityScore":55}');
