a de aplicación Flutter","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles con inteligencia artificial","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores","cómo usar Flutter para desarrollar aplicaciones móviles","alternativas a React Native","guía de instalación de Flutter","configuración de proyectos de inteligencia artificial con Flutter"],"fr":["modèle d''application Flutter","développement d''applications mobiles avec intelligence artificielle","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs","comment utiliser Flutter pour développer des applications mobiles","alternatives à React Native","guide d''installation de Flutter","configuration de projets d''intelligence artificielle avec Flutter"],"de":["Flutter-Anwendungsvorlage","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen mit Künstlicher Intelligenz","KI-Tools für Entwickler","wie man Flutter für die Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen verwendet","Alternativen zu React Native","Installationsanleitung für Flutter","Konfiguration von KI-Projekten mit Flutter"],"pt":["como usar template-mason-brick","o que é Ferramentas de IA","modelo de aplicativo Flutter","desenvolvimento de soluções de IA","Ferramentas de IA alternative","template-mason-brick vs outros modelos","instalação do template-mason-brick","guia de configuração do template-mason-brick"],"ru":["как использовать шаблон template-mason-brick","что такое ИИ Агенты","шаблон приложения Flutter","разработка решений ИИ","ИИ Агенты alternative","шаблон template-mason-brick vs другие шаблоны","установка шаблона template-mason-brick","руководство по настройке шаблона template-mason-brick"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام قالب template-mason-brick","ما هو آلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","قالب تطبيق Flutter","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي","آلات الذكاء الاصطناعي alternative","قالب template-mason-brick vs قوالب أخرى","تثبيت قالب template-mason-brick","دليل إعداد قالب template-mason-brick"]}},"owner":"gsmlg-app","repo":"flutter-app-template","repoPath":"gsmlg-app/flutter-app-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.690Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"template-mason-brick","description":"Guide for creating, updating, or removing Mason bricks with corresponding tests and CI workflow (project)","bodyPreview":"# Mason Brick Development Skill\n\nThis skill guides the creation, modification, and removal of Mason bricks, ensuring test coverage and CI workflow integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nTrigger this skill when:\n- Creating a new Mason brick template\n- Updating an existing brick''s structure or variables\n- Removing a brick from the project\n- User asks to \"create a brick\", \"add a mason template\", \"update brick\", or \"remove brick\"\n\n## Project Structure\n\nBricks are organized in three locations:\n\n```\nbricks/","body":"# Mason Brick Development Skill\n\nThis skill guides the creation, modification, and removal of Mason bricks, ensuring test coverage and CI workflow integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nTrigger this skill when:\n- Creating a new Mason brick template\n- Updating an existing brick''s structure or variables\n- Removing a brick from the project\n- User asks to \"create a brick\", \"add a mason template\", \"update brick\", or \"remove brick\"\n\n## Project Structure\n\nBricks are organized in three locations:\n\n```\nbricks/                    # Mason template definitions\n├── brick_name/\n│   ├── brick.yaml         # Brick configuration and variables\n│   ├── __brick__/         # Template files with Mustache syntax\n│   └── hooks/             # Optional pre/post generation hooks\n\ntest_bricks/               # Brick tests (one folder per brick)\n├── brick_name/\n│   └── brick_name_test.dart\n\n.github/workflows/\n└── brick-test.yml         # Parallel CI jobs for each brick\n```\n\n## Creating a New Brick\n\n### Step 1: Create Brick Directory\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p bricks/new_brick/__brick__\n```\n\n### Step 2: Create brick.yaml\n\n```yaml\nname: new_brick\ndescription: Description of what this brick generates\nversion: 0.1.0+1\n\nenvironment:\n  mason: ^0.1.1\n\nvars:\n  name:\n    type: string\n    description: The name for the generated component\n    prompt: What is the name?\n\n  # Add more variables as needed\n  optional_var:\n    type: boolean\n    description: Optional feature flag\n    default: true\n```\n\n### Step 3: Create Template Files\n\nIn `__brick__/`, create files using Mustache syntax:\n\n```\n__brick__/\n├── {{name.snakeCase()}}/\n│   ├── lib/\n│   │   └── {{name.snakeCase()}}.dart\n│   ├── pubspec.yaml\n│   └── README.md\n```\n\nUse these Mustache helpers:\n- `{{name}}` - raw value\n- `{{name.snakeCase()}}` - snake_case\n- `{{name.pascalCase()}}` - PascalCase\n- `{{name.camelCase()}}` - camelCase\n- `{{name.paramCase()}}` - param-case\n- `{{#flag}}...{{/flag}}` - conditional block\n- `{{^flag}}...{{/flag}}` - inverted conditional\n\n### Step 4: Create Brick Test\n\nCreate `test_bricks/new_brick/new_brick_test.dart`:\n\n```dart\nimport ''dart:io'';\nimport ''package:mason/mason.dart'';\nimport ''package:path/path.dart'' as path;\nimport ''package:test/test.dart'';\n\nvoid main() {\n  group(''New Brick Tests'', () {\n    late Directory tempDir;\n\n    setUp(() async {\n      tempDir = await Directory.systemTemp.createTemp(''new_brick_test_'');\n    });\n\n    tearDown(() async {\n      if (await tempDir.exists()) {\n        await tempDir.delete(recursive: true);\n      }\n    });\n\n    test(''generates correct structure'', () async {\n      final brick = Brick.path(path.join(''..'', ''..'', ''bricks'', ''new_brick''));\n\n      final generator = await MasonGenerator.fromBrick(brick);\n      await generator.generate(\n        DirectoryGeneratorTarget(tempDir),\n        vars: {''name'': ''test_name''},\n      );\n\n      // Verify generated files exist\n      final file = File(path.join(tempDir.path, ''test_name'', ''pubspec.yaml''));\n      expect(await file.exists(), isTrue);\n    });\n\n    // Add more tests for different variable combinations\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Add Workflow Job\n\nAdd a new job to `.github/workflows/brick-test.yml`:\n\n```yaml\n  new-brick:\n    name: Test new_brick\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6\n\n      - uses: flutter-actions/setup-flutter@v4\n\n      - name: Cache dependencies\n        uses: actions/cache@v5\n        with:\n          path: |\n            ~/.pub-cache\n            .dart_tool\n          key: ${{ runner.os }}-pub-${{ hashFiles(''**/pubspec.lock'') }}\n          restore-keys: ${{ runner.os }}-pub-\n\n      - name: Install tools\n        run: dart pub global activate melos\n\n      - name: Prepare project\n        run: |\n          melos run prepare\n          mason get\n\n      - name: Test new_brick brick\n        run: dart run test_bricks/new_brick/new_brick_test.dart\n```\n\n### Step 6: Register Brick\n\nAdd to root `mason.yaml`:\n\n```yaml\nbricks:\n  new_brick:\n    path: bricks/new_brick\n```\n\nThen run `mason get` to register.\n\n## Updating an Existing Brick\n\nWhen modifying a brick:\n\n1. Update `brick.yaml` if adding/removing variables\n2. Update template files in `__brick__/`\n3. **Update tests** in `test_bricks/brick_name/` to cover changes\n4. Run test locally: `dart run test_bricks/brick_name/brick_name_test.dart`\n5. Increment version in `brick.yaml`\n\n## Removing a Brick\n\nWhen removing a brick, update all three locations:\n\n1. Remove brick directory: `rm -rf bricks/brick_name`\n2. Remove test directory: `rm -rf test_bricks/brick_name`\n3. Remove workflow job from `.github/workflows/brick-test.yml`\n4. Remove from `mason.yaml`\n5. Update CLAUDE.md if the brick was documented\n\n## Testing Locally\n\n```bash\n# Register bricks\nmason get\n\n# Test a specific brick\ndart run test_bricks/brick_name/brick_name_test.dart\n\n# Test brick generation manually\nmason make brick_name -o /tmp/test_output --var1=value1\n```\n\n## Existing Bricks Reference\n\n| Brick | Purpose | Key Variables |\n|-------|---------|---------------|\n| `screen` | Flutter screen with routing | `name`, `folder`, `has_adaptive_scaffold` |\n| `widget` | Reusable widget | `name`, `type`, `folder` |\n| `simple_bloc` | Basic BLoC package | `name` |\n| `list_bloc` | List management BLoC | `name` |\n| `form_bloc` | Form validation BLoC | `name`, `field_names` |\n| `repository` | Data repository | `name` |\n| `api_client` | API client package | `package_name` |\n| `native_federation_plugin` | Federated native plugin | `name`, `package_prefix`, `support_*` |\n\n## Checklist\n\nWhen creating/updating a brick:\n\n- [ ] `brick.yaml` has name, description, version, and vars\n- [ ] Template files use correct Mustache syntax\n- [ ] Test file exists in `test_bricks/brick_name/`\n- [ ] Tests cover main generation paths\n- [ ] Workflow job added/updated in `brick-test.yml`\n- [ ] Brick registered in `mason.yaml`\n- [ ] Run `mason get` to verify registration\n- [ ] Run test locally before committing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:31:19.950Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Flutter Development Agents needing streamlined Mason brick template management","zh":"非常适合需要简化Mason砖模板管理的Flutter开发代理","ja":"Flutter開発エージェントがMasonブリックテンプレートの管理をストリームライン化する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"Mason砖 템플릿 관리를 간소화해야 하는 Flutter 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Flutter que necesitan una gestión de plantillas de ladrillos Mason optimizada","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Flutter nécessitant une gestion de modèles de briques Mason rationalisée","de":"Perfekt für Flutter-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Mason-Backstein-Vorlagenverwaltung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Flutter que necessitam de gerenciamento de modelo de tijolo Mason simplificado","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Flutter, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент шаблонов кирпичей Mason","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير Flutter الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة قالب طوب ماسون المبسطة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, modify, and remove Mason bricks with integrated test coverage and CI workflow capabilities using Flutter, ensuring seamless project structure organization within the bricks directory","zh":"赋予代理创建、修改和删除Mason砖的能力，并集成了测试覆盖和CI工作流能力，使用Flutter，确保砖目录内的项目结构组织无缝","ja":"エージェントがMasonブリックを作成、変更、削除する能力を与え、統合テストカバレッジとCIワークフロー能力を使用してFlutterでプロジェクト構造の組織をシームレスに保つ","ko":"에이전트가 Mason砖을 생성, 수정, 삭제할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 통합 테스트 커버리지 및 CI 워크플로우 능력을 사용하여 Flutter에서 프로젝트 구조의 조직을无缝하게 유지","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, modificar y eliminar ladrillos Mason con cobertura de prueba integrada y capacidades de flujo de trabajo de CI utilizando Flutter, lo que garantiza una organización perfecta de la estructura del proyecto dentro del directorio de ladrillos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de modifier et de supprimer des briques Mason avec une couverture de test intégrée et des capacités de workflow de CI utilisant Flutter, garantissant ainsi une organisation parfaite de la structure du projet au sein du répertoire de briques","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Mason-Steine zu erstellen, zu modifizieren und zu entfernen, mit integrierter Testabdeckung und CI-Workflown-Fähigkeiten unter Verwendung von Flutter, was eine nahtlose Organisation der Projektkonstruktion innerhalb des Brick-Verzeichnisses gewährleistet","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, modificar e remover tijolos Mason com cobertura de teste integrada e capacidades de fluxo de trabalho de CI usando Flutter, garantindo organização de estrutura de projeto sem problemas dentro do diretório de tijolos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, изменять и удалять кирпичи Mason с интегрированным тестовым покрытием и возможностями рабочего процесса CI, используя Flutter, обеспечивая бесперебойную организацию структуры проекта внутри директории кирпичей","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء و تعديل و إزالة طوب ماسون مع تغطية اختبار متكاملة و قدرات تدفق عمل CI باستخدام Flutter، مما يضمن تنظيم هيكل المشروع بدون مشاكل داخل دليل الطوب"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new Mason brick templates","Updating existing brick structures or variables","Removing bricks from projects","Integrating bricks into Flutter applications"],"zh":["创建新的Mason砖模板","更新现有的砖结构或变量","从项目中删除砖","将砖集成到Flutter应用程序中"],"ja":["新しいMasonブリックテンプレートを作成する","既存のブリック構造または変数を更新する","プロジェクトからブリックを削除する","ブリックをFlutterアプリケーションに統合する"],"ko":["新的 Mason砖 템플릿을 생성","기존의 브릭 구조 또는 변수를 업데이트","프로젝트에서 브릭을 삭제","브릭을 Flutter 애플리케이션에 통합"],"es":["Creación de nuevas plantillas de ladrillos Mason","Actualización de estructuras o variables de ladrillos existentes","Eliminación de ladrillos de proyectos","Integración de ladrillos en aplicaciones Flutter"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux modèles de briques Mason","Mise à jour de structures ou de variables de briques existantes","Suppression de briques de projets","Intégration de briques dans des applications Flutter"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Mason-Backstein-Vorlagen","Aktualisierung bestehender Backsteinstrukturen oder -variablen","Entfernen von Steinen aus Projekten","Integrieren von Steinen in Flutter-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de novos modelos de tijolo Mason","Atualização de estruturas de tijolo existentes ou variáveis","Remoção de tijolos de projetos","Integração de tijolos em aplicações Flutter"],"ru":["Создание новых шаблонов кирпичей Mason","Обновление существующих структур кирпичей или переменных","Удаление кирпичей из проектов","Интеграция кирпичей в приложения Flutter"],"ar":["إنشاء قوالب طوب ماسون جديدة","تحديث هياكل طوب موجودة أو متغيرات","إزالة الطوب من المشاريع","دمج الطوب في تطبيقات Flutter"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Flutter environment","Limited to Mason brick development","Needs CI workflow integration"],"zh":["需要Flutter环境","仅限Mason砖开发","需要CI工作流集成"],"ja":["Flutter環境が必要","Masonブリック開発のみ","CIワークフロー統合が必要"],"ko":["Flutter 환경이 필요","Mason砖 개발만 가능","CI 워크플로우 통합이 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Flutter","Limitado al desarrollo de ladrillos Mason","Necesita integración de flujo de trabajo de CI"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Flutter","Limité au développement de briques Mason","Nécessite une intégration de workflow de CI"],"de":["Benötigt Flutter-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Mason-Backstein-Entwicklung","Benötigt CI-Workflown-Integration"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Flutter","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de tijolo Mason","Necessita integração do fluxo de trabalho de CI"],"ru":["Требует среды Flutter","Ограничен разработкой кирпичей Mason","Требует интеграции рабочего процесса CI"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Flutter","محدود بتطوير طوب ماسون","يحتاج إلى دمج تدفق عمل CI"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7f5bc93c91d686a91ad8260c4c82b4cdfa3f7b204561a5ed4bbfd3d81ac7dfe1","qualityScore":55}');
