":"ИИ Агенты: review-pr для Kubernetes","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: review-pr ل/kubernetes","en":"review-pr"},"description":{"zh":"review-pr AI智能代理提供一键优化和维护Hetzner Cloud上的Kubernetes，实现高效开发","ja":"review-pr AIエージェントは、Hetzner Cloud上的Kubernetesを1コマンドで最適化して維持します","ko":"review-pr AI 에이전트는 Hetzner Cloud의 Kubernetes를 한 번의 명령으로 최적화하고 유지합니다","es":"Optimiza y mantiene Kubernetes en Hetzner Cloud con un solo comando usando review-pr","fr":"Optimisez et maintenez Kubernetes sur Hetzner Cloud en une seule commande avec review-pr","de":"Optimieren und warten Sie Kubernetes auf Hetzner Cloud mit einem einzigen Befehl mit review-pr","pt":"O review-pr é uma ferramenta de IA que otimiza e mantém o Kubernetes no Hetzner Cloud em um único comando, garantindo uma infraestrutura escalável e segura","ru":"ИИ Агент review-pr оптимизирует и поддерживает Kubernetes на Hetzner Cloud с одной командой, обеспечивая масштабируемую и безопасную инфраструктуру","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي review-pr تمتاز بتحسين وادارة كوبيرنتس على هيتزنر كلاود مع أمر واحد، مما يضمن بنية تحتية قابلة للتوسيع والأمان","en":"Optimized and Maintenance-free Kubernetes on Hetzner Cloud in one command!"},"definition":{"en":"Optimized and Maintenance-free Kubernetes on Hetzner Cloud in one command!"},"features":{"zh":["一键优化Hetzner Cloud上的Kubernetes","维护免费的Kubernetes集群","提高开发效率","支持Hetzner Cloud","简单易用的CLI接口"],"ja":["Hetzner Cloud上的Kubernetesを1コマンドで最適化","メンテナンスフリーのKubernetesクラスター","開発効率の向上","Hetzner Cloudのサポート","シンプルなCLIインターフェース"],"ko":["한 번의 명령으로 Hetzner Cloud의 Kubernetes 최적화","유지 보수 없는 Kubernetes 클러스터","개발 효율성 향상","Hetzner Cloud 지원","단순한 CLI 인터페이스"],"es":["Optimización de Kubernetes","Despliegue sin mantenimiento","Integración con Hetzner Cloud","Uso de un solo comando","Herramienta de AI para la automatización","Mejora de la eficiencia y la escalabilidad"],"fr":["Optimisation de Kubernetes","Déploiement sans maintenance","Intégration avec Hetzner Cloud","Utilisation d''une seule commande","Outil d''IA pour l''automatisation","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la scalabilité"],"de":["Optimierung von Kubernetes","Wartungsfreie Bereitstellung","Integration mit Hetzner Cloud","Verwendung eines einzigen Befehls","KI-Tool für die Automatisierung","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["Otimização de Kubernetes","Manutenção automática","Infraestrutura escalável","Segurança garantida","Integração com Hetzner Cloud","Uso de um único comando"],"ru":["Оптимизация Kubernetes","Автоматическое обслуживание","Масштабируемая инфраструктура","Гарантированная безопасность","Интеграция с Hetzner Cloud","Использование одной команды"],"ar":["تحسين كوبيرنتس","ادارة خودكار","بنية تحتية قابلة للتوسيع","أمان مضمون","تكامل مع هيتزنر كلاود","استخدام أمر واحد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用review-pr","什么是Kubernetes","review-pr替代品","Hetzner Cloud Kubernetes","Kubernetes安装","Kubernetes配置指南","review-pr vs kubectl","Kubernetes优化"],"ja":["review-prの使い方","Kubernetesとは","review-prの代替","Hetzner Cloud Kubernetes","Kubernetesのインストール","Kubernetesの設定ガイド","review-pr vs kubectl","Kubernetesの最適化"],"ko":["review-pr 사용 방법","Kubernetes란","review-pr 대체","Hetzner Cloud Kubernetes","Kubernetes 설치","Kubernetes 설정 가이드","review-pr vs kubectl","Kubernetes 최적화"],"es":["cómo usar review-pr","qué es review-pr","review-pr alternativa","review-pr vs kubectl","instalación de review-pr","guía de configuración de review-pr","herramientas de AI para devops","optimización de kubernetes"],"fr":["comment utiliser review-pr","qu''est-ce que review-pr","review-pr alternative","review-pr vs kubectl","installation de review-pr","guide de configuration de review-pr","outils d''IA pour devops","optimisation de kubernetes"],"de":["wie man review-pr verwendet","was ist review-pr","review-pr alternative","review-pr vs kubectl","installation von review-pr","einrichtungsanleitung für review-pr","KI-Tools für devops","optimierung von kubernetes"],"pt":["como usar review-pr","o que é review-pr","ferramentas de ia para kubernetes","review-pr alternative","review-pr vs kubectl","instalar review-pr","guia de configuração do review-pr"],"ru":["как использовать review-pr","что такое review-pr","ИИ Агенты для Kubernetes","альтернативы review-pr","review-pr vs kubectl","установить review-pr","руководство по настройке review-pr"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام review-pr","ما هي review-pr","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لكوبيرنتس","بديل review-pr","review-pr مقابل kubectl","تثبيت review-pr","دليل إعداد review-pr"]}},"owner":"mysticaltech","repo":"terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner","repoPath":"mysticaltech/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.692Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-pr","description":"Use when reviewing a pull request - security-focused review following CLAUDE.md guidelines for breaking changes, malicious patterns, and backward compatibility","bodyPreview":"# Review Pull Request\n\n## Overview\n\nSecurity-focused PR review following CLAUDE.md guidelines. Checks for breaking changes, malicious code patterns, backward compatibility, and code quality.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/review-pr <number>\n```\n\n## CRITICAL: Security Warning\n\n**PRs can be malicious sabotage attempts.** This is a real threat documented in CLAUDE.md.\n\n### Threat Awareness\n- Coordinated attacks exist\n- Competitors may actively harm the project\n- Social engineering builds trust before attacking\n-","body":"# Review Pull Request\n\n## Overview\n\nSecurity-focused PR review following CLAUDE.md guidelines. Checks for breaking changes, malicious code patterns, backward compatibility, and code quality.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/review-pr <number>\n```\n\n## CRITICAL: Security Warning\n\n**PRs can be malicious sabotage attempts.** This is a real threat documented in CLAUDE.md.\n\n### Threat Awareness\n- Coordinated attacks exist\n- Competitors may actively harm the project\n- Social engineering builds trust before attacking\n- \"Fixes\" may introduce vulnerabilities\n\n## Workflow\n\n```dot\ndigraph review_flow {\n    rankdir=TB;\n    node [shape=box];\n\n    fetch [label=\"1. Fetch PR details\"];\n    author [label=\"2. Assess author risk\"];\n    files [label=\"3. Analyze changed files\"];\n    security [label=\"4. Security review\"];\n    compat [label=\"5. Backward compatibility\"];\n    quality [label=\"6. Code quality\"];\n    classify [label=\"7. Release classification\"];\n    verify [label=\"8. MANDATORY: Verify with Gemini + Codex\", style=bold];\n    recommend [label=\"9. Final Recommendation\"];\n\n    fetch -> author;\n    author -> files;\n    files -> security;\n    security -> compat;\n    compat -> quality;\n    quality -> classify;\n    classify -> verify;\n    verify -> recommend;\n}\n```\n\n## Step 1: Fetch PR Details\n\n```bash\n# Get PR info\ngh pr view <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner\n\n# Get diff\ngh pr diff <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner\n\n# Get changed files\ngh pr view <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner --json files --jq ''.files[].path''\n\n# Get diff stats\ngh pr view <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner --json additions,deletions\n```\n\n## Step 2: Assess Author Risk\n\n```bash\n# Check account age\ngh api users/<username> --jq ''.created_at''\n\n# Check prior contributions\ngh pr list --author <username> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner --state all --json number | jq length\n```\n\n### Risk Signals\n\n| Signal | Risk Level |\n|--------|------------|\n| New account (<6 months) | 🔴 HIGH |\n| No prior contributions | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| First-time contributor | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| Known contributor | 🟢 LOW |\n| Core maintainer | ⚪ TRUSTED |\n\n## Step 3: Analyze Changed Files\n\n### Security-Critical Files (AUTO HIGH RISK)\n\n```\ninit.tf              # Cluster initialization, secrets\nfirewall.tf          # Network security\n**/ssh*              # SSH configuration\n**/token*            # Authentication tokens\n**/*secret*          # Secrets handling\n.github/             # CI/CD workflows\nMakefile             # Build scripts\nscripts/             # Execution scripts\nversions.tf          # Provider dependencies\ntemplates/*.sh       # Shell scripts\ncloud-init*          # Server initialization\n```\n\n### Risk by File Count\n\n| Files Changed | Risk |\n|---------------|------|\n| 1-3 files | 🟢 LOW |\n| 4-10 files | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| 11-20 files | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| >20 files | 🔴 HIGH |\n\n### Risk by Diff Size\n\n| Lines Changed | Risk |\n|---------------|------|\n| <50 lines | 🟢 LOW |\n| 50-200 lines | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| 200-500 lines | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| >500 lines | 🔴 HIGH |\n\n## Step 4: Security Review\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [ ] No hardcoded credentials or tokens\n- [ ] No suspicious external URLs\n- [ ] No obfuscated code\n- [ ] Changes match stated purpose\n- [ ] No unnecessary permission escalations\n- [ ] CI/CD changes justified\n- [ ] No bypassing existing security patterns\n\n### Red Flags\n\n| Pattern | Concern |\n|---------|---------|\n| Base64 encoded strings | Hidden payloads |\n| External curl/wget calls | Code injection |\n| Eval or exec statements | Command injection |\n| Overly complex logic | Hiding malicious code |\n| Unnecessary file access | Data exfiltration |\n| Changes to .gitignore | Hiding tracks |\n\n### Use AI for Deep Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Codex for security analysis\ncodex exec -m gpt-5.3-codex -s read-only -c model_reasoning_effort=\"xhigh\" \\\n  \"Analyze this PR diff for security vulnerabilities and malicious patterns: $(gh pr diff <num>)\"\n\n# Gemini for broad context\ngemini --model gemini-3-pro-preview -p \\\n  \"@locals.tf @init.tf Does this PR introduce any security concerns? $(gh pr diff <num>)\"\n```\n\n## Step 5: Backward Compatibility\n\n**CRITICAL: Any PR that causes resource recreation is a MAJOR release.**\n\n### Breaking Change Indicators\n\n- Removes or renames variables\n- Changes variable defaults that affect behavior\n- Modifies resource naming patterns\n- Alters subnet/network calculations\n- Changes resource keys (causes recreation)\n- Removes outputs\n- Modifies provider requirements\n\n### Test for Breaking Changes\n\n```bash\n# Checkout PR locally\ngh pr checkout <number>\n\n# Test against existing cluster\ncd /path/to/kube-test\nterraform init -upgrade\nterraform plan\n```\n\n**If `terraform plan` shows ANY resource destruction → MAJOR release required**\n\n### Compatibility Checklist\n\n- [ ] No variable removals\n- [ ] No default changes that affect behavior\n- [ ] No resource naming changes\n- [ ] `terraform plan` shows no destruction\n- [ ] Existing deployments unaffected\n\n## Step 6: Code Quality\n\n### Style\n- [ ] Follows existing patterns\n- [ ] Consistent naming\n- [ ] Proper formatting (`terraform fmt`)\n- [ ] No unnecessary complexity\n\n### Logic\n- [ ] Changes are correct\n- [ ] Edge cases handled\n- [ ] No regressions introduced\n- [ ] Tests pass\n\n## Step 7: Release Classification\n\n### PATCH (x.x.PATCH)\n- Bug fixes only\n- No new features\n- Fully backward compatible\n- No terraform state impact\n\n### MINOR (x.MINOR.0)\n- New features (backward compatible)\n- New optional variables with defaults\n- Deprecation warnings (not removals)\n\n### MAJOR (MAJOR.0.0)\n- Breaking changes\n- Removed/renamed variables\n- Changed defaults affecting behavior\n- State migrations required\n- Resource recreations\n\n## Step 8: MANDATORY - Verify with Gemini and Codex\n\n**CRITICAL: Before making your final recommendation, you MUST run both Gemini and Codex to triple-verify the PR.**\n\nThis is not optional. External AI verification catches issues that may be missed in the initial review.\n\n### Run Both in Parallel\n\n```bash\n# Gemini - Broad context analysis (run first or in parallel)\ngemini --model gemini-3-pro-preview -p \"@control_planes.tf @locals.tf @init.tf\n\nAnalyze this PR diff for the kube-hetzner terraform module:\n\n$(gh pr diff <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner)\n\nQuestions:\n1. Is this change consistent with existing patterns in the codebase?\n2. Are there any security concerns?\n3. Could this cause breaking changes or resource recreation?\n4. Is this a legitimate bug fix or could it be malicious?\"\n\n# Codex - Deep reasoning security analysis (run in parallel)\ncodex exec -m gpt-5.3-codex -s read-only -c model_reasoning_effort=\"xhigh\" \\\n\"Analyze this Terraform PR for the kube-hetzner module.\n\nDIFF:\n$(gh pr diff <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner)\n\nSECURITY ANALYSIS QUESTIONS:\n1. Could this change introduce any security vulnerabilities?\n2. Could this be a malicious change disguised as a bug fix?\n3. Will this cause any Terraform state changes or resource recreation?\n4. Is this pattern safe and consistent with Terraform best practices?\n5. Any edge cases or potential issues?\"\n```\n\n### Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] Gemini analysis completed\n- [ ] Codex analysis completed\n- [ ] Both agree the change is safe\n- [ ] No concerns raised by either tool\n- [ ] If concerns raised, they have been addressed or explained\n\n### When Reviewers Disagree\n\nIf Gemini or Codex raises concerns that you didn''t catch:\n1. **Take the concern seriously** - investigate further\n2. **Re-read the code** with the concern in mind\n3. **Request changes** if the concern is valid\n4. **Document** why the concern was dismissed if you determine it''s a false positive\n\n### Output in Final Review\n\nInclude a summary of external verification:\n\n```markdown\n### External AI Verification\n\n| Reviewer | Verdict | Key Finding |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| Claude | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n| Gemini | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n| Codex | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n\n**Consensus:** All reviewers agree / Disagreement on X\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 9: Final Recommendation\n\n### PR Review Output Template\n\n```markdown\n## PR Review: #<number>\n\n**Title:** <title>\n**Author:** @<username>\n**Files:** <count> files changed (+<additions>/-<deletions>)\n\n### Risk Assessment\n\n| Factor | Value | Risk |\n|--------|-------|------|\n| Author tenure | X months | 🟢/🟡/🔴 |\n| Prior contributions | N PRs | 🟢/🟡/🔴 |\n| Files changed | N files | 🟢/🟡/🔴 |\n| Lines changed | +X/-Y | 🟢/🟡/🔴 |\n| Security-critical files | Yes/No | 🟢/🔴 |\n| External dependencies | Yes/No | 🟢/🔴 |\n\n**Overall Risk:** 🔴 HIGH / 🟡 MEDIUM / 🟢 LOW\n\n### Security Review\n\n- [ ] No hardcoded credentials\n- [ ] No suspicious external URLs\n- [ ] No obfuscated code\n- [ ] Changes match stated purpose\n\n### Backward Compatibility\n\n- [ ] No breaking changes\n- [ ] terraform plan shows no destruction\n- [ ] Existing deployments unaffected\n\n### Release Classification\n\n**Type:** PATCH / MINOR / MAJOR\n**Reason:** <explanation>\n\n### External AI Verification\n\n| Reviewer | Verdict | Key Finding |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| Claude | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n| Gemini | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n| Codex | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n\n**Consensus:** All agree / Disagreement on X\n\n### Recommendation\n\n**Action:** APPROVE / REQUEST CHANGES / CLOSE\n**Notes:** <specific concerns or required changes>\n```\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Approve PR\ngh pr review <num> --approve --body \"LGTM! ...\"\n\n# Request changes\ngh pr review <num> --request-changes --body \"Please address: ...\"\n\n# Comment\ngh pr review <num> --comment --body \"...\"\n\n# Merge (after approval)\ngh pr merge <num> --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n## Never Merge Directly to Master\n\nAll PRs go through staging branches first:\n\n1. Create staging branch\n2. Test thoroughly\n3. Get AI review (Codex + Gemini)\n4. Then merge to master\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:35:00.821Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Security-Focused Code Review Agents operating in high-risk open source environments.","zh":"适用于在高风险开源环境中运行的安全专注代码审查代理。","ja":"セキュリティに焦点を当てたコードレビュー エージェントが、高リスクのオープンソース環境で動作するには不可欠です。","ko":"고위험 오픈소스 환경에서 작동하는 보안 중심 코드 검토 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Revisión de Código con Enfoque en Seguridad que operan en entornos de código abierto de alto riesgo.","fr":"Essentiel pour les Agents de Révision de Code axés sur la Sécurité opérant dans des environnements open source à haut risque.","de":"Wesentlich für Sicherheitsorientierte Code-Review-Agents, die in hochrisikoreichen Open-Source-Umgebungen operieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Revisão de Código com Foco em Segurança que operam em ambientes de código aberto de alto risco.","ru":"Необходим для агентов проверки кода, ориентированных на безопасность, работающих в средах с открытым исходным кодом высокого риска.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات مراجعة الأكواد الموحدة مع التركيز على الأمان والتي تعمل في بيئات مفتوحة المصدر ذات مخاطر عالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated detection of malicious code patterns and breaking changes following CLAUDE.md security guidelines. Provides critical threat awareness against coordinated sabotage attempts and social engineering attacks documented in real-world scenarios.","zh":"启用自动检测恶意代码模式和违反CLAUDE.md安全指南的破坏性更改。提供针对协调破坏尝试和记录在真实世界场景中的社会工程攻击的关键威胁感知。","ja":"CLAUDE.mdセキュリティガイドラインに違反する悪意のあるコードパターンと破壊的な変更の自動検出を有効にする。現実世界のシナリオで文書化された社会工学攻撃に対する調整された破壊の試みに対する重要な脅威認識を提供する。","ko":"CLAUDE.md 보안 가이드ライン에 위반하는 악성 코드 패턴 및 破壊적인 변경의 자동 감지를 활성화합니다. 실제 العالم 시나리오에서 문서화된 사회 공학 공격에 대한 조정된 破壊 시도의 주요 위협 인식을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la detección automatizada de patrones de código malicioso y cambios de ruptura siguiendo las directrices de seguridad de CLAUDE.md. Proporciona una conciencia crítica de las amenazas contra intentos de sabotaje coordinados y ataques de ingeniería social documentados en escenarios del mundo real.","fr":"Permet la détection automatisée de modèles de code malveillants et de changements de rupture suivant les directives de sécurité de CLAUDE.md. Fournit une conscience critique des menaces contre les tentatives de sabotage coordonnées et les attaques d''ingénierie sociale documentées dans des scénarios du monde réel.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Erkennung von bösartigen Code-Mustern und brechenden Änderungen unter Einhaltung der Sicherheitsrichtlinien von CLAUDE.md. Bietet ein kritisches Bewusstsein für Bedrohungen gegen koordinierte Sabotageversuche und Social-Engineering-Angriffe, die in realen Szenarien dokumentiert sind.","pt":"Permite a detecção automatizada de padrões de código maliciosos e alterações de quebra seguindo as diretrizes de segurança do CLAUDE.md. Fornece conscientização crítica de ameaças contra tentativas de sabotagem coordenadas e ataques de engenharia social documentados em cenários do mundo real.","ru":"Позволяет автоматически обнаруживать вредоносные шаблоны кода и изменения, нарушающие совместимость, в соответствии с руководящими принципами безопасности CLAUDE.md. Предоставляет критическую осведомленность об угрозах против скоординированных попыток саботажа и атак социальной инженерии, задокументированных в реальных сценариях.","ar":"تمكن من الكشف التلقائي عن أنماط الأكواد الخبيثة والتغييرات التي تسبب مشاكل في التوافق، وفقًا لإرشادات الأمان CLAUDE.md. توفر الوعي بالتهديدات الحاسمة ضد محاولات التخريب المنظمة وهجمات الهندسة الاجتماعية الموثقة في السيناريوهات الحقيقية."},"useCases":{"en":["Scanning PRs for backward compatibility issues","Detecting malicious code patterns in pull requests","Validating code quality against security standards","Identifying potential social engineering attacks in contributions"],"zh":["扫描PR以查找向后兼容性问题","检测PR中的恶意代码模式","验证代码质量是否符合安全标准","识别投稿中的潜在社会工程攻击"],"ja":["バックワード互換性の問題のPRをスキャンする","PRの中の悪意のあるコードパターンを検出する","コード品質をセキュリティ規格に照らして検証する","投稿の中の潜在的な社会工学攻撃を特定する"],"ko":["PR에서 후방 호환성 문제를 스캔합니다","PR에서 악성 코드 패턴을 감지합니다","코드 품질을 보안 표준과 비교하여 검증합니다","기고문에서 잠재적인 사회 공학 공격을 식별합니다"],"es":["Escaneo de PR para problemas de compatibilidad hacia atrás","Detección de patrones de código malicioso en solicitudes de extracción","Validación de la calidad del código contra normas de seguridad","Identificación de posibles ataques de ingeniería social en contribuciones"],"fr":["Analyse de PR pour les problèmes de compatibilité ascendante","Détection de modèles de code malveillants dans les demandes d''extraction","Validation de la qualité du code contre les normes de sécurité","Identification d''attaques potentielles d''ingénierie sociale dans les contributions"],"de":["Scannen von PR auf Kompatibilitätsprobleme im Hinblick auf rückwärts","Erkennung von bösartigen Code-Mustern in Pull-Requests","Validierung der Code-Qualität gegen Sicherheitsstandards","Identifizierung potenzieller Social-Engineering-Angriffe in Beiträgen"],"pt":["Digitalização de PRs para questões de compatibilidade para trás","Detecção de padrões de código maliciosos em solicitações de pull","Validação da qualidade do código contra padrões de segurança","Identificação de ataques de engenharia social potenciais em contribuições"],"ru":["Сканирование PR на предмет проблем с обратной совместимостью","Обнаружение вредоносных шаблонов кода в запросах на включение","Проверка качества кода на соответствие стандартам безопасности","Определение потенциальных атак социальной инженерии в вкладках"],"ar":["فحص الطلبات الجديدة للتوافق العكسي","الكشف عن أنماط الأكواد الخبيثة في الطلبات الجديدة","التحقق من جودة الأكواد مقابل معايير الأمان","تحديد الهجمات المحتملة لهندسة الاجتماع في المساهمات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PR number input parameter","Designed for Kubernetes/Hetzner Cloud environments","Follows specific CLAUDE.md security protocols"],"zh":["需要PR编号输入参数","为Kubernetes/Hetzner Cloud环境而设计","遵循特定的CLAUDE.md安全协议"],"ja":["PR番号入力パラメータが必要","Kubernetes/Hetzner Cloud環境用に設計","特定のCLAUDE.mdセキュリティプロトコルに従う"],"ko":["PR 번호 입력 매개 변수가 필요합니다","Kubernetes/Hetzner Cloud 환경을 위한 설계","특정 CLAUDE.md 보안 프로토콜을 따름"],"es":["Requiere el parámetro de entrada del número de PR","Diseñado para entornos de Kubernetes/Hetzner Cloud","Sigue protocolos de seguridad específicos de CLAUDE.md"],"fr":["Nécessite le paramètre d''entrée du numéro de PR","Conçu pour les environnements Kubernetes/Hetzner Cloud","Suit des protocoles de sécurité spécifiques de CLAUDE.md"],"de":["Benötigt den Eingabeparameter der PR-Nummer","Entworfen für Kubernetes/Hetzner Cloud-Umgebungen","Befolgt spezifische Sicherheitsprotokolle von CLAUDE.md"],"pt":["Exige parâmetro de entrada do número da PR","Projetado para ambientes Kubernetes/Hetzner Cloud","Sigue protocolos de segurança específicos do CLAUDE.md"],"ru":["Требует параметра ввода номера PR","Разработан для сред Kubernetes/Hetzner Cloud","Следует конкретным протоколам безопасности CLAUDE.md"],"ar":["يتطلب معامل إدخال رقم الطلب الجديدة","مصمم للبيئات Kubernetes/Hetzner Cloud","يتبع بروتوكولات أمان محددة من CLAUDE.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"58bf3bb29861e478cfbe5fc8ba3c9d1c2d993d0b3fa86f85daa05bbd0f74f8cc","qualityScore":55}');
