ucture des applications","Contrats core et packages sdk","Outils de développement pour Hyperlane","Intégration avec d''autres outils d''IA"],"de":["Untersuchung von steckenbleibenden Nachrichten","Verbesserung der Infrastruktur von Anwendungen","Core-Verträge und SDK-Pakete","Entwicklungstools für Hyperlane","Integration mit anderen AI-Tools"],"pt":["Diagnóstico de problemas de mensagens presas","Análise de infraestrutura de Hyperlane","Desenvolvimento de soluções personalizadas","Integração com SDKs e contratos core","Suporte a desenvolvedores de Node.js e React"],"ru":["Диагностика проблем застрявших сообщений","Анализ инфраструктуры Hyperlane","Разработка индивидуальных решений","Интеграция с SDK и核心ными контрактами","Поддержка разработчиков Node.js и React"],"ar":["تشخيص مشاكل الرسائل العالقة","تحليل بنية تحتية Hyperlane","تطوير حلول مخصصة","التكامل مع SDKs وعقود.Core","دعم المطورين من Node.js و React"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Hyperlane开发","sdk包管理","基础设施优化","investigate-stuck-messages教程","AI工具比较","Hyperlane安装","sdk包下载"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Hyperlane開発","sdkパッケージの管理","インフラストラクチャの最適化","investigate-stuck-messagesの使い方","AIツールの比較","Hyperlaneのインストール","sdkパッケージのダウンロード"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Hyperlane 개발","sdk 패키지 관리","인프라 최적화","investigate-stuck-messages 사용법","AI 도구 비교","Hyperlane 설치","sdk 패키지 다운로드"],"es":["herramientas de ai","investigar mensajes bloqueados","hyperlane","desarrollo de aplicaciones","infraestructura de aplicaciones","contratos core","paquetes sdk","guias de instalación de hyperlane","configuración de hyperlane"],"fr":["outils d''ia","investiguer les messages bloqués","hyperlane","développement d''applications","infrastructure des applications","contrats core","packages sdk","guides d''installation de hyperlane","configuration de hyperlane"],"de":["ai-tools","steckenbleibende nachrichten untersuchen","hyperlane","anwendungsentwicklung","anwendungsinfrastruktur","core-verträge","sdk-pakete","installation guides für hyperlane","hyperlane konfiguration"],"pt":["como usar investigate-stuck-messages","o que é investigate-stuck-messages","investigate-stuck-messages vs outras ferramentas","instalar investigate-stuck-messages","guia de configuração do investigate-stuck-messages","desenvolvimento de infraestrutura de Hyperlane","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","investigate-stuck-messages alternative"],"ru":["как использовать investigate-stuck-messages","что такое investigate-stuck-messages","investigate-stuck-messages vs другие инструменты","установить investigate-stuck-messages","руководство по настройке investigate-stuck-messages","разработка инфраструктуры Hyperlane","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","альтернатива investigate-stuck-messages"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام investigate-stuck-messages","ما هي investigate-stuck-messages","investigate-stuck-messages مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت investigate-stuck-messages","دليل إعداد investigate-stuck-messages","تطوير بنية تحتية Hyperlane","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل investigate-stuck-messages"]}},"owner":"hyperlane-xyz","repo":"hyperlane-monorepo","repoPath":"hyperlane-xyz/hyperlane-monorepo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.693Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"investigate-stuck-messages","description":"Investigate stuck messages in relayer queue. Use when alerts mention queue length > 0, to diagnose why messages are stuck, or to get message IDs for denylisting.","bodyPreview":"# Investigate Stuck Messages\n\nQuery the relayer API to investigate stuck messages, their retry counts, and error reasons.\n\n## When to Use\n\n1. **Alert-based triggers:**\n   - Alert: \"Known app context relayer queue length > 0 for 40m\"\n   - Any alert mentioning stuck messages in prepare queue\n   - High retry counts for specific app contexts\n\n2. **User request triggers:**\n   - \"Why are messages stuck for [app_context]?\"\n   - \"Investigate stuck messages on [chain]\"\n   - \"What''s causing the queue aler","body":"# Investigate Stuck Messages\n\nQuery the relayer API to investigate stuck messages, their retry counts, and error reasons.\n\n## When to Use\n\n1. **Alert-based triggers:**\n   - Alert: \"Known app context relayer queue length > 0 for 40m\"\n   - Any alert mentioning stuck messages in prepare queue\n   - High retry counts for specific app contexts\n\n2. **User request triggers:**\n   - \"Why are messages stuck for [app_context]?\"\n   - \"Investigate stuck messages on [chain]\"\n   - \"What''s causing the queue alert?\"\n   - Pasting a Grafana alert URL\n\n## Input Parameters\n\n**Option 1: Grafana Alert URL (recommended)**\n\n```\n/investigate-stuck-messages https://abacusworks.grafana.net/alerting/grafana/cdg1ro5hi4vswb/view?tab=instances\n```\n\n**Option 2: Manual specification**\n\n```\n/investigate-stuck-messages app_context=EZETH/renzo-prod remote=linea\n```\n\n| Parameter     | Required | Default    | Description                                                           |\n| ------------- | -------- | ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `alert_url`   | No       | -          | Grafana alert URL (extracts app_context/remote from firing instances) |\n| `app_context` | No\\*     | -          | The app context (e.g., `EZETH/renzo-prod`, `oUSDT/production`)        |\n| `remote`      | No\\*     | -          | Destination chain name (e.g., `linea`, `ethereum`, `arbitrum`)        |\n| `environment` | No       | `mainnet3` | Deployment environment                                                |\n\n\\*Either `alert_url` OR both `app_context` and `remote` must be provided.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Parse Input and Extract Alert Instances\n\n**If Grafana alert URL provided:**\n\n1. Extract the alert UID from the URL (e.g., `cdg1ro5hi4vswb` from `.../alerting/grafana/cdg1ro5hi4vswb/view`)\n\n2. Query Prometheus directly for firing instances using `mcp__grafana__query_prometheus`:\n\n   ```\n   sum by (app_context, remote)(\n       max_over_time(\n           hyperlane_submitter_queue_length{\n               queue_name=\"prepare_queue\",\n               app_context!~\"Unknown|merkly_eth|merkly_erc20|helloworld|velo_message_module\",\n               hyperlane_context!~\"rc|vanguard0|vanguard1|vanguard2|vanguard3|vanguard4|vanguard5\",\n               operation_status!~\"Retry\\\\(ApplicationReport\\\\(.*\\\\)\\\\)|FirstPrepareAttempt\",\n               hyperlane_deployment=\"mainnet3\",\n           }[2m]\n       )\n   ) > 0\n   ```\n\n3. Extract `app_context` and `remote` labels from each result.\n\n**If manual app_context/remote provided:**\n\nUse the provided values directly.\n\n### Step 2: Setup Port-Forward to Relayer\n\nCheck if port 9090 is already in use:\n\n```bash\nlsof -i :9090\n```\n\nIf not in use, start port-forward in background:\n\n```bash\nkubectl port-forward omniscient-relayer-hyperlane-agent-relayer-0 9090 -n mainnet3 &\n```\n\nWait a few seconds for the port-forward to establish.\n\n### Step 3: Get Domain IDs for Chains\n\nLook up domain IDs from the registry:\n\n```bash\ncat node_modules/.pnpm/@hyperlane-xyz+registry@*/node_modules/@hyperlane-xyz/registry/dist/chains/<chain>/metadata.json | jq ''.domainId''\n```\n\nCommon domain IDs:\n\n- ethereum: 1\n- optimism: 10\n- arbitrum: 42161\n- polygon: 137\n- base: 8453\n- unichain: 130\n- avalanche: 43114\n\n### Step 4: Query Relayer API\n\nFor each destination chain, query the relayer API:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s ''http://localhost:9090/list_operations?destination_domain=<DOMAIN_ID>'' > /tmp/<chain>.json\n```\n\nThe response contains operations with:\n\n- `id`: Message ID (H256)\n- `operation.message.sender`: Sender address\n- `operation.message.recipient`: Recipient address\n- `operation.num_retries`: Number of retries (higher = more stuck)\n- `operation.status`: Error status (e.g., `{\"Retry\": \"ErrorEstimatingGas\"}`)\n- `operation.message.origin`: Origin domain ID\n- `operation.message.destination`: Destination domain ID\n- `operation.app_context`: App context name\n\n### Step 5: Filter Messages by App Context\n\nLook up the `app_context` in `rust/main/app-contexts/mainnet_config.json`:\n\n```bash\njq ''.metricAppContexts[] | select(.name == \"<APP_CONTEXT>\")'' rust/main/app-contexts/mainnet_config.json\n```\n\nFilter API results to only include messages where:\n\n- `operation.message.recipient` matches one of the `recipientAddress` values for that destination domain\n\n**Important**: Addresses are padded to 32 bytes (H256 format).\n\n### Step 6: Query GCP Logs for Actual Errors\n\n**Calculate log freshness based on retry count:**\n\nThe relayer uses exponential backoff (see `calculate_msg_backoff` in `rust/main/agents/relayer/src/msg/pending_message.rs`):\n\n| Retries | Backoff/retry | Cumulative Time | Freshness Flag    |\n| ------- | ------------- | --------------- | ----------------- |\n| 1-4     | 5s-1min       | ~2min           | `--freshness=1h`  |\n| 5-24    | 3min          | ~1h             | `--freshness=3h`  |\n| 25-39   | 5-26min       | ~5h             | `--freshness=12h` |\n| 40-49   | 30min-1h      | ~12h            | `--freshness=24h` |\n| 50-60   | 2-22h         | ~35h            | `--freshness=3d`  |\n| 60+     | 22h+          | 35h+            | `--freshness=7d`  |\n\nFor each message ID, query GCP logs with calculated freshness:\n\n```bash\ngcloud logging read ''resource.type=k8s_container AND resource.labels.namespace_name=mainnet3 AND resource.labels.pod_name:omniscient-relayer AND jsonPayload.span.id:<MESSAGE_ID> AND jsonPayload.fields.error:*'' --project=abacus-labs-dev --limit=1 --format=''value(jsonPayload.fields.error)'' --freshness=<CALCULATED_FRESHNESS>\n```\n\nExtract the human-readable error from the response using `sed` (macOS compatible):\n\n```bash\necho \"$raw_error\" | sed -n ''s/.*execution reverted: \\([^\"]*\\)\".*/\\1/p'' | head -1\n```\n\nCommon error patterns:\n\n- `\"execution reverted: Nonce already used\"` → \"Nonce already used\"\n- `\"execution reverted: panic: arithmetic underflow\"` → \"Arithmetic underflow\"\n\n**Note**: Do not use `grep -P` as it''s not available on macOS.\n\n### Step 7: Present Investigation Results\n\nOutput a detailed summary table with **full message IDs** and **both error sources**:\n\n```\n## Investigation Results for [APP_CONTEXT]\n\n### Summary\n- Total stuck messages: X\n- Destinations affected: [list]\n- Reprepare reasons: ErrorEstimatingGas (N), CouldNotFetchMetadata (M)\n\n### Messages\n\n| Message ID | Retries | Reprepare Reason | Error | Origin |\n|------------|---------|------------------|-----------|--------|\n| `0xaa18ebc1c79345e6d24984a0b9a5ab66c968d128d46b2357b641e56e71b8d30c` | 47 | ErrorEstimatingGas | Nonce already used | optimism |\n| `0xd6aeef7c092a88aa23ad53227aeb834ae731d059b3ce749db8451e761f3f15ac` | 47 | ErrorEstimatingGas | Nonce already used | arbitrum |\n\n**Important**: Always show the full 66-character message ID (0x + 64 hex chars). Do not truncate.\n\n### Error Analysis\n[Explain based on the actual log errors found]\n\n### Next Steps\nTo denylist these messages, run:\n/denylist-stuck-messages <message_ids> app_context=APP_CONTEXT\n```\n\n**Column definitions:**\n\n- **Reprepare Reason**: From `operation.status` in relayer API (e.g., ErrorEstimatingGas, CouldNotFetchMetadata)\n- **Error**: Actual revert reason from GCP logs (e.g., \"Nonce already used\", \"Arithmetic underflow\")\n\n### Step 8: Output Denylist Command\n\nAt the end of the investigation results, output the full denylist command:\n\n```\n### Next Steps\nTo denylist, run:\n/denylist-stuck-messages 0xaa18ebc1c79345e6d24984a0b9a5ab66c968d128d46b2357b641e56e71b8d30c 0xd6aeef7c092a88aa23ad53227aeb834ae731d059b3ce749db8451e761f3f15ac app_context=APP_CONTEXT\n```\n\nAlways use full message IDs, never truncated.\n\n## Error Status Reference\n\n| Status                   | Meaning                                 | Action                                   |\n| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `ErrorEstimatingGas`     | Gas estimation failed (contract revert) | Usually denylist - contract won''t accept |\n| `CouldNotFetchMetadata`  | Can''t get ISM metadata                  | Check validators, may resolve itself     |\n| `ApplicationReport(...)` | App-specific error                      | Check the specific error message         |\n| `GasPaymentNotFound`     | No IGP payment                          | May need manual relay with gas           |\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- **Port-forward fails**: Check kubectl context: `kubectl config current-context`\n- **No messages found**: Queue may have cleared; alert may be stale\n- **API returns error**: Check relayer pod: `kubectl get pods -n mainnet3 | grep relayer`\n- **App context not found**: May be new/custom; ask user for sender/recipient addresses\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `kubectl` configured with access to mainnet cluster\n- Grafana MCP server connected (for alert URL parsing)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:35:08.270Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Relayer API Agents needing advanced message queue analysis and error troubleshooting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级消息队列分析和错误排查功能的Relayer API代理。","ja":"Relayer APIエージェントが高度なメッセージキュー分析とエラートラブルシューティング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Relayer API 에이전트가 고급 메시지 큐 분석 및 오류 문제 해결 기능을 필요로 할 때 完全에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de API de Relayer que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis de cola de mensajes y solución de problemas de errores.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents API Relayer nécessitant des capacités avancées d''analyse de file d''attente de messages et de dépannage d''erreurs.","de":"Perfekt für Relayer-API-Agents, die erweiterte Nachrichtenwarteschlangenanalyse- und Fehlersuche-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de API Relayer que precisam de análise avançada de filas de mensagens e capacidades de depuração de erros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Relayer API, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа очередей сообщений и устранения ошибок.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وسيط API الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم لصفوف الرسائل وقدرات فحص الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query the relayer API, investigate stuck messages, and analyze retry counts and error reasons using Hyperlane core contracts and SDK packages, enabling efficient debugging and optimization of message queues.","zh":"赋予代理查询Relayer API、调查卡住的消息、并使用Hyperlane核心合约和SDK包分析特定应用程序上下文的重试次数和错误原因，从而实现消息队列的高效调试和优化。","ja":"Relayer APIエージェントに、Relayer APIを照会し、メッセージがスタックしている原因を調査し、Hyperlaneコア契約とSDKパッケージを使用して特定のアプリケーションコンテキストのリトライ回数とエラー理由を分析する機能を提供し、メッセージキューの効率的なデバッグと最適化を可能にします。","ko":"Relayer API 에이전트에게 Relayer API를 쿼리하고, 메시지가 걸리는 원인을 조사하고, Hyperlane 핵심 계약 및 SDK 패키지를 사용하여 특정 애플리케이션 컨텍스트의 재시도 횟수 및 오류 사유를 분석하여 메시지 큐의 효율적인 디버깅 및 최적화를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar la API de relayer, investigar mensajes atascados y analizar los recuentos de reintentos y razones de error utilizando contratos y paquetes de SDK de Hyperlane core, lo que permite una depuración y optimización eficientes de las colas de mensajes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger l''API Relayer, d''enquêter sur les messages bloqués et d''analyser les comptes de réessais et les raisons d''erreur en utilisant les contrats et les packages de SDK de Hyperlane core, ce qui permet un débogage et une optimisation efficaces des files d''attente de messages.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Relayer-API abzufragen, feststeckende Nachrichten zu untersuchen und Wiederholungszähler und Fehlernamen mit Hyperlane-Kernverträgen und SDK-Paketen zu analysieren, wodurch eine effiziente Fehlersuche und Optimierung der Nachrichtenwarteschlangen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a consultar a API do relayer, investigar mensagens presas, analisar contagens de reenvio e razões de erro usando contratos principais do Hyperlane e pacotes de SDK, permitindo depuração e otimização eficientes das filas de mensagens.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запроса к API релея, расследования застрявших сообщений, анализа количества повторных попыток и причин ошибок с помощью основных контрактов Hyperlane и пакетов SDK, обеспечивая эффективную отладку и оптимизацию очередей сообщений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استفسار وسيط API، والتحقيق في الرسائل العالقة، وتحليل عدد مرات إعادة الإرسال وأسباب الأخطاء باستخدام عقود Hyperlane الأساسية وحزم SDK، مما يتيح فحصًا وتصحيحًا فعالين لصفوف الرسائل."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging stuck messages in prepare queues","Analyzing retry counts for specific app contexts","Investigating error reasons for messages on multiple chains"],"zh":["调试准备队列中的卡住消息","分析特定应用程序上下文的重试次数","调查多个链上的消息的错误原因"],"ja":["準備キュー内のメッセージがスタックしている原因を調査する","特定のアプリケーションコンテキストのリトライ回数を分析する","複数のチェーン上のメッセージのエラー理由を調査する"],"ko":["준비 큐에 있는 메시지가 걸리는 원인을 디버깅하는 것","특정 애플리케이션 컨텍스트의 재시도 횟수를 분석하는 것","複数 체인의 메시지의 오류 사유를 조사하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de mensajes atascados en colas de preparación","Análisis de recuentos de reintentos para contextos de aplicación específicos","Investigación de razones de error para mensajes en varias cadenas"],"fr":["Débogage de messages bloqués dans les files d''attente de préparation","Analyse des comptes de réessais pour des contextes d''application spécifiques","Enquête sur les raisons d''erreur pour les messages sur plusieurs chaînes"],"de":["Fehlersuche für feststeckende Nachrichten in Vorbereitungsqueues","Analyse von Wiederholungszählern für spezifische App-Kontexte","Untersuchung von Fehlernamen für Nachrichten auf mehreren Ketten"],"pt":["Depuração de mensagens presas em filas de preparação","Análise de contagens de reenvio para contextos de aplicativos específicos","Investigação de razões de erro para mensagens em várias cadeias"],"ru":["Отладка застрявших сообщений в очередях подготовки","Анализ количества повторных попыток для конкретных контекстов приложений","Расследование причин ошибок для сообщений на нескольких цепочках"],"ar":["فحص الرسائل العالقة في صفوف التحضير","تحليل عدد مرات إعادة الإرسال لمواقف تطبيق محددة","التحقيق في أسباب الأخطاء للرسائل على عدة سلاسل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to relayer API","Limited to Hyperlane core contracts and SDK packages","Needs specific app context and chain information"],"zh":["需要访问Relayer API","仅限Hyperlane核心合约和SDK包","需要特定应用程序上下文和链信息"],"ja":["Relayer APIへのアクセスが必要","Hyperlaneコア契約とSDKパッケージのみ","特定のアプリケーションコンテキストとチェーン情報が必要"],"ko":["Relayer API에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","Hyperlane 핵심 계약 및 SDK 패키지에만 제한됩니다","특정 애플리케이션 컨텍스트 및 체인 정보가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de relayer","Limitado a contratos y paquetes de SDK de Hyperlane core","Necesita información de contexto de aplicación y cadena específica"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API Relayer","Limité aux contrats et packages de SDK de Hyperlane core","Nécessite des informations de contexte d''application et de chaîne spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Relayer-API","Begrenzt auf Hyperlane-Kernverträge und SDK-Pakete","Benötigt spezifische App-Kontext- und Ketteninformationen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do relayer","Limitado a contratos principais do Hyperlane e pacotes de SDK","Necessita de informações de contexto de aplicativo e cadeia específicas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API релея","Ограничен основных контрактов Hyperlane и пакетов SDK","Требует конкретной информации о контексте приложения и цепочке"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وسيط API","محدود بعقود Hyperlane الأساسية وحزم SDK","يحتاج إلى معلومات محددة حول سياق التطبيق والسلسلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2c12df2a52c8e020ad99cdfaefec86e0ac9350f10fcb85d864b7115700fede26","qualityScore":55}');
