ón de informes técnicos y dashboards"],"fr":["Automatisation de la recherche de KPIs avec Alkana","Intégration avec APIs RESTful et GraphQL","Scripting personnalisable avec Python et Node.js","Interface en ligne de commande (CLI) pour développeurs","Traitement de données en temps réel et par lots","Génération de rapports techniques et tableaux de bord"],"de":["Automatisierung der KPI-Recherche mit Alkana","Integration mit RESTful und GraphQL APIs","Anpassbares Scripting mit Python und Node.js","Kommandozeileninterface (CLI) für Entwickler","Echtzeit- und Batch-Datenverarbeitung","Erstellung technischer Reports und Dashboards"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de soluções de IA com React","Integração com Python e Node.js","Análise de dados com Alkana KPI","Otimização de processos com IA","Suporte ao desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["Разработка решений ИИ с React","Интеграция с Python и Node.js","Анализ данных с Alkana KPI","Оптимизация процессов с ИИ","Поддержка разработки приложений"],"ar":["تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي مع React","التكامل مع Python و Node.js","تحليل البيانات مع Alkana KPI","تحسين العمليات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم تطوير التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Alkana KPI应用","Alkana KPI应用的优势","AI智能工具的使用方法","Alkana KPI应用与其他工具的比较","Alkana KPI应用的安装指南","Alkana KPI应用的设置教程","使用Alkana KPI应用进行数据分析","Alkana KPI应用的数据可视化功能"],"ja":["Alkana KPIアプリケーションの使い方","Alkana KPIアプリケーションの特徴","AIエージェントの活用方法","Alkana KPIアプリケーションと他のツールの比較","Alkana KPIアプリケーションのインストールガイド","Alkana KPIアプリケーションの設定手順","Alkana KPIアプリケーションを使用したデータ分析","Alkana KPIアプリケーションのデータ可視化機能"],"ko":["Alkana KPI 애플리케이션 사용 방법","Alkana KPI 애플리케이션의 장점","AI 에이전트의 사용법","Alkana KPI 애플리케이션과 다른 도구의 비교","Alkana KPI 애플리케이션의 설치 가이드","Alkana KPI 애플리케이션의 설정 튜토리얼","Alkana KPI 애플리케이션을 사용한 데이터 분석","Alkana KPI 애플리케이션의 데이터 시각화 기능"],"es":["research AI agent Alkana","cómo usar Alkana KPI","automatización investigación datos","herramientas AI para desarrolladores","Alkana KPI install","API Alkana integration","Python script Alkana","alternativa a Alkana KPI","análisis KPIs automatizado","Alkana vs competitors"],"fr":["research AI agent Alkana","comment utiliser Alkana KPI","automatisation recherche données","outils IA pour développeurs","Alkana KPI install","API Alkana intégration","script Python Alkana","alternative à Alkana KPI","analyse KPIs automatisée","Alkana vs concurrents"],"de":["research AI agent Alkana","wie verwendet man Alkana KPI","Datenrecherche Automatisierung","KI Tools für Entwickler","Alkana KPI installieren","Alkana API Integration","Python Skript Alkana","Alternative zu Alkana KPI","automatisierte KPI Analyse","Alkana vs Wettbewerber"],"pt":["como usar Alkana KPI","o que é Alkana KPI","Alkana KPI vs outras ferramentas","instalar Alkana KPI","guias de configuração Alkana KPI","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com Alkana KPI"],"ru":["как использовать Alkana KPI","что такое Alkana KPI","Alkana KPI vs другие инструменты","установить Alkana KPI","руководства по настройке Alkana KPI","разработка приложений с Alkana KPI"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Alkana KPI","ما هو Alkana KPI","Alkana KPI مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Alkana KPI","دليل إعداد Alkana KPI","تطوير التطبيقات مع Alkana KPI"]}},"owner":"hotriluan","repo":"alkana_kpi","repoPath":"hotriluan/alkana_kpi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.697Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"research","description":"[CK] Research technical solutions, analyze architectures, gather requirements thoroughly. Use for technology evaluation, best practices research, solution design, scalability/security/maintainability analysis.","bodyPreview":"# Research\n\n## Research Methodology\n\nAlways honoring **YAGNI**, **KISS**, and **DRY** principles.\n**Be honest, be brutal, straight to the point, and be concise.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scope Definition\n\nFirst, you will clearly define the research scope by:\n- Identifying key terms and concepts to investigate\n- Determining the recency requirements (how current must information be)\n- Establishing evaluation criteria for sources\n- Setting boundaries for the research depth\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Informatio","body":"# Research\n\n## Research Methodology\n\nAlways honoring **YAGNI**, **KISS**, and **DRY** principles.\n**Be honest, be brutal, straight to the point, and be concise.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scope Definition\n\nFirst, you will clearly define the research scope by:\n- Identifying key terms and concepts to investigate\n- Determining the recency requirements (how current must information be)\n- Establishing evaluation criteria for sources\n- Setting boundaries for the research depth\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Information Gathering\n\nYou will employ a multi-source research strategy:\n\n1. **Search Strategy**:\n   - **Gemini Toggle**: Check `.claude/.ck.json` (or `~/.claude/.ck.json`) for `skills.research.useGemini` (default: `true`). If `false`, skip Gemini and use WebSearch.\n   - **Gemini Model**: Read from `.claude/.ck.json`: `gemini.model` (default: `gemini-3-flash-preview`)\n   - If `useGemini` is enabled and `gemini` bash command is available, execute `gemini -y -m <gemini.model> \"...your search prompt...\"` bash command (timeout: 10 minutes) and save the output using `Report:` path from `## Naming` section (including all citations).\n   - If `useGemini` is disabled or `gemini` bash command is not available, use `WebSearch` tool.\n   - Run multiple `gemini` bash commands or `WebSearch` tools in parallel to search for relevant information.\n   - Craft precise search queries with relevant keywords\n   - Include terms like \"best practices\", \"2024\", \"latest\", \"security\", \"performance\"\n   - Search for official documentation, GitHub repositories, and authoritative blogs\n   - Prioritize results from recognized authorities (official docs, major tech companies, respected developers)\n   - **IMPORTANT:** You are allowed to perform at most **5 researches (max 5 tool calls)**, user might request less than this amount, **strictly respect it**, think carefully based on the task before performing each related research topic.\n\n2. **Deep Content Analysis**:\n   - When you found a potential Github repository URL, use `docs-seeker` skill to find read it.\n   - Focus on official documentation, API references, and technical specifications\n   - Analyze README files from popular GitHub repositories\n   - Review changelog and release notes for version-specific information\n\n3. **Video Content Research**:\n   - Prioritize content from official channels, recognized experts, and major conferences\n   - Focus on practical demonstrations and real-world implementations\n\n4. **Cross-Reference Validation**:\n   - Verify information across multiple independent sources\n   - Check publication dates to ensure currency\n   - Identify consensus vs. controversial approaches\n   - Note any conflicting information or debates in the community\n\n### Phase 3: Analysis and Synthesis\n\nYou will analyze gathered information by:\n- Identifying common patterns and best practices\n- Evaluating pros and cons of different approaches\n- Assessing maturity and stability of technologies\n- Recognizing security implications and performance considerations\n- Determining compatibility and integration requirements\n\n### Phase 4: Report Generation\n\n**Notes:**\n- Research reports are saved using `Report:` path from `## Naming` section.\n- If `## Naming` section is not available, ask main agent to provide the output path.\n\nYou will create a comprehensive markdown report with the following structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Research Report: [Topic]\n\n## Executive Summary\n[2-3 paragraph overview of key findings and recommendations]\n\n## Research Methodology\n- Sources consulted: [number]\n- Date range of materials: [earliest to most recent]\n- Key search terms used: [list]\n\n## Key Findings\n\n### 1. Technology Overview\n[Comprehensive description of the technology/topic]\n\n### 2. Current State & Trends\n[Latest developments, version information, adoption trends]\n\n### 3. Best Practices\n[Detailed list of recommended practices with explanations]\n\n### 4. Security Considerations\n[Security implications, vulnerabilities, and mitigation strategies]\n\n### 5. Performance Insights\n[Performance characteristics, optimization techniques, benchmarks]\n\n## Comparative Analysis\n[If applicable, comparison of different solutions/approaches]\n\n## Implementation Recommendations\n\n### Quick Start Guide\n[Step-by-step getting started instructions]\n\n### Code Examples\n[Relevant code snippets with explanations]\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n[Mistakes to avoid and their solutions]\n\n## Resources & References\n\n### Official Documentation\n- [Linked list of official docs]\n\n### Recommended Tutorials\n- [Curated list with descriptions]\n\n### Community Resources\n- [Forums, Discord servers, Stack Overflow tags]\n\n### Further Reading\n- [Advanced topics and deep dives]\n\n## Appendices\n\n### A. Glossary\n[Technical terms and definitions]\n\n### B. Version Compatibility Matrix\n[If applicable]\n\n### C. Raw Research Notes\n[Optional: detailed notes from research process]\n```\n\n## Quality Standards\n\nYou will ensure all research meets these criteria:\n- **Accuracy**: Information is verified across multiple sources\n- **Currency**: Prioritize information from the last 12 months unless historical context is needed\n- **Completeness**: Cover all aspects requested by the user\n- **Actionability**: Provide practical, implementable recommendations\n- **Clarity**: Use clear language, define technical terms, provide examples\n- **Attribution**: Always cite sources and provide links for verification\n\n## Special Considerations\n\n- When researching security topics, always check for recent CVEs and security advisories\n- For performance-related research, look for benchmarks and real-world case studies\n- When investigating new technologies, assess community adoption and support levels\n- For API documentation, verify endpoint availability and authentication requirements\n- Always note deprecation warnings and migration paths for older technologies\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nYour final report must:\n1. Be saved using the `Report:` path from `## Naming` section with a descriptive filename\n2. Include a timestamp of when the research was conducted\n3. Provide clear section navigation with a table of contents for longer reports\n4. Use code blocks with appropriate syntax highlighting\n5. Include diagrams or architecture descriptions where helpful (in mermaid or ASCII art)\n6. Conclude with specific, actionable next steps\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Sacrifice grammar for the sake of concision when writing reports.\n**IMPORTANT:** In reports, list any unresolved questions at the end, if any.\n\n**Remember:** You are not just collecting information, but providing strategic technical intelligence that enables informed decision-making. Your research should anticipate follow-up questions and provide comprehensive coverage of the topic while remaining focused and practical."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:47.447Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Information Retrieval Agents requiring efficient data analysis and filtering capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高效数据分析和过滤能力的信息检索代理。","ja":"情報検索エージェントが効率的なデータ分析およびフィルタリング機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"효율적인 데이터 분석 및 필터링 기능이 필요한 정보 검색 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Recuperación de Información que requieren capacidades de análisis y filtrado de datos eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Recherche d''Informations nécessitant des capacités d''analyse et de filtrage de données efficaces.","de":"Ideal für Informationsabrufagenten, die effiziente Datenanalyse- und Filterfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Recuperação de Informações que requerem capacidades de análise e filtragem de dados eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов поиска информации, требующих эффективного анализа и фильтрации данных.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء استرجاع المعلومات الذين يتطلبون قدرات تحليل وتصفية البيانات فعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically gather and evaluate information using YAGNI, KISS, and DRY principles, incorporating key terms, recency requirements, and evaluation criteria for sources, while setting research boundaries and utilizing protocols like Alkana KPI application.","zh":"赋予代理系统地收集和评估信息的能力，使用YAGNI、KISS和DRY原则，结合关键术语、时效性要求和来源评估标准，同时设定研究边界并利用Alkana KPI应用等协议。","ja":"YAGNI、KISS、DRY原則を使用して、エージェントが体系的に情報を収集し評価することを可能にし、重要な用語、時効要件、および情報源の評価基準を組み込み、研究の境界を設定し、Alkana KPIアプリケーションなどのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"YAGNI, KISS, DRY 원칙을 사용하여 에이전트가 체계적으로 정보를 수집하고 평가할 수 있도록 하며, 주요 용어, 시효 요구 사항 및 정보源 평가 기준을 통합하고 연구 경계를 설정하며 Alkana KPI 애플리케이션과 같은 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a reunir y evaluar sistemáticamente la información utilizando los principios YAGNI, KISS y DRY, incorporando términos clave, requisitos de recencia y criterios de evaluación para fuentes, al mismo tiempo que se establecen límites de investigación y se utilizan protocolos como la aplicación de indicadores clave de rendimiento Alkana.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rassembler et d''évaluer systématiquement les informations en utilisant les principes YAGNI, KISS et DRY, en intégrant des termes clés, des exigences de récence et des critères d''évaluation pour les sources, tout en établissant des limites de recherche et en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''application d''indicateurs clés de performance Alkana.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Informationen systematisch unter Verwendung der Prinzipien YAGNI, KISS und DRY zu sammeln und zu bewerten, indem Schlüsselbegriffe, Aktualitätsanforderungen und Bewertungskriterien für Quellen einbezogen werden, während gleichzeitig Forschungsgrenzen festgelegt und Protokolle wie die Alkana KPI-Anwendung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a reunirem e avaliarem sistematicamente as informações usando os princípios YAGNI, KISS e DRY, incorporando termos-chave, requisitos de recentidade e critérios de avaliação para fontes, ao mesmo tempo definindo limites de pesquisa e utilizando protocolos como o aplicativo Alkana KPI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически собирать и оценивать информацию, используя принципы YAGNI, KISS и DRY, включая ключевые термины, требования к актуальности и критерии оценки источников, а также устанавливая границы исследования и используя протоколы, такие как приложение Alkana KPI.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من جمع المعلومات وتقييمها بطريقة منهجية باستخدام مبادئ YAGNI و KISS و DRY، ودمج المصطلحات الرئيسية ومتطلبات الحداثة ومعايير تقييم المصادر، مع تحديد حدود البحث واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تطبيق Alkana KPI."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining research scope by identifying key terms and concepts","Evaluating source credibility based on recency and relevance","Setting boundaries for research depth to optimize information gathering"],"zh":["通过识别关键术语和概念来定义研究范围","根据时效性和相关性评估信息源的可信度","设置研究深度边界以优化信息收集"],"ja":["重要な用語と概念を特定して調査の範囲を定義する","時効性と関連性に基づいて情報源の信憑性を評価する","調査の深さの境界を設定して情報の収集を最適化する"],"ko":["주요 용어 및 개념을 식별하여 연구 범위를 정의하는 것","시효성 및 관련성에 따라 정보원의 신뢰도를 평가하는 것","연구 깊이의 경계를 설정하여 정보 수집을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Definir el alcance de la investigación identificando términos y conceptos clave","Evaluar la credibilidad de las fuentes en función de la recencia y la relevancia","Establecer límites para la profundidad de la investigación para optimizar la recopilación de información"],"fr":["Définir la portée de la recherche en identifiant les termes et les concepts clés","Évaluer la crédibilité des sources en fonction de la récence et de la pertinence","Fixer des limites pour la profondeur de la recherche pour optimiser la collecte d''informations"],"de":["Forschungsumfang durch Identifizierung von Schlüsselbegriffen und -konzepten definieren","Glaubwürdigkeit von Quellen basierend auf Aktualität und Relevanz bewerten","Grenzen für die Forschungstiefe festlegen, um die Informationsbeschaffung zu optimieren"],"pt":["Definir o escopo da pesquisa identificando termos e conceitos-chave","Avaliar a credibilidade da fonte com base na recentidade e relevância","Definir limites para a profundidade da pesquisa para otimizar a coleta de informações"],"ru":["Определение объема исследования путем определения ключевых терминов и концепций","Оценка достоверности источника на основе актуальности и релевантности","Установление границ глубины исследования для оптимизации сбора информации"],"ar":["تحديد نطاق البحث من خلال تحديد المصطلحات والمفاهيم الرئيسية","تقييم مصداقية المصدر بناءً على الحداثة والأهمية","تحديد حدود عمق البحث لتحسين جمع المعلومات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear definition of research scope","Dependent on quality and relevance of sources","May be limited by information availability and accessibility"],"zh":["需要明确的研究范围定义","依赖于信息源的质量和相关性","可能受到信息可用性和可访问性的限制"],"ja":["調査の範囲の明確な定義が必要","情報源の品質と関連性に依存する","情報の可用性とアクセシビリティの制限を受ける可能性がある"],"ko":["연구 범위의 명확한 정의가 필요함","정보원의 품질 및 관련성에 의존함","정보의 가용성 및 접근성의 제한을 받을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una definición clara del alcance de la investigación","Depende de la calidad y la relevancia de las fuentes","Puede estar limitado por la disponibilidad y la accesibilidad de la información"],"fr":["Nécessite une définition claire de la portée de la recherche","Dépend de la qualité et de la pertinence des sources","Peut être limité par la disponibilité et l''accessibilité de l''information"],"de":["Benötigt eine klare Definition des Forschungsumfangs","Hängt von der Qualität und Relevanz der Quellen ab","Kann durch die Verfügbarkeit und Zugänglichkeit von Informationen eingeschränkt sein"],"pt":["Requer definição clara do escopo da pesquisa","Depende da qualidade e relevância das fontes","Pode ser limitado pela disponibilidade e acessibilidade das informações"],"ru":["Требует четкого определения объема исследования","Зависит от качества и релевантности источников","Может быть ограничен доступностью и доступом к информации"],"ar":["يتطلب تحديدًا واضحًا لنطاق البحث","يعتمد على جودة وأهمية المصادر","يمكن أن يكون مقيدًا بتوافر وصولية المعلومات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d7eed88b8d795e30c8c17661998aeffc1246d8caac283f935f27a3382a1bc36b","qualityScore":55}');
