n-Kommunikation","Intégration mit anderen Kommunikations-Tools","Sicherheit und Authentifizierung für Agenten-Kommunikation"],"pt":["Envelope de comunicação de agente","Utilitários para desenvolvedores de AI","Facilita a criação de soluções de AI","Integração com tecnologias de ponta","Documentação completa e suporte"],"ru":["Обертка коммуникации агентов","Утилиты для разработчиков ИИ","Облегчает создание решений ИИ","Интеграция с передовыми технологиями","Полная документация и поддержка"],"ar":["غلاف اتصال الوكيل","مرافق للمطورين الذكاء الاصطناعي","يسهل إنشاء حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع التكنولوجيا المتقدمة","دعم وثائق كامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["hex-release","AI智能工具","通信封包","实用程序","AI应用开发","如何使用hex-release","hex-release安装","hex-release设置指南"],"ja":["hex-release","AIエージェント","エージェントコミュニケーションエンベロープ","ユーティリティ","AIアプリケーション開発","hex-releaseの使い方","hex-releaseのインストール","hex-releaseの設定ガイド"],"ko":["hex-release","AI 에이전트","에이전트 통신 봉투","유틸리티","AI 애플리케이션 개발","hex-release 사용법","hex-release 설치","hex-release 설정 가이드"],"es":["Herramientas de comunicación de agentes","Cómo usar herramientas de comunicación de agentes","Qué es un envelope de comunicación","Alternativas a herramientas de comunicación de agentes","Herramientas de comunicación de agentes vs otros herramientas","Instalación de herramientas de comunicación de agentes"],"fr":["Outils de communication d''agents","Comment utiliser les outils de communication d''agents","Qué est un enveloppe de communication","Alternatives à outils de communication d''agents","Outils de communication d''agents vs autres outils","Installation d''outils de communication d''agents"],"de":["Agenten-Kommunikations-Tools","Wie man Agenten-Kommunikations-Tools verwendet","Was ist ein Kommunikations-Envelope","Alternatives zu Agenten-Kommunikations-Tools","Agenten-Kommunikations-Tools vs andere Tools","Installation von Agenten-Kommunikations-Tools"],"pt":["como usar hex-release","o que é hex-release","ferramentas de AI","alternativas ao hex-release","hex-release vs outras ferramentas","instalar hex-release","guia de configuração do hex-release"],"ru":["как использовать hex-release","что такое hex-release","инструменты ИИ","альтернативы hex-release","hex-release vs другие инструменты","установить hex-release","руководство по настройке hex-release"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام hex-release","ما هو hex-release","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل hex-release","hex-release مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت hex-release","دليل إعداد hex-release"]}},"owner":"agentjido","repo":"jido_signal","repoPath":"agentjido/jido_signal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.705Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hex-release","description":"Guides interactive Hex package release for AgentJido repos. Supports automated (GitHub Actions workflow_dispatch) and manual release flows. Uses git_ops for version bumping and changelog generation. Triggers on: release, hex publish, bump version, new release, publish package.","bodyPreview":"# Hex Release (Human-in-the-Loop)\n\nInteractive workflow for releasing a Hex package with manual verification at each step.\nSupports two release paths: **automated** (via GitHub Actions) and **manual** (local).\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when asked to:\n- Release a new version to Hex\n- Bump the package version\n- Prepare a release\n- Create a release tag\n- Trigger a release workflow\n\n## Pre-flight Checks\n\nBefore starting, run these checks automatically:\n\n### 1. Identify the Package\n\nRead `mix.e","body":"# Hex Release (Human-in-the-Loop)\n\nInteractive workflow for releasing a Hex package with manual verification at each step.\nSupports two release paths: **automated** (via GitHub Actions) and **manual** (local).\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when asked to:\n- Release a new version to Hex\n- Bump the package version\n- Prepare a release\n- Create a release tag\n- Trigger a release workflow\n\n## Pre-flight Checks\n\nBefore starting, run these checks automatically:\n\n### 1. Identify the Package\n\nRead `mix.exs` to determine:\n- Package name (from `project()` → `:name` or `:app`)\n- Current version (from `@version` or `project()` → `:version`)\n- Whether it has `git_ops` as a dependency (required for automated release)\n\n### 2. Check for Git Dependencies\n\n```bash\ngrep -E ''github:|git:|path:'' mix.exs\n```\n\nCategorize any git/path deps found:\n- **dev/test only** (`only: [:dev, :test]`): Will not block Hex publish — note but continue\n- **runtime deps**: **STOP** — these block `mix hex.publish`. Tell the user which deps need to be published to Hex first or switched to Hex versions\n\n### 3. Git Status\n\n```bash\ngit status --porcelain\n```\nIf dirty, **STOP** and ask user to commit or stash changes first.\n\n### 4. Verify Branch\n\n```bash\ngit branch --show-current\n```\nConfirm user is on `main`. Warn if on a different branch.\n\n### 5. Check for Releasable Commits\n\n```bash\ngit log --oneline $(git describe --tags --abbrev=0 2>/dev/null || echo \"\")..HEAD\n```\nIf no commits since last tag, **STOP** — nothing to release.\n\nReview commits and confirm they follow conventional commit format (`feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`, etc.).\nNon-conventional commits won''t be picked up by `git_ops` for the CHANGELOG.\n\n### 6. Run Tests\n\n```bash\nmix test\n```\nIf tests fail, **STOP** and show failures.\n\n### 7. Run Quality Checks\n\n```bash\nmix quality\n```\nThis typically runs: format check, compile with warnings-as-errors, credo, and dialyzer.\nIf the alias doesn''t exist, run `mix format --check-formatted && mix compile --warnings-as-errors` as a minimum.\nIf any check fails, **STOP** and show the issues.\n\n### 8. Hex Publish Dry Run\n\n```bash\nmix hex.publish --dry-run\n```\nVerify the package metadata and file list look correct. If this fails, **STOP**.\n\n**SHOW USER**: Summary of all pre-flight results and current version.\n\n**ASK USER**: \"All checks passed. Which release path: **automated** (GitHub Actions) or **manual** (local)?\"\n\n---\n\n## Path A: Automated Release (GitHub Actions)\n\nThe AgentJido repos have a reusable release workflow triggered via `workflow_dispatch`.\n\n### Step 1: Confirm Workflow Exists\n\nCheck that `.github/workflows/release.yml` exists and calls:\n```yaml\nuses: agentjido/github-actions/.github/workflows/elixir-release.yml@main\n```\n\n### Step 2: Explain Dispatch Options\n\n**TELL USER**:\n```\nThe release workflow supports these options:\n\n  • dry_run: true     — Full dry run (no git push, no tag, no Hex publish)\n  • hex_dry_run: true — Runs git_ops release + push, but skips actual Hex publish\n  • skip_tests: true  — Skip test step (use if CI already passed)\n\nRecommended first run: dry_run: true\n```\n\n### Step 3: Trigger the Workflow\n\n**Option 1 — GitHub CLI** (if `gh` is available):\n```bash\n# Dry run first\ngh workflow run release.yml -f dry_run=true\n\n# Watch the run\ngh run list --workflow=release.yml --limit=1\ngh run watch\n```\n\n**Option 2 — GitHub UI**:\n```\n1. Go to: https://github.com/agentjido/{REPO}/actions/workflows/release.yml\n2. Click \"Run workflow\"\n3. Set dry_run = true for first attempt\n4. Click \"Run workflow\"\n```\n\n**ASK USER**: \"Run a dry run first? (recommended)\"\n\n### Step 4: Verify Dry Run Results\n\nAfter the dry run completes:\n```bash\ngh run view --log-failed  # Check for errors\n```\n\nReview the workflow summary for:\n- Version that would be released\n- Hex publish dry-run output\n- Any skipped steps\n\n**ASK USER**: \"Dry run succeeded. Ready to run the real release?\"\n\n### Step 5: Trigger Real Release\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run release.yml\n# Or with skip_tests if CI already passed:\ngh workflow run release.yml -f skip_tests=true\n```\n\n### Step 6: Verify\n\n```bash\ngh run watch  # Wait for completion\n```\n\n**TELL USER**:\n```\n✅ Release triggered!\n\nThe workflow will:\n  1. Run git_ops.release to bump version + update CHANGELOG\n  2. Push the release commit and tag\n  3. Publish to Hex.pm\n  4. Create a GitHub Release\n\nMonitor at: https://github.com/agentjido/{REPO}/actions\nAfter publish, verify at: https://hex.pm/packages/{PACKAGE}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Path B: Manual Release (Local)\n\nUse when the automated workflow isn''t available, or for repos that can''t publish to Hex (e.g., git deps blocking publish).\n\n### Step 1: Determine Version Bump\n\n`git_ops` handles this automatically from conventional commits, but ask the user for confirmation.\n\nRun the release in dry-run mode to preview:\n```bash\nmix git_ops.release --dry-run\n```\n\nThis shows what version would be bumped to based on commit types:\n- `feat:` commits → minor bump\n- `fix:` commits → patch bump\n- `BREAKING CHANGE:` → major bump\n\n**SHOW USER**: The proposed version bump and commits that will be included.\n\n**ASK USER**: \"git_ops wants to release vX.Y.Z. Proceed, or override with a specific version?\"\n\n### Step 2: Run the Release\n\n```bash\n# Let git_ops decide the version:\nmix git_ops.release --yes\n\n# Or force a specific version:\nmix git_ops.release --yes --new-version X.Y.Z\n```\n\nThis will:\n- Bump the version in `mix.exs`\n- Update `CHANGELOG.md` from conventional commits\n- Create a release commit\n- Create a git tag\n\n**SHOW USER**: The release commit diff and tag.\n\n### Step 3: Review Before Pushing\n\n```bash\ngit log --oneline -3\ngit diff HEAD~1\ngit tag -l | tail -5\n```\n\n**ASK USER**: \"Release commit and tag created locally. Ready to push?\"\n\n### Step 4: Push\n\n```bash\ngit push origin main\ngit push origin --tags\n```\n\n### Step 5: Publish to Hex\n\n```bash\n# Final dry-run check\nmix hex.publish --dry-run\n\n# Publish\nmix hex.publish --yes\n```\n\n### Step 6: Create GitHub Release\n\n```bash\nVERSION=\"v$(grep -m1 ''@version \"'' mix.exs | sed ''s/.*\"\\(.*\\)\".*/\\1/'')\"\ngh release create \"$VERSION\" \\\n  --title \"Release $VERSION\" \\\n  --notes \"See [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) for details.\"\n```\n\n**TELL USER**:\n```\n✅ Release complete!\n\n  Published: https://hex.pm/packages/{PACKAGE}\n  GitHub:    https://github.com/agentjido/{REPO}/releases/tag/{VERSION}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Rollback\n\n### Before pushing:\n```bash\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1          # Undo release commit\ngit tag -d v{VERSION}            # Delete local tag\ngit checkout mix.exs CHANGELOG.md  # Restore files\n```\n\n### After pushing but before Hex publish:\n```bash\ngit push origin :refs/tags/v{VERSION}  # Delete remote tag\ngit revert HEAD                         # Revert release commit\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n### After Hex publish:\nHex packages **cannot be unpublished** after 1 hour. You can retire a version:\n```bash\nmix hex.retire {PACKAGE} {VERSION} invalid --message \"Released in error\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- All AgentJido repos use **conventional commits** — non-conventional commits are ignored by `git_ops`\n- The `quality` mix alias varies per repo — check `mix.exs` aliases section\n- `git_ops` is a dev-only dependency — release commands run in `MIX_ENV=dev`\n- The automated workflow uses `GITHUB_TOKEN` for git push and `HEX_API_KEY` (org secret) for Hex publish\n- Repos with runtime git dependencies (e.g., `jido_runic`) cannot publish to Hex — use manual path for git tag/release only, skip Hex publish step\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:41:57.434Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Elixir Agents managing package releases, needing automated and manual release workflows via GitHub Actions and local environments.","zh":"适用于管理包发布的Elixir Agents，需要通过GitHub Actions和本地环境进行自动化和手动发布工作流程。","ja":"パッケージのリリースを管理するElixirエージェントに適しています。 GitHub Actionsおよびローカル環境を介した自動化および手動リリースワークフローが必要です。","ko":"패키지 릴리스를 관리하는 Elixir 에이전트에 적합합니다. GitHub Actions 및 로컬 환경을 통해 자동화된 릴리스 및 수동 릴리스 워크플ロー가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Elixir que gestionan lanzamientos de paquetes, necesitando flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento automatizados y manuales a través de GitHub Actions y entornos locales.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Elixir gérant les versions de packages, nécessitant des flux de travail de publication automatisés et manuels via GitHub Actions et des environnements locaux.","de":"Ideal für Elixir-Agents, die Paketversionen verwalten und automatisierte und manuelle Release-Workflows über GitHub Actions und lokale Umgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Elixir que gerenciam lançamentos de pacotes, necessitando de fluxos de trabalho de lançamento automatizados e manuais via GitHub Actions e ambientes locais.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Elixir, управляющих выпусками пакетов, требующих автоматизированных и ручных рабочих процессов выпуска через GitHub Actions и локальные среды.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إيليكسير الذي يدير إصدارات الحزم ، ويحتاج إلى سير عمل الإصدار الآلي واليدوي عبر إجراءات جيت هاب والبيئات المحلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Hex package releases with manual verification, supporting GitHub Actions for automated releases and local environments for manual releases, utilizing mix.exs files for package identification.","zh":"赋予代理人使用手动验证自动发布Hex包的能力，支持GitHub Actions进行自动发布，并且支持本地环境进行手动发布，使用mix.exs文件进行包识别。","ja":"エージェントは手動検証でHexパッケージの自動公開を実行できるようになります。自動公開のためにGitHub Actionsをサポートし、手動公開のためにローカル環境をサポートします。さらに、パッケージの識別にはmix.exsファイルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 수동 확인으로 Hex 패키지 자동 릴리스를 수행할 수 있도록 합니다. 자동 릴리스를 위한 GitHub Actions를 지원하며 수동 릴리스를 위한 로컬 환경을 지원합니다. 또한 패키지 식별을 위해 mix.exs 파일을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar los lanzamientos de paquetes Hex con verificación manual, admitiendo GitHub Actions para lanzamientos automatizados y entornos locales para lanzamientos manuales, utilizando archivos mix.exs para la identificación de paquetes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les publications de packages Hex avec vérification manuelle, en prenant en charge GitHub Actions pour les publications automatisées et les environnements locaux pour les publications manuelles, en utilisant des fichiers mix.exs pour l''identification des packages.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Veröffentlichung von Hex-Paketen mit manueller Überprüfung zu automatisieren, wobei GitHub Actions für automatisierte Veröffentlichungen und lokale Umgebungen für manuelle Veröffentlichungen unterstützt werden, wobei Dateien mix.exs zur Paketidentifizierung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar os lançamentos de pacotes Hex com verificação manual, dando suporte a GitHub Actions para lançamentos automatizados e ambientes locais para lançamentos manuais, utilizando arquivos mix.exs para identificação de pacotes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать выпуски пакетов Hex с ручной верификацией, поддерживая GitHub Actions для автоматизированных выпусков и локальные среды для ручных выпусков, используя файлы mix.exs для идентификации пакетов.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تفعيل عميل لتأتمة إصدارات حزمة هكس مع التحقق اليدوي ، ودعم إجراءات جيت هاب لإصدارات أوتوماتيكية وبيئات محلية لإصدارات يدوية ، باستخدام ملفات mix.exs للتعرف على الحزم."},"useCases":{"en":["Releasing new versions to Hex","Bumping package versions","Creating release tags","Triggering release workflows","Preparing releases with pre-flight checks"],"zh":["发布新版本到Hex","升级包版本","创建发布标签","触发发布工作流程","使用预飞行检查准备发布"],"ja":["Hexへの新しいバージョンの公開","パッケージバージョンのバンプ","リリースタグの作成","リリースワークフローのトリガー","事前飛行チェックを使用してリリースを準備する"],"ko":["Hex에 새로운 버전 릴리스","패키지 버전업","릴리스 태그 생성","릴리스 워크플로우 트리거","사전 비행 체크로 릴리스 준비"],"es":["Lanzar nuevas versiones a Hex","Actualizar versiones de paquetes","Crear etiquetas de lanzamiento","Activar flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento","Preparar lanzamientos con controles previos al vuelo"],"fr":["Publier de nouvelles versions sur Hex","Mettre à jour les versions de packages","Créer des étiquettes de publication","Déclencher des flux de travail de publication","Préparer les publications avec des vérifications préalables"],"de":["Veröffentlichung neuer Versionen in Hex","Aktualisieren von Paketversionen","Erstellen von Release-Tags","Auslösen von Release-Workflows","Vorbereiten von Releases mit Vorkontrollen"],"pt":["Lançar novas versões para o Hex","Aumentar versões de pacotes","Criar tags de lançamento","Acionar fluxos de trabalho de lançamento","Preparar lançamentos com verificações de pré-voo"],"ru":["Выпускать новые версии в Hex","Повышать версии пакетов","Создавать теги выпуска","Запускать рабочие процессы выпуска","Подготавливать выпуски с предварительными проверками"],"ar":["إصدار إصدارات جديدة إلى هكس","تعزيز إصدارات الحزم","إنشاء علامات الإصدار","تشغيل سير عمل الإصدار","إعداد الإصدارات مع فحص ما قبل الطيران"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Actions setup for automated releases","Needs local environment setup for manual releases","Specific to Elixir packages with mix.exs files"],"zh":["需要GitHub Actions设置用于自动发布","需要本地环境设置用于手动发布","仅适用于具有mix.exs文件的Elixir包"],"ja":["自動公開のためにGitHub Actionsの設定が必要","手動公開のためにローカル環境の設定が必要","mix.exsファイルを含むElixirパッケージのみに適用"],"ko":["자동 릴리스를 위한 GitHub Actions 설정이 필요","수동 릴리스를 위한 로컬 환경 설정이 필요","mix.exs 파일을 포함하는 Elixir 패키지에만 적용"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de GitHub Actions para lanzamientos automatizados","Necesita la configuración de un entorno local para lanzamientos manuales","Específico para paquetes Elixir con archivos mix.exs"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de GitHub Actions pour les publications automatisées","Nécessite la configuration d''un environnement local pour les publications manuelles","Spécifique aux packages Elixir avec des fichiers mix.exs"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung von GitHub Actions für automatisierte Veröffentlichungen","Benötigt die Einrichtung einer lokalen Umgebung für manuelle Veröffentlichungen","Spezifisch für Elixir-Pakete mit Dateien mix.exs"],"pt":["Requer configuração do GitHub Actions para lançamentos automatizados","Necessita de configuração de ambiente local para lançamentos manuais","Específico para pacotes Elixir com arquivos mix.exs"],"ru":["Требует настройки GitHub Actions для автоматизированных выпусков","Требует настройки локальной среды для ручных выпусков","Специфичен для пакетов Elixir с файлами mix.exs"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد إجراءات جيت هاب لإصدارات أوتوماتيكية","يحتاج إلى إعداد بيئة محلية لإصدارات يدوية","محدد لعميل إيليكسير مع ملفات mix.exs"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e4dd7b750b4f89eabc6495c806fb2a618741335129f169ecce72c5eee7f3ddd0","qualityScore":55}');
