r-draft-summary","desenvolvimento de workflows de multiagentes","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать pr-draft-summary","что такое pr-draft-summary","pr-draft-summary альтернатива","pr-draft-summary vs другие фреймворки","установить pr-draft-summary","руководство по настройке pr-draft-summary","разработка мультиагентных рабочих процессов","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام pr-draft-summary","ما هو pr-draft-summary","بديل pr-draft-summary","pr-draft-summary مقابل إطارات أخرى","تثبيت pr-draft-summary","دليل إعداد pr-draft-summary","تطوير تدفقات العمل المتعددة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"openai","repo":"openai-agents-python","repoPath":"openai/openai-agents-python","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.706Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-draft-summary","description":"Create a PR title and draft description after substantive code changes are finished. Trigger when wrapping up a moderate-or-larger change (runtime code, tests, build config, docs with behavior impact) and you need the PR-ready summary block with change summary plus PR draft text.","bodyPreview":"# PR Draft Summary\n\n## Purpose\nProduce the PR-ready summary required in this repository after substantive code work is complete: a concise summary plus a PR-ready title and draft description that begins with \"This pull request <verb> ...\". The block should be ready to paste into a PR for openai-agents-python.\n\n## When to Trigger\n- The task for this repo is finished (or ready for review) and it touched runtime code, tests, examples, docs with behavior impact, or build/test configuration.\n- You ar","body":"# PR Draft Summary\n\n## Purpose\nProduce the PR-ready summary required in this repository after substantive code work is complete: a concise summary plus a PR-ready title and draft description that begins with \"This pull request <verb> ...\". The block should be ready to paste into a PR for openai-agents-python.\n\n## When to Trigger\n- The task for this repo is finished (or ready for review) and it touched runtime code, tests, examples, docs with behavior impact, or build/test configuration.\n- You are about to send the \"work complete\" response and need the PR block included.\n- Skip only for trivial or conversation-only tasks where no PR-style summary is expected.\n\n## Inputs to Collect Automatically (do not ask the user)\n- Current branch: `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD`.\n- Working tree: `git status -sb`.\n- Untracked files: `git ls-files --others --exclude-standard` (use with `git status -sb` to ensure they are surfaced; `--stat` does not include them).\n- Changed files: `git diff --name-only` (unstaged) and `git diff --name-only --cached` (staged); sizes via `git diff --stat` and `git diff --stat --cached`.\n- Base reference (use the branch''s upstream, fallback to `origin/main`):\n  - `BASE_REF=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref --symbolic-full-name @{upstream} 2>/dev/null || echo origin/main)`.\n  - `BASE_COMMIT=$(git merge-base --fork-point \"$BASE_REF\" HEAD || git merge-base \"$BASE_REF\" HEAD || echo \"$BASE_REF\")`.\n- Commits ahead of the base fork point: `git log --oneline --no-merges ${BASE_COMMIT}..HEAD`.\n- Category signals for this repo: runtime (`src/agents/`), tests (`tests/`), examples (`examples/`), docs (`docs/`, `mkdocs.yml`), build/test config (`pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`, `Makefile`, `.github/`).\n\n## Workflow\n1) Run the commands above without asking the user; compute `BASE_REF`/`BASE_COMMIT` first so later commands reuse them.\n2) If there are no staged/unstaged/untracked changes and no commits ahead of `${BASE_COMMIT}`, reply briefly that no code changes were detected and skip emitting the PR block.\n3) Infer change type from the touched paths listed under \"Category signals\"; classify as feature, fix, refactor, or docs-with-impact, and flag backward-compatibility risk when runtime code changed.\n4) Summarize changes in 1–3 short sentences using the key paths (top 5) and `git diff --stat` output; explicitly call out untracked files from `git status -sb`/`git ls-files --others --exclude-standard` because `--stat` does not include them. If the working tree is clean but there are commits ahead of `${BASE_COMMIT}`, summarize using those commit messages.\n5) Choose the lead verb for the description: feature → `adds`, bug fix → `fixes`, refactor/perf → `improves` or `updates`, docs-only → `updates`.\n6) Suggest a branch name. If already off main, keep it; otherwise propose `feat/<slug>`, `fix/<slug>`, or `docs/<slug>` based on the primary area (e.g., `docs/pr-draft-summary-guidance`).\n7) If the current branch matches `issue-<number>` (digits only), keep that branch suggestion. Optionally pull light issue context (for example via the GitHub API) when available, but do not block or retry if it is not. When an issue number is present, reference `https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/issues/<number>` and include an auto-closing line such as `This pull request resolves #<number>.`.\n8) Draft the PR title and description using the template below.\n9) Output only the block in \"Output Format\". Keep any surrounding status note minimal and in English.\n\n## Output Format\nWhen closing out a task and the summary block is desired, add this concise Markdown block (English only) after any brief status note. If the user says they do not want it, skip this section.\n\n```\n# Pull Request Draft\n\n## Branch name suggestion\n\ngit checkout -b <kebab-case suggestion, e.g., feat/pr-draft-summary-skill>\n\n## Title\n\n<single-line imperative title, which can be a commit message; if a common prefix like chore: and feat: etc., having them is preferred>\n\n## Description\n\n<include what you changed plus a draft pull request title and description for your local changes; start the description with prose such as \"This pull request resolves/updates/adds ...\" using a verb that matches the change (you can use bullets later), explain the change background (for bugs, clearly describe the bug, symptoms, or repro; for features, what is needed and why), any behavior changes or considerations to be aware of, and you do not need to mention tests you ran.>\n```\n\nKeep it tight—no redundant prose around the block, and avoid repeating details between `Changes` and the description. Tests do not need to be listed unless specifically requested.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:42:04.233Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing automated PR summary generation for openai-agents-python repository","zh":"非常适合需要为 openai-agents-python 仓库自动生成 PR 摘要的代码审查代理","ja":"openai-agents-python リポジトリの自動 PR 摘要生成を必要とするコードレビュー エージェントに最適","ko":"openai-agents-python 리포지토리에서 자동 PR 요약을 생성하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan generación automática de resúmenes de PR para el repositorio openai-agents-python","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code ayant besoin d''une génération automatisée de résumés de PR pour le référentiel openai-agents-python","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine automatisierte PR-Zusammenfassungsgenerierung für das openai-agents-python-Repository benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de geração automática de resumo de PR para o repositório openai-agents-python","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Кодового Обзора, требующих автоматизированного создания сводок PR для репозитория openai-agents-python","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء مراجعة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد تلقائي لملخصات PR لمستودع openai-agents-python"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce PR-ready summaries with concise titles and draft descriptions, streamlining the code review process for runtime code, tests, examples, and documentation changes using multi-agent workflows","zh":"赋予代理生成 PR 准备好的摘要，具有简洁的标题和草稿描述，简化运行时代码、测试、示例和文档更改的代码审查流程，使用多代理工作流","ja":"エージェントが PR 准備好的要約を生成できるようにし、タイトルと説明の草案を簡潔にし、openai-agents-python リポジトリの実行時コード、テスト、例、およびドキュメントの変更のコードレビューのプロセスを、マルチエージェント ワークフローを使用して合理化する","ko":"에이전트가 PR 준비 요약을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 제목과 설명의 초안을 간결하게 하여 런타임 코드, 테스트, 예제 및 문서 변경의 코드 리뷰 프로세스를 다중 에이전트 워크플로를 사용하여 최적화","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir resúmenes listos para PR con títulos concisos y descripciones de borrador, simplificando el proceso de revisión de código para el código de tiempo de ejecución, pruebas, ejemplos y cambios de documentación utilizando flujos de trabajo multiagente","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire des résumés prêts pour PR avec des titres concis et des descriptions de brouillon, simplifiant le processus de révision de code pour le code de runtime, les tests, les exemples et les modifications de documentation en utilisant des flux de travail multi-agents","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, PR-fertige Zusammenfassungen mit knappen Titeln und Entwurfsbeschreibungen zu erstellen, wodurch der Code-Review-Prozess für Laufzeitcode, Tests, Beispiele und Dokumentationsänderungen mithilfe von Multi-Agent-Workflows rationalisiert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir resumos prontos para PR com títulos concisos e descrições de rascunho, otimizando o processo de revisão de código para código de tempo de execução, testes, exemplos e alterações de documentação usando fluxos de trabalho de multiagente","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать сводки PR с краткими заголовками и черновыми описаниями, оптимизируя процесс кодового обзора для runtime-кода, тестов, примеров и изменений документации с помощью мультиагентных рабочих процессов","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنتاج ملخصات جاهزة لمراجعة PR بألقاب موجزة ووصف مسودات، مما يُبسط عملية مراجعة الشفرة للشفرة في وقت التشغيل والاختبارات والأمثلة وتغييرات الوثائق باستخدام سير عمل متعدد الوكلاء"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PR summaries after substantive code changes","Automating PR title and description drafting","Streamlining code review for openai-agents-python repository"],"zh":["在实质性代码更改后生成 PR 摘要","自动化 PR 标题和描述草稿","简化 openai-agents-python 仓库的代码审查"],"ja":["実質的なコード変更後の PR 要約の生成","PR タイトルと説明の草案の自動化","openai-agents-python リポジトリのコードレビューの合理化"],"ko":["실질적인 코드 변경 후 PR 요약 생성","PR 제목 및 설명 초안 자동화","openai-agents-python 리포지토리의 코드 리뷰 최적화"],"es":["Generación de resúmenes de PR después de cambios de código sustanciales","Automatización de la redacción de títulos y descripciones de PR","Simplificación de la revisión de código para el repositorio openai-agents-python"],"fr":["Génération de résumés de PR après des modifications de code substantielles","Automatisation de la rédaction de titres et de descriptions de PR","Simplification de la révision de code pour le référentiel openai-agents-python"],"de":["Erstellung von PR-Zusammenfassungen nach wesentlichen Codeänderungen","Automatisierung der Erstellung von PR-Titeln und -Beschreibungen","Rationalisierung der Code-Review für das openai-agents-python-Repository"],"pt":["Geração de resumos de PR após alterações de código substantivas","Automação de redação de títulos e descrições de PR","Otimização da revisão de código para o repositório openai-agents-python"],"ru":["Генерация сводок PR после существенных изменений кода","Автоматизация создания заголовков и описаний PR","Оптимизация кодового обзора для репозитория openai-agents-python"],"ar":["توليد ملخصات PR بعد تغييرات شفرة جوهرية","تحويل تلقائي لكتابة ألقاب ووصف PR","تبسيط مراجعة الشفرة لمستودع openai-agents-python"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to repository code changes","Specific to openai-agents-python repository","Limited to generating summaries for PRs with behavior impact or build/test configuration changes"],"zh":["需要访问仓库代码更改","特定于 openai-agents-python 仓库","仅限于生成影响行为或生成/测试配置更改的 PR 摘要"],"ja":["リポジトリのコード変更へのアクセスが必要","openai-agents-python リポジトリに特有","動作に影響を与える、またはビルド/テストの構成変更の PR の要約の生成のみ"],"ko":["리포지토리 코드 변경에 대한 액세스가 필요","openai-agents-python 리포지토리에 특정","동작에 영향을 미치거나 빌드/테스트 구성 변경의 PR 요약 생성만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los cambios de código del repositorio","Específico del repositorio openai-agents-python","Limitado a la generación de resúmenes para PR con impacto de comportamiento o cambios de configuración de compilación/pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux modifications de code du référentiel","Spécifique au référentiel openai-agents-python","Limité à la génération de résumés pour les PR ayant un impact sur le comportement ou des modifications de configuration de build/test"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Code-Änderungen des Repositorys","Spezifisch für das openai-agents-python-Repository","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Zusammenfassungen für PRs mit Verhaltensauswirkungen oder Änderungen an der Build-/Testkonfiguration"],"pt":["Requer acesso às alterações de código do repositório","Específico para o repositório openai-agents-python","Limitado à geração de resumos para PRs com impacto de comportamento ou alterações de configuração de build/teste"],"ru":["Требует доступа к изменениям кода репозитория","Специфичен для репозитория openai-agents-python","Ограничен генерацией сводок для PR с изменением поведения или изменением конфигурации сборки/тестирования"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تغييرات الشفرة في المستودع","محدد لمستودع openai-agents-python","محدود بتوليد ملخصات لمراجعات PR التي لها تأثير على السلوك أو تغييرات في تكوين البناء / الاختبار"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7d4da99993c8a05e9cd84885cc15831f8c1c73f621f7cf5c3f62c127eb21ba3f","qualityScore":55}');
