","Crea proyectos de escritura de agentes de manera eficiente","Permite la creación de proyectos de escritura de agentes de manera personalizada","Ofrece herramientas para la creación de proyectos de escritura de agentes de manera eficiente","Permite la creación de proyectos de escritura de agentes de manera automatizada"],"fr":["Écrivez des agents de intelligence artificielle avec facilité","Créez des projets d''écriture d''agents de manière efficace","Permet la création de projets d''écriture d''agents de manière personnalizada","Offre des outils pour la création de projets d''écriture d''agents de manière efficace","Permet la création de projets d''écriture d''agents de manière automatisée"],"de":["Schreiben Sie mit adr-write Agenten von KI mit Leichtigkeit","Erstellen Sie mit adr-write Projekte von KI-Agenten effizient","Permitieren Sie mit adr-write die Erstellung von Projekten von KI-Agenten in einer personalisierten Weise","Bieten Sie mit adr-write Tools für die Erstellung von Projekten von KI-Agenten effizient","Permitieren Sie mit adr-write die Erstellung von Projekten von KI-Agenten in einer automatisierten Weise"],"pt":["Documentação oficial no GitHub Pages","Integração perfeita com desenvolvedores","Ferramenta de IA para desenvolvimento","Site oficial para informações adicionais","Suporte para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Официальная документация на GitHub Pages","Безшовная интеграция с разработчиками","Инструмент ИИ для разработки","Официальный сайт для дополнительной информации","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["توثيق رسمي على GitHub Pages","تكامل سلس مع المانحين","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للتنمية","موقع رسمي لمعلومات إضافية","دعم المانحين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["adr-write 项目官网","adr-write 文档中心","GitHub Pages托管","adr-write 开发指南","adr-write 安装指南","adr-write 设置指南","adr-write 项目介绍","adr-write 使用方法","adr-write 优势"],"ja":["adr-write プロジェクト公式ウェブサイト","adr-write ドキュメントハブ","GitHub Pages ホスト","adr-write 開発ガイド","adr-write インストールガイド","adr-write 設定ガイド","adr-write プロジェクト紹介","adr-write 使用方法","adr-write の利点"],"ko":["adr-write 프로젝트 공식 웹사이트","adr-write 문서 허브","GitHub Pages 호스팅","adr-write 개발 가이드","adr-write 설치 가이드","adr-write 설정 가이드","adr-write 프로젝트 소개","adr-write 사용 방법","adr-write의 장점"],"es":["adr-write","herramienta de escritura de agentes de inteligencia artificiales","agentes de inteligencia artificiales","proyectos de escritura de agentes","creación de proyectos de escritura de agentes","herramientas para la creación de proyectos de escritura de agentes","proyectos de escritura de agentes de manera eficiente","proyectos de escritura de agentes de manera personalizada"],"fr":["adr-write","outil d''écriture d''agents de intelligence artificielle","agents de intelligence artificielle","projets d''écriture d''agents","création de projets d''écriture d''agents","outils pour la création de projets d''écriture d''agents","projets d''écriture d''agents de manière efficace","projets d''écriture d''agents de manière personnalizada"],"de":["adr-write","Tool für das Schreiben von KI-Agenten","KI-Agenten","Projekte von KI-Agenten","Erstellung von Projekten von KI-Agenten","Tools für die Erstellung von Projekten von KI-Agenten","Projekte von KI-Agenten de manera eficiente","Projekte von KI-Agenten de manera personalizada"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","adr-write","desenvolvedores","github pages","documentação oficial","como usar adr-write","o que é adr-write","adr-write vs outras ferramentas","instalar adr-write","guia de configuração do adr-write"],"ru":["инструменты ии","adr-write","разработчики","github pages","официальная документация","как использовать adr-write","что такое adr-write","adr-write vs другие инструменты","установить adr-write","руководство по настройке adr-write"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","adr-write","المانحين","github pages","توثيق رسمي","كيفية استخدام adr-write","ما هي أداة adr-write","adr-write مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت adr-write","دليل إعداد adr-write"]}},"owner":"specvital","repo":"specvital.github.io","repoPath":"specvital/specvital.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.722Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"adr-write","description":"Write ADR document from discovered candidates with GitHub context research","bodyPreview":"# ADR Write Command\n\nWrite ADR documents based on discovered candidates from `adr-candidates.md`.\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nYou **MUST** consider the user input before proceeding.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nGenerate complete ADR documents by researching GitHub commits/PRs and applying the ADR template.\n\n**Multi-Agent Collaboration Pipeline**:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    ADR Writing Pipeline                          │\n├──────","body":"# ADR Write Command\n\nWrite ADR documents based on discovered candidates from `adr-candidates.md`.\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nYou **MUST** consider the user input before proceeding.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nGenerate complete ADR documents by researching GitHub commits/PRs and applying the ADR template.\n\n**Multi-Agent Collaboration Pipeline**:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    ADR Writing Pipeline                          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Phase 1: specvital-specialist                                   │\n│    → Search related commits/PRs via GitHub API                   │\n│    → Extract decision context and rationale                      │\n│    → Identify options that were considered                       │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Phase 2: product-strategist                                     │\n│    → Analyze decision trade-offs                                 │\n│    → Evaluate consequences (positive/negative)                   │\n│    → Structure options comparison                                │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Phase 3: Write ADR Documents                                    │\n│    → Generate English version (docs/en/adr/)                     │\n│    → Generate Korean version (docs/ko/adr/)                      │\n│    → Update all required index files                             │\n│    → Update sidebar configuration                                │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Input Interpretation\n\n### Numeric Reference\n\nReference candidates by number from `adr-candidates.md`:\n\n```bash\n/adr-write 1          # Platform Level candidate #1\n/adr-write core/1     # Core repository candidate #1\n/adr-write worker/1   # Worker repository candidate #1\n```\n\n### Natural Language\n\nDescribe what ADR to write:\n\n```bash\n/adr-write billing and quota system\n/adr-write write the AI spec document generation ADR\n/adr-write domain hints extraction for core repository\n```\n\n### Parsing Logic\n\n1. **Numeric only** (e.g., `1`, `2`): Match Platform Level candidate by number\n2. **Prefixed numeric** (e.g., `core/1`, `web/2`): Match repository-level candidate\n3. **Natural language**: Search candidate titles and descriptions for best match\n\n---\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### Phase 0: Load Candidate Information\n\nRead `adr-candidates.md` and identify the target ADR:\n\n```\n1. Parse user input to identify candidate\n2. Extract from adr-candidates.md:\n   - Title\n   - Target location (e.g., /en/adr/13-xxx.md)\n   - Related repositories\n   - Complexity and priority\n3. Determine ADR number and file paths\n```\n\n**File Path Determination**:\n\n| Candidate Type | English Path                         | Korean Path                          |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| Platform Level | `docs/en/adr/{num}-{slug}.md`        | `docs/ko/adr/{num}-{slug}.md`        |\n| Core           | `docs/en/adr/core/{num}-{slug}.md`   | `docs/ko/adr/core/{num}-{slug}.md`   |\n| Worker         | `docs/en/adr/worker/{num}-{slug}.md` | `docs/ko/adr/worker/{num}-{slug}.md` |\n| Web            | `docs/en/adr/web/{num}-{slug}.md`    | `docs/ko/adr/web/{num}-{slug}.md`    |\n\n---\n\n### Phase 1: Context Research (specvital-specialist)\n\n**Task tool invocation**:\n\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"specvital-specialist\", prompt=\"\"\"\nResearch GitHub context for ADR: {candidate_title}\n\n**Target Repositories**: {related_repos}\n\n**Research Tasks**:\n\n1. **Search Related Commits**\n   - Use gh CLI or GitHub MCP to search commits\n   - Keywords: {extracted_keywords}\n   - Timeframe: Last 90 days\n   - Command: `gh search commits \"{keyword}\" --repo specvital/{repo} --limit 20`\n\n2. **Search Related PRs**\n   - Find PRs that introduced or modified this feature\n   - Command: `gh pr list --repo specvital/{repo} --search \"{keyword}\" --state all --limit 10`\n\n3. **Extract Decision Context**\n   For each relevant commit/PR:\n   - What problem was being solved?\n   - What approach was taken?\n   - Any alternatives mentioned in discussions?\n\n4. **Output Format**\n```\n\n## Relevant Commits\n\n- {commit_sha}: {message} - {date}\n\n## Relevant PRs\n\n- #{pr_number}: {title} - {state}\n\n## Context Summary\n\n- Problem: ...\n- Decision: ...\n- Alternatives mentioned: ...\n\n```\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2: Decision Analysis (product-strategist)\n\n**Task tool invocation**:\n\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"product-strategist\", prompt=\"\"\"\nAnalyze the architectural decision for ADR: {candidate_title}\n\n**Input**: Context from Phase 1\n\n**Analysis Tasks**:\n\n1. **Structure the Context**\n   - What was the problem/need?\n   - Why was a decision required?\n   - What constraints existed?\n\n2. **Identify Options**\n   Based on commits/PRs and common patterns:\n   - Option A (selected): What was chosen and why\n   - Option B: What alternatives existed\n   - Option C: Any other approaches considered\n\n3. **Evaluate Consequences**\n   For the selected option:\n   - Positive outcomes (benefits, improvements)\n   - Negative outcomes (trade-offs, limitations)\n   - Technical implications\n\n4. **Output Format**\n   Structured content ready for ADR template sections:\n   - Context section content\n   - Decision section content\n   - Options Considered section content\n   - Consequences section content\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 3: Write ADR Documents\n\nGenerate both English and Korean versions following the template.\n\n**ADR Template Structure**:\n\n```markdown\n---\ntitle: { Title }\ndescription: ADR for {brief description}\n---\n\n# ADR-{num}: {Title}\n\n> [Korean Version](/ko/adr/{path}) OR 🇰🇷 [한국어 버전](/ko/adr/{path})\n\n| Date       | Author    | Repos            |\n| ---------- | --------- | ---------------- |\n| YYYY-MM-DD | @{author} | {repo1}, {repo2} |\n\n## Context\n\n{Problem situation and why a decision was needed}\n\n## Decision\n\n{The decision made and its rationale}\n\n## Options Considered\n\n### Option A: {Name} (Selected)\n\n{Description, pros, cons}\n\n### Option B: {Name}\n\n{Description, pros, cons}\n\n## Consequences\n\n**Positive:**\n\n- {Benefit 1}\n- {Benefit 2}\n\n**Negative:**\n\n- {Trade-off 1}\n- {Trade-off 2}\n\n## References\n\n- [Related ADR](/en/adr/XX-related.md)\n- [Related PR](https://github.com/specvital/{repo}/pull/{num})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Post-Write Updates (CRITICAL)\n\nAfter writing ADR documents, you **MUST** update all required files per CLAUDE.md rules.\n\n### For Platform Level ADR (e.g., `adr/13-xxx.md`)\n\nUpdate **6 files**:\n\n```\n☐ docs/en/index.md           ← Homepage ADR links section\n☐ docs/ko/index.md           ← Homepage ADR links section\n☐ docs/en/adr/index.md       ← ADR overview\n☐ docs/ko/adr/index.md       ← ADR overview\n☐ docs/.vitepress/config.mts ← Sidebar navigation\n```\n\n### For Repository Level ADR (e.g., `adr/core/16-xxx.md`)\n\nUpdate **6 files**:\n\n```\n☐ docs/en/index.md                 ← Homepage ADR links section\n☐ docs/ko/index.md                 ← Homepage ADR links section\n☐ docs/en/adr/index.md             ← ADR overview (repository section)\n☐ docs/ko/adr/index.md             ← ADR overview (repository section)\n☐ docs/en/adr/{category}/index.md  ← Category index\n☐ docs/ko/adr/{category}/index.md  ← Category index\n☐ docs/.vitepress/config.mts       ← Sidebar navigation\n```\n\n---\n\n## Language Rules\n\n### English Version (`/en/`)\n\n- Write entirely in English\n- Use technical terminology appropriately\n- Clear, concise prose\n\n### Korean Version (`/ko/`)\n\n- Write entirely in Korean\n- **MUST use noun-ending style** (명사형 종결)\n- **NEVER use verb-ending style** (동사 종결어미 금지)\n\n**Korean Style Examples**:\n\n| ✅ Correct                   | ❌ Incorrect                         |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 데이터 무결성 검증           | 데이터 무결성을 검증합니다           |\n| API 호출 최소화              | API 호출이 최소화됩니다              |\n| 정적 분석 기반 테스트 카운트 | 정적 분석을 통해 테스트를 카운트한다 |\n\n---\n\n## Key Rules\n\n### Must Do\n\n- Load candidate info from `adr-candidates.md`\n- Research actual GitHub commits/PRs for context\n- Follow ADR template structure exactly\n- Generate both English and Korean versions\n- Update ALL required index files (check CLAUDE.md for complete list)\n- Update sidebar in `config.mts`\n- Use noun-ending style for Korean\n\n### Must Not Do\n\n- Skip GitHub research (must base on actual commits)\n- Write only one language version\n- Forget to update index files\n- Use verb endings in Korean documents\n- Guess content without evidence from commits/PRs\n\n---\n\n## Output Summary\n\nAfter completion, report:\n\n```\n## ADR Written\n\n| Item | Value |\n|------|-------|\n| Title | {ADR Title} |\n| Number | ADR-{num} |\n| English | docs/en/adr/{path} |\n| Korean | docs/ko/adr/{path} |\n\n## Files Updated\n\n- [x] docs/en/adr/{path} (created)\n- [x] docs/ko/adr/{path} (created)\n- [x] docs/en/index.md\n- [x] docs/ko/index.md\n- [x] docs/en/adr/index.md\n- [x] docs/ko/adr/index.md\n- [x] docs/.vitepress/config.mts\n\n## Source References\n\n- {commit_sha}: {message}\n- PR #{num}: {title}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n```bash\n# Write Platform Level candidate #1 (Billing and Quota)\n/adr-write 1\n\n# Write Core repository candidate #1\n/adr-write core/1\n\n# Natural language - matches \"AI-Based Spec Document Generation Pipeline\"\n/adr-write AI spec generation\n\n# Natural language with context\n/adr-write write the billing ADR, focus on quota tracking aspects\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Commands\n\n- `/adr-discover`: Discover ADR candidates\n- `/document-business-rule`: Business rule documentation\n- `/commit`: Commit message generation\n\n## Related Agents\n\n- `specvital-specialist`: GitHub context research\n- `product-strategist`: Decision analysis and trade-offs\n- `prompt-engineer`: Document quality optimization\n- `claude-code-specialist`: Command and workflow optimization\n\n---\n\n## Execution\n\nNow execute the workflow:\n\n1. **Parse $ARGUMENTS**: Identify target candidate from `adr-candidates.md`\n2. **Phase 1**: Invoke Task(specvital-specialist) for GitHub research\n3. **Phase 2**: Invoke Task(product-strategist) for decision analysis\n4. **Phase 3**: Write ADR documents (English + Korean)\n5. **Update Index Files**: Per CLAUDE.md requirements\n6. **Report**: Summary of created/updated files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:52:39.104Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing automated Architecture Decision Record (ADR) document generation.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化架构决策记录（ADR）文档生成的技术写作代理。","ja":"技術文章作成エージェントが自動化されたアーキテクチャ決定レコード（ADR）ドキュメント生成を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 아키텍처 결정 레코드(ADR) 문서 생성이 필요한 기술 문서 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Escritura Técnica que necesitan generación automática de documentos de Registro de Decisiones de Arquitectura (ADR).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin de génération automatisée de documents d''enregistrement de décisions d''architecture (ADR).","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die eine automatisierte Generierung von Architektur-Entscheidungsprotokoll (ADR)-Dokumenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que necessitam de geração automática de documentos de Registro de Decisão de Arquitetura (ADR).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технической документации, которым необходима автоматизированная генерация документов Архитектурного Решения (ADR).","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الفنية الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد مستندات سجل تصميم بنية otomatis (ADR)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate complete ADR documents by researching GitHub commits and pull requests, and applying the ADR template, utilizing GitHub Pages for hosting and Markdown files like `adr-candidates.md` for input.","zh":"使代理能够通过研究GitHub提交和拉取请求，应用ADR模板，利用GitHub Pages进行托管和像`adr-candidates.md`这样的Markdown文件作为输入，生成完整的ADR文档。","ja":"エージェントがGitHubのコミットとプルリクエストを調査し、ADRテンプレートを適用し、GitHub Pagesをホスティングに使用し、`adr-candidates.md`のようなMarkdownファイルを入力として使用して、完全なADRドキュメントを生成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub 커밋과 풀 리퀘스트를 조사하고 ADR 템플릿을 적용하고 GitHub Pages를 호스팅에 사용하고 `adr-candidates.md`와 같은 Markdown 파일을 입력으로 사용하여 완전한 ADR 문서를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentos ADR completos investigando los commits y solicitudes de extracción de GitHub y aplicando la plantilla ADR, utilizando GitHub Pages para la hospedaje y archivos Markdown como `adr-candidates.md` para la entrada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents ADR complets en recherchant les commits et les demandes de tirage de GitHub et en appliquant le modèle ADR, en utilisant GitHub Pages pour l''hébergement et des fichiers Markdown comme `adr-candidates.md` pour l''entrée.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, vollständige ADR-Dokumente zu generieren, indem sie GitHub-Commits und Pull-Requests recherchieren und die ADR-Vorlage anwenden, wobei GitHub Pages für das Hosting und Markdown-Dateien wie `adr-candidates.md` für die Eingabe verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentos ADR completos, pesquisando commits e solicitações de pull do GitHub e aplicando o modelo de ADR, utilizando o GitHub Pages para hospedagem e arquivos Markdown como `adr-candidates.md` para entrada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полные документы ADR, исследуя коммиты и запросы на пулл в GitHub и применяя шаблон ADR, используя GitHub Pages для хостинга и файлы Markdown, такие как `adr-candidates.md`, для ввода.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد مستندات ADR كاملة من خلال البحث في الالتزامات وطلبات السحب من GitHub وتطبيق قالب ADR، باستخدام GitHub Pages لاستضافة ملفات Markdown مثل `adr-candidates.md` للإدخال."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ADR document creation","Generating reports from GitHub project history","Researching commit and pull request data for informed decision-making"],"zh":["自动化ADR文档创建","从GitHub项目历史记录生成报告","研究提交和拉取请求数据以进行明智的决策"],"ja":["ADRドキュメントの自動化された作成","GitHubプロジェクトの履歴からレポートを生成","コミットとプルリクエストのデータを調査して情報に基づいた意思決定を行う"],"ko":["ADR 문서 자동화 생성","GitHub 프로젝트 기록에서 보고서 생성","커밋 및 풀 리퀘스트 데이터 연구를 통한 정보에 기반한 의사 결정"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de documentos ADR","Generación de informes a partir del historial del proyecto de GitHub","Investigación de datos de commit y solicitud de extracción para la toma de decisiones informadas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de documents ADR","Génération de rapports à partir de l''historique du projet GitHub","Recherche de données de commit et de demande de tirage pour une prise de décision éclairée"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von ADR-Dokumenten","Generierung von Berichten aus der Geschichte des GitHub-Projekts","Recherche von Commit- und Pull-Request-Daten für eine fundierte Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de documentos ADR","Gerar relatórios a partir do histórico do projeto GitHub","Pesquisar dados de commit e solicitação de pull para tomada de decisão informada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание документов ADR","Генерировать отчеты из истории проекта GitHub","Исследовать данные коммитов и запросов на пулл для принятия обоснованных решений"],"ar":["توليد مستندات ADR آليًا","توليد تقارير من تاريخ مشروع GitHub","البحث في بيانات الالتزام وطلب السحب لأخذ القرارات الم 知ة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to GitHub project data","Needs user input in the form of `$ARGUMENTS`","Specific to ADR document generation using Markdown template"],"zh":["需要访问GitHub项目数据","需要用户以`$ARGUMENTS`形式输入","特定于使用Markdown模板的ADR文档生成"],"ja":["GitHubプロジェクトデータへのアクセスが必要","ユーザーが`$ARGUMENTS`形式で入力する必要がある","Markdownテンプレートを使用したADRドキュメント生成に特化"],"ko":["GitHub 프로젝트 데이터에 대한 액세스가 필요","사용자가 `$ARGUMENTS` 형식으로 입력해야 함","Markdown 템플릿을 사용한 ADR 문서 생성에 특화"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los datos del proyecto de GitHub","Necesita entrada de usuario en forma de `$ARGUMENTS`","Específico para la generación de documentos ADR utilizando plantilla Markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données du projet GitHub","A besoin d''une entrée utilisateur sous la forme de `$ARGUMENTS`","Spécifique à la génération de documents ADR à l''aide d''un modèle Markdown"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub-Projekt-Daten","Benötigt Benutzereingabe in Form von `$ARGUMENTS`","Spezifisch für die Generierung von ADR-Dokumenten unter Verwendung von Markdown-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos dados do projeto GitHub","Necessita de entrada do usuário na forma de `$ARGUMENTS`","Específico para geração de documentos ADR usando modelo Markdown"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным проекта GitHub","Требует ввода пользователя в виде `$ARGUMENTS`","Конкретно для генерации документов ADR с использованием шаблона Markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات مشروع GitHub","يتطلب إدخال المستخدم في شكل `$ARGUMENTS`","محدد لتوليد مستندات ADR باستخدام قالب Markdown"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2b49e1f6e1ac1e9a21ff7ea6d2daa32f7d67c98683ffe41a3b2869dbb30862b4","qualityScore":55}');
