 Node.js"],"ar":["استضافة آمنة للوكلاء الذكيين","نماذج سطر الأوامر سهلة الاستخدام","تنفيذ مبسط","دعم للفئات غير الفنية","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AIエージェント CLI 模式","安全的非技术性托管","CLI 模式支持","如何使用 AIエージェント","AIエージェント CLI 模式安装","AIエージェント CLI 模式设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント CLI パターン","安全な非技術的なホスティング","CLI パターン対応","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェント CLI パターンのインストール","AIエージェント CLI パターンの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 CLI 패턴","안전한 비기술적인 호스팅","CLI 패턴 지원","AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트 CLI 패턴 설치","AI 에이전트 CLI 패턴 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar patrones de CLI","qué es un Agente de IA","alternativas a patrones de CLI","patrones de CLI vs otros herramientas","instalación de patrones de CLI","guía de configuración de patrones de CLI"],"fr":["comment utiliser des modèles CLI","qu''est-ce qu''un Outil d''IA","alternatives aux modèles CLI","modèles CLI vs autres outils","installation de modèles CLI","guide de configuration de modèles CLI"],"de":["wie man CLI-Muster verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agents","Alternativen zu CLI-Mustern","CLI-Muster vs andere Tools","Installation von CLI-Mustern","Konfigurationsanleitung für CLI-Muster"],"pt":["como usar padrões CLI","o que é CLI-Patterns","ferramentas de IA para não técnicos","alternativas para hospedagem segura","CLI-Patterns vs outros padrões","instalar CLI-Patterns","guia de configuração para CLI-Patterns"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агенты","инструменты ИИ для не-технических пользователей","альтернативы для безопасного хостинга","ИИ Агенты vs другие агенты","установить ИИ Агенты","руководство по настройке для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام نماذج سطر الأوامر","ما هي نماذج سطر الأوامر","أدوات ذكية للفئات غير الفنية","بديلات لاستضافة آمنة","نماذج سطر الأوامر مقابل نماذج أخرى","تثبيت نماذج سطر الأوامر","دليل إعداد لنماذج سطر الأوامر"]}},"owner":"ADLenehan","repo":"battery","repoPath":"ADLenehan/battery","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.724Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cli-patterns","description":"Patterns for building Battery CLI commands with Commander.js. Use this skill when creating new CLI commands, adding options/flags, formatting output, handling errors, or implementing interactive prompts.","bodyPreview":"# CLI Patterns\n\n## Command Structure\n\nUse Commander.js for all CLI commands. Commands live in `packages/cli/src/commands/`.\n\n### Basic Command\n\n```typescript\nimport { Command } from ''commander''\n\nexport const deployCommand = new Command(''deploy'')\n  .description(''Deploy an application to Battery'')\n  .argument(''<path>'', ''Path to the application directory'')\n  .option(''-e, --env <environment>'', ''Target environment'', ''production'')\n  .option(''--dry-run'', ''Show what would be deployed without deploying'')","body":"# CLI Patterns\n\n## Command Structure\n\nUse Commander.js for all CLI commands. Commands live in `packages/cli/src/commands/`.\n\n### Basic Command\n\n```typescript\nimport { Command } from ''commander''\n\nexport const deployCommand = new Command(''deploy'')\n  .description(''Deploy an application to Battery'')\n  .argument(''<path>'', ''Path to the application directory'')\n  .option(''-e, --env <environment>'', ''Target environment'', ''production'')\n  .option(''--dry-run'', ''Show what would be deployed without deploying'')\n  .action(async (path, options) => {\n    // Implementation\n  })\n```\n\n### Command with Subcommands\n\n```typescript\nexport const configCommand = new Command(''config'')\n  .description(''Manage Battery configuration'')\n\nconfigCommand\n  .command(''set <key> <value>'')\n  .description(''Set a configuration value'')\n  .action(async (key, value) => {})\n\nconfigCommand\n  .command(''get <key>'')\n  .description(''Get a configuration value'')\n  .action(async (key) => {})\n```\n\n## Output Formatting\n\n### Chalk for Colors\n\n```typescript\nimport chalk from ''chalk''\n\n// Status messages\nconsole.log(chalk.green(''✓''), ''Deployment successful'')\nconsole.log(chalk.yellow(''!''), ''Warning: No auth detected'')\nconsole.log(chalk.red(''✗''), ''Error: Invalid credentials'')\n\n// Emphasis\nconsole.log(chalk.bold(''Scanning...''))\nconsole.log(chalk.dim(''Press Ctrl+C to cancel''))\n\n// URLs and paths\nconsole.log(chalk.cyan(''https://app.battery.dev''))\nconsole.log(chalk.gray(''./src/config.ts''))\n```\n\n### Ora for Spinners\n\n```typescript\nimport ora from ''ora''\n\nconst spinner = ora(''Scanning for credentials...'').start()\n\ntry {\n  const results = await scan(path)\n  spinner.succeed(''Scan complete'')\n} catch (error) {\n  spinner.fail(''Scan failed'')\n  throw error\n}\n```\n\n### Tree Output\n\n```typescript\nfunction printTree(items: string[], indent = 0): void {\n  const prefix = ''  ''.repeat(indent)\n  items.forEach((item, i) => {\n    const isLast = i === items.length - 1\n    const branch = isLast ? ''└──'' : ''├──''\n    console.log(`${prefix}${branch} ${item}`)\n  })\n}\n\n// Output:\n// ├── Detected: Next.js\n// ├── Found credentials:\n// │   ├── SNOWFLAKE_PASSWORD in .env\n// │   └── SALESFORCE_TOKEN in lib/api.ts\n// └── Deploying...\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Exit Codes\n\n```typescript\nexport const ExitCode = {\n  Success: 0,\n  GeneralError: 1,\n  InvalidArgument: 2,\n  ConfigError: 3,\n  NetworkError: 4,\n  AuthError: 5,\n} as const\n\nprocess.exit(ExitCode.InvalidArgument)\n```\n\n### Error Display\n\n```typescript\nimport chalk from ''chalk''\n\nfunction handleError(error: Error): never {\n  console.error()\n  console.error(chalk.red(''Error:''), error.message)\n\n  if (error.cause) {\n    console.error(chalk.dim(''Cause:''), String(error.cause))\n  }\n\n  if (process.env.DEBUG) {\n    console.error(chalk.dim(error.stack))\n  }\n\n  process.exit(ExitCode.GeneralError)\n}\n```\n\n### Graceful Shutdown\n\n```typescript\nprocess.on(''SIGINT'', () => {\n  console.log()\n  console.log(chalk.dim(''Cancelled''))\n  process.exit(130)\n})\n```\n\n## Interactive Prompts\n\nUse @inquirer/prompts for user input.\n\n### Confirmation\n\n```typescript\nimport { confirm } from ''@inquirer/prompts''\n\nconst proceed = await confirm({\n  message: ''Deploy to production?'',\n  default: false,\n})\n```\n\n### Selection\n\n```typescript\nimport { select } from ''@inquirer/prompts''\n\nconst environment = await select({\n  message: ''Select environment'',\n  choices: [\n    { name: ''Production'', value: ''production'' },\n    { name: ''Staging'', value: ''staging'' },\n    { name: ''Development'', value: ''development'' },\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n### Text Input\n\n```typescript\nimport { input } from ''@inquirer/prompts''\n\nconst projectName = await input({\n  message: ''Project name'',\n  default: path.basename(process.cwd()),\n  validate: (value) => {\n    if (!/^[a-z0-9-]+$/.test(value)) {\n      return ''Must be lowercase alphanumeric with hyphens''\n    }\n    return true\n  },\n})\n```\n\n### Password Input\n\n```typescript\nimport { password } from ''@inquirer/prompts''\n\nconst token = await password({\n  message: ''Enter your API token'',\n  mask: ''*'',\n})\n```\n\n## Configuration Files\n\n### Config Location\n\n```typescript\nimport { homedir } from ''os''\nimport { join } from ''path''\n\nconst CONFIG_DIR = join(homedir(), ''.battery'')\nconst CONFIG_FILE = join(CONFIG_DIR, ''config.json'')\nconst CREDENTIALS_FILE = join(CONFIG_DIR, ''credentials.json'')\n```\n\n### Config Schema\n\n```typescript\ninterface BatteryConfig {\n  defaultOrg?: string\n  defaultEnvironment?: ''production'' | ''staging''\n  telemetry?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n## Patterns to Follow\n\n1. **Always show progress** - Use spinners for operations > 500ms\n2. **Confirm destructive actions** - Prompt before deleting or overwriting\n3. **Support --json flag** - For programmatic output\n4. **Respect NO_COLOR** - Disable colors when env var is set\n5. **Use stderr for errors** - Keep stdout clean for piping\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:54:59.391Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing structured command-line interface interactions using Commander.js","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Commander.js 进行结构化命令行接口交互的开发者代理","ja":"Commander.js を使用した構造化されたコマンドラインインターフェイスの相互作用が必要な開発者エージェントに最適","ko":"Commander.js를 사용한 구조화된 명령줄 인터페이스 상호작용이 필요한 개발자 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan interacciones de interfaz de línea de comandos estructuradas utilizando Commander.js","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin d''interactions d''interface de ligne de commande structurées utilisant Commander.js","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die strukturierte Kommandozeilen-Schnittstellen-Interaktionen mit Commander.js benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de interações de interface de linha de comando estruturadas usando Commander.js","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков, которым необходимы структурированные взаимодействия с командной строкой с помощью Commander.js","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى تفاعلات واجهة سطر الأوامر المهيكلة باستخدام Commander.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define and execute custom CLI commands with arguments and options, leveraging Commander.js for robust command structure and parsing, and supporting features like environment targeting and dry-run simulations","zh":"赋予代理定义和执行自定义的 CLI 命令，包括参数和选项，利用 Commander.js 实现强大的命令结构和解析，并支持环境目标和 dry-run 模拟等功能","ja":"エージェントがカスタムの CLI コマンドを定義および実行できるようにし、引数とオプションを備え、Commander.js を使用して強力なコマンド構造と解析を実現し、環境ターゲットや dry-run シミュレーションなどの機能をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 커스텀 CLI 명령을 정의하고 실행할 수 있도록 하며, 인수와 옵션을 포함하여 Commander.js를 사용하여 강력한 명령 구조와 구문을 제공하며, 환경 대상 및 dry-run 시뮬레이션 등의 기능을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir y ejecutar comandos personalizados de CLI con argumentos y opciones, aprovechando Commander.js para una estructura de comandos robusta y análisis, y admitiendo características como la orientación del entorno y las simulaciones de ejecución en seco","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir et d''exécuter des commandes CLI personnalisées avec des arguments et des options, en exploitant Commander.js pour une structure de commande robuste et un parsing, et en prenant en charge des fonctionnalités comme la ciblage d''environnement et les simulations de dry-run","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, benutzerdefinierte CLI-Befehle mit Argumenten und Optionen zu definieren und auszuführen, indem Commander.js für eine robuste Befehlsstruktur und Analyse genutzt wird und Funktionen wie Umgebungszielen und Dry-Run-Simulationen unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definirem e executarem comandos personalizados CLI com argumentos e opções, aproveitando o Commander.js para estrutura de comando robusta e análise, e suportando recursos como direcionamento de ambiente e simulações de teste de execução seca","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять и выполнять пользовательские команды CLI с аргументами и опциями, используя Commander.js для надежной структуры команд и парсинга, а также поддерживая функции, такие как целевая среда и симуляции сухого запуска","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تعريف وتشغيل أوامر CLI مخصصة مع الحجج والخيارات، واستخدام Commander.js لهيكلة الأوامر القوية والتحليل، ودعم الميزات مثل استهداف البيئة ومحاكاة اختبار التشغيل الجاف"},"useCases":{"en":["Defining custom deploy commands with environment options","Parsing command-line arguments for application directories","Implementing dry-run simulations for deployment testing"],"zh":["定义带环境选项的自定义部署命令","解析命令行参数以获取应用程序目录","实现 dry-run 模拟以进行部署测试"],"ja":["環境オプションを備えたカスタムのデプロイコマンドを定義","アプリケーションディレクトリを取得するためにコマンドライン引数を解析","デプロイテストのために dry-run シミュレーションを実装"],"ko":["환경 옵션을 갖춘 커스텀 배포 명령을 정의","애플리케이션 디렉토리를 얻기 위해 명령줄 인수를 구문 분석","배포 테스트를 위해 dry-run 시뮬레이션을 구현"],"es":["Definir comandos personalizados de implementación con opciones de entorno","Analizar argumentos de línea de comandos para directorios de aplicaciones","Implementar simulaciones de ejecución en seco para pruebas de implementación"],"fr":["Définir des commandes de déploiement personnalisées avec des options d''environnement","Analyser les arguments de ligne de commande pour les répertoires d''applications","Mettre en œuvre des simulations de dry-run pour les tests de déploiement"],"de":["Definieren benutzerdefinierter Bereitstellungs-Befehle mit Umgebungs-Optionen","Analysieren von Kommandozeilen-Argumenten für Anwendungsverzeichnisse","Implementieren von Dry-Run-Simulationen für Bereitstellungstests"],"pt":["Definindo comandos personalizados de implantação com opções de ambiente","Analisando argumentos de linha de comando para diretórios de aplicativos","Implementando simulações de teste de execução seca para testes de implantação"],"ru":["Определение пользовательских команд развертывания с опциями среды","Парсинг аргументов командной строки для каталогов приложений","Реализация симуляций сухого запуска для тестирования развертывания"],"ar":["تعريف أوامر تثبيت مخصصة مع خيارات بيئة","تحليل الحجج سطر الأوامر لملفات تطبيق","تنفيذ محاكاة اختبار تشغيل جاف لاختبارات التثبيت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Commander.js installation","Node.js environment necessary","Limited to TypeScript and JavaScript applications"],"zh":["需要安装 Commander.js","需要 Node.js 环境","仅限于 TypeScript 和 JavaScript 应用程序"],"ja":["Commander.js のインストールが必要","Node.js 環境が必要","TypeScript と JavaScript のアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["Commander.js 설치가 필요","Node.js 환경이 필요","TypeScript 및 JavaScript 애플리케이션에 한함"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Commander.js","Entorno de Node.js necesario","Limitado a aplicaciones de TypeScript y JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Commander.js","Environnement Node.js nécessaire","Limité aux applications TypeScript et JavaScript"],"de":["Benötigt Commander.js-Installation","Node.js-Umgebung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf TypeScript- und JavaScript-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Commander.js","Ambiente Node.js necessário","Limitado a aplicações TypeScript e JavaScript"],"ru":["Требуется установка Commander.js","Необходимо окружение Node.js","Ограничен для приложений TypeScript и JavaScript"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Commander.js","بيئة Node.js ضرورية","محدود لتطبيقات TypeScript وJavaScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fdc3424fa0a45dc2c320bc2894ae384c51794b3a26189b7bf2b28a1bb6987d08","qualityScore":55}');
