ppement de logiciels","Compatibilité avec Racket et d''autres langages de programmation","Installation et configuration faciles"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten CLI-Tools","Integration mit KI zur Verbesserung der Entwicklungsarbeit","Verbesserung der Produktivität und Effizienz in der Softwareentwicklung","Kompatibilität mit Racket und anderen Programmiersprachen","Einfache Installation und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Crie interfaces de linha de comando personalizadas","Use tecnologia de IA para automação de tarefas","Desenvolva CLIs Racket eficazes","Aprenda a trabalhar com Racket e IA","Construa soluções personalizadas"],"ru":["Создавайте индивидуальные командные интерфейсы","Используйте технологию ИИ Агентов для автоматизации задач","Разрабатывайте эффективные Racket CLI","Узнайте, как работать с Racket и ИИ","Постройте индивидуальные решения"],"ar":["ابني واجهات سطر الأوامر المخصصة","استخدم تقنية الذكاء الاصطناعي للautomatização المهام","طور واجهات سطر الأوامر Racket الفعالة","تعلم كيفية العمل مع Racket والذكاء الاصطناعي","ابني حلولاً مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Racket构建CLI","Racket CLI教程","AI工具是什么","Racket CLI替代品","Racket CLI安装","Racket CLI设置指南","Racket vs Node.js","CLI开发框架"],"ja":["Racketを使用してCLIを構築する方法","Racket CLIチュートリアル","AIエージェントとは何か","Racket CLIの代替品","Racket CLIのインストール","Racket CLIの設定ガイド","Racket vs Node.js","CLI開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["랙켓을 사용하여 CLI를 구축하는 방법","랙켓 CLI 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트란 무엇인가","랙켓 CLI의 대체品","랙켓 CLI의 설치","랙켓 CLI의 설정 가이드","랙켓 vs Node.js","CLI 개발 프레임워크"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","CLI de Racket","desarrollo de software","productividad y eficiencia","instalación de herramientas de inteligencia artificial","guía de configuración de herramientas de inteligencia artificial","alternativas a herramientas de inteligencia artificial","herramientas de inteligencia artificial vs competidores"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","CLI Racket","développement de logiciels","productivité et efficacité","installation d''outils d''intelligence artificielle","guide de configuration d''outils d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives aux outils d''intelligence artificielle","outils d''intelligence artificielle vs concurrents"],"de":["KI-Tools","Racket-CLI","Softwareentwicklung","Produktivität und Effizienz","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Tools","Alternativen zu KI-Tools","KI-Tools vs Wettbewerber"],"pt":["como usar Racket","o que é Racket CLI","Racket CLI alternative","Racket vs outros CLI","instalar Racket","guias de configuração Racket","desenvolvimento de CLIs Racket","ferramentas de IA para Racket"],"ru":["как использовать Racket","что такое Racket CLI","ИИ Агенты для Racket","Racket CLI альтернатива","Racket vs другие CLI","установка Racket","руководства по настройке Racket","разработка Racket CLI","ИИ Агенты для автоматизации задач"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Racket","ما هي واجهة سطر الأوامر Racket","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ل Racket","واجهة سطر الأوامر Racket البديلة","Racket مقابل واجهات سطر الأوامر الأخرى","تثبيت Racket","دليل إعداد Racket","تطوير واجهات سطر الأوامر Racket","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للautomatización المهام"]}},"owner":"Diogenesoftoronto","repo":"chrysalis-forge","repoPath":"Diogenesoftoronto/chrysalis-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.737Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"building-racket-clis","description":"Builds Racket command-line applications with proper argument parsing, subcommands, and packaging. Use when creating CLI tools, adding command-line options, or packaging Racket executables.","bodyPreview":"# Building Racket CLI Applications\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```racket\n#lang racket\n(require racket/cmdline)\n\n(define verbose (make-parameter #f))\n\n(command-line\n #:program \"my-cli\"\n #:once-each\n [(\"-v\" \"--verbose\") \"Enable verbose output\" (verbose #t)]\n #:args (filename)\n (when (verbose) (displayln \"Processing...\"))\n (displayln filename))\n```\n\n## Command-Line Parsing with `racket/cmdline`\n\n### Basic Flags and Arguments\n\n```racket\n(require racket/cmdline)\n\n(define output-file (make-parameter \"out.txt\"))","body":"# Building Racket CLI Applications\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```racket\n#lang racket\n(require racket/cmdline)\n\n(define verbose (make-parameter #f))\n\n(command-line\n #:program \"my-cli\"\n #:once-each\n [(\"-v\" \"--verbose\") \"Enable verbose output\" (verbose #t)]\n #:args (filename)\n (when (verbose) (displayln \"Processing...\"))\n (displayln filename))\n```\n\n## Command-Line Parsing with `racket/cmdline`\n\n### Basic Flags and Arguments\n\n```racket\n(require racket/cmdline)\n\n(define output-file (make-parameter \"out.txt\"))\n(define count (make-parameter 1))\n\n(command-line\n #:program \"tool\"\n #:once-each\n [(\"-o\" \"--output\") file \"Output file path\" (output-file file)]\n [(\"-n\" \"--count\") n \"Number of iterations\" (count (string->number n))]\n #:once-any\n [(\"--json\") \"Output as JSON\" (format-param ''json)]\n [(\"--csv\") \"Output as CSV\" (format-param ''csv)]\n #:multi\n [(\"-i\" \"--include\") path \"Include additional path\" (includes (cons path (includes)))]\n #:args (input-file . rest-files)\n (process-files (cons input-file rest-files)))\n```\n\n### Flag Types\n\n| Directive | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `#:once-each` | Flag can appear once |\n| `#:once-any` | Only one of these flags allowed |\n| `#:multi` | Flag can repeat, accumulates values |\n| `#:final` | Stops processing after this flag |\n| `#:args` | Positional arguments pattern |\n| `#:usage-help` | Custom usage message |\n\n### Subcommands Pattern\n\n```racket\n#lang racket\n(require racket/cmdline)\n\n(define (cmd-init args)\n  (command-line #:program \"mycli init\"\n                #:argv args\n                #:args () (displayln \"Initialized!\")))\n\n(define (cmd-run args)\n  (define watch (make-parameter #f))\n  (command-line #:program \"mycli run\"\n                #:argv args\n                #:once-each [(\"-w\" \"--watch\") \"Watch mode\" (watch #t)]\n                #:args (file) (run-file file (watch))))\n\n(define (main)\n  (define args (current-command-line-arguments))\n  (when (zero? (vector-length args))\n    (displayln \"Usage: mycli <command> [options]\")\n    (displayln \"Commands: init, run\")\n    (exit 1))\n  (match (vector-ref args 0)\n    [\"init\" (cmd-init (vector-drop args 1))]\n    [\"run\" (cmd-run (vector-drop args 1))]\n    [cmd (eprintf \"Unknown command: ~a~n\" cmd) (exit 1)]))\n\n(module+ main (main))\n```\n\n## Packaging as Executable\n\n### Method 1: raco exe (Standalone Binary)\n\n```bash\n# Create standalone executable\nraco exe -o my-cli main.rkt\n\n# Create distribution with dependencies\nraco distribute dist-folder my-cli\n```\n\n### Method 2: Launcher via info.rkt (Installed with Package)\n\nIn `info.rkt`:\n```racket\n#lang info\n(define collection \"my-package\")\n(define deps ''(\"base\"))\n\n;; Define CLI launchers\n(define racket-launcher-names ''(\"my-cli\" \"my-cli-admin\"))\n(define racket-launcher-libraries ''(\"main.rkt\" \"admin.rkt\"))\n```\n\nInstall with:\n```bash\nraco pkg install --link .\n# Now ''my-cli'' is available in PATH\n```\n\n### Method 3: GraalVM Native Image (Advanced)\n\n```bash\n# Compile to bytecode\nraco make main.rkt\n# Use racket-native or wrap in GraalVM (experimental)\n```\n\n## Interactive Input\n\n```racket\n;; Simple prompt\n(define (prompt msg)\n  (display msg)\n  (flush-output)\n  (read-line))\n\n;; Password input (no echo - requires terminal)\n(define (prompt-password msg)\n  (display msg)\n  (flush-output)\n  (system \"stty -echo\")\n  (define pw (read-line))\n  (system \"stty echo\")\n  (newline)\n  pw)\n\n;; Confirmation\n(define (confirm? msg)\n  (define response (prompt (format \"~a [y/N]: \" msg)))\n  (member (string-downcase (string-trim response)) ''(\"y\" \"yes\")))\n```\n\n## Output Formatting\n\n### Colored Output\n\n```racket\n(require racket/format)\n\n(define (color code text)\n  (format \"\\033[~am~a\\033[0m\" code text))\n\n(define (red text) (color 31 text))\n(define (green text) (color 32 text))\n(define (yellow text) (color 33 text))\n(define (blue text) (color 34 text))\n(define (bold text) (color 1 text))\n\n(displayln (green \"✓ Success\"))\n(displayln (red \"✗ Error\"))\n```\n\n### Progress Indicators\n\n```racket\n(define (with-spinner msg thunk)\n  (define frames ''(\"⠋\" \"⠙\" \"⠹\" \"⠸\" \"⠼\" \"⠴\" \"⠦\" \"⠧\" \"⠇\" \"⠏\"))\n  (define done? (box #f))\n  (define spinner-thread\n    (thread\n     (λ ()\n       (let loop ([i 0])\n         (unless (unbox done?)\n           (printf \"\\r~a ~a\" (list-ref frames (modulo i 10)) msg)\n           (flush-output)\n           (sleep 0.1)\n           (loop (add1 i)))))))\n  (define result (thunk))\n  (set-box! done? #t)\n  (thread-wait spinner-thread)\n  (printf \"\\r✓ ~a~n\" msg)\n  result)\n```\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n```racket\n;; Standard exit codes\n(define EXIT-SUCCESS 0)\n(define EXIT-ERROR 1)\n(define EXIT-USAGE 64)    ; EX_USAGE from sysexits.h\n(define EXIT-DATAERR 65)  ; EX_DATAERR\n(define EXIT-NOINPUT 66)  ; EX_NOINPUT\n\n(define (die! msg [code EXIT-ERROR])\n  (eprintf \"Error: ~a~n\" msg)\n  (exit code))\n\n;; Usage\n(unless (file-exists? input-file)\n  (die! (format \"File not found: ~a\" input-file) EXIT-NOINPUT))\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```racket\n;; Reading\n(define api-key (getenv \"API_KEY\"))\n(define debug? (equal? (getenv \"DEBUG\") \"1\"))\n(define home (or (getenv \"HOME\") (find-system-path ''home-dir)))\n\n;; With defaults\n(define port (string->number (or (getenv \"PORT\") \"8080\")))\n\n;; Setting (for child processes)\n(putenv \"MY_VAR\" \"value\")\n```\n\n## Configuration Files\n\n### XDG-Compliant Config Location\n\n```racket\n(define (config-dir)\n  (or (getenv \"XDG_CONFIG_HOME\")\n      (build-path (find-system-path ''home-dir) \".config\")))\n\n(define (app-config-path app-name)\n  (build-path (config-dir) app-name \"config.toml\"))\n```\n\n### Simple Config Loading\n\n```racket\n(require json)\n\n(define (load-config path)\n  (if (file-exists? path)\n      (with-input-from-file path read-json)\n      (hash)))\n\n(define (save-config path data)\n  (make-parent-directory* path)\n  (with-output-to-file path\n    #:exists ''replace\n    (λ () (write-json data))))\n```\n\n## Testing CLIs\n\n```racket\n#lang racket\n(require rackunit)\n\n;; Capture stdout/stderr\n(define (capture-output thunk)\n  (define out (open-output-string))\n  (define err (open-output-string))\n  (parameterize ([current-output-port out]\n                 [current-error-port err])\n    (thunk))\n  (values (get-output-string out)\n          (get-output-string err)))\n\n;; Test CLI with args\n(define (run-cli-test args)\n  (parameterize ([current-command-line-arguments (list->vector args)])\n    (capture-output main)))\n\n(test-case \"help flag shows usage\"\n  (define-values (out err) (run-cli-test ''(\"--help\")))\n  (check-regexp-match #rx\"Usage:\" out))\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use parameters** for configuration, not global variables\n2. **Validate inputs early** with clear error messages\n3. **Support `--help`** automatically via command-line\n4. **Use exit codes** consistently (0 = success)\n5. **Write to stderr** for errors and diagnostics\n6. **Support `--version`** for installed tools\n7. **Handle signals** gracefully when possible\n\n```racket\n;; Version flag\n(command-line\n #:program \"my-cli\"\n #:once-each\n [(\"--version\") \"Show version\" \n  (displayln \"my-cli v1.0.0\") (exit 0)]\n ...)\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:03:25.679Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Racket-focused Agents needing command-line interface creation capabilities with racket/cmdline","zh":"适合于 Racket 关注的 Agents 需要创建命令行界面的能力，使用 racket/cmdline","ja":"Racket に焦点を当てた Agents に適合する、コマンドライン インターフェイスの作成機能を提供する、racket/cmdline を使用する","ko":"Racket에 집중한 Agents가 명령줄 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하는 racket/cmdline을 사용하여 Racket에 적합한 Agents","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en Racket que necesitan capacidades de creación de interfaz de línea de comandos con racket/cmdline","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents axés sur Racket nécessitant des capacités de création d''interface de ligne de commande avec racket/cmdline","de":"Perfekt für Racket-fokussierte Agenten, die Funktionen zur Erstellung von Kommandozeilenoberflächen mit racket/cmdline benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Racket que necessitam de capacidades de criação de interface de linha de comando com racket/cmdline","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на Racket, которым необходимы возможности создания командной строки с помощью racket/cmdline","ar":"مثالي لعميل براكيت الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات إنشاء واجهة سطر الأوامر مع racket/cmdline"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to parse command-line arguments and flags using racket/cmdline, enabling the creation of customizable CLI applications with features like verbose output and file processing","zh":"赋予 Agents 解析命令行参数和标志的能力，使用 racket/cmdline，实现可定制的 CLI 应用，具有诸如详细输出和文件处理等功能","ja":"Agents がコマンドライン引数とフラグを解析する機能を提供する、racket/cmdline を使用して、可定制の CLI アプリケーションを実現する","ko":"Agents가 명령줄 인수와 플래그를 파싱하는 기능을 제공하는 racket/cmdline을 사용하여 커스텀 CLI 애플리케이션을 구현하는 것을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes para analizar argumentos y opciones de línea de comandos utilizando racket/cmdline, lo que permite la creación de aplicaciones CLI personalizables con características como salida detallada y procesamiento de archivos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les arguments et les options de ligne de commande à l''aide de racket/cmdline, permettant ainsi la création d''applications CLI personnalisables avec des fonctionnalités telles que la sortie détaillée et le traitement de fichiers","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Kommandozeilenargumente und -optionen mithilfe von racket/cmdline zu parsen, wodurch die Erstellung von anpassbaren CLI-Anwendungen mit Funktionen wie detaillierter Ausgabe und Dateiverarbeitung ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar argumentos e flags de linha de comando usando racket/cmdline, permitindo a criação de aplicações CLI personalizáveis com recursos como saída detalhada e processamento de arquivos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью парсить аргументы и флаги командной строки с помощью racket/cmdline, что позволяет создавать настраиваемые приложения CLI с функциями, такими как подробный вывод и обработка файлов","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل الحجج وعلامات سطر الأوامر باستخدام racket/cmdline، مما يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات CLI قابلة للتخصيص مع ميزات مثل الإخراج المفصل والمعالجة الملف"},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom CLI tools with parameterized options","Parsing command-line flags and arguments for Racket scripts","Creating verbose output for debugging purposes"],"zh":["使用参数化的选项构建自定义的 CLI 工具","解析命令行标志和参数用于 Racket 脚本","创建详细输出用于调试目的"],"ja":["パラメータ化されたオプションを使用してカスタム CLI ツールを構築する","コマンドライン フラグと引数を解析する Racket 脚本","デバッグ目的の詳細な出力を作成する"],"ko":["매개변수화된 옵션을 사용하여 커스텀 CLI 도구를 구축하는","명령줄 플래그와 인수를 파싱하는 Racket 스크립트","디버깅 목적으로詳細한 출력을 생성하는"],"es":["Creación de herramientas CLI personalizadas con opciones parametrizadas","Análisis de opciones y argumentos de línea de comandos para scripts de Racket","Creación de salida detallada para fines de depuración"],"fr":["Création d''outils CLI personnalisés avec des options paramétrées","Analyse des options et des arguments de ligne de commande pour les scripts Racket","Création d''une sortie détaillée pour des fins de débogage"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter CLI-Tools mit parametrierten Optionen","Analyse von Kommandozeilenoptionen und -argumenten für Racket-Skripte","Erstellung detaillierter Ausgaben für Debugging-Zwecke"],"pt":["Construir ferramentas CLI personalizadas com opções parametrizadas","Analizar flags e argumentos de linha de comando para scripts Racket","Criar saída detalhada para fins de depuração"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских инструментов CLI с параметризованными опциями","Парсинг флагов и аргументов командной строки для скриптов Racket","Создание подробного вывода для целей отладки"],"ar":["بناء أدوات CLI مخصصة مع خيارات مُ 매设","تحليل أعلام وسطر الأوامر للحصول على نصوص براكيت","إنشاء إخراج مفصل لغرض التصحيح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Racket runtime environment","Limited to Racket-specific command-line parsing"],"zh":["需要 Racket 运行时环境","仅限于 Racket específico의命令行解析"],"ja":["Racket 런타임 환경이 필요합니다","Racket에 특정한 명령줄 파싱에만 제한됩니다"],"ko":["Racket 런타임 환경이 필요합니다","Racket에 특정한 명령줄 파싱에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno de tiempo de ejecución de Racket","Limitado al análisis de línea de comandos específico de Racket"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement d''exécution Racket","Limité à l''analyse de ligne de commande spécifique à Racket"],"de":["Benötigt Racket-Laufzeitumgebung","Begrenzt auf Racket-spezifische Kommandozeilenanalyse"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de tempo de execução Racket","Limitado ao parsing de linha de comando específico do Racket"],"ru":["Требует среды выполнения Racket","Ограничен парсингом командной строки, специфичным для Racket"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة وقت تشغيل براكيت","محدود بتحليل سطر الأوامر النوعي لبراكيت"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9761259249db4e7ed5f85b4f3ca282fa6bc1992194085c700175931ffa637722","qualityScore":55}');
