g für Blockchain","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Revisão de Plano de Implementação com ...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Проверка Плана Реализации с Blockscout APIs","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: مراجعة خطة التنفيذ باستخدام Block...","en":"implementation-plan-review"},"description":{"zh":"实现计划审查AI智能代理，使用Blockscout API和Model Context Protocol实现区块链数据的审查和管理","ja":"実装計画レビューAIエージェント、Blockscout APIとModel Context Protocolを使用してブロックチェーンデータをレビューして管理する","ko":"구현 계획 검토 AI 에이전트, Blockscout API와 Model Context Protocol을 사용하여 블록체인 데이터를 검토하고 관리합니다","es":"La revisión de planes de implementación envuelve Blockscout APIs para exponer datos de blockchain a través del Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo","fr":"La revue des plans d''implémentation enveloppe les API Blockscout pour exposer les données de blockchain via le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle","de":"Die Implementierungsplan-Überprüfung umhüllt Blockscout-APIs, um Blockchain-Daten über das Modellkontextprotokoll zu exponieren","pt":"A revisão de plano de implementação envolve a utilização de Blockscout APIs para expor dados de blockchain por meio do Model Context Protocol.","ru":"Проверка плана реализации включает в себя использование Blockscout APIs для экспонирования данных блокчейна через Model Context Protocol.","ar":"مراجعة خطة التنفيذ تتضمن استخدام Blockscout APIs لعرض بيانات البلوكشين من خلال بروتوكول سياق النموذج.","en":"Wraps Blockscout APIs and exposes blockchain data by Model Context Protocol"},"definition":{"en":"Wraps Blockscout APIs and exposes blockchain data by Model Context Protocol"},"features":{"zh":["使用Blockscout API","支持Model Context Protocol","区块链数据审查","实现计划管理","支持多种区块链平台"],"ja":["Blockscout APIを使用","Model Context Protocolをサポート","ブロックチェーンデータのレビュー","実装計画の管理","複数のブロックチェーンプラットフォームをサポート"],"ko":["Blockscout API 사용","Model Context Protocol 지원","블록체인 데이터 검토","구현 계획 관리","다중 블록체인 플랫폼 지원"],"es":["Integración con Blockscout APIs","Exposición de datos de blockchain","Compatibilidad con Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo","Optimización del acceso a datos","Implementación de planes de acción personalizados"],"fr":["Intégration avec les API Blockscout","Exposition des données de blockchain","Compatibilité avec le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle","Optimisation de l''accès aux données","Implémentation de plans d''action personnalisés"],"de":["Integration mit Blockscout-APIs","Exposition von Blockchain-Daten","Kompatibilität mit dem Modellkontextprotokoll","Optimierung des Zugriffs auf Daten","Implementierung von maßgeschneiderten Aktionsplänen"],"pt":["Integração com Blockscout APIs","Exposição de dados de blockchain","Utilização do Model Context Protocol","Revisão de planos de implementação","Análise de dados de blockchain"],"ru":["Интеграция с Blockscout APIs","Экспонирование данных блокчейна","Использование Model Context Protocol","Проверка планов реализации","Анализ данных блокчейна"],"ar":["التكامل مع Blockscout APIs","عرض بيانات البلوكشين","استخدام بروتوكول سياق النموذج","مراجعة خطط التنفيذ","تحليل بيانات البلوكشين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","实现计划审查","Blockscout API","Model Context Protocol","区块链数据管理","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装"],"ja":["AIエージェント","実装計画レビュー","Blockscout API","Model Context Protocol","ブロックチェーンデータ管理","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","구현 계획 검토","Blockscout API","Model Context Protocol","블록체인 데이터 관리","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para blockchain","cómo usar Blockscout APIs","qué es la revisión de planes de implementación","alternativas a la revisión de planes de implementación","revisión de planes de implementación vs competidores","instalación de la revisión de planes de implementación","guía de configuración para la revisión de planes de implementación"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour blockchain","comment utiliser les API Blockscout","quoi est la revue des plans d''implémentation","alternatives à la revue des plans d''implémentation","revue des plans d''implémentation vs concurrents","installation de la revue des plans d''implémentation","guide de configuration pour la revue des plans d''implémentation"],"de":["KI-Tools für Blockchain","wie man Blockscout-APIs verwendet","was ist die Implementierungsplan-Überprüfung","Alternativen zur Implementierungsplan-Überprüfung","Implementierungsplan-Überprüfung vs Wettbewerber","Installation der Implementierungsplan-Überprüfung","Konfigurationsanleitung für die Implementierungsplan-Überprüfung"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","revisão de plano de implementação","blockscout apis","model context protocol","dados de blockchain","como usar blockscout","o que é model context protocol","alternativas ao blockscout","instalação do blockscout"],"ru":["ии агенты","проверка плана реализации","blockscout apis","model context protocol","данные блокчейна","как использовать blockscout","что такое model context protocol","альтернативы blockscout","установка blockscout"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مراجعة خطة التنفيذ","blockscout apis","بروتوكول سياق النموذج","بيانات البلوكشين","كيفية استخدام blockscout","ما هي بروتوكول سياق النموذج","بديلات blockscout","تثبيت blockscout"]}},"owner":"blockscout","repo":"mcp-server","repoPath":"blockscout/mcp-server","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.747Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implementation-plan-review","description":"Expert review of an implementation plan against a GitHub issue/enhancement description (provided as a local file or a GitHub issue URL) and the current repository codebase. Use when asked to critique a plan for correctness, completeness, codebase alignment, risks, and test/rollout readiness (do not implement).","bodyPreview":"# Implementation Plan Review (Expert)\n\nReview an implementation plan for coverage, correctness, and fit with the current codebase. Do not implement.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Implementation plan: a local file path.\n- Issue/requirements: either (a) a local file path, or (b) a GitHub issue number (run from the target repo so `gh` resolves it).\n\nIf the user provides a GitHub issue number, prefer fetching it into a local file using the bundled script (requires `gh` auth and network access; otherwise ask for a l","body":"# Implementation Plan Review (Expert)\n\nReview an implementation plan for coverage, correctness, and fit with the current codebase. Do not implement.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Implementation plan: a local file path.\n- Issue/requirements: either (a) a local file path, or (b) a GitHub issue number (run from the target repo so `gh` resolves it).\n\nIf the user provides a GitHub issue number, prefer fetching it into a local file using the bundled script (requires `gh` auth and network access; otherwise ask for a local issue description file):\n\n```bash\nbash .codex/skills/implementation-plan-review/scripts/fetch_github_issue.sh <issue-number> --out /tmp/issue.md\n```\n\nIf the script reports that `gh` is not authenticated (exit code `3`), ask the user to run:\n\n```bash\ngh auth login\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) Ensure repo startup constraints are satisfied:\n   - In this repository, run `$codex-session-bootstrap` before doing any other work.\n\n2) Read the two inputs in full:\n   - Plan file\n   - Issue description file (or the fetched `/tmp/issue.md`)\n\n3) Apply strict versioning-comment policy:\n   - Do **not** request or suggest any version bump (package version, `server.json`, etc.) unless the **issue description explicitly requires** a version bump/release/publish/tag.\n   - Even if the plan changes externally-consumed surfaces (tool schemas, REST/OpenAPI, manifests), treat missing version bump steps as **intentional** unless the issue says otherwise.\n\n4) Validate codebase reality (start targeted, expand as needed):\n   - Start by finding referenced modules/configs/env vars/tests with `rg` (fast and low-noise).\n   - Prefer opening the minimal set of files *first* to confirm patterns and naming, but broaden freely if you suspect hidden coupling or cross-cutting behavior (e.g., shared helpers, config loading, response models, pagination, truncation).\n   - If the plan touches MCP tools, REST API, docs, or tests, cross-check relevant `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` guidance.\n   - If it improves confidence, use any other repo investigation strategy (e.g., inspect docs like `SPEC.md`/`API.md`, check tests, use `git blame`, or run unit tests/lint locally).\n\nSuggested commands (adapt as needed):\n\n```bash\nrg -n \"name_in_plan|function_in_plan|ENV_VAR_IN_PLAN\" -S .\nrg -n \"ToolResponse\\\\[|@mcp\\\\.tool\\\\(|log_tool_invocation\" blockscout_mcp_server -S\nrg -n \"ServerConfig\\\\(|BaseSettings\\\\(|BLOCKSCOUT_\" blockscout_mcp_server/config.py -S\nrg -n \"pytest\\\\.mark\\\\.integration|tests/integration|tests/tools\" tests -S\n```\n\n1) Produce the review in the required format (next section).\n\n## Required output format\n\nProduce a review with these sections:\n\n### 1) Understanding\n\n- Issue summary\n- Acceptance criteria (bulleted)\n\n### 2) Plan ↔ Requirements coverage\n\n- What is covered well\n- What is missing / ambiguous\n\n### 3) Codebase alignment\n\n- Key files/modules you inspected (with paths)\n- Assumptions in the plan that match the codebase\n- Assumptions that don’t match (explain and suggest correction)\n\n### 4) Review comments (actionable)\n\nProvide comments as a list. Each comment must include:\n\n- Severity: `Blocker | Major | Minor | Question | Nit`\n- Location: plan section/step + (when relevant) repo file/function/class\n- Problem: what’s wrong / missing\n- Recommendation: concrete change to the plan\n- Rationale: why it matters (bug risk / security / perf / maintainability)\n\n**Testing gaps rule:**\n\n- List every specific missing/incorrect test as an actionable comment in **§4**.\n- In **§6**, provide a consolidated checklist that references those items **without repeating full explanations**.\n\n### 5) Junior-dev readiness check\n\n- Missing prerequisites, commands, step ordering, “how to verify”\n- Where the plan needs more explicit detail\n\n### 6) Test & rollout strategy\n\n- Consolidated test checklist (Unit / Integration / E2E / Negative & security / Performance & regression), referencing §4 test comments\n- Migration/rollback plan if applicable\n- Feature flags / safe rollout suggestions if applicable\n\n## Review focus checklist (use as prompts, not new requirements)\n\n- Coverage: every acceptance criterion mapped to plan steps.\n- Codebase alignment: paths, module structure, naming, existing helpers and patterns.\n- Edge cases & compatibility: pagination, timeouts, empty results, truncation limits, backward compatibility.\n- Security: input validation, SSRF/DNS rebinding boundaries, secrets handling, logging redaction, auth assumptions.\n- Performance/scale: API call counts, caching, pagination strategy, long-running tasks/progress updates.\n- Ops/observability: error handling, logs, metrics/telemetry/analytics implications, rollout/rollback.\n- Versioning: only comment if explicitly required by the issue description; otherwise assume omission is intentional.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:09:58.886Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced implementation plan analysis capabilities for blockchain data via Model Context Protocol","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Model Context Protocol 对区块链数据进行高级实施计划分析的 Code Review Agents。","ja":"Model Context Protocol を介したブロックチェーンデータに対する高度な実装計画分析機能を必要とする Code Review Agents に最適です。","ko":"Model Context Protocol를 통해 블록체인 데이터에 대한 고급 구현 계획 분석 기능이 필요한 Code Review Agents에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades de análisis de planes de implementación avanzados para datos de blockchain a través del Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des capacités d''analyse de plans de mise en œuvre avancées pour les données de blockchain via le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die erweiterte Implementierungsplan-Analysefunktionen für Blockchain-Daten über das Model Context Protocol benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise de planos de implementação para dados de blockchain via Model Context Protocol","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов проверки кода, которым требуются расширенные возможности анализа планов реализации для данных блокчейна через Model Context Protocol","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء مراجعة التعليمات البرمجية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل خطة التنفيذ لبيانات سلسلة الكتل عبر Model Context Protocol"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review implementation plans for coverage, correctness, and fit with the current codebase, leveraging Blockscout APIs and GitHub issue integration for comprehensive analysis","zh":"赋能 Agents 审查实施计划的覆盖范围、正确性以及与当前代码库的契合度，利用 Blockscout API 和 GitHub issue 集成进行全面的分析。","ja":"Blockscout API と GitHub issue 連携を活用して包括的な分析を行い、実装計画のカバレッジ、正確性、および現在のコードベースとの適合性をレビューする能力を Agents に付与します。","ko":"Blockscout API와 GitHub issue 통합을 활용하여 포괄적인 분석을 통해 구현 계획의 커버리지, 정확성 및 현재 코드베이스와의 적합성을 검토할 수 있는 능력을 Agents에 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar planes de implementación para cobertura, corrección y ajuste con la base de código actual, aprovechando las API de Blockscout y la integración de problemas de GitHub para un análisis integral","fr":"Permet aux agents de réviser les plans de mise en œuvre pour la couverture, la correction et l''ajustement avec la base de code actuelle, en exploitant les API Blockscout et l''intégration des problèmes GitHub pour une analyse complète","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Implementierungspläne für Abdeckung, Korrektheit und Passgenauigkeit mit dem aktuellen Codebestand zu überprüfen, indem sie die Blockscout-APIs und die GitHub-Issue-Integration für eine umfassende Analyse nutzen","pt":"Capacita os agentes a revisar planos de implementação quanto à cobertura, correção e adequação à base de código atual, aproveitando as APIs do Blockscout e a integração com problemas do GitHub para uma análise abrangente","ru":"Позволяет агентам проверять планы реализации на предмет покрытия, корректности и соответствия текущей кодовой базе, используя API Blockscout и интеграцию с проблемами GitHub для всестороннего анализа","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من مراجعة خطط التنفيذ للتغطية والصحة والملاءمة مع قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية الحالية، والاستفادة من واجهات برمجة تطبيقات Blockscout ودمج مشكلات GitHub لإجراء تحليل شامل"},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing implementation plans for blockchain projects","Validating codebase integrity against proposed changes","Analyzing GitHub issues for implementation plan requirements"],"zh":["审查区块链项目的实施计划","根据提议的变更验证代码库的完整性","分析 GitHub issues 以获取实施计划要求"],"ja":["ブロックチェーンプロジェクトの実装計画のレビュー","提案された変更に対してコードベースの整合性を検証","実装計画の要件について GitHub issues を分析"],"ko":["블록체인 프로젝트의 구현 계획 검토","제안된 변경 사항에 대해 코드베이스 무결성 검증","구현 계획 요구사항에 대한 GitHub issues 분석"],"es":["Revisar planes de implementación para proyectos de blockchain","Validar la integridad de la base de código contra los cambios propuestos","Analizar problemas de GitHub para los requisitos del plan de implementación"],"fr":["Réviser les plans de mise en œuvre pour les projets de blockchain","Valider l''intégrité de la base de code par rapport aux changements proposés","Analyser les problèmes GitHub pour les exigences du plan de mise en œuvre"],"de":["Überprüfen von Implementierungsplänen für Blockchain-Projekte","Überprüfen der Integrität des Codebestands gegenüber vorgeschlagenen Änderungen","Analysieren von GitHub-Problemen für die Anforderungen des Implementierungsplans"],"pt":["Revisão de planos de implementação para projetos de blockchain","Validação da integridade da base de código em relação a alterações propostas","Análise de problemas do GitHub para requisitos do plano de implementação"],"ru":["Проверка планов реализации для проектов блокчейна","Проверка целостности кодовой базы в отношении предлагаемых изменений","Анализ проблем на GitHub для определения требований плана реализации"],"ar":["مراجعة خطط التنفيذ لمشاريع سلسلة الكتل","التحقق من سلامة قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية مقابل التغييرات المقترحة","تحليل مشكلات GitHub لمتطلبات خطة التنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires local file access or GitHub authentication","Needs network access for GitHub issue fetching","Limited to reviewing plans, does not implement changes"],"zh":["需要本地文件访问权限或 GitHub 身份验证","获取 GitHub issues 需要网络访问权限","仅限于审查计划，不实施更改"],"ja":["ローカルファイルへのアクセスまたは GitHub 認証が必要","GitHub issues の取得にはネットワークアクセスが必要","計画のレビューのみに限定され、変更は実装しない"],"ko":["로컬 파일 액세스 또는 GitHub 인증이 필요함","GitHub issues를 가져오기 위해 네트워크 액세스가 필요함","계획 검토로 제한되며 변경 사항을 구현하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos locales o autenticación de GitHub","Necesita acceso a la red para la recuperación de problemas de GitHub","Limitado a la revisión de planes, no implementa cambios"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers locaux ou une authentification GitHub","Nécessite un accès au réseau pour la récupération des problèmes GitHub","Limité à la révision des plans, n''implémente pas les changements"],"de":["Benötigt lokalen Dateizugriff oder GitHub-Authentifizierung","Benötigt Netzwerkzugriff für das Abrufen von GitHub-Problemen","Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung von Plänen, implementiert keine Änderungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos locais ou autenticação no GitHub","Necessita de acesso à rede para busca de problemas do GitHub","Limitado à revisão de planos, não implementa alterações"],"ru":["Требует доступа к локальным файлам или аутентификации в GitHub","Требует доступ к сети для получения проблем с GitHub","Ограничивается проверкой планов, не реализует изменения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الملفات المحلية أو مصادقة GitHub","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى الشبكة لجلب مشكلات GitHub","مقتصر على مراجعة الخطط، لا ينفذ التغييرات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bcf01d24e8de601d15506b9c13d66142a1d58f53677dc749f18548f93acb6f1e","qualityScore":55}');
