una habilidad de AI que permite la configuración y sincronización de documentos con habilidades y configuraciones comunes","fr":"doc-sync est une compétence d''IA qui permet la configuration et la synchronisation de documents avec des compétences et configurations courantes","de":"doc-sync ist eine KI-Fähigkeit, die die Konfiguration und Synchronisation von Dokumenten mit gemeinsamen Fähigkeiten und Konfigurationen ermöglicht","pt":"O Doc-Sync é uma habilidade de IA que fornece configurações em comum para desenvolvedores","ru":"Doc-Sync - навык ИИ, который предоставляет общие настройки для разработчиков","ar":"Doc-Sync هو مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي توفر إعدادات شائعة للمطورين","en":"Common skills and configurations"},"definition":{"en":"Common skills and configurations"},"features":{"zh":["常见配置","高效开发","AI智能代理","自动同步","简化开发流程"],"ja":["共通の設定","効率的な開発","AIエージェント","自動同期","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["일반적인 구성","효율적인 개발","AI 에이전트","자동 동기화","개발 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Configuración de documentos con habilidades de AI","Sincronización de documentos en tiempo real","Compatibilidad con formatos de documentos comunes","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo populares","Seguridad y autenticación avanzadas","Escalabilidad y flexibilidad para proyectos de todos los tamaños"],"fr":["Configuration de documents avec des compétences d''IA","Synchronisation de documents en temps réel","Compatibilité avec des formats de documents courants","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires","Sécurité et authentification avancées","Evolutivité et flexibilité pour les projets de toutes tailles"],"de":["Konfiguration von Dokumenten mit KI-Fähigkeiten","Synchronisation von Dokumenten in Echtzeit","Kompatibilität mit gängigen Dokumentenformaten","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Erweiterte Sicherheit und Authentifizierung","Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität für Projekte aller Größen"],"pt":["Configurações em comum para desenvolvedores","Integração com React e Python","Suporte a CLI","Documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Общие настройки для разработчиков","Интеграция с React и Python","Поддержка CLI","Дetailed документация"],"ar":["إعدادات شائعة للمطورين","التكامل مع React و Python","دعم CLI","توثيق مفصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","doc-sync技能","如何使用doc-sync","doc-sync安装","AI工具比较","doc-sync教程","AI智能代理开发","doc-sync配置"],"ja":["AIエージェント","doc-syncスキル","doc-syncの使い方","doc-syncのインストール","AIツールの比較","doc-syncチュートリアル","AIエージェントの開発","doc-syncの設定"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","doc-sync 기능","doc-sync 사용법","doc-sync 설치","AI 도구 비교","doc-sync 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 개발","doc-sync 설정"],"es":["cómo usar doc-sync","qué es doc-sync","alternativas a doc-sync","doc-sync vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de doc-sync","guía de configuración de doc-sync","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","desarrollo de proyectos con doc-sync"],"fr":["comment utiliser doc-sync","quoi est doc-sync","alternatives à doc-sync","doc-sync vs autres outils d''IA","installation de doc-sync","guide de configuration de doc-sync","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","développement de projets avec doc-sync"],"de":["wie man doc-sync verwendet","was ist doc-sync","alternativen zu doc-sync","doc-sync vs andere KI-Tools","installation von doc-sync","konfigurationsanleitung für doc-sync","KI-Tools für Entwickler","projektentwicklung mit doc-sync"],"pt":["como usar Doc-Sync","o que é Doc-Sync","Doc-Sync alternativa","Doc-Sync vs outros","instalar Doc-Sync","guia de configuração do Doc-Sync"],"ru":["как использовать Doc-Sync","что такое Doc-Sync","альтернатива Doc-Sync","Doc-Sync vs другие","установить Doc-Sync","руководство по настройке Doc-Sync"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Doc-Sync","ما هو Doc-Sync","بديل Doc-Sync","Doc-Sync مقابل الأخرى","تثبيت Doc-Sync","دليل إعداد Doc-Sync"]}},"owner":"LixvYang","repo":"common-skills","repoPath":"LixvYang/common-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.755Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-sync","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Doc-Sync: Self-Documenting Architecture\n\nThis Skill enforces a strict documentation synchronization pattern where code changes automatically update all related documentation.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**Documentation = Code**: Any functional, architectural, or implementation change MUST update its corresponding documentation immediately after work completes.\n\n## Three-Level Documentation Structure\n\n### Level 1: Root Documentation (README.md)\n\nEvery project root MUST have a `README.md` that states:","body":"# Doc-Sync: Self-Documenting Architecture\n\nThis Skill enforces a strict documentation synchronization pattern where code changes automatically update all related documentation.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**Documentation = Code**: Any functional, architectural, or implementation change MUST update its corresponding documentation immediately after work completes.\n\n## Three-Level Documentation Structure\n\n### Level 1: Root Documentation (README.md)\n\nEvery project root MUST have a `README.md` that states:\n\n```markdown\n# Project Documentation Sync Contract\n\n**CRITICAL**: Any feature, architecture, or implementation update MUST update:\n1. This root README.md (high-level changes)\n2. The relevant folder''s folder.md (structure changes)\n3. All affected files'' header annotations (implementation changes)\n\nAfter completing ANY work, update documentation BEFORE committing.\n```\n\n### Level 2: Folder Documentation (folder.md)\n\n**Every folder** MUST contain a `folder.md` file with:\n\n```markdown\n# Folder Architecture\n\n## Overview (max 3 lines)\n[Brief description of this folder''s purpose and scope]\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Role | Function |\n|------|------|----------|\n| filename.ext | [role: controller/service/model/util] | [what it does] |\n| filename2.ext | [role] | [what it does] |\n\n---\n**SYNC ALERT**: If this folder changes (files added/removed/renamed), UPDATE THIS FILE.\n```\n\n**Example**:\n```markdown\n# src/auth Module\n\n## Overview\nAuthentication and authorization layer handling JWT validation, session management, and role-based access control.\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Role | Function |\n|------|------|----------|\n| index.ts | Controller | HTTP routing, request validation |\n| service.ts | Service | Business logic, token generation |\n| model.ts | Model | TypeBox schemas, DTOs |\n| middleware.ts | Middleware | Request interception, guards |\n\n---\nSYNC ALERT: If this folder changes, UPDATE THIS FILE.\n```\n\n### Level 3: File Header Annotations\n\n**Every source file** MUST start with:\n\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: [external dependencies: imports, env vars, services]\n * OUTPUT: [what this exports/provides: functions, types, values]\n * POSITION: [local role in system architecture: controller/service/model/util]\n *\n * SYNC: If this file changes, UPDATE this header AND the parent folder.md\n */\n```\n\n**Examples**:\n\n**Controller** (`index.ts`):\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: Request (Express/Elysia), body validation schemas\n * OUTPUT: HTTP responses, status codes, error handlers\n * POSITION: Entry point - handles HTTP layer only\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nimport { service } from ''./service''\n\nexport const handler = (req: Request) => service.process(req)\n```\n\n**Service** (`service.ts`):\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: Validated request data, database client, external APIs\n * OUTPUT: Business logic results, domain entities\n * POSITION: Core logic - decoupled from HTTP, pure business rules\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nexport const process = (data: Data) => { /* ... */ }\n```\n\n**Model** (`model.ts`):\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: TypeBox/T, Zod, or validation library\n * OUTPUT: Validation schemas, TypeScript types, DTOs\n * POSITION: Data contract - defines interface between layers\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nimport { t } from ''elysia''\n\nexport const UserSchema = t.Object({ /* ... */ })\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nWhen creating or modifying code:\n\n1. **Before coding**: Read existing folder.md to understand context\n2. **During coding**: Focus on implementation\n3. **After coding (MANDATORY)**:\n   - Update file header (INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION)\n   - Update folder.md if structure changed\n   - Update README.md if architecture changed\n   - Commit ONLY after all docs updated\n\n## Commands\n\n### Create new file with template:\n```bash\n# Creates file with doc-sync header\ncat > src/newFile.ts << ''EOF''\n/**\n * INPUT: [TODO]\n * OUTPUT: [TODO]\n * POSITION: [TODO]\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nEOF\n```\n\n### Check documentation coverage:\n```bash\n# Find folders missing folder.md\nfind . -type d -not -path \"*/node_modules/*\" -not -path \"*/.git/*\" | while read dir; do\n  if [ ! -f \"$dir/folder.md\" ]; then\n    echo \"Missing: $dir/folder.md\"\n  fi\ndone\n\n# Find files missing header annotations\ngrep -rL \"INPUT:\" src/ || echo \"All files have headers\"\n```\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nBefore committing, verify:\n\n- [ ] Root README.md updated (for architectural changes)\n- [ ] Every affected folder has folder.md\n- [ ] Every folder.md lists all files with roles\n- [ ] Every file has INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION header\n- [ ] SYNC reminders present in all folder.md and file headers\n- [ ] No \"TODO\" in INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION fields\n\n## Examples\n\nSee [examples/](examples/) for complete project structures:\n- `basic-auth/` - Simple auth module with full doc-sync\n- `ecommerce/` - Multi-module project\n- `api-service/` - Layered architecture\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Update immediately**: Don''t batch doc updates\n- **Be specific**: INPUT should list actual imports, not \"various\"\n- **Keep POSITION brief**: One line describing architectural role\n- **Folder overview max 3 lines**: Keep it scannable\n- **Use tables**: folder.md files section MUST use markdown table\n- **No exceptions**: Even test files need headers\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n❌ **Don''t**:\n- Leave \"TODO\" in headers\n- Update docs in separate PR\n- Skip folder.md for \"simple\" folders\n- Copy-paste headers without updating INPUT/OUTPUT\n- Write POSITION as \"utility file\" (be specific: \"validation utility for user input\")\n\n✅ **Do**:\n- Update docs as part of the same commit\n- Run validation checklist before push\n- Treat docs as code, not comments\n- Review folder.md changes in code review\n\n## Advanced: Nested Folder Sync\n\nFor deep hierarchies, each level updates its parent:\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── folder.md (mentions modules/ as subdirectory)\n└── modules/\n    ├── folder.md (lists auth/, user/ subdirs)\n    └── auth/\n        ├── folder.md (lists index.ts, service.ts, model.ts)\n        └── index.ts (has INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION)\n```\n\nWhen `auth/index.ts` changes:\n1. Update its header\n2. Update `auth/folder.md`\n3. Update `modules/folder.md`\n4. Update `src/folder.md` (if role changed)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:13:30.110Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing automated documentation updates and synchronization.","zh":"非常适合需要自动文档更新和同步的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード分析エージェントが自動的なドキュメントの更新と同期を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동 문서 업데이트 및 동기화를 필요로 하는 코드 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Código que necesitan actualizaciones automatizadas de documentación y sincronización.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code nécessitant des mises à jour de documentation automatisées et une synchronisation.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die automatisierte Dokumentationsaktualisierungen und -synchronisation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que precisam de atualizações de documentação automatizadas e sincronização.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым необходимы автоматические обновления документации и синхронизация.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل الشفرة الذين بحاجة إلى تحديثات توثيقية آلية وتزامن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain accurate and up-to-date documentation using a three-level structure, including root documentation in README.md files, ensuring that documentation equals code through immediate updates after functional, architectural, or implementation changes.","zh":"使代理能够通过三层结构维护准确和最新的文档，包括根文档在README.md文件中，确保文档与代码通过功能、架构或实现更改后立即更新保持一致。","ja":"エージェントがREADME.mdファイル内のルートドキュメントを含む3層構造を使用して、正確で最新のドキュメントを維持できるようにし、機能的、建築的、または実装の変更後にドキュメントがコードと同期するようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 README.md 파일内の 루트 문서를 포함한 3단계 구조를 사용하여 정확하고 최신의 문서를 유지할 수 있도록 하여, 기능적, 구조적, 또는 구현 변경 후 문서가 코드와 즉시 업데이트되도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener una documentación precisa y actualizada utilizando una estructura de tres niveles, que incluye la documentación raíz en archivos README.md, asegurando que la documentación sea igual al código a través de actualizaciones inmediatas después de cambios funcionales, arquitectónicos o de implementación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir une documentation précise et à jour en utilisant une structure à trois niveaux, y compris la documentation racine dans les fichiers README.md, en s''assurant que la documentation est égale au code grâce à des mises à jour immédiates après des changements fonctionnels, architecturaux ou d''implémentation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, eine präzise und aktuelle Dokumentation mithilfe einer dreistufigen Struktur zu pflegen, die die Root-Dokumentation in README.md-Dateien umfasst, und stellt sicher, dass die Dokumentation dem Code entspricht durch unmittelbare Updates nach funktionalen, architektonischen oder Implementierungsänderungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes mantenham documentação precisa e atualizada usando uma estrutura de três níveis, incluindo documentação raiz em arquivos README.md, garantindo que a documentação seja igual ao código por meio de atualizações imediatas após alterações funcionais, arquiteturais ou de implementação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам поддерживать точную и актуальную документацию, используя трехуровневую структуру, включая корневую документацию в файлах README.md, гарантируя, что документация равна коду посредством немедленных обновлений после функциональных, архитектурных или изменений реализации.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء الحفاظ على توثيق دقيق ومحدث باستخدام هيكل من ثلاثة مستويات، بما في ذلك توثيق الجذر في ملفات README.md، مما يضمن أن يكون التوثيق مساوياً للشفرة من خلال التحديثات الفورية بعد التغييرات الوظيفية أو الهيكلية أو التطبيقية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation updates after code changes","Generating consistent README.md files across projects","Synchronizing documentation with implementation details"],"zh":["代码更改后自动更新文档","在项目中生成一致的README.md文件","将文档与实现细节同步"],"ja":["コードの変更後にドキュメントを自動的に更新する","プロジェクト全体で一貫したREADME.mdファイルを生成する","ドキュメントを実装の詳細と同期する"],"ko":["코드 변경 후 문서를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","프로젝트 전반에서 일관된 README.md 파일을 생성하는 것","문서를 구현 세부 사항과 동기화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de documentación después de los cambios de código","Generar archivos README.md coherentes en todos los proyectos","Sincronizar la documentación con los detalles de implementación"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de documentation après des changements de code","Générer des fichiers README.md cohérents à travers les projets","Synchroniser la documentation avec les détails d''implémentation"],"de":["Automatisieren von Dokumentationsaktualisierungen nach Codeänderungen","Erzeugen konsistenter README.md-Dateien über alle Projekte hinweg","Synchronisieren der Dokumentation mit den Implementierungsdetails"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação após alterações de código","Gerar arquivos README.md consistentes em projetos","Sincronizar documentação com detalhes de implementação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации после изменений кода","Генерировать последовательные файлы README.md в проектах","Синхронизировать документацию с деталями реализации"],"ar":["تحديث التوثيق آلياً بعد تغييرات الشفرة","توليد ملفات README.md المتسقة عبر المشاريع","مزامنة التوثيق مع تفاصيل التنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to documentation synchronization pattern","Implies additional overhead for immediate documentation updates after work completion"],"zh":["需要严格遵守文档同步模式","意味着在完成工作后立即更新文档时需要额外的开销"],"ja":["ドキュメントの同期パターンに厳格に従う必要がある","作業完了後にドキュメントをすぐに更新する場合に追加のオーバーヘッドが必要であることを意味する"],"ko":["문서 동기화 패턴을 엄격히遵守해야 하는 것","작업을 완료한 후 문서를 즉시 업데이트하는 경우에 추가적인 오버헤드가 필요함을 의미하는 것"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adhesión al patrón de sincronización de documentación","Implica un sobrecoste adicional para las actualizaciones inmediatas de documentación después de la finalización del trabajo"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte au modèle de synchronisation de documentation","Implique un surcoût supplémentaire pour les mises à jour immédiates de documentation après l''achèvement des travaux"],"de":["Erfordert eine strikte Einhaltung des Dokumentationssynchronisationsmusters","Impliziert einen zusätzlichen Overhead für unmittelbare Dokumentationsaktualisierungen nach Arbeitsabschluss"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita ao padrão de sincronização de documentação","Implica sobrecarga adicional para atualizações de documentação imediatas após conclusão do trabalho"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения шаблона синхронизации документации","Имплицирует дополнительную нагрузку для немедленных обновлений документации после завершения работы"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع صارم لنمط مزامنة التوثيق","ي подразумевает عبء إضافي لتحدّث التوثيق على الفور بعد الانتهاء من العمل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7ca62ea69f6ae30fb5084fed5f90f8d0eba162406d5d4aec0f2cd074269bd5f1","qualityScore":55}');
