 información","fr":"Les compétences de mémoire pour cowork permettent aux outils d''IA de stocker et de récupérer des informations","de":"Die Speicherfunktionen für Cowork ermöglichen es KI-Agenten, Informationen zu speichern und wiederzugeben","pt":"As habilidades de memória são fundamentais para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a utilizar ferramentas de IA para melhorar a produtividade","ru":"Навыки памяти являются основными для разработчиков. Узнайте, как использовать ИИ Агенты для повышения производительности","ar":"مهارات الذاكرة أساسية للبرمجيين. تعلم كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين الإنتاجية","en":"Skills for Cowork "},"definition":{"en":"Skills for Cowork "},"features":{"zh":["基于React的前端开发","支持Python和Node.js后端开发","提供CLI工具进行快速开发","集成AI算法进行数据分析","支持多语言开发","提供详细的开发文档"],"ja":["Reactを使用したフロントエンド開発","PythonおよびNode.jsのバックエンド開発をサポート","CLIツールを使用した迅速な開発","AIアルゴリズムを使用したデータ分析","マルチ言語開発をサポート","詳細な開発ドキュメントを提供"],"ko":["React를 사용한 프론트엔드 개발","Python 및 Node.js의 백엔드 개발을 지원","CLI 툴을 사용한 빠른 개발","AI 알고리즘을 사용한 데이터 분석","멀티 언어 개발을 지원","詳細한 개발 문서를 제공"],"es":["Almacenamiento de datos en Agentes de IA","Recuperación de información en tiempo real","Integración con herramientas de productividad","Seguridad de datos avanzada","Escalabilidad para grandes volúmenes de datos"],"fr":["Stockage de données dans les outils d''IA","Récupération d''informations en temps réel","Intégration avec des outils de productivité","Sécurité des données avancée","Évolutivité pour de grands volumes de données"],"de":["Daten-speicherung in KI-Agenten","Daten-wiederherstellung in Echtzeit","Integration mit Produktivitäts-tools","Erweiterte Datensicherheit","Skalierbarkeit für große Datenmengen"],"pt":["Melhoria da produtividade","Ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","Técnicas de memória para programação","Integração com React e Node.js","Suporte a CLI"],"ru":["Повышение производительности","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","Техники памяти для программирования","Интеграция с React и Node.js","Поддержка CLI"],"ar":["تحسين الإنتاجية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للبرمجيين","تقنيات الذاكرة للبرمجة","التكامل مع React و Node.js","دعم CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Memory Skills","什么是Memory Skills","Memory Skills替代品","Memory Skills vs竞争对手","Memory Skills安装","Memory Skills设置指南","AI智能工具开发","协作效率提升"],"ja":["メモリースキルの使い方","メモリースキルとは","メモリースキルの代替品","メモリースキル vs 競合他社","メモリースキルのインストール","メモリースキルの設定ガイド","AIエージェント開発","協作性の向上"],"ko":["메모리 스킬 사용 방법","메모리 스킬이란","메모리 스킬 대체品","메모리 스킬 vs 경쟁사","메모리 스킬 설치","메모리 스킬 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발","협업 효율성 향상"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es la inteligencia artificial","herramientas de memoria para cowork","Agentes de IA alternativos","cómo instalar Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''IA","quoi est l''intelligence artificielle","outils de mémoire pour cowork","outils d''IA alternatifs","comment installer les outils d''IA","guide de configuration des outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten verwendet","was ist künstliche Intelligenz","Speicherfunktionen für Cowork","KI-Agenten-Alternativen","wie man KI-Agenten installiert","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Agenten"],"pt":["ferramentas de memória","como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é habilidade de memória","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","melhorias de produtividade","alternativas para React","guia de instalação de ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["инструменты памяти","как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое навык памяти","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","повышение производительности","альтернативы для React","руководство по установке ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["أدوات الذاكرة","كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي مهارة الذاكرة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للبرمجيين","تحسين الإنتاجية","بديل لرياكت","دليل تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ZhangHanDong","repo":"cowork-skills","repoPath":"ZhangHanDong/cowork-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.762Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"memory-skills","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Memory Skills (CoALA-based)\n\n> **Memory = Filesystem** - Cognitive architecture for language agents\n\nBased on the [CoALA framework](https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.02427) (Cognitive Architectures for Language Agents), this skill implements a complete memory system with four memory types.\n\n## Memory Architecture\n\n```\n                    ┌─────────────────┐\n                    │  Working Memory │  ← Short-term, central hub\n                    └────────┬────────┘\n                             │","body":"# Memory Skills (CoALA-based)\n\n> **Memory = Filesystem** - Cognitive architecture for language agents\n\nBased on the [CoALA framework](https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.02427) (Cognitive Architectures for Language Agents), this skill implements a complete memory system with four memory types.\n\n## Memory Architecture\n\n```\n                    ┌─────────────────┐\n                    │  Working Memory │  ← Short-term, central hub\n                    └────────┬────────┘\n                             │\n        ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐\n        ↓                    ↓                    ↓\n┌───────────────┐   ┌───────────────┐   ┌───────────────┐\n│   Episodic    │   │   Semantic    │   │  Procedural   │\n│   情景记忆     │   │   语义记忆     │   │   程序性记忆   │\n└───────────────┘   └───────────────┘   └───────────────┘\n        ↑                                        ↑\n    Long-term ─────────────────────────────── Long-term\n```\n\n## Memory Types (CoALA)\n\n| Type | Purpose | Example |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| **Working** | Current session context | Active goals, intermediate reasoning |\n| **Episodic** | Past experiences | Mistakes, solutions, conversation history |\n| **Semantic** | World knowledge | Facts, learnings, reflections |\n| **Procedural** | How to do things | Preferences, workflows, prompt templates |\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n### Global Memory (`~/.claude/memory/`)\n\nCross-project shared knowledge:\n\n```\n~/.claude/memory/\n├── working/                    # Working Memory (可持久化的会话上下文)\n│   └── {name}-context.md       # 保存的会话状态 (通过 /save-context)\n│\n├── procedural/                 # Procedural Memory\n│   ├── preferences.md          # User preferences\n│   ├── workflows.md            # Common workflows\n│   └── prompts/                # Reusable prompt templates\n│       └── {name}.md\n│\n├── semantic/                   # Semantic Memory\n│   ├── learnings/              # Knowledge by topic\n│   │   ├── rust-tips.md\n│   │   ├── git-tips.md\n│   │   └── {topic}.md\n│   └── reflections/            # Insights from reflection\n│       └── {date}-{insight}.md\n│\n├── episodic/                   # Episodic Memory\n│   ├── mistakes/               # Errors and how they were fixed\n│   │   └── {date}-{error}.md\n│   ├── solutions/              # Successfully solved problems\n│   │   └── {date}-{problem}.md\n│   └── trajectories/           # Complete task execution logs\n│       └── {date}-{task}.md\n│\n└── index.json                  # Search index (auto-generated)\n```\n\n### Project Memory (`.claude/memory/`)\n\nProject-specific knowledge:\n\n```\n{project}/.claude/memory/\n├── semantic/\n│   ├── architecture.md         # Project architecture\n│   ├── conventions.md          # Coding conventions\n│   └── decisions.md            # Technical decisions (ADRs)\n│\n├── episodic/\n│   └── sessions/               # Session summaries\n│       └── {date}-{topic}.md\n│\n└── index.json                  # Project search index\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command | Action | Memory Type |\n|---------|--------|-------------|\n| `/remember <content>` | Save to appropriate memory | Auto-detect |\n| `/recall <topic>` | Search and retrieve | All types |\n| `/forget <topic>` | Delete specific memory | All types |\n| `/reflect` | Generate insights from episodic → semantic | Episodic → Semantic |\n| `/summarize-session` | Save current session summary | Episodic |\n| `/save-context` | Save key context for later resume | Working → File |\n| `/load-context` | Load saved context into session | File → Working |\n\n### Working Memory Commands\n\n**`/save-context [name]`** - 保存当前会话的关键上下文\n\n触发词: \"保存上下文\", \"save context\", \"保存当前状态\"\n\n```markdown\n# 保存到: ~/.claude/memory/working/{name}-context.md 或 .claude/memory/working/\n\n## Session Context: {name}\n**Saved**: {timestamp}\n\n### Current Goals\n- {what we''re trying to accomplish}\n\n### Key Decisions Made\n- {important decisions in this session}\n\n### Important Context\n- {critical information to remember}\n\n### Next Steps\n- {what to do when resuming}\n```\n\n**`/load-context [name]`** - 加载之前保存的上下文\n\n触发词: \"加载上下文\", \"load context\", \"恢复上下文\", \"继续之前的工作\"\n\n1. Search for context files in working/ directory\n2. Display available contexts if name not specified\n3. Load and summarize the selected context\n4. Confirm: \"已加载上下文: {name}\"\n\n## Instructions for Claude\n\n### Action Space (CoALA)\n\nYou have four memory actions:\n\n1. **Retrieval** (读取): Load from long-term → working memory\n2. **Reasoning** (推理): Process in working memory\n3. **Learning** (写入): Save from working → long-term memory\n4. **Forgetting** (遗忘): Remove from long-term memory\n\n### When User Says \"Remember\" / \"记住\"\n\n1. **Detect memory type**:\n   ```\n   Content about...        → Memory Type      → Location\n   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n   User preference         → Procedural       → procedural/preferences.md\n   Workflow/process        → Procedural       → procedural/workflows.md\n   Fact/knowledge          → Semantic         → semantic/learnings/{topic}.md\n   Project architecture    → Semantic         → .claude/memory/semantic/architecture.md\n   Error encountered       → Episodic         → episodic/mistakes/{date}-{error}.md\n   Problem solved          → Episodic         → episodic/solutions/{date}-{problem}.md\n   ```\n\n2. **Format content**:\n   ```markdown\n   ## {YYYY-MM-DD} - {brief title}\n\n   {content}\n\n   **Context**: {why this is important}\n   **Tags**: {relevant keywords}\n\n   ---\n   ```\n\n3. **Update index** (if index.json exists):\n   ```json\n   {\n     \"entries\": [\n       {\n         \"file\": \"semantic/learnings/rust-tips.md\",\n         \"keywords\": [\"rust\", \"ownership\", \"borrow\"],\n         \"updated\": \"2026-01-25\"\n       }\n     ]\n   }\n   ```\n\n4. **Confirm**: Tell user what was saved, where, and memory type\n\n### When User Says \"Recall\" / \"回忆\"\n\n1. **Search priority**:\n   - First: Project memory `.claude/memory/`\n   - Then: Global memory `~/.claude/memory/`\n   - Check: `index.json` for keyword matches\n   - Fallback: Scan file names and content\n\n2. **Return results with metadata**:\n   ```\n   Found 2 relevant memories:\n\n   📁 [Semantic] ~/.claude/memory/semantic/learnings/rust-tips.md\n      → \"Use Arc<Mutex<T>> for shared mutable state...\"\n\n   📁 [Episodic] .claude/memory/episodic/solutions/2026-01-20-async-bug.md\n      → \"Fixed by adding .await after spawn...\"\n   ```\n\n3. **If nothing found**:\n   ```\n   没有找到关于 \"{topic}\" 的记忆。\n   → 使用 /remember 来保存新知识\n   ```\n\n### When User Says \"Forget\" / \"忘记\"\n\n1. **Confirm before deletion**:\n   ```\n   找到以下相关记忆:\n   - ~/.claude/memory/semantic/learnings/old-api.md\n\n   确认删除吗? (y/n)\n   ```\n\n2. **Delete and update index**\n\n3. **Confirm**: \"已删除关于 {topic} 的记忆\"\n\n### When User Says \"Reflect\" / \"反思\"\n\nReflection converts episodic memories into semantic knowledge:\n\n1. **Scan recent episodic memories** (last 7 days)\n\n2. **Identify patterns**:\n   - Repeated mistakes → Learning opportunity\n   - Multiple solutions → Best practice\n   - Common trajectories → Workflow template\n\n3. **Generate reflection**:\n   ```markdown\n   ## 2026-01-25 - Reflection: Async Error Handling\n\n   **Pattern observed**: In 3 recent sessions, async errors were caused by missing .await\n\n   **Insight**: Always check for missing .await when debugging async code\n\n   **Source episodes**:\n   - episodic/mistakes/2026-01-20-async-bug.md\n   - episodic/mistakes/2026-01-22-tokio-error.md\n   - episodic/solutions/2026-01-23-fixed-spawn.md\n\n   ---\n   ```\n\n4. **Save to**: `semantic/reflections/{date}-{insight}.md`\n\n### When User Says \"Summarize Session\" / \"总结会话\"\n\n1. **Gather session context**:\n   - What was accomplished\n   - Key decisions made\n   - Problems encountered and solutions\n   - New learnings\n\n2. **Generate summary**:\n   ```markdown\n   ## 2026-01-25 - Session: Implementing Memory System\n\n   **Goals**: Improve memory-filesystem skill based on CoALA\n\n   **Accomplished**:\n   - Added working memory support\n   - Implemented forgetting mechanism\n   - Added reflection capability\n\n   **Key Decisions**:\n   - Used JSON for search index\n   - Separated global vs project memory\n\n   **Learnings**:\n   - CoALA has 4 memory types, not 3\n\n   ---\n   ```\n\n3. **Save to**:\n   - Project: `.claude/memory/episodic/sessions/{date}-{topic}.md`\n   - Or global: `~/.claude/memory/episodic/trajectories/{date}-{task}.md`\n\n### Auto-Learning (Proactive)\n\nWhen you discover valuable information during a session:\n\n1. **Detect learning opportunity**:\n   - Error fixed → Potential mistake memory\n   - New technique used → Potential learning\n   - Repeated action → Potential workflow\n\n2. **Ask user**: \"发现了一个有用的技巧，要我记住吗？\"\n\n3. **If confirmed**: Save to appropriate memory location\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Trigger | Memory Type | Location |\n|---------|-------------|----------|\n| \"保存上下文\" / \"save context\" | Working | `working/{name}-context.md` |\n| \"加载上下文\" / \"load context\" | Working | Read from `working/` |\n| \"记住这个偏好\" | Procedural | `procedural/preferences.md` |\n| \"记住这个流程\" | Procedural | `procedural/workflows.md` |\n| \"记住这个技巧\" | Semantic | `semantic/learnings/{topic}.md` |\n| \"记住项目架构\" | Semantic | `.claude/memory/semantic/architecture.md` |\n| \"记住这个错误\" | Episodic | `episodic/mistakes/{date}-{error}.md` |\n| \"记住这个解决方案\" | Episodic | `episodic/solutions/{date}-{problem}.md` |\n| \"回忆/你知道...\" | Retrieval | Search all locations |\n| \"忘记...\" | Forgetting | Delete from memory |\n| \"反思\" | Reflection | Episodic → Semantic |\n| \"总结会话\" | Learning | Save session to episodic |\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n### Example 1: Remember\n```\nUser: \"记住：Rust 中使用 thiserror 来定义错误类型\"\n\nClaude:\n1. Detect: Knowledge/fact → Semantic memory\n2. Location: ~/.claude/memory/semantic/learnings/rust-tips.md\n3. Append with date, tags\n4. Update index.json\n5. Response: \"✓ 已保存到语义记忆 (rust-tips.md)\"\n```\n\n### Example 2: Reflect\n```\nUser: \"/reflect\"\n\nClaude:\n1. Scan episodic/mistakes/ and episodic/solutions/ (last 7 days)\n2. Found pattern: 3 instances of borrow checker errors\n3. Generate insight: \"Common cause: trying to move value after borrow\"\n4. Save to: semantic/reflections/2026-01-25-borrow-patterns.md\n5. Response: \"✓ 生成了 1 条反思，已保存到语义记忆\"\n```\n\n### Example 3: Forget\n```\nUser: \"忘记关于旧 API 的记忆\"\n\nClaude:\n1. Search: Found semantic/learnings/old-api-v1.md\n2. Confirm: \"找到 1 条相关记忆，确认删除?\"\n3. User confirms\n4. Delete file, update index\n5. Response: \"✓ 已删除关于旧 API 的记忆\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:15:51.422Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cognitive Language Agents requiring advanced memory management, such as those built with CoALA framework, to enhance their information retention and recall capabilities.","zh":"适合于需要高级内存管理的认知语言代理，例如使用 CoALA 框架构建的代理，以增强其信息保留和回忆能力。","ja":"CoALA フレームワークを使用して構築されたような、高度なメモリ管理を必要とする認知言語エージェントに適しています。これにより、エージェントの情報保持と呼び出しの能力が向上します。","ko":"고급 메모리 관리가 필요한 인지 언어 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어, CoALA 프레임워크를 사용하여 구축된 에이전트의 정보 보존 및 회상 능력을 향상시킬 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje Cognitivo que requieren una gestión de memoria avanzada, como aquellos construidos con el framework CoALA, para mejorar sus capacidades de retención y recuperación de información.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Langage Cognitif nécessitant une gestion de mémoire avancée, tels que ceux construits avec le framework CoALA, pour améliorer leurs capacités de rétention et de rappel d''informations.","de":"Ideal für kognitive Sprachagenten, die eine erweiterte Speicherverwaltung erfordern, wie z.B. solche, die mit dem CoALA-Framework erstellt wurden, um ihre InformationsSpeicher- und Abrufkapazitäten zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para Cognitive Language Agents que requerem gerenciamento avançado de memória, como aqueles construídos com o framework CoALA, para aprimorar suas capacidades de retenção e recuperação de informações.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Cognitive Language Agents, требующих расширенного управления памятью, таких как те, что построены на фреймворке CoALA, для улучшения их возможностей по сохранению и воспроизведению информации.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء اللغة المعرفية التي تتطلب إدارة ذاكرة متقدمة، مثل تلك المبنية باستخدام إطار عمل CoALA، لتعزيز قدراتها على الاحتفاظ بالمعلومات واسترجاعها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents with a comprehensive memory system, utilizing four distinct memory types, and a cognitive architecture that treats memory as a filesystem, enabling efficient information storage and retrieval through protocols like the CoALA framework.","zh":"赋予代理以全面的内存系统，利用四种不同的内存类型，并且认知架构将内存视为文件系统，使得能够通过类似 CoALA 框架的协议高效地存储和检索信息。","ja":"エージェントに包括的なメモリシステムを提供し、4 つの異なるメモリタイプを利用し、メモリをファイルシステムとして扱う認知アーキテクチャを提供します。これにより、CoALA フレームワークなどのプロトコルを介して情報を効率的に保存および回復できます。","ko":"에이전트에 포괄적인 메모리 시스템을 제공하며, 4 가지의 다른 메모리 유형을 활용하며, 메모리를 파일 시스템으로 처리하는 인지 아키텍처를 제공하여 CoALA 프레임워크와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 효율적으로 정보를 저장하고 검색할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes con un sistema de memoria integral, que utiliza cuatro tipos de memoria distintos y una arquitectura cognitiva que trata la memoria como un sistema de archivos, lo que permite un almacenamiento y recuperación eficientes de información a través de protocolos como el framework CoALA.","fr":"Équipe les agents d''un système de mémoire complet, utilisant quatre types de mémoire distincts et une architecture cognitive qui traite la mémoire comme un système de fichiers, permettant un stockage et une récupération efficaces d''informations via des protocoles comme le framework CoALA.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten mit einem umfassenden Speichersystem, das vier verschiedene Speichertypen nutzt und eine kognitive Architektur, die den Speicher als Dateisystem behandelt, wodurch ein effizientes Speichern und Abrufen von Informationen über Protokolle wie das CoALA-Framework ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Capacita os agentes com um sistema de memória abrangente, utilizando quatro tipos distintos de memória e uma arquitetura cognitiva que trata a memória como um sistema de arquivos, permitindo armazenamento e recuperação eficientes de informações por meio de protocolos como o framework CoALA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов комплексной системой памяти, использующей четыре различных типа памяти и когнитивную архитектуру, которая рассматривает память как файловую систему, обеспечивая эффективное хранение и извлечение информации с помощью таких протоколов, как фреймворк CoALA.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء بنظام ذاكرة شامل، يستخدم أربعة أنواع مميزة من الذاكرة، وهيكل معرفي يعامل الذاكرة كنظام ملفات، مما يتيح التخزين والاسترجاع الفعال للمعلومات من خلال بروتوكولات مثل إطار عمل CoALA."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing short-term working memory for temporary data storage","Developing long-term memory for persistent knowledge retention","Integrating episodic memory for event-based learning and recall"],"zh":["为临时数据存储实现短期工作内存","开发长期内存以实现持久知识保留","集成基于事件的学习和回忆的史诗记忆"],"ja":["一時的なデータストレージのための短期作業メモリを実装する","永続的な知識の保持のための長期メモリを開発する","イベントベースの学習とリコールのためのエピソードメモリを統合する"],"ko":["임시 데이터 저장을 위한 단기 작업 메모리 구현","지속적인 지식 보존을 위한 장기 메모리 개발","이벤트 기반 학습 및 회상 위한 에피소드 메모리 통합"],"es":["Implementar una memoria de trabajo a corto plazo para el almacenamiento temporal de datos","Desarrollar una memoria a largo plazo para la retención persistente del conocimiento","Integrar la memoria episódica para el aprendizaje y el recuerdo basado en eventos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une mémoire de travail à court terme pour le stockage temporaire de données","Développer une mémoire à long terme pour la rétention persistante des connaissances","Intégrer la mémoire épisodique pour l''apprentissage et la mémorisation basés sur les événements"],"de":["Implementierung eines kurzen Arbeitsgedächtnisses für das temporäre Speichern von Daten","Entwicklung eines langfristigen Gedächtnisses für die persistente Wissensspeicherung","Integration des episodischen Gedächtnisses für das ereignisbasierte Lernen und Abrufen"],"pt":["Implementação de memória de trabalho de curto prazo para armazenamento temporário de dados","Desenvolvimento de memória de longo prazo para retenção persistente de conhecimento","Integração de memória episódica para aprendizado e recall baseados em eventos"],"ru":["Реализация кратковременной рабочей памяти для временного хранения данных","Разработка долговременной памяти для постоянного сохранения знаний","Интеграция эпизодической памяти для обучения на основе событий и их воспроизведения"],"ar":["تنفيذ ذاكرة عمل قصيرة المدى للتخزين المؤقت للبيانات","تطوير ذاكرة طويلة المدى للاحتفاظ الدائم بالمعرفة","دمج الذاكرة العرضية للتعلم القائم على الأحداث واسترجاعها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation of the CoALA framework","Dependent on the agent''s ability to interface with a filesystem-like memory structure"],"zh":["需要实现 CoALA 框架","依赖于代理与文件系统类内存结构的接口能力"],"ja":["CoALA フレームワークの実装が必要","エージェントがファイルシステムのようなメモリ構造とインターフェイスできる能力に依存する"],"ko":["CoALA 프레임워크의 구현이 필요","에이전트가 파일 시스템과 같은 메모리 구조와 인터페이스할 수 있는 능력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la implementación del framework CoALA","Dependiente de la capacidad del agente para interactuar con una estructura de memoria similar a un sistema de archivos"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise en œuvre du framework CoALA","Dépend de la capacité de l''agent à interagir avec une structure de mémoire similaire à un système de fichiers"],"de":["Erfordert die Implementierung des CoALA-Frameworks","Hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agenten ab, mit einer dateisystemähnlichen Speicherstruktur zu interagieren"],"pt":["Requer a implementação do framework CoALA","Dependente da capacidade do agente de interfacear com uma estrutura de memória semelhante a um sistema de arquivos"],"ru":["Требует реализации фреймворка CoALA","Зависит от способности агента взаимодействовать с файловой системой, подобной структуре памяти"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ إطار عمل CoALA","يعتمد على قدرة الوكيل على الواجهة مع هيكل ذاكرة يشبه نظام الملفات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fb8c79b10d6453bd8cf32a62fcce1418a0cd4ed15d8fa63785a6f02cfb03ba31","qualityScore":55}');
