plificada","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo de juegos","Optimización de rendimiento y escalabilidad","Seguridad y autenticación avanzadas"],"fr":["Génération d''actifs 3D propulsée par l''IA","Configuration de la passerelle API simplifiée","Intégration avec les outils de développement de jeux","Optimisation des performances et de la scalabilité","Sécurité et authentification avancées"],"de":["3D-Asset-Generierung angetrieben von KI","Vereinfachte API-Gateway-Konfiguration","Integration mit Spielentwicklungstools","Leistungs- und Skalierbarkeitsoptimierung","Erweiterte Sicherheit und Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Geração de ativos 3D por IA","Configurador de gateway de API para desenvolvimento de jogos","Melhoria da produtividade do time de desenvolvimento","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento de jogos","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo 3D"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-активов ИИ","Конфигуратор API-шлюза для разработки игр","Повышение производительности команды разработчиков","Интеграция с инструментами разработки игр","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов 3D"],"ar":["إنشاء موارد ثلاثية الأبعاد بالذكاء الاصطناعي","مكوّن بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لتطوير الألعاب","تحسين إنتاجية فريق التطوير","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير الألعاب","دعم عدة صيغ ملفات ثلاثية الأبعاد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI配置API网关","API网关配置工具","AI智能API网关设置","游戏开发API网关","API网关设置教程","API网关安全性","API网关性能优化"],"ja":["AIエージェントを使用してAPIゲートウェイを設定する方法","APIゲートウェイ設定ツール","AIエージェントによるAPIゲートウェイ設定","ゲーム開発APIゲートウェイ","APIゲートウェイ設定ガイド","APIゲートウェイのセキュリティ","APIゲートウェイのパフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["AI 에이전트를 사용하여 API 게이트웨이를 설정하는 방법","API 게이트웨이 설정 도구","AI 에이전트를 사용한 API 게이트웨이 설정","게임 개발 API 게이트웨이","API 게이트웨이 설정 가이드","API 게이트웨이 보안","API 게이트웨이 성능 최적화"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de AI","qué es un configurador de API Gateway","alternativas a API Gateway","API Gateway vs NGINX","instalación de API Gateway","guía de configuración de API Gateway"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un configureur de passerelle API","alternatives à la passerelle API","passerelle API vs NGINX","installation de la passerelle API","guide de configuration de la passerelle API"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein API-Gateway-Konfigurator","Alternativen zu API-Gateway","API-Gateway vs NGINX","Installation von API-Gateway","Konfigurationsanleitung für API-Gateway"],"pt":["configurador de gateway de api","desenvolvimento de jogos","inteligência artificial","geração de ativos 3d","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de jogos","como usar configurador de gateway de api","alternativas ao configurador de gateway de api","configurador de gateway de api vs outros"],"ru":["конфигуратор api-шлюза","разработка игр","искусственный интеллект","генерация 3d-активов","инструменты разработки игр","как использовать конфигуратор api-шлюза","альтернативы конфигуратору api-шлюза","конфигуратор api-шлюза vs другие"],"ar":["مكوّن بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تطوير الألعاب","الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء موارد ثلاثية الأبعاد","أدوات تطوير الألعاب","كيفية استخدام مكوّن بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","بديل لمكوّن بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","مكوّن بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مقابل غيره"]}},"owner":"Dexploarer","repo":"hyper-forge","repoPath":"Dexploarer/hyper-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.769Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-gateway-configurator","description":"Configure and manage API gateways including Kong, Tyk, AWS API Gateway, and Apigee. Activates when users need help setting up API gateways, rate limiting, authentication, request transformation, or API management.","bodyPreview":"# API Gateway Configurator\n\nEnterprise skill for configuring and managing API gateways for microservices architectures.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill should be used when:\n- Setting up API gateway for microservices\n- Configuring rate limiting and throttling\n- Implementing API authentication and authorization\n- Setting up request/response transformation\n- Configuring API routing and load balancing\n- Implementing API versioning strategies\n- Setting up API monitoring and analytics\n- Managing API docum","body":"# API Gateway Configurator\n\nEnterprise skill for configuring and managing API gateways for microservices architectures.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill should be used when:\n- Setting up API gateway for microservices\n- Configuring rate limiting and throttling\n- Implementing API authentication and authorization\n- Setting up request/response transformation\n- Configuring API routing and load balancing\n- Implementing API versioning strategies\n- Setting up API monitoring and analytics\n- Managing API documentation and developer portals\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Choose API Gateway Platform\n\nSelect the appropriate API gateway based on requirements:\n\n**Kong Gateway (Open Source/Enterprise):**\n- Best for: Kubernetes-native, plugin ecosystem\n- Strengths: Performance, extensibility, cloud-native\n- Use cases: Microservices, multi-cloud, hybrid cloud\n\n**AWS API Gateway:**\n- Best for: AWS-native applications, serverless\n- Strengths: AWS integration, managed service, scalability\n- Use cases: Lambda functions, AWS services, serverless APIs\n\n**Tyk:**\n- Best for: GraphQL, multi-cloud, analytics\n- Strengths: Developer portal, analytics, open source\n- Use cases: GraphQL federation, API analytics\n\n**Apigee (Google Cloud):**\n- Best for: Enterprise API management, monetization\n- Strengths: Analytics, developer portal, API products\n- Use cases: External APIs, partner APIs, API monetization\n\n### Step 2: Configure Core Features\n\n#### Kong Configuration Example:\n\n```yaml\n# kong.yml - Declarative configuration\n_format_version: \"3.0\"\n\nservices:\n  - name: user-service\n    url: http://user-service:8080\n    routes:\n      - name: user-routes\n        paths:\n          - /api/v1/users\n        methods:\n          - GET\n          - POST\n        strip_path: false\n    plugins:\n      - name: rate-limiting\n        config:\n          minute: 100\n          policy: local\n      - name: jwt\n        config:\n          claims_to_verify:\n            - exp\n      - name: cors\n        config:\n          origins:\n            - \"*\"\n          methods:\n            - GET\n            - POST\n          headers:\n            - Accept\n            - Authorization\n          max_age: 3600\n\n  - name: order-service\n    url: http://order-service:8080\n    routes:\n      - name: order-routes\n        paths:\n          - /api/v1/orders\n    plugins:\n      - name: rate-limiting\n        config:\n          minute: 50\n      - name: request-transformer\n        config:\n          add:\n            headers:\n              - \"X-Gateway:Kong\"\n\n# Global plugins\nplugins:\n  - name: prometheus\n    config:\n      per_consumer: true\n  - name: correlation-id\n    config:\n      header_name: X-Correlation-ID\n      generator: uuid\n```\n\n#### AWS API Gateway Configuration:\n\n```yaml\n# serverless.yml for AWS API Gateway\nprovider:\n  name: aws\n  runtime: nodejs18.x\n  apiGateway:\n    apiKeys:\n      - name: premium-api-key\n        value: ${env:API_KEY}\n    usagePlan:\n      - premium:\n          quota:\n            limit: 5000\n            period: MONTH\n          throttle:\n            burstLimit: 200\n            rateLimit: 100\n    resourcePolicy:\n      - Effect: Allow\n        Principal: \"*\"\n        Action: execute-api:Invoke\n        Resource:\n          - execute-api:/*/*/*\n\nfunctions:\n  getUsers:\n    handler: users.getUsers\n    events:\n      - http:\n          path: users\n          method: get\n          cors: true\n          authorizer:\n            name: jwtAuthorizer\n            type: request\n          request:\n            parameters:\n              querystrings:\n                page: false\n                limit: false\n          throttling:\n            maxRequestsPerSecond: 100\n            maxConcurrentRequests: 50\n\n  createUser:\n    handler: users.createUser\n    events:\n      - http:\n          path: users\n          method: post\n          cors: true\n          authorizer: jwtAuthorizer\n```\n\n### Step 3: Implement Authentication & Authorization\n\n#### JWT Authentication (Kong):\n\n```yaml\n# Create JWT consumer\nconsumers:\n  - username: mobile-app\n    jwt_credentials:\n      - key: mobile-app-key\n        algorithm: HS256\n        secret: ${JWT_SECRET}\n\n# Apply JWT plugin to service\nservices:\n  - name: protected-service\n    plugins:\n      - name: jwt\n        config:\n          header_names:\n            - Authorization\n          claims_to_verify:\n            - exp\n            - nbf\n```\n\n#### OAuth2 (Kong):\n\n```yaml\nplugins:\n  - name: oauth2\n    config:\n      scopes:\n        - read\n        - write\n        - admin\n      mandatory_scope: true\n      enable_authorization_code: true\n      enable_client_credentials: true\n      enable_implicit_grant: false\n      token_expiration: 3600\n      refresh_token_ttl: 2592000\n```\n\n### Step 4: Configure Rate Limiting & Throttling\n\n```yaml\n# Kong - Multiple rate limiting strategies\nplugins:\n  # Per-consumer rate limiting\n  - name: rate-limiting\n    consumer: mobile-app\n    config:\n      second: 10\n      minute: 100\n      hour: 1000\n      policy: redis\n      redis:\n        host: redis-cluster\n        port: 6379\n        database: 0\n\n  # Advanced rate limiting\n  - name: rate-limiting-advanced\n    config:\n      limit:\n        - minute: 100\n        - hour: 1000\n      window_size:\n        - 60\n        - 3600\n      sync_rate: 10\n      strategy: cluster\n      dictionary_name: kong_rate_limiting_counters\n```\n\n### Step 5: Set Up Request/Response Transformation\n\n```yaml\n# Request transformation\nplugins:\n  - name: request-transformer\n    config:\n      add:\n        headers:\n          - \"X-Request-ID:$(uuid)\"\n          - \"X-Forwarded-For:$(client_ip)\"\n        querystring:\n          - \"version:v1\"\n      remove:\n        headers:\n          - \"Authorization\"  # Don''t pass to backend\n      replace:\n        headers:\n          - \"Host:backend-service\"\n\n# Response transformation\nplugins:\n  - name: response-transformer\n    config:\n      add:\n        headers:\n          - \"X-Response-Time:$(latency)\"\n          - \"X-Gateway:Kong\"\n      remove:\n        headers:\n          - \"X-Internal-Secret\"\n      replace:\n        json:\n          - \"$.metadata.source:api-gateway\"\n```\n\n### Step 6: Implement API Versioning\n\n```yaml\n# URL path versioning\nservices:\n  - name: user-service-v1\n    url: http://user-service-v1:8080\n    routes:\n      - paths:\n          - /api/v1/users\n\n  - name: user-service-v2\n    url: http://user-service-v2:8080\n    routes:\n      - paths:\n          - /api/v2/users\n\n# Header-based versioning\nroutes:\n  - name: versioned-route\n    paths:\n      - /api/users\n    plugins:\n      - name: request-transformer\n        config:\n          add:\n            headers:\n              - \"X-API-Version:$(header.Accept-Version)\"\n```\n\n### Step 7: Configure Monitoring & Analytics\n\n```yaml\n# Prometheus metrics\nplugins:\n  - name: prometheus\n    config:\n      per_consumer: true\n      status_code_metrics: true\n      latency_metrics: true\n      bandwidth_metrics: true\n      upstream_health_metrics: true\n\n# Logging\nplugins:\n  - name: file-log\n    config:\n      path: /var/log/kong/access.log\n      reopen: true\n\n  - name: http-log\n    config:\n      http_endpoint: http://log-aggregator:8080/logs\n      method: POST\n      content_type: application/json\n      timeout: 10000\n      keepalive: 60000\n\n# Datadog integration\nplugins:\n  - name: datadog\n    config:\n      host: datadog-agent\n      port: 8125\n      metrics:\n        - name: request_count\n          stat_type: counter\n        - name: latency\n          stat_type: timer\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Security:\n- ✅ Always use HTTPS/TLS for API gateway\n- ✅ Implement JWT or OAuth2 for authentication\n- ✅ Use API keys for external partners\n- ✅ Enable CORS with specific origins\n- ✅ Implement request size limits\n- ✅ Add security headers (HSTS, CSP, etc.)\n\n### Performance:\n- ✅ Enable caching for GET requests\n- ✅ Use Redis for distributed rate limiting\n- ✅ Configure connection pooling to backends\n- ✅ Set appropriate timeouts\n- ✅ Enable gzip compression\n- ✅ Use CDN for static content\n\n### Reliability:\n- ✅ Configure health checks for backends\n- ✅ Implement circuit breakers\n- ✅ Set up retry policies\n- ✅ Configure fallback responses\n- ✅ Use multiple gateway instances\n- ✅ Monitor gateway metrics\n\n### Operations:\n- ✅ Use declarative configuration (GitOps)\n- ✅ Version control gateway configs\n- ✅ Implement blue-green deployments\n- ✅ Set up comprehensive logging\n- ✅ Configure alerts for anomalies\n- ✅ Regular security audits\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Microservices E-Commerce Gateway\n\n```yaml\n# Kong configuration for e-commerce platform\nservices:\n  - name: product-catalog\n    url: http://catalog-service:8080\n    routes:\n      - paths: [\"/api/v1/products\"]\n    plugins:\n      - name: rate-limiting\n        config:\n          minute: 1000\n      - name: cors\n      - name: jwt\n      - name: response-cache\n        config:\n          strategy: memory\n          memory:\n            dictionary_name: kong_cache\n\n  - name: shopping-cart\n    url: http://cart-service:8080\n    routes:\n      - paths: [\"/api/v1/cart\"]\n    plugins:\n      - name: rate-limiting\n        config:\n          minute: 100\n      - name: jwt\n      - name: request-size-limiting\n        config:\n          allowed_payload_size: 10\n\n  - name: checkout\n    url: http://checkout-service:8080\n    routes:\n      - paths: [\"/api/v1/checkout\"]\n    plugins:\n      - name: rate-limiting\n        config:\n          minute: 50\n      - name: jwt\n      - name: bot-detection\n      - name: ip-restriction\n        config:\n          allow:\n            - 10.0.0.0/8\n```\n\n### Example 2: AWS API Gateway with Lambda\n\n```yaml\n# API Gateway with Lambda integration\nfunctions:\n  getUserProfile:\n    handler: handlers/users.getProfile\n    events:\n      - http:\n          path: users/{userId}/profile\n          method: get\n          cors:\n            origin: ''https://app.example.com''\n            headers:\n              - Content-Type\n              - Authorization\n          authorizer:\n            arn: arn:aws:lambda:us-east-1:123456789:function:authorizer\n            resultTtlInSeconds: 300\n            identitySource: method.request.header.Authorization\n          request:\n            parameters:\n              paths:\n                userId: true\n          caching:\n            enabled: true\n            ttlInSeconds: 300\n            dataEncrypted: true\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n- ❌ Not implementing rate limiting\n- ❌ Exposing internal service URLs\n- ❌ No authentication on public APIs\n- ❌ Missing CORS configuration\n- ❌ No monitoring or logging\n- ❌ Hardcoding credentials in config\n- ❌ Not versioning APIs\n- ❌ Single gateway instance (no HA)\n- ❌ No request/response validation\n- ❌ Missing error handling\n\n✅ **Correct approach:**\n- Implement multi-layer rate limiting\n- Use service discovery internally\n- JWT/OAuth2 authentication\n- Proper CORS with allowed origins\n- Comprehensive monitoring\n- Use environment variables/secrets\n- Version APIs from day one\n- Deploy in HA configuration\n- Validate all inputs/outputs\n- Implement circuit breakers\n\n## Tips\n\n- 💡 Start with managed API gateway for faster setup\n- 💡 Use declarative configuration for repeatability\n- 💡 Implement caching to reduce backend load\n- 💡 Monitor gateway metrics continuously\n- 💡 Use API gateway for security boundary\n- 💡 Implement request tracing for debugging\n- 💡 Version APIs early, migrate gradually\n- 💡 Test rate limiting before production\n\n## Related Skills/Commands\n\n### Skills:\n- `microservices-orchestrator` - Microservices architecture\n- `service-mesh-integrator` - Service mesh integration\n- `distributed-tracing-setup` - Request tracing\n\n### Commands:\n- `/dependency-graph` - Visualize API dependencies\n- `/load-test-suite` - Test API gateway performance\n- `/security-posture` - Security assessment\n\n### Agents:\n- `enterprise-architect` - Architecture design\n- `security-architect` - Security configuration\n- `sre-consultant` - SLO/SLI setup\n\n## Notes\n\n**API Gateway Selection Criteria:**\n- ✅ **Kong**: Best for Kubernetes, open source, plugin ecosystem\n- ✅ **AWS API Gateway**: Best for AWS Lambda, managed service\n- ✅ **Tyk**: Best for GraphQL, analytics, multi-cloud\n- ✅ **Apigee**: Best for enterprise API management\n\n**Common Patterns:**\n- Backend for Frontend (BFF) pattern\n- API composition\n- API aggregation\n- Protocol translation (REST to gRPC)\n- Request/response transformation\n\n**Production Checklist:**\n- [ ] TLS/HTTPS enabled\n- [ ] Authentication configured\n- [ ] Rate limiting implemented\n- [ ] CORS configured\n- [ ] Monitoring enabled\n- [ ] Logging configured\n- [ ] Health checks set up\n- [ ] High availability (3+ instances)\n- [ ] Backup and disaster recovery\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:19:37.125Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Native Agents requiring advanced API gateway configuration and management capabilities for microservices architectures.","zh":"适用于需要高级 API 网关配置和管理功能的云原生代理，特别是用于微服务架构。","ja":"マイクロサービスアーキテクチャで高度なAPIゲートウェイ構成および管理機能を必要とするクラウドネイティブエージェントに最適。","ko":"마이크로 서비스 아키텍처에서 고급 API 게이트웨이 구성 및 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos en la Nube que requieren una configuración y gestión avanzadas de la pasarela de API para arquitecturas de microservicios.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud Natifs nécessitant une configuration et une gestion avancées de la passerelle d''API pour les architectures de microservices.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Native-Agents, die eine erweiterte Konfiguration und Verwaltung von API-Gateways für Microservices-Architekturen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos em Nuvem que exigem configuração avançada de gateway de API e capacidades de gerenciamento para arquiteturas de microsserviços.","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, требующих продвинутой настройки шлюза API и возможностей управления для микросервисных архитектур.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابي الأصلي الذي يتطلب تكوين متقدم لبوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وقدرات إدارة لمعمارية المايكروسيرفس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure and manage API gateways with features like rate limiting, API authentication and authorization, request/response transformation, and API routing using protocols such as HTTP and HTTPS, while also implementing API versioning strategies and setting up API monitoring and analytics.","zh":"赋予代理配置和管理API网关的能力，包括限速、API身份验证和授权、请求/响应转换以及使用HTTP和HTTPS等协议的API路由，同时还实现API版本控制策略和设置API监控和分析。","ja":"エージェントがAPIゲートウェイを構成および管理する能力を提供し、レート制限、API認証および認可、リクエスト/レスポンス変換、およびHTTPおよびHTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用したAPIルーティングなどの機能を提供し、同時にAPIバージョニング戦略の実装およびAPIモニタリングおよび分析の設定を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 API 게이트웨이를 구성 및 관리할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, 속도 제한, API 인증 및 인가, 요청/응답 변환, HTTP 및 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하는 API 라우팅 등과 같은 기능을 제공하고,同時에 API 버전 관리 전략을 구현하고 API 모니터링 및 분석을 설정합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para configurar y gestionar las pasarelas de API con características como el límite de velocidad, autenticación y autorización de API, transformación de solicitudes y respuestas, y enrutamiento de API utilizando protocolos como HTTP y HTTPS, así como también implementar estrategias de control de versiones de API y configurar el monitoreo y análisis de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer et de gérer les passerelles d''API avec des fonctionnalités telles que la limitation de débit, l''authentification et l''autorisation d''API, la transformation de requêtes et de réponses, et l''acheminement d''API en utilisant des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTTPS, ainsi que la mise en œuvre de stratégies de gestion de version d''API et la configuration du suivi et de l''analyse d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, API-Gateways mit Funktionen wie Rate Limiting, API-Authentifizierung und -Autorisierung, Anfrage-/Antwort-Transformation und API-Routing unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie HTTP und HTTPS zu konfigurieren und zu verwalten, sowie auch API-Versionierungsstrategien umzusetzen und API-Überwachung und -Analytik zu konfigurieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar e gerenciar gateways de API com recursos como limitação de taxa, autenticação e autorização de API, transformação de solicitação/resposta e roteamento de API usando protocolos como HTTP e HTTPS, além de implementar estratégias de controle de versão de API e configurar monitoramento e análise de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настраивать и управлять шлюзами API с функциями, такими как ограничение скорости, аутентификация и авторизация API, преобразование запроса/ответа и маршрутизация API с использованием протоколов, таких как HTTP и HTTPS, а также реализацию стратегий управления версиями API и настройку мониторинга и аналитики API.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تكوين و إدارة بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام ميزات مثل تحديد معدل و مصادقة و تفويض واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، وتحويل الطلب/الإجابة، وتوجيه واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و HTTPS، بالإضافة إلى تنفيذ استراتيجيات التحكم في إصدار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وضبط مراقبة وتحليل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring rate limiting and throttling for API endpoints","Implementing API authentication and authorization using OAuth and JWT","Setting up request/response transformation for data formatting and validation"],"zh":["为API端点配置限速和节流","使用OAuth和JWT实现API身份验证和授权","设置请求/响应转换用于数据格式化和验证"],"ja":["APIエンドポイントのレート制限とスロットリングを構成する","OAuthとJWTを使用したAPI認証および認可の実装","データのフォーマットと検証のためにリクエスト/レスポンス変換を設定する"],"ko":["API 엔드포인트를 위한 속도 제한 및 제한 설정","OAuth 및 JWT를 사용한 API 인증 및 인가 구현","데이터 형식 및 유효성 검증을 위한 요청/응답 변환 설정"],"es":["Configuración del límite de velocidad y la limitación para puntos de conexión de API","Implementación de autenticación y autorización de API utilizando OAuth y JWT","Configuración de la transformación de solicitudes y respuestas para el formato y la validación de datos"],"fr":["Configuration de la limitation de débit et de la limitation pour les points de terminaison d''API","Mise en œuvre de l''authentification et de l''autorisation d''API en utilisant OAuth et JWT","Configuration de la transformation de requêtes et de réponses pour le formatage et la validation des données"],"de":["Konfiguration von Rate Limiting und Drosselung für API-Endpunkte","Implementierung von API-Authentifizierung und -Autorisierung unter Verwendung von OAuth und JWT","Konfiguration der Anfrage-/Antwort-Transformation für Datenformatierung und -validierung"],"pt":["Configurando limitação de taxa e controle de largura de banda para pontos de extremidade de API","Implementando autenticação e autorização de API usando OAuth e JWT","Configurando transformação de solicitação/resposta para formatação e validação de dados"],"ru":["Настройка ограничения скорости и контроля пропускной способности для конечных точек API","Реализация аутентификации и авторизации API с использованием OAuth и JWT","Настройка преобразования запроса/ответа для форматирования и проверки данных"],"ar":["تكوين تحديد معدل ومراقبة عرض النطاق الترددي لنقاط النهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تنفيذ مصادقة و تفويض واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام OAuth و JWT","تكوين تحويل الطلب/الإجابة لتنسيق و التحقق من البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of microservices architecture","Limited to API gateway configuration and management","Needs access to API gateway infrastructure"],"zh":["需要了解微服务架构","仅限API网关配置和管理","需要访问API网关基础设施"],"ja":["マイクロサービスアーキテクチャの知識が必要","APIゲートウェイ構成および管理に限定される","APIゲートウェイインフラストラクチャへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["마이크로 서비스 아키텍처에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","API 게이트웨이 구성 및 관리에만 제한됩니다","API 게이트웨이 인프라에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de arquitectura de microservicios","Limitado a la configuración y gestión de la pasarela de API","Necesita acceso a la infraestructura de la pasarela de API"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en matière d''architecture de microservices","Limité à la configuration et à la gestion de la passerelle d''API","Nécessite un accès à l''infrastructure de la passerelle d''API"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Microservices-Architektur","Begrenzt auf die Konfiguration und Verwaltung von API-Gateways","Benötigt Zugriff auf die API-Gateway-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de arquitetura de microsserviços","Limitado à configuração e gerenciamento de gateway de API","Necessita acesso à infraestrutura de gateway de API"],"ru":["Требует знания микросервисной архитектуры","Ограничен настройкой и управлением шлюзом API","Требует доступа к инфраструктуре шлюза API"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمعمارية المايكروسيرفس","محدود لتكوين و إدارة بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","يحتاج إلى وصول إلى بنية تحتية لبوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"17eaebca7e4360c85ecf663e2a12143a2df8a212d4cfd58fdec69cdfc1bfff29","qualityScore":55}');
