volvimento de aplicações descentralizadas","Integração com SKALE","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento de IA","Suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["EVM port","Разработка децентрализованных приложений","Интеграция с SKALE","Инструменты разработки ИИ","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["منفذ EVM","تطوير التطبيقات اللامركزية","التكامل مع SKALE","أدوات تطوير الإي أй","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SKALE x402 AI智能工具","Legasi Hackathon","EVM端口","AI智能工具开发","SKALE x402 安装","SKALE x402 教程","AI智能工具比较","SKALE x402 vs 其他AI工具"],"ja":["SKALE x402 AIエージェント","Legasiハッカソン","EVMポート","AIエージェント開発","SKALE x402 インストール","SKALE x402 ガイド","AIエージェント比較","SKALE x402 vs その他のAIエージェント"],"ko":["SKALE x402 AI 에이전트","Legasi 해커톤","EVM 포트","AI 에이전트 개발","SKALE x402 설치","SKALE x402 가이드","AI 에이전트 비교","SKALE x402 vs 다른 AI 에이전트"],"es":["cómo usar Legasi","qué es EVM","alternativas a SKALE","SKALE vs Ethereum","instalación de Legasi","guía de configuración de Legasi","desarrollo de contratos inteligentes con Legasi"],"fr":["comment utiliser Legasi","qu''est-ce que EVM","alternatives à SKALE","SKALE vs Ethereum","installation de Legasi","guide de configuration de Legasi","développement de contrats intelligents avec Legasi"],"de":["wie man Legasi verwendet","was ist EVM","Alternativen zu SKALE","SKALE vs Ethereum","Installation von Legasi","Konfigurationsanleitung für Legasi","Entwicklung von Smart Contracts mit Legasi"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de aplicações descentralizadas","EVM port","SKALE","como usar x402","x402 vs outros instrumentos de IA","instalar x402","guia de configuração do x402"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ","разработка децентрализованных приложений","EVM port","SKALE","как использовать x402","x402 vs другие инструменты ИИ","установить x402","руководство по настройке x402"],"ar":["أدوات الإي أй","تطوير التطبيقات اللامركزية","منفذ EVM","SKALE","كيفية استخدام x402","x402 مقابل أدوات الإي أй الأخرى","تثبيت x402","دليل إعداد x402"]}},"owner":"legasicrypto","repo":"skale-hackathon","repoPath":"legasicrypto/skale-hackathon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.772Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"x402","description":"Search for new services and make paid API requests using the x402 payment protocol. Use when you dont have a clear tool to choose, search the bazaar. You can also use this tool if you or the user want to call an x402 endpoint, discover payment requirements, browse the bazaar, or search for paid services.","bodyPreview":"# x402 Payment Protocol\n\nUse the `npx awal@latest x402` commands to discover, inspect, and call paid API endpoints using the X402 payment protocol. Payments are made in USDC on Base.\n\n## Workflow\n\nThe typical x402 workflow is:\n\n1. **Find a service** - Search the bazaar or get details for a known endpoint\n2. **Check requirements** - Inspect price, method, and input schema\n3. **Make the request** - Call the endpoint with automatic USDC payment\n\n## Commands\n\n### Search the Bazaar\n\nFind paid service","body":"# x402 Payment Protocol\n\nUse the `npx awal@latest x402` commands to discover, inspect, and call paid API endpoints using the X402 payment protocol. Payments are made in USDC on Base.\n\n## Workflow\n\nThe typical x402 workflow is:\n\n1. **Find a service** - Search the bazaar or get details for a known endpoint\n2. **Check requirements** - Inspect price, method, and input schema\n3. **Make the request** - Call the endpoint with automatic USDC payment\n\n## Commands\n\n### Search the Bazaar\n\nFind paid services by keyword using BM25 relevance search:\n\n```bash\nnpx awal@latest x402 bazaar search <query> [-k <n>] [--force-refresh] [--json]\n```\n\n| Option            | Description                          |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `-k, --top <n>`   | Number of results (default: 5)       |\n| `--force-refresh` | Re-fetch resource index from CDP API |\n| `--json`          | Output as JSON                       |\n\nResults are cached locally at `~/.config/awal/bazaar/` and auto-refresh after 12 hours.\n\n### List Bazaar Resources\n\nBrowse all available resources:\n\n```bash\nawal x402 bazaar list [--network <network>] [--full] [--json]\n```\n\n| Option             | Description                             |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| `--network <name>` | Filter by network (base, base-sepolia)  |\n| `--full`           | Show complete details including schemas |\n| `--json`           | Output as JSON                          |\n\n### Discover Payment Requirements\n\nInspect an endpoint''s x402 payment requirements without paying:\n\n```bash\nawal x402 details <url> [--json]\n```\n\nAuto-detects the correct HTTP method (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH) by trying each until it gets a 402 response, then displays price, accepted payment schemes, network, and input/output schemas.\n\n### Make a Paid Request\n\nCall an x402 endpoint with automatic USDC payment:\n\n```bash\nawal x402 pay <url> [-X <method>] [-d <json>] [-q <params>] [-h <json>] [--max-amount <n>] [--json]\n```\n\n| Option                  | Description                                        |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `-X, --method <method>` | HTTP method (default: GET)                         |\n| `-d, --data <json>`     | Request body as JSON string                        |\n| `-q, --query <params>`  | Query parameters as JSON string                    |\n| `-h, --headers <json>`  | Custom HTTP headers as JSON string                 |\n| `--max-amount <amount>` | Max payment in USDC atomic units (1000000 = $1.00) |\n| `--correlation-id <id>` | Group related operations                           |\n| `--json`                | Output as JSON                                     |\n\n## Examples\n\n```bash\n# Search for weather-related paid APIs\nawal x402 bazaar search \"weather\"\n\n# Search with more results\nawal x402 bazaar search \"sentiment analysis\" -k 10\n\n# Check what an endpoint costs\nawal x402 details https://example.com/api/weather\n\n# Make a GET request (auto-pays)\nawal x402 pay https://example.com/api/weather\n\n# Make a POST request with body\nawal x402 pay https://example.com/api/sentiment -X POST -d ''{\"text\": \"I love this product\"}''\n\n# Limit max payment to $0.10\nawal x402 pay https://example.com/api/data --max-amount 100000\n\n# Browse all bazaar resources with full details\nawal x402 bazaar list --full\n```\n\n## USDC Amounts\n\nX402 uses USDC atomic units (6 decimals):\n\n| Atomic Units | USD   |\n| ------------ | ----- |\n| 1000000      | $1.00 |\n| 100000       | $0.10 |\n| 50000        | $0.05 |\n| 10000        | $0.01 |\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- **Search/Details**: No authentication needed\n- **Pay**: Must be authenticated (`awal auth login <email>`) with sufficient USDC balance (`awal balance`)\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- \"Not authenticated\" - Run `awal auth login <email>` first\n- \"No X402 payment requirements found\" - URL may not be an x402 endpoint\n- \"CDP API returned 429\" - Rate limited; cached data will be used if available\n- \"Insufficient balance\" - Fund wallet with USDC (`awal balance` to check)"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:21:22.485Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Financial Agents requiring automated payment processing using the X402 payment protocol on the SKALE network","zh":"适合需要在SKALE网络上使用X402支付协议进行自动化支付处理的金融代理","ja":"SKALEネットワーク上でX402支払プロトコルを使用して自動化された支払処理を必要とする金融エージェントに適しています","ko":"SKALE 네트워크에서 X402 결제 프로토콜을 사용하여 자동화된 결제 처리가 필요한 금융 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes Financieros que requieren procesamiento de pagos automatizados utilizando el protocolo de pago X402 en la red SKALE","fr":"Idéal pour les agents financiers nécessitant un traitement de paiement automatisé utilisant le protocole de paiement X402 sur le réseau SKALE","de":"Ideal für Finanzagenten, die ein automatisiertes Zahlungsverarbeitung unter Verwendung des X402-Zahlungsprotokolls im SKALE-Netzwerk erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Financeiros que exigem processamento de pagamento automatizado usando o protocolo de pagamento X402 na rede SKALE","ru":"Идеально для финансовых агентов, требующих автоматизированной обработки платежей с использованием протокола платежей X402 в сети SKALE","ar":"مثالي لويجراء عمليات دفع آلية باستخدام بروتوكول الدفع X402 على شبكة SKALE"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover, inspect, and call paid API endpoints using USDC on Base, leveraging the `npx awal@latest x402` command for seamless transactions via the X402 protocol","zh":"赋予代理发现、检查和调用Base上的USDC付费API端点，利用`npx awal@latest x402`命令实现X402协议的无缝交易","ja":"エージェントがBase上のUSDCを使用した有料APIエンドポイントを検出、検査、および呼び出し、`npx awal@latest x402`コマンドを使用してX402プロトコルによるシームレスなトランザクションを実現する","ko":"에이전트가 Base上的 USDC를 사용하여 유료 API 엔드포인트를 발견, 검사 및 호출하고 `npx awal@latest x402` 명령을 사용하여 X402 프로토콜의 원활한 트랜잭션을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descubrir, inspeccionar y llamar a puntos finales de API de pago utilizando USDC en Base, aprovechando el comando `npx awal@latest x402` para transacciones sin problemas a través del protocolo X402","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir, d''inspecter et d''appeler les points de terminaison API payants en utilisant USDC sur Base, en exploitant la commande `npx awal@latest x402` pour des transactions sans accroc via le protocole X402","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, zu entdecken, zu untersuchen und aufgerufene kostenpflichtige API-Endpunkte unter Verwendung von USDC auf Base zu nutzen, indem sie den Befehl `npx awal@latest x402` für nahtlose Transaktionen über das X402-Protokoll nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrir, inspecionar e chamar pontos de extremidade de API pagos usando USDC na Base, aproveitando o comando `npx awal@latest x402` para transações sem problemas via o protocolo X402","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать, инспектировать и вызывать платные конечные точки API с использованием USDC на Base, используя команду `npx awal@latest x402` для беспроблемных транзакций через протокол X402","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء اكتشاف و فحص ونقاط النهاية المدفوعة API باستخدام USDC على القاعدة، و باستخدام الأمر `npx awal@latest x402` من أجل المعاملات السلسة عبر بروتوكول X402"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating payments for API services","Inspecting pricing and input schema for paid endpoints","Discovering new services on the bazaar"],"zh":["自动化API服务的支付","检查付费端点的定价和输入模式","发现bazzaar上的新服务"],"ja":["APIサービスへの支払いを自動化する","有料エンドポイントの価格と入力スキーマを検査する","バザール上で新しいサービスを発見する"],"ko":["API 서비스의 결제를 자동화하는 것","유료 엔드포인트의 가격 및 입력 스키마를 검사","바자上的 새로운 서비스를 발견"],"es":["Automatizar pagos para servicios de API","Inspeccionar precios y esquemas de entrada para puntos finales pagados","Descubrir nuevos servicios en el bazar"],"fr":["Automatiser les paiements pour les services API","Inspecter les prix et les schémas d''entrée pour les points de terminaison payants","Découvrir de nouveaux services sur le bazar"],"de":["Automatisierung von Zahlungen für API-Dienste","Untersuchung von Preisen und Eingabeschemata für kostenpflichtige Endpunkte","Entdeckung neuer Dienste auf dem Basar"],"pt":["Automatizar pagamentos para serviços de API","Inspecionar preços e esquema de entrada para pontos de extremidade pagos","Descobrir novos serviços no bazar"],"ru":["Автоматизировать платежи за услуги API","Просматривать цены и схему ввода для платных конечных точек","Обнаруживать новые услуги на базаре"],"ar":["توفير عمليات دفع آلية للخدمات API","فحص الأسعار ومخطط الإدخال لنقاط النهاية المدفوعة","اكتشاف خدمات جديدة في السوق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires USDC on Base for payments","Limited to EVM port on SKALE network"],"zh":["需要Base上的USDC进行支付","仅限于SKALE网络上的EVM端口"],"ja":["支払いにBase上的USDCを必要とする","SKALEネットワーク上のEVMポートに限定される"],"ko":["결제를 위해 Base上的 USDC가 필요","SKALE 네트워크上的 EVM 포트로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere USDC en Base para pagos","Limitado al puerto EVM en la red SKALE"],"fr":["Nécessite USDC sur Base pour les paiements","Limité au port EVM sur le réseau SKALE"],"de":["Benötigt USDC auf Base für Zahlungen","Begrenzt auf den EVM-Port im SKALE-Netzwerk"],"pt":["Exige USDC na Base para pagamentos","Limitado à porta EVM na rede SKALE"],"ru":["Требует USDC на Base для платежей","Ограничен порт EVM в сети SKALE"],"ar":["يتطلب USDC على القاعدة للعمليات الدفعية","محدود منفذ EVM على شبكة SKALE"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e237334e8699efc1a62d8d617f31c1ea6d1cf5b221372eb848287f7ff035b039","qualityScore":55}');
