de IA","Suporte a Python"],"ru":["Поддержка CLI","Автоматизированное разработка программного обеспечения","Интеграция с React и Node.js","Инструменты разработки ИИ","Поддержка Python"],"ar":["دعم واجهة سطر الأوامر","برمجة تلقائية","التكامل مع React و Node.js","أدوات البرمجة الذكية","دعم Python"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用codex-worker","什么是CLI AI代理","codex-worker安装","codex-worker替代品","codex-worker教程","CLI开发工具"],"ja":["codex-workerの使い方","CLI AIエージェントとは","codex-workerのインストール","codex-workerの代替","codex-workerのチュートリアル","CLI開発ツール"],"ko":["codex-worker 사용법","CLI AI 에이전트란","codex-worker 설치","codex-worker 대체","codex-worker 튜토리얼","CLI 개발 도구"],"es":["cómo usar Kimi Code CLI","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","alternativas a Kimi Code CLI","Kimi Code CLI vs otros agentes de línea de comandos","instalación de Kimi Code CLI","guía de configuración de Kimi Code CLI","mejora de la productividad con Kimi Code CLI"],"fr":["comment utiliser Kimi Code CLI","outils IA pour les développeurs","alternatives à Kimi Code CLI","Kimi Code CLI vs d''autres agents CLI","installation de Kimi Code CLI","guide de configuration de Kimi Code CLI","amélioration de la productivité avec Kimi Code CLI"],"de":["wie man Kimi Code CLI verwendet","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Alternativen zu Kimi Code CLI","Kimi Code CLI im Vergleich zu anderen Befehlszeilen-Agents","Installation von Kimi Code CLI","Konfigurationsanleitung für Kimi Code CLI","Produktivitätssteigerung mit Kimi Code CLI"],"pt":["como usar codex-worker","o que é agente de IA","alternativas para codex-worker","codex-worker vs outros agentes","instalar codex-worker","guia de configuração do codex-worker","desenvolvimento de software com IA","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de IA"],"ru":["как использовать codex-worker","что такое ИИ Агент","альтернативы для codex-worker","codex-worker vs другие агенты","установить codex-worker","руководство по настройке codex-worker","разработка программного обеспечения с ИИ","инструменты разработки ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام codex-worker","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل لبرنامج codex-worker","codex-worker مقابل وكلاء آخرين","تثبيت codex-worker","دليل إعداد codex-worker","برمجة البرمجيات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات البرمجة الذكية"]}},"owner":"MoonshotAI","repo":"kimi-cli","repoPath":"MoonshotAI/kimi-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.809Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"codex-worker","description":"Spawn and manage multiple Codex CLI agents via tmux to work on tasks in parallel. Use whenever a task can be decomposed into independent subtasks (e.g. batch triage, parallel fixes, multi-file refactors). When codex and tmux are available, prefer this over the built-in Task tool for parallelism.","bodyPreview":"# codex-worker\n\nOrchestrate multiple Codex CLI (`codex`) agents running in parallel, each in its\nown git worktree and tmux session.\n\n**When to use:** Whenever you identify that a task can be split into independent\nsubtasks — don''t wait for the user to ask for parallelism. Examples:\n- User says \"triage all open issues updated in the last 7 days\" → fetch the\n  issue list, then spawn one codex worker per issue.\n- User says \"refactor these 5 modules\" → one worker per module.\n- User says \"fix lint er","body":"# codex-worker\n\nOrchestrate multiple Codex CLI (`codex`) agents running in parallel, each in its\nown git worktree and tmux session.\n\n**When to use:** Whenever you identify that a task can be split into independent\nsubtasks — don''t wait for the user to ask for parallelism. Examples:\n- User says \"triage all open issues updated in the last 7 days\" → fetch the\n  issue list, then spawn one codex worker per issue.\n- User says \"refactor these 5 modules\" → one worker per module.\n- User says \"fix lint errors across packages\" → one worker per package.\n\n**Replaces Task tool:** When `codex` and `tmux` are available in the\nenvironment, use codex workers instead of the built-in Task (subagent) tool.\nCodex workers are full-featured agents with their own file system access, shell,\nand isolated worktree — far more capable than subagents.\n\n## Preflight check\n\n```bash\ncommand -v codex && codex login status && command -v tmux\n```\n\nAll three must succeed. The project must be a git repository.\n\n## Naming convention\n\nGit branch and worktree directory share a **task name**:\n\n```\n<type>-<issue number (optional)>-<short description>\n```\n\nThe tmux session adds a `codex-worker-` prefix so workers are easy to filter:\n\n| | Format | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| Task name | `<type>-<number>-<desc>` | `issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign` |\n| Git branch | same as task name | `issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign` |\n| Worktree dir | `<project>.worktrees/<task>` | `kimi-cli.worktrees/issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign` |\n| tmux session | `codex-worker-<task>` | `codex-worker-issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign` |\n\nMore examples:\n- `issue-518-mcp-config-isolation`\n- `fix-share-dir-skills-path`\n- `feat-ask-user-tool`\n- `refactor-jinja-templates`\n\nList only codex workers: `tmux ls | grep ^codex-worker-`\n\n## Usage\n\nPrefer tmux + interactive codex for all tasks. It supports multi-turn dialogue,\nthe user can `tmux attach` to inspect or intervene, and you can send follow-up\nprompts from outside.\n\n### Spawn a worker\n\n```bash\nNAME=\"issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign\"        # task name\nSESSION=\"codex-worker-$NAME\"               # tmux session name\nPROJECT_DIR=\"$(pwd)\"\nWORKTREE_DIR=\"$PROJECT_DIR.worktrees\"\n\n# 1. Create worktree (skip if exists)\ngit worktree add \"$WORKTREE_DIR/$NAME\" -b \"$NAME\" main 2>/dev/null\n\n# 2. Launch interactive codex inside tmux\ntmux new-session -d -s \"$SESSION\" -x 200 -y 50 \\\n  \"cd $WORKTREE_DIR/$NAME && codex --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox\"\n```\n\n### Send a prompt\n\nThe Codex TUI needs time to initialize before it accepts input.\nAfter launching a session, **wait at least 5 seconds** before sending\na prompt. Then send the text followed by `Enter`. If the prompt stays\nin the input field without being submitted, send an additional `Enter`.\n\n```bash\nsleep 5  # wait for Codex TUI to initialize\ntmux send-keys -t \"$SESSION\" \"Your prompt here\" Enter\n# If it doesn''t submit, send another Enter:\n# tmux send-keys -t \"$SESSION\" Enter\n```\n\n### Peek at output\n\n```bash\ntmux capture-pane -t \"$SESSION\" -p | tail -30\n```\n\n### Attach for hands-on interaction\n\n```bash\ntmux attach -t \"$SESSION\"\n```\n\n### Parallel fan-out\n\n```bash\nTASKS=(\n  \"issue-518-mcp-config-isolation|Triage #518: MCP config 被子 agent 继承的隔离问题。分析根因，给出修复方案。\"\n  \"issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign|Triage #836: prompt 包含 $ 时启动静默失败。分析根因，给出修复方案。\"\n)\n\nPROJECT_DIR=\"$(pwd)\"\nWORKTREE_DIR=\"$PROJECT_DIR.worktrees\"\n\nfor entry in \"${TASKS[@]}\"; do\n  NAME=\"${entry%%|*}\"\n  PROMPT=\"${entry#*|}\"\n  SESSION=\"codex-worker-$NAME\"\n  git worktree add \"$WORKTREE_DIR/$NAME\" -b \"$NAME\" main 2>/dev/null\n  tmux new-session -d -s \"$SESSION\" -x 200 -y 50 \\\n    \"cd $WORKTREE_DIR/$NAME && codex --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox\"\n  sleep 5  # wait for Codex TUI to fully initialize\n  tmux send-keys -t \"$SESSION\" \"$PROMPT\" Enter\ndone\n```\n\n### Fallback: `codex exec`\n\nOnly use `codex exec` when you explicitly don''t need follow-up (e.g. CI, pure\nanalysis with `-o` output). It does not support multi-turn dialogue.\n\n```bash\ncodex exec --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox \\\n  -o \"/tmp/$NAME-result.md\" \\\n  \"Your prompt here\"\n```\n\n## Lifecycle management\n\nList active workers:\n\n```bash\ntmux ls | grep ^codex-worker-\n```\n\nKill a finished worker:\n\n```bash\ntmux kill-session -t \"codex-worker-$NAME\"\n```\n\nClean up worktree after merging:\n\n```bash\ntmux kill-session -t \"codex-worker-$NAME\" 2>/dev/null\ngit worktree remove \"$WORKTREE_DIR/$NAME\"\ngit branch -d \"$NAME\"\n```\n\nBatch cleanup of dead sessions:\n\n```bash\ntmux list-sessions -F ''#{session_name}:#{pane_dead}'' \\\n  | grep '':1$'' \\\n  | cut -d: -f1 \\\n  | xargs -I{} tmux kill-session -t {}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:32:53.794Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Tasking Agents needing parallel execution of independent subtasks using Codex CLI and git worktrees","zh":"非常适合需要利用 Codex CLI 和 git worktree 并行执行独立子任务的多任务 Agent","ja":"Codex CLI と git worktree を使用して独立したサブタスクを並列実行する必要があるマルチタスクエージェントに最適","ko":"Codex CLI와 git worktree를 사용하여 독립적인 하위 작업을 병렬 실행해야 하는 다중 작업 에이전트에 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Multi-Tarea que necesitan ejecución paralela de subtareas independientes utilizando Codex CLI y git worktrees","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Multi-Tâche nécessitant une exécution parallèle de sous-tâches indépendantes en utilisant Codex CLI et git worktrees","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Tasking-Agents, die eine parallele Ausführung von unabhängigen Subtasks mit Codex CLI und git Worktrees benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Multi-Tarefas que necessitam de execução paralela de subtarefas independentes usando Codex CLI e git worktrees","ru":"Идеально подходит для многозадачных агентов, которым требуется параллельное выполнение независимых подзадач с использованием Codex CLI и git worktrees","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المهام المتعددة الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ متوازٍ للمهام الفرعية المستقلة باستخدام Codex CLI و git worktrees"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate multiple Codex CLI agents running in parallel, each in its own git worktree and tmux session, utilizing protocols like git and tmux for efficient task management","zh":"使 Agent 能够协调多个并行运行的 Codex CLI Agent，每个 Agent 都在其自己的 git worktree 和 tmux 会话中，利用 git 和 tmux 等协议实现高效的任务管理","ja":"エージェントが、それぞれが独自の git worktree と tmux セッション内で並列実行されている複数の Codex CLI エージェントを調整できるようにし、git や tmux などのプロトコルを利用した効率的なタスク管理を実現","ko":"각각 자체 git worktree 및 tmux 세션에서 병렬로 실행되는 여러 Codex CLI 에이전트를 오케스트레이션할 수 있도록 하여, git 및 tmux와 같은 프로토콜을 활용한 효율적인 작업 관리 가능","es":"Permite a los agentes orquestar múltiples agentes de Codex CLI que se ejecutan en paralelo, cada uno en su propio git worktree y sesión tmux, utilizando protocolos como git y tmux para una gestión de tareas eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer plusieurs agents Codex CLI s''exécutant en parallèle, chacun dans son propre git worktree et session tmux, en utilisant des protocoles tels que git et tmux pour une gestion de tâches efficace","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, mehrere Codex-CLI-Agents zu orchestrieren, die parallel laufen, jeder in seinem eigenen git-Worktree und tmux-Sitzung, wobei Protokolle wie git und tmux für eine effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung verwendet werden","pt":"Capacita os agentes a orquestrar múltiplos agentes Codex CLI em execução paralela, cada um em seu próprio git worktree e sessão tmux, utilizando protocolos como git e tmux para um gerenciamento eficiente de tarefas","ru":"Позволяет агентам оркестрировать несколько агентов Codex CLI, работающих параллельно, каждый в своей собственной git worktree и сессии tmux, используя такие протоколы, как git и tmux, для эффективного управления задачами","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تنظيم وحدات عمل Codex CLI متعددة تعمل بالتوازي، كل منها في فرع git worktree الخاص به وجلسة tmux خاصة، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل git و tmux للإدارة الفعالة للمهام"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue triage by spawning one codex worker per issue","Refactoring multiple modules concurrently with one worker per module","Debugging and fixing lint errors in parallel across different codebases"],"zh":["通过为每个 Issue 生成一个 codex worker 来自动化 Issue 分类","使用每个模块一个 worker 来并发重构多个模块","跨不同代码库并行调试和修复 lint 错误"],"ja":["Issue ごとに 1 つの codex worker を生成することによる Issue トリアージの自動化","モジュールごとに 1 つのワーカーを使用した複数モジュールの同時リファクタリング","異なるコードベースにわたる lint エラーの並列デバッグと修正"],"ko":["Issue당 하나의 codex worker를 생성하여 Issue 분류 자동화","모듈당 하나의 worker를 사용하여 여러 모듈 동시 리팩토링","서로 다른 코드베이스에서 lint 오류 병렬 디버깅 및 수정"],"es":["Automatizar la clasificación de problemas mediante la creación de un trabajador de codex por problema","Reorganizar módulos múltiples de forma concurrente con un trabajador por módulo","Depurar y corregir errores de lint en paralelo en diferentes bases de código"],"fr":["Automatiser le triage des problèmes en faisant apparaître un travailleur de codex par problème","Réorganiser plusieurs modules de manière concurrente avec un travailleur par module","Déboguer et corriger les erreurs de lint en parallèle sur différents codes sources"],"de":["Automatisierung der Problemtriage durch Erstellung eines Codex-Workers pro Problem","Neustrukturierung mehrerer Module gleichzeitig mit einem Worker pro Modul","Fehlerbehebung und Korrektur von Lint-Fehlern in parallelen Codebasen"],"pt":["Automatização de triagem de problemas gerando um worker codex por problema","Refatoração de múltiplos módulos simultaneamente com um worker por módulo","Depuração e correção de erros de lint em paralelo em diferentes codebases"],"ru":["Автоматизация сортировки проблем путем запуска одного воркера codex на каждую проблему","Рефакторинг нескольких модулей одновременно с одним воркером на модуль","Отладка и исправление ошибок линтинга параллельно в разных кодовых базах"],"ar":["أتمتة فرز المشكلات من خلال تشغيل عامل codex واحد لكل مشكلة","إعادة هيكلة وحدات متعددة في وقت واحد مع عامل واحد لكل وحدة","التصحيح وإصلاح أخطاء lint بالتوازي عبر قاعدة أكواد مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git worktree and tmux setup","Limited to tasks that can be split into independent subtasks","Dependent on Codex CLI availability and compatibility"],"zh":["需要 git worktree 和 tmux 设置","仅限于可以拆分为独立子任务的任务","依赖于 Codex CLI 的可用性和兼容性"],"ja":["git worktree と tmux のセットアップが必要","独立したサブタスクに分割できるタスクに限定される","Codex CLI の可用性と互換性に依存"],"ko":["git worktree 및 tmux 설정 필요","독립적인 하위 작업으로 분할할 수 있는 작업으로 제한됨","Codex CLI 가용성 및 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de git worktree y tmux","Limitado a tareas que se pueden dividir en subtareas independientes","Dependiente de la disponibilidad y compatibilidad de Codex CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de git worktree et tmux","Limité aux tâches qui peuvent être divisées en sous-tâches indépendantes","Dépend de la disponibilité et de la compatibilité de Codex CLI"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration von git-Worktree und tmux","Begrenzt auf Aufgaben, die in unabhängige Subtasks aufgeteilt werden können","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit und Kompatibilität von Codex CLI"],"pt":["Requer configuração de git worktree e tmux","Limitado a tarefas que podem ser divididas em subtarefas independentes","Dependente da disponibilidade e compatibilidade do Codex CLI"],"ru":["Требует настройки git worktree и tmux","Ограничено задачами, которые можно разделить на независимые подзадачи","Зависит от доступности и совместимости Codex CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد git worktree و tmux","مقتصر على المهام التي يمكن تقسيمها إلى مهام فرعية مستقلة","يعتمد على توفر Codex CLI والتوافق معه"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3abb4cf9cf6bea74ba6fb6bdb63f69b455d21fd58dc3b6df200c44188e0dd556","qualityScore":55}');
