媒体解决方案的AI智能代理，能够在任何地方运行","ja":"fill-changelogは、クラウドとメディアソリューションを提供するAIエージェントです","ko":"fill-changelog는 클라우드와 미디어 솔루션을 제공하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"fill-changelog es una herramienta de AI para soluciones de media en la nube que ofrece funcionalidades avanzadas","fr":"fill-changelog est un outil d''IA pour les solutions de media dans le cloud qui propose des fonctionnalités avancées","de":"fill-changelog ist ein KI-Tool für Medienlösungen in der Cloud, das erweiterte Funktionen bietet","pt":"O fill-changelog é uma ferramenta de IA que permite soluções de nuvem e mídia inovadoras, funcionando até em um quadro de cortar","ru":"ИИ Агент fill-changelog позволяет создавать инновационные облачные и медиа решения, которые работают даже на разделочной доске","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي fill-changelog تمكن من إنشاء حلول سحابة وإعلام مبتكرة تعمل حتى على لوح تقطيع","en":"home cloud and media solutions that runs even on a cutting board"},"definition":{"en":"home cloud and media solutions that runs even on a cutting board"},"features":{"zh":["云端解决方案","媒体解决方案","跨平台运行","高性能计算","自动化更新"],"ja":["クラウドソリューション","メディアソリューション","クロスプラットフォームでの実行","高性能コンピューティング","自動更新"],"ko":["클라우드 솔루션","미디어 솔루션","크로스 플랫폼 실행","고성능 컴퓨팅","자동 업데이트"],"es":["Funciona en la nube","Compatible con soluciones de media","Generación automática de registros de cambios","Soporte para múltiples plataformas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Fonctionne dans le cloud","Compatible avec les solutions de media","Génération automatique de journaux de modifications","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes","Intégration avec les outils de développement"],"de":["Funktioniert in der Cloud","Kompatibel mit Medienlösungen","Automatische Generierung von Änderungsprotokollen","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Suporte a sistemas operacionais leves","Funcionamento em dispositivos de baixo custo","Integração com soluções de nuvem e mídia","Automatização de registros de alterações","Compatibilidade com React, Python e Node.js"],"ru":["Поддержка легких операционных систем","Работа на устройствах с низкой стоимостью","Интеграция с облачными и медиа решениями","Автоматизация журналов изменений","Совместимость с React, Python и Node.js"],"ar":["دعم لأنظمة التشغيل الخفيفة","العمل على الأجهزة منخفضة التكلفة","التكامل مع حلول السحابة والإعلام","التلقائية لإنشاء سجلات التعديلات","التوافق مع React و Python و Node.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","fill-changelog","云端解决方案","媒体解决方案","如何使用fill-changelog","fill-changelog安装","fill-changelog vs 其他AI代理"],"ja":["AIエージェント","fill-changelog","クラウドソリューション","メディアソリューション","fill-changelogの使い方","fill-changelogのインストール","fill-changelog vs 他のAIエージェント"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","fill-changelog","클라우드 솔루션","미디어 솔루션","fill-changelog 사용법","fill-changelog 설치","fill-changelog vs 다른 AI 에이전트"],"es":["cómo usar fill-changelog","qué es fill-changelog","alternativas a fill-changelog","fill-changelog vs otras herramientas","instalación de fill-changelog","guía de configuración de fill-changelog"],"fr":["comment utiliser fill-changelog","qu''est-ce que fill-changelog","alternatives à fill-changelog","fill-changelog vs d''autres outils","installation de fill-changelog","guide de configuration de fill-changelog"],"de":["wie man fill-changelog verwendet","was ist fill-changelog","alternativen zu fill-changelog","fill-changelog vs andere tools","installation von fill-changelog","konfigurationsanleitung für fill-changelog"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","fill-changelog","soluções de nuvem e mídia","sistemas operacionais leves","React","Python","Node.js","como usar fill-changelog","o que é fill-changelog"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","fill-changelog","облачные и медиа решения","легкие операционные системы","React","Python","Node.js","как использовать fill-changelog","что такое fill-changelog"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","fill-changelog","حلول السحابة والإعلام","أنظمة التشغيل الخفيفة","React","Python","Node.js","كيفية استخدام fill-changelog","ما هو fill-changelog"]}},"owner":"furystack","repo":"pi-rat","repoPath":"furystack/pi-rat","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.817Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fill-changelog","description":"Fill changelog entries for the current branch. Use when the user asks to fill changelog, write changelog entries, update changelog, or prepare changelog for a PR.","bodyPreview":"# fill-changelog\n\nAutomate filling changelog entries based on the changes in the current branch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nVersion bumps MUST be configured before running this skill. If `yarn version check` fails, version files need to be adjusted first using `yarn version patch/minor/major` or `yarn bumpVersions` (interactive).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Validate Version Configuration\n\nRun `yarn version check` to validate version manifests exist:\n\n```bash\nyarn version check\n```\n\n**If fails:** Stop and","body":"# fill-changelog\n\nAutomate filling changelog entries based on the changes in the current branch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nVersion bumps MUST be configured before running this skill. If `yarn version check` fails, version files need to be adjusted first using `yarn version patch/minor/major` or `yarn bumpVersions` (interactive).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Validate Version Configuration\n\nRun `yarn version check` to validate version manifests exist:\n\n```bash\nyarn version check\n```\n\n**If fails:** Stop and report error. The user must run `yarn version patch`, `yarn version minor`, `yarn version major`, or `yarn bumpVersions` first to configure version bumps.\n\n### Step 2: Create/Recreate Changelog Drafts\n\nRun with force flag to ensure all drafts are created or recreated:\n\n```bash\nyarn changelog create -f\n```\n\nThis creates files in `.yarn/changelogs/` with the pattern `{package-name}.{manifest-id}.md`.\n\n### Step 3: Analyze Branch Changes\n\nGather information about changes:\n\n```bash\ngit diff develop...HEAD --stat\ngit log develop...HEAD --oneline\n```\n\nRead the changed files to understand what was actually modified.\n\n### Step 4: Read Changelog Drafts\n\nUse Glob to find `.yarn/changelogs/*.md` files, then Read to load their content.\n\n### Step 5: Fill Changelog Entries\n\nMap changes to the appropriate sections and fill the changelog drafts.\n\n## Section Mapping\n\n| Section             | When to Use                                    |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| ✨ Features         | New functionality, new files, new capabilities |\n| 🐛 Bug Fixes        | Corrections to existing behavior               |\n| 📚 Documentation    | README, comments, documentation files          |\n| ⚡ Performance      | Optimizations                                  |\n| ♻️ Refactoring      | Code restructuring without behavior change     |\n| 🧪 Tests            | Test additions/modifications                   |\n| 📦 Build            | Build system, dependencies configuration       |\n| 👷 CI               | CI/CD configuration changes                    |\n| ⬆️ Dependencies     | Dependency updates                             |\n| 🔧 Chores           | Other maintenance tasks                        |\n| 💥 Breaking Changes | Major version only (REQUIRED)                  |\n| 🗑️ Deprecated       | Minor/Major versions only                      |\n\n## Quality Guidelines\n\n### Writing Style: Documentation, NOT Git Log\n\nWrite for package consumers, not as git history.\n\n**Avoid vague terms:**\n\n- \"improved\", \"updated\", \"refactored\", \"fixed bugs\", \"changed internal implementation\"\n\n**Use specific, actionable language:**\n\n- \"Added pagination support to `getUserList()` with page and limit parameters\"\n- \"Fixed date picker not respecting user timezone in profile settings\"\n\n### Version-Specific Requirements\n\n**Major Versions:**\n\n- Document ALL breaking changes with descriptive titles\n- Explain WHAT changed and WHY\n- Include before/after code examples using ❌/✅ markers\n- Provide migration guide with step-by-step instructions\n- Explain impact (who is affected)\n\n**Minor Versions:**\n\n- Document new features with descriptive titles\n- Provide usage examples\n- Explain benefits/use cases\n\n**Patch Versions:**\n\n- Be specific about bug fixes (not vague \"fixed bugs\")\n- Describe what was broken\n\n### List Items Need Descriptions\n\nWhen listing multiple items (features, agents, tools, etc.), each item should include a brief description of what it does and why it matters:\n\n```markdown\n// ❌ Bad - just names without context\n\n- Added `reviewer-changelog`\n- Added `reviewer-eslint`\n- Added `reviewer-prettier`\n\n// ✅ Good - each item explains its purpose\n\n- Added `reviewer-changelog` - Validates changelog entries have high-quality, descriptive content\n- Added `reviewer-eslint` - Runs ESLint checks to catch linting violations automatically\n- Added `reviewer-prettier` - Validates code formatting matches project standards\n```\n\nEven for simple list items, the reader should understand **what** the item does without needing to look elsewhere.\n\n## Entry Format Examples\n\n### Simple List (straightforward changes)\n\n```markdown\n## ✨ Features\n\n- Added `exportToCSV()` function for data export\n- Implemented multi-select filtering in list views\n```\n\n### Detailed Entry (complex changes)\n\n```markdown\n## ✨ Features\n\n### New Data Export Feature\n\nExport data in multiple formats for analysis and reporting.\n\n**Usage:**\n\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\nimport { exportData } from ''common'';\n\nconst result = await exportData(items, { format: ''csv'' });\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n### Breaking Changes (major versions)\n\n```markdown\n## 💥 Breaking Changes\n\n### API Methods Now Use Object Parameters\n\nMethods now accept object parameters instead of positional arguments.\n\n**Examples:**\n\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\n// ❌ Before\nawait injector.getInstance(MyService, arg1, arg2);\n\n// ✅ After\nawait injector.getInstance(MyService, { arg1, arg2 });\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n**Impact:** All callers of the affected methods need to be updated.\n\n**Migration:** Search for method calls with `grep -r \"getInstance\" service/` and update to object syntax.\n```\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter filling entries, run:\n\n```bash\nyarn changelog check\n```\n\nThis validates:\n\n- Every release has a changelog file\n- Major releases have filled \"💥 Breaking Changes\" section\n- At least one section has content\n- Version type matches the manifest\n\n## Reference\n\nFor detailed guidelines, see:\n\n- `.cursor/rules/` for coding guidelines\n- `.cursor/agents/reviewer-changelog.md` (will review the filled entries)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:36:50.795Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated changelog management and version control.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化变更日志管理和版本控制的开发Agent。","ja":"変更ログの自動管理とバージョン管理を必要とする開発エージェントに理想的です。","ko":"변경 로그 자동化管理 및 버전 제어가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión de registros de cambios automatizada y control de versiones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion automatisée des journaux des modifications et un contrôle de version.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Verwaltung von Änderungsprotokollen und Versionskontrolle erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento de changelog automatizado e controle de versão.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированного управления журналом изменений и управления версиями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية الذين يتطلبون إدارة سجل التغييرات الآلي وإدارة الإصدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate filling changelog entries based on branch changes, utilizing version bumps and validation through yarn version checks, ensuring accurate and up-to-date changelogs in JSON or markdown formats.","zh":"使Agent能够基于分支变更自动填充变更日志条目，利用版本升级（version bumps）并通过yarn version检查进行验证，确保JSON或markdown格式的变更日志准确且最新。","ja":"ブランチの変更に基づいて変更ログエントリを自動的に入力することをエージェントに可能にし、バージョンアップ（version bumps）を利用し、yarn versionチェックによる検証を通じて、JSONまたはマークダウン形式の正確で最新の変更ログを保証します。","ko":"브랜치 변경 사항을 기반으로 변경 로그 항목 자동 작성을 에이전트가 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 버전 범프(version bumps)를 활용하고 yarn version 검사를 통해 검증하여 JSON 또는 마크다운 형식의 정확하고 최신의 변경 로그를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar el llenado de entradas del registro de cambios en función de los cambios de rama, utilizando incrementos de versión y validación a través de comprobaciones de versión de yarn, lo que garantiza registros de cambios precisos y actualizados en formatos JSON o markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la saisie des entrées du journal des modifications en fonction des modifications de branche, en utilisant des increments de version et une validation via des vérifications de version de yarn, garantissant ainsi des journaux des modifications précis et à jour dans des formats JSON ou markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Ausfüllung von Änderungsprotokoll-Einträgen zu automatisieren, basierend auf Branch-Änderungen, unter Verwendung von Versionsinkrementen und Validierung durch yarn-Version-Checks, um genaue und aktuelle Änderungsprotokolle in JSON- oder Markdown-Formaten sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar o preenchimento de entradas de changelog com base em alterações de branch, utilizando aumentos de versão e validação por meio de verificações de versão do yarn, garantindo changelogs precisos e atualizados nos formatos JSON ou markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать заполнение записей журнала изменений на основе изменений веток, используя увеличение версий и проверку через проверки версии yarn, обеспечивая точные и актуальные журналы изменений в форматах JSON или markdown.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير تلقائي لمدخلات سجل التغييرات بناءً على تغييرات الفرع، باستخدام زيادة الإصدار والتحقق من خلال عمليات التحقق من إصدار yarn، مما يضمن سجلات التغييرات الدقيقة والمحدّثة في تنسيقات JSON أو markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating changelog updates","Validating version configurations","Streamlining release note generation"],"zh":["自动化变更日志更新","验证版本配置","简化发布说明生成"],"ja":["変更ログの更新の自動化","バージョン設定の検証","リリースノート生成の効率化"],"ko":["변경 로그 업데이트 자동화","버전 구성 검증","릴리스 노트 생성 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones del registro de cambios","Validación de configuraciones de versión","Optimización de la generación de notas de lanzamiento"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour du journal des modifications","Validation des configurations de version","Optimisation de la génération de notes de publication"],"de":["Automatisierung von Änderungsprotokoll-Updates","Validierung von Versionskonfigurationen","Optimierung der Generierung von Release-Notizen"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de changelog","Validar configurações de versão","Otimizar geração de notas de lançamento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления журнала изменений","Проверять конфигурации версий","Оптимизировать генерацию заметок о выпуске"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات سجل التغييرات آليًا","التحقق من إعدادات الإصدار","تحسين توليد ملاحظات الإصدار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires yarn version configuration","Version bumps must be configured beforehand","Dependent on successful yarn version checks"],"zh":["需要配置yarn version","版本升级（version bumps）必须预先配置","依赖于成功的yarn version检查"],"ja":["yarn versionの設定が必要","バージョンアップ（version bumps）は事前に設定する必要がある","成功するyarn versionチェックに依存"],"ko":["yarn version 구성 필요","버전 범프(version bumps)는 사전에 구성되어야 함","성공적인 yarn version 검사에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de versión de yarn","Los incrementos de versión deben estar configurados de antemano","Dependiente de comprobaciones de versión de yarn exitosas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de version de yarn","Les increments de version doivent être configurés au préalable","Dépendante de vérifications de version de yarn réussies"],"de":["Benötigt yarn-Version-Konfiguration","Versionsinkrementen müssen im Voraus konfiguriert werden","Abhängig von erfolgreichen yarn-Version-Checks"],"pt":["Exige configuração de versão do yarn","Os aumentos de versão devem ser configurados previamente","Dependente de verificações de versão do yarn bem-sucedidas"],"ru":["Требует настройки версии yarn","Увеличения версий должны быть настроены заранее","Зависит от успешных проверок версии yarn"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد إصدار yarn","يجب تحديد زيادات الإصدار مسبقًا","يعتمد على عمليات التحقق من إصدار yarn الناجحة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7f934309e6801e3b3cf9c3c28996a6d9aba3684dfbe0863c17b30f0f28415efd","qualityScore":55}');
