И Агентов","разработка носимых устройств с ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام نماط الخلفية للسماعات الذكية","ما هي السماعات الذكية بإستخدام الإعتبارات الاصطناعية","نماط الخلفية للسماعات الذكية بإستخدام الإعتبارات الاصطناعية بديل","نماط الخلفية للسماعات الذكية بإستخدام الإعتبارات الاصطناعية مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت نماط الخلفية للسماعات الذكية","دليل إعداد نماط الخلفية للسماعات الذكية","تطوير السماعات الذكية بإستخدام الإعتبارات الاصطناعية"]}},"owner":"BasedHardware","repo":"omi","repoPath":"BasedHardware/omi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.824Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"omi-backend-patterns","description":"Omi backend patterns conversation processing memory extraction chat system LangGraph FastAPI Firestore Pinecone Redis","bodyPreview":"# Omi Backend Patterns Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for working with the Omi backend, including conversation processing, memory extraction, chat system, and LangGraph integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Working on backend Python code in `backend/`\n- Implementing new API endpoints\n- Processing conversations or extracting memories\n- Working with the LangGraph chat system\n- Integrating with Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Conversation Processing\n\nThe conv","body":"# Omi Backend Patterns Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for working with the Omi backend, including conversation processing, memory extraction, chat system, and LangGraph integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Working on backend Python code in `backend/`\n- Implementing new API endpoints\n- Processing conversations or extracting memories\n- Working with the LangGraph chat system\n- Integrating with Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Conversation Processing\n\nThe conversation processing pipeline follows this flow:\n\n1. **Audio arrives via WebSocket** (`/v4/listen`)\n2. **Transcription** via Deepgram/Soniox/Speechmatics\n3. **Conversation creation** in Firestore (status: \"in_progress\")\n4. **Processing trigger** via `POST /v1/conversations` or timeout\n5. **LLM extraction** of structured data:\n   - Title and overview\n   - Action items\n   - Calendar events\n   - Memories (user facts)\n6. **Storage** in Firestore and Pinecone\n\n**Key Function**: `utils/conversations/process_conversation.py::process_conversation()`\n\n### Memory Extraction\n\nMemories are extracted from conversations using LLM:\n\n```python\nfrom utils.llm.conversation_processing import _extract_memories\n\nmemories = await _extract_memories(\n    transcript=transcript,\n    existing_memories=existing_memories,\n)\n```\n\n**Categories**: personal, health, work, relationships, preferences\n\n### Chat System Architecture\n\nThe chat system uses LangGraph for routing:\n\n1. **Classification**: `requires_context()` determines path\n2. **Simple Path**: Direct LLM response (no context needed)\n3. **Agentic Path**: Full tool access with LangGraph ReAct agent\n4. **Persona Path**: Persona app responses\n\n**Key File**: `utils/retrieval/graph.py`\n\n### Module Hierarchy\n\n**CRITICAL**: Always follow the import hierarchy:\n\n1. `database/` - Data access (lowest)\n2. `utils/` - Business logic\n3. `routers/` - API endpoints\n4. `main.py` - Application entry\n\n**Never import from higher levels in lower levels!**\n\n### Database Patterns\n\n- **Firestore**: Primary database for conversations, memories, users\n- **Pinecone**: Vector embeddings for semantic search\n- **Redis**: Caching (speech profiles, enabled apps, user names)\n- **GCS**: Binary files (audio, photos, speech profiles)\n\n### API Endpoint Patterns\n\n- Use FastAPI routers in `routers/`\n- Keep routers thin - business logic in `utils/`\n- Use dependency injection for auth\n- Return consistent error formats\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Adding a New API Endpoint\n\n1. Create router function in appropriate `routers/*.py`\n2. Add business logic in `utils/`\n3. Use database functions from `database/`\n4. Follow error handling patterns\n5. Add to router in `main.py`\n\n### Processing Conversations\n\n1. Use `process_conversation()` from `utils/conversations/process_conversation.py`\n2. Handle extraction results\n3. Store in Firestore and Pinecone\n4. Trigger app webhooks if needed\n\n### Adding a Chat Tool\n\n1. Create tool function in `utils/retrieval/tools/`\n2. Use `@tool` decorator from LangChain\n3. Add to tool loading in `utils/retrieval/tools/app_tools.py`\n4. Tool will be available in agentic chat path\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n**The `docs/` folder is the single source of truth for all user-facing documentation, deployed at [docs.omi.me](https://docs.omi.me/).**\n\n- **Backend Deep Dive**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/backend_deepdive.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/backend_deepdive)\n- **Chat System**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/chat_system.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/chat_system)\n- **Data Storage**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/StoringConversations.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/StoringConversations)\n- **Transcription**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/transcription.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/transcription)\n- **Backend Setup**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/Backend_Setup.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/Backend_Setup)\n- **Backend Architecture**: `.cursor/rules/backend-architecture.mdc`\n\n## Related Cursor Resources\n\n### Rules\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-architecture.mdc` - System architecture and module hierarchy\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-api-patterns.mdc` - FastAPI router patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-database-patterns.mdc` - Database storage patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-llm-patterns.mdc` - LLM integration patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-testing.mdc` - Testing patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-imports.mdc` - Import rules\n- `.cursor/rules/memory-management.mdc` - Memory management\n\n### Subagents\n- `.cursor/agents/backend-api-developer/` - Uses this skill for API development\n- `.cursor/agents/backend-llm-engineer/` - Uses this skill for LLM integration\n- `.cursor/agents/backend-database-engineer/` - Uses this skill for database work\n\n### Commands\n- `/backend-setup` - Uses this skill for setup guidance\n- `/backend-test` - Uses this skill for testing patterns\n- `/backend-deploy` - Uses this skill for deployment patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:40:52.644Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversation Analysis Agents requiring advanced backend integration with LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis.","zh":"适合需要与LangGraph、Firestore、Pinecone或Redis进行高级后端集成的对话分析代理。","ja":"LangGraph、Firestore、Pinecone、またはRedisとの高度なバックエンド統合を必要とする会話分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone 또는 Redis와의 고급 백엔드 통합을 필요로 하는 대화 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Conversación que requieren una integración avanzada de backend con LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone o Redis.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de conversation nécessitant une intégration avancée de backend avec LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis.","de":"Ideal für Conversation Analysis Agents, die eine erweiterte Backend-Integration mit LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone oder Redis erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Conversação que exigem integração avançada de backend com LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Разговора, требующих продвинутой интеграции бэкенда с LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone или Redis.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل المحادثة الذين يتطلبون دمج متقدم للخلفية مع LangGraph، Firestore، Pinecone أو Redis."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to process conversations, extract memories, and integrate with the LangGraph chat system using Python, while providing robust backend patterns for API endpoint implementation and data storage with Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis.","zh":"赋予代理处理会话、提取记忆并使用Python与LangGraph聊天系统集成的能力，同时为API端点实现和使用Firestore、Pinecone或Redis进行数据存储提供强大的后端模式。","ja":"Pythonを使用して会話を処理し、記憶を抽出し、LangGraphチャットシステムと統合するエージェントを可能にし、APIエンドポイントの実装とFirestore、Pinecone、またはRedisを使用したデータストレージのための強力なバックエンドパターンを提供します。","ko":"Python을 사용하여 대화를 처리하고, 기억을 추출하고, LangGraph 채팅 시스템과 통합하며, API 엔드포인트 구현 및 Firestore, Pinecone 또는 Redis를 사용한 데이터 저장을 위한 강력한 백엔드 패턴을 제공하는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para procesar conversaciones, extraer recuerdos e integrarse con el sistema de chat LangGraph utilizando Python, mientras proporciona patrones de backend robustos para la implementación de puntos finales de API y almacenamiento de datos con Firestore, Pinecone o Redis.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter les conversations, d''extraire des mémoires et de s''intégrer avec le système de chat LangGraph en utilisant Python, tout en fournissant des modèles de backend robustes pour la mise en œuvre des points de terminaison d''API et le stockage de données avec Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Konversationen zu verarbeiten, Erinnerungen zu extrahieren und sich mit dem LangGraph-Chat-System unter Verwendung von Python zu integrieren, während robuste Backend-Muster für die Implementierung von API-Endpunkten und Daten-speicherung mit Firestore, Pinecone oder Redis bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar conversas, extrair memórias e integrar-se com o sistema de chat LangGraph usando Python, enquanto fornece padrões de backend robustos para implementação de pontos de extremidade da API e armazenamento de dados com Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать разговоры, извлекать воспоминания и интегрироваться с системой чата LangGraph с помощью Python, обеспечивая при этом прочные шаблоны бэкенда для реализации конечных точек API и хранения данных с Firestore, Pinecone или Redis.","ar":"يُمكن الوكلاء من معالجة المحادثات واستخلاص الذكريات وتكامل نظام المحادثة LangGraph باستخدام Python، مع تقديم أنماط خلفية قوية لتنفيذ نقاط النهاية API وتخزين البيانات مع Firestore، Pinecone أو Redis."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing new API endpoints for conversation processing","Extracting memories from user interactions","Integrating LangGraph with existing chat systems","Optimizing backend code in the `backend/` directory"],"zh":["为会话处理实现新的API端点","从用户交互中提取记忆","将LangGraph与现有的聊天系统集成","在`backend/`目录中优化后端代码"],"ja":["会話処理のための新しいAPIエンドポイントを実装する","ユーザーとのやり取りから記憶を抽出する","LangGraphを既存のチャットシステムと統合する","`backend/`ディレクトリ内のバックエンドコードを最適化する"],"ko":["대화 처리를 위한 새로운 API 엔드포인트를 구현하는 것","사용자 상호 작용에서 기억을 추출하는 것","LangGraph를 기존의 채팅 시스템과 통합하는 것","`backend/` 디렉토리 내의 백엔드 코드를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Implementar nuevos puntos finales de API para el procesamiento de conversaciones","Extraer recuerdos de las interacciones del usuario","Integrar LangGraph con sistemas de chat existentes","Optimizar el código de backend en el directorio `backend/`"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre de nouveaux points de terminaison d''API pour le traitement des conversations","Extraire des mémoires des interactions de l''utilisateur","Intégrer LangGraph avec des systèmes de chat existants","Optimiser le code de backend dans le répertoire `backend/`"],"de":["Implementierung neuer API-Endpunkte für die Konversationsverarbeitung","Extrahieren von Erinnerungen aus den Benutzerinteraktionen","Integration von LangGraph mit bestehenden Chat-Systemen","Optimierung des Backend-Codes im Verzeichnis `backend/`"],"pt":["Implementar novos pontos de extremidade da API para processamento de conversas","Extrair memórias das interações do usuário","Integrar LangGraph com sistemas de chat existentes","Otimizar o código de backend no diretório `backend/`"],"ru":["Реализация новых конечных точек API для обработки разговоров","Извлечение воспоминаний из взаимодействий пользователя","Интеграция LangGraph с существующими системами чата","Оптимизация кода бэкенда в каталоге `backend/`"],"ar":["تنفيذ نقاط نهاية API جديدة لمعالجة المحادثات","استخلاص الذكريات من تفاعلات المستخدم","تكامل LangGraph مع أنظمة المحادثة الحالية","تحسين код الخلفية في الدليل `backend/`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python backend environment","Specific to Omi backend and LangGraph integration","Needs access to Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis for data storage"],"zh":["需要Python后端环境","特定于Omi后端和LangGraph集成","需要访问Firestore、Pinecone或Redis进行数据存储"],"ja":["Pythonバックエンド環境が必要","OmiバックエンドとLangGraph統合に特有","データストレージのためにFirestore、Pinecone、またはRedisへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Python 백엔드 환경이 필요함","Omi 백엔드와 LangGraph 통합에 특정됨","데이터 저장을 위해 Firestore, Pinecone 또는 Redis에 접근할 수 있어야 함"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de backend Python","Específico para la integración de Omi backend y LangGraph","Necesita acceso a Firestore, Pinecone o Redis para el almacenamiento de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de backend Python","Spécifique à l''intégration de Omi backend et LangGraph","A besoin d''un accès à Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis pour le stockage de données"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Backend-Umgebung","Spezifisch für die Integration von Omi-Backend und LangGraph","Benötigt Zugriff auf Firestore, Pinecone oder Redis für die Datenspeicherung"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de backend Python","Específico para backend Omi e integração LangGraph","Necessita acesso a Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis para armazenamento de dados"],"ru":["Требует среды бэкенда Python","Спецефичен для бэкенда Omi и интеграции LangGraph","Требует доступа к Firestore, Pinecone или Redis для хранения данных"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة خلفية Python","محدد لخلفية Omi وتكامل LangGraph","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى Firestore، Pinecone أو Redis لتخزين البيانات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c154bb998eb4e912f67bef1fe38b2f6fd7fbe0769e52109d73965e271284ee90","qualityScore":55}');
