e":["Verbesserung des Design des Systems mit Technologien wie React","Integration mit Node.js für eine optimale Benutzererfahrung","Analyse von Änderungen für eine informierte Entscheidungsfindung","Einfache Implementierung mit der CLI","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Integração com Ferramentas de IA","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Revisão de alterações eficaz","Design System personalizável","Suporte a múltiplos dispositivos"],"ru":["Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Улучшение опыта пользователя","Эффективная проверка изменений","Настройка Design System","Поддержка нескольких устройств"],"ar":["التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","استعراض التغييرات بفعالية","نظام التصميم القابل للتعديل","دعم أجهزة متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Review Changes AI Agent","Review Changes AI","Review Changes AI Agent - ","Review Changes AI Agent - ","Review Changes AI Agent - ","Review Changes AI Agent - "],"ja":["Review Changes AI","Review Changes AI - ","Review Changes AI - ","Review Changes AI - ","Review Changes AI - ","Review Changes AI - "],"ko":["Review Changes AI - ","Review Changes AI - ","Review Changes AI - ","Review Changes AI - ","Review Changes AI - ","Review Changes AI - "],"es":["cómo usar review-changes","qué es review-changes","review-changes alternativa","review-changes vs Razorpay","instalación de review-changes","guía de configuración de review-changes","herramientas de AI para el desarrollo"],"fr":["comment utiliser review-changes","qu''est-ce que review-changes","review-changes alternative","review-changes vs Razorpay","installation de review-changes","guide de configuration de review-changes","outils d''IA pour le développement"],"de":["wie man review-changes verwendet","was ist review-changes","review-changes Alternative","review-changes vs Razorpay","Installation von review-changes","Einrichtungsanleitung für review-changes","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["Ferramentas de IA","Design System","Razorpay","como usar Ferramentas de IA","o que é Review de Alterações","Ferramentas de IA alternative","instalar Ferramentas de IA","guia de configuração de Ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Design System","Razorpay","как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое Проверка Изменений","ИИ Агенты альтернатива","установить ИИ Агенты","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","نظام التصميم","Razorpay","كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو استعراض التغييرات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي بديلة","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"razorpay","repo":"blade","repoPath":"razorpay/blade","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.824Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-changes","description":"Review blade PRs by fetching diff, checking CI status, and getting Storybook URL. Use when reviewing PRs, checking PR status, or getting preview links for razorpay/blade PRs.","bodyPreview":"# Review Blade PR\n\nReview PRs in the razorpay/blade repository by fetching the diff, checking CI status, and extracting the Storybook preview URL.\n\n## Arguments / Clarifications (Use Cursor''s AskQuestion tool to get clarifications)\n\n- PR: Link / Number of the PR to review\n- ShouldReviewUI: Whether UI should be reviewed or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n- ShouldRunHeadedBrowser: Whether to run the browser in headed mode or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- GitH","body":"# Review Blade PR\n\nReview PRs in the razorpay/blade repository by fetching the diff, checking CI status, and extracting the Storybook preview URL.\n\n## Arguments / Clarifications (Use Cursor''s AskQuestion tool to get clarifications)\n\n- PR: Link / Number of the PR to review\n- ShouldReviewUI: Whether UI should be reviewed or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n- ShouldRunHeadedBrowser: Whether to run the browser in headed mode or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- GitHub CLI (`gh`) must be installed and authenticated\n- `agent-browser` command must be installed (if ShouldReviewUI is true)\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Avoid printing intermediate commentary; only output the final review in the main chat\n\n## Steps (Create checklist for each step)\n\n### 1. Fetch the PR Diff and CI Status in Main Agent\n\n```\nhttps://patch-diff.githubusercontent.com/raw/razorpay/blade/pull/{PR_NUMBER}.diff\n```\n\n(Ignore the lock file changes from diff)\n\nFetch status checks once and extract both CI status and Storybook URL:\n\n```bash\ngh pr checks {PR_NUMBER} --repo razorpay/blade\n```\n\n#### If checks are failing / skipped, get the details from the checks on why they are failing / skipped\n\nUse the following command (replace `{JOB_ID}` with the job id from the previous `gh pr checks` output):\n\n```bash\ngh run view --job {JOB_ID} --repo razorpay/blade\n```\n\n### 2. UI Review the Changes (if ShouldReviewUI is true)\n\n- Using agent-browser (Do NOT use Playwright MCP), open the Storybook URL (returned by earlier subagent)\n  - `agent-browser --help` on docs on how to use it\n- Determine which URL to open based on the PR changes\n- `agent-browser close` to close any earlier opened browser instances\n- Open the URL with the agent-browser and test the functionality of the changes\n  ```sh\n  agent-browser open {storybook_url} --headed (if ShouldRunHeadedBrowser is true)\n  ```\n- Close the agent-browser at the end with `agent-browser close`\n\n#### How to Find Changes\n\n- You can open the story outside iframe using the `iframe.html` url of storybook\n  - E.g. `https://61c19ee8d3d282003ac1d81c-rzqbxanzgn.chromatic.com/?path=/story/components-datepicker--date-picker-presets-with-display-format-compact` this story can be opened as an iframe in `https://61c19ee8d3d282003ac1d81c-rzqbxanzgn.chromatic.com/iframe.html?args=&id=components-datepicker--date-picker-presets-with-display-format-compact&viewMode=story`\n  - If iframe is not working, open the storybook url directly and find the story in the sidebar\n- If changes are in svelte components, check the svelte version of storybook on `{storybook_base_url}/svelte/` route\n\nReport the flows / features that were tested, if they are working as expected or not, and the issues found.\n\n### 3. Code Review the Changes\n\nAnalyze the diff for:\n\n- Potential bugs or logic errors\n- TypeScript/type safety issues\n- Missing tests for new functionality\n- Accessibility concerns\n- Performance implications\n- API Breaking changes\n- Do not review the changes in the codebase, only review the changes in the diff.\n\n## Output Format\n\nThe subagent should return all the gathered information. Then in the main chat strictly following the output format mentioned in references/output-format.md\n\n- [Output Format](./references/output-format.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:40:53.385Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing automated Git repository analysis and UI validation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要自动化Git仓库分析和UI验证功能的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが自動化されたGitリポジトリ分析およびUI検証機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 자동화된 Git 저장소 분석 및 UI 유효성 검사 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Code Review Agents que necesitan análisis de repositorios de Git automatizados y capacidades de validación de UI.","fr":"Parfait pour les Code Review Agents qui ont besoin d''une analyse de repository de Git automatisée et de capacités de validation de UI.","de":"Perfekt für Code Review Agents, die eine automatisierte Analyse von Git-Repositorys und UI-Validierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de análise automatizada de repositórios Git e capacidades de validação de UI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по обзору кода, которым необходима автоматизированная анализ репозиториев Git и возможности проверки UI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء قائم على مراجعة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل مستودع جيت 자동 ووظائف التحقق من واجهة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review Blade PRs by fetching diffs, checking CI status, and extracting Storybook preview URLs, utilizing Git and GitHub protocols for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理审查Blade PR的能力，通过获取差异、检查CI状态和提取Storybook预览URL，利用Git和GitHub协议实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがBlade PRをレビューする能力を付与し、差分の取得、CI状態の確認、およびStorybookプレビューURLの抽出を行い、GitおよびGitHubプロトコルを使用してシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 Blade PR을 리뷰할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 차이점을 가져오고, CI 상태를 확인하며, Storybook 미리보기 URL을 추출하여 Git 및 GitHub 프로토콜을 사용하여 무분별한 통합을 thực現합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes a revisar Blade PRs al fetching de diffs, comprobando el estado de CI y extrayendo URLs de preview de Storybook, utilizando los protocolos de Git y GitHub para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Empodera les agents à reviser les Blade PRs en fetchant les diffs, en vérifiant le statut de CI et en extrayant les URLs de preview de Storybook, en utilisant les protocoles de Git et GitHub pour une intégration sans problème.","de":"Empodera die Agenten, Blade PRs zu überprüfen, indem sie die Diffs abrufen, den CI-Status überprüfen und die Storybook-Preview-URLs extrahieren, indem sie die Git- und GitHub-Protokolle für eine problemlose Integration verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar PRs do Blade, buscando diffs, verificando o status do CI e extrair URLs de pré-visualização do Storybook, utilizando protocolos Git e GitHub para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность обзора PRs Blade, получая diffs, проверяя статус CI и извлекая URL-адреса предварительного просмотра Storybook, используя протоколы Git и GitHub для беспроблемной интеграции.","ar":"يطلق العنان للوكلاء لمراجعة طلبات السحب من بليد، من خلال الحصول على فروق، وفحص حالة سي آي، و استخراج عناوين URL للتحقق المسبق من ستوريبوك، باستخدام بروتوكولات جيت وجيت هاب للدمج السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PR reviews in the razorpay/blade repository","Validating UI changes with Storybook previews","Debugging CI status for failed builds"],"zh":["在razorpay/blade存储库中自动化PR审查","使用Storybook预览验证UI更改","调试失败构建的CI状态"],"ja":["razorpay/bladeリポジトリでのPRレビューの自動化","Storybookプレビューを使用したUI変更の検証","失敗したビルドのCI状態のデバッグ"],"ko":["razorpay/blade 저장소에서 PR 리뷰 자동화","Storybook 미리보기를 사용한 UI 변경 유효성 검사","실패한 빌드의 CI 상태 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de PR en el repositorio razorpay/blade","Validar los cambios de UI con las vistas de Storybook","Depurar el estado de CI para construcciones fallidas"],"fr":["Automatiser les révisions de PR dans le dépôt razorpay/blade","Valider les changements de UI avec les vues de Storybook","Déboguer le statut de CI pour les constructions fallidas"],"de":["Automatisieren Sie die PR-Überprüfungen im razorpay/blade-Repository","Validieren Sie die UI-Änderungen mit den Storybook-Vorschauen","Fehlerbehebung für den CI-Status bei fehlgeschlagenen Builds"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de PRs no repositório razorpay/blade","Validar alterações de UI com pré-visualizações do Storybook","Depurar status de CI para compilações com falhas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обзор PRs в репозитории razorpay/blade","Проверять изменения UI с помощью предварительных просмотров Storybook","Отлаживать статус CI для неудачных сборок"],"ar":["تأتمتة مراجعة طلبات السحب في مستودع رازورباي/بليد","التحقق من تغييرات واجهة المستخدم باستخدام معاينة ستوريبوك","تصحيح أخطاء حالة سي آي للبناءات الفاشلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub access","Limited to razorpay/blade repository","Needs clarification on ShouldReviewUI and ShouldRunHeadedBrowser arguments"],"zh":["需要GitHub访问权限","仅限razorpay/blade存储库","需要对ShouldReviewUI和ShouldRunHeadedBrowser参数进行澄清"],"ja":["GitHubへのアクセスが必要","razorpay/bladeリポジトリのみ","ShouldReviewUIおよびShouldRunHeadedBrowser引数の明確化が必要"],"ko":["GitHub 접근 권한 필요","razorpay/blade 저장소에만 제한됨","ShouldReviewUI 및 ShouldRunHeadedBrowser 인수에 대한 명확화 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a GitHub","Limitado al repositorio razorpay/blade","Necesita aclaración sobre los argumentos ShouldReviewUI y ShouldRunHeadedBrowser"],"fr":["Requiere un accès à GitHub","Limité au dépôt razorpay/blade","Necesita una aclaración sobre los argumentos ShouldReviewUI y ShouldRunHeadedBrowser"],"de":["Requiere Zugriff auf GitHub","Limitiert auf das razorpay/blade-Repository","Necesita una aclaración sobre die Argumente ShouldReviewUI und ShouldRunHeadedBrowser"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao GitHub","Limitado ao repositório razorpay/blade","Necessita esclarecimento sobre os argumentos ShouldReviewUI e ShouldRunHeadedBrowser"],"ru":["Требует доступа к GitHub","Ограничен репозиторием razorpay/blade","Требует уточнения по аргументам ShouldReviewUI и ShouldRunHeadedBrowser"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى جيت هاب","محدود بمستودع رازورباي/بليد","يحتاج إلى توضيح حول الحجج ShouldReviewUI و ShouldRunHeadedBrowser"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2e72a55c513d0e6c3b956fe735d861a65eb6975396d3ac604745d61a89bbae80","qualityScore":55}');
